  <Placemark>
    <name>18 Central Oyster Bar &amp; Grill Rockport ME</name>
    <description><![CDATA[18 Central Oyster Bar & Grill<br/><br/>📍 18 Central Street, Rockport Village, ME (next to Rockport Harbor Hotel)<br/><br/>A high-end wood-fire grill and raw bar in the heart of Rockport Village, drawing far fewer crowds than Camden's harbor restaurants despite excellent oysters and seafood.<br/><br/>Must Order<br/>- Oysters<br/>- Mussels in butter broth<br/>- Bread pudding<br/><br/>Tips<br/>- Water views without Camden's wait times.<br/>- Reservations by phone only — (207) 466-9055.<br/>- Oysters can sell out by peak weekend hours.<br/><br/>More info: https://www.google.com/maps/place/18+Central+Oyster+Bar+%26+Grill/@44.1876048,-69.0733086,256m/data=!3m1!1e3!4m6!3m5!1s0x4cadd72ff7f9d885:0x4209497031a90fdb!8m2!3d44.1875205!4d-69.0722033!16s%2Fg%2F11c45vm25d?entry=ttu&g_ep=EgoyMDI2MDYxMC4wIKXMDSoASAFQAw%3D%3D]]></description>
    <styleUrl>#c-purple</styleUrl>
    <ExtendedData>
      <Data name="vault_type"><value>Restaurant</value></Data>
      <Data name="icon"><value>sandwich</value></Data>
      <Data name="color"><value>purple</value></Data>
    </ExtendedData>
    <Point>
      <coordinates>-69.0722033,44.1876048,0</coordinates>
    </Point>
  </Placemark>
  <Placemark>
    <name>27 North</name>
    <description><![CDATA[27 North is a women-owned restaurant serving American breakfast and lunch fare, focusing on items like burgers, pancake, and tater tots. It is open for lunch and breakfast (8 AM - 3 PM, daily) but does not serve dinner. Alcohol availability is not mentioned.<br/><br/>More info: https://www.google.com/maps/place/27+North/@44.0520084,-71.1257588,3a,75y,212.64h,91.22t/data=!3m7!1e1!3m5!1sY5eUyDe1tXgOz1KApZjbLw!2e0!6shttps:%2F%2Fstreetviewpixels-pa.googleapis.com%2Fv1%2Fthumbnail%3Fcb_client%3Dmaps_sv.tactile%26w%3D900%26h%3D600%26pitch%3D-1.2181865820509188%26panoid%3DY5eUyDe1tXgOz1KApZjbLw%26yaw%3D212.64176149621287!7i16384!8i8192!4m6!3m5!1s0x4cb3a1302e0f004f:0xc0fe4083b275ed59!8m2!3d44.0541981!4d-71.1297328!16s%2Fg%2F11h3j3cwcs?entry=ttu&g_ep=EgoyMDI2MDcxNC4wIKXMDSoASAFQAw%3D%3D]]></description>
