  <Placemark>
    <name>727 Ocean Sunset Bar East Boothbay ME</name>
    <description><![CDATA[727 Ocean Sunset Bar<br/><br/>📍 At Smuggler's Cove Inn, 727 Ocean Point Rd, East Boothbay, ME<br/><br/>A cocktail bar at Smuggler's Cove Inn with genuinely stunning Linekin Bay views — creative craft cocktails, local brews, and small plates: oysters, fish tacos, sliders, and a cheese/charcuterie board built on locally produced meats and cheeses. The setting is the main draw as much as the food.<br/><br/>Must Order<br/>- Fried chicken wings — called out as large and crispy<br/>- Cheese/charcuterie board<br/>- Fish tacos<br/><br/>Tips<br/>- Very limited hours: Monday, Tuesday, and Thursday only, 3pm–8:30pm — closed Wednesday and (per available info) weekends, so this takes real planning to hit.<br/>- Go for sunset — that's the entire point of the location, right on Linekin Bay.<br/>- One review flagged a discrepancy between menu price and actual charge — worth confirming prices verbally if anything seems off.<br/>- On the way out toward Ocean Point / Ocean Point Preserve, so easy to combine with that stop.<br/><br/>More info: https://www.smugglerscoveinn.com/727-ocean-sunset-bar/]]></description>
    <styleUrl>#c-purple</styleUrl>
