  <Placemark>
    <name>88 Charles St Restaurant Montgomery NY</name>
    <description><![CDATA[Overview<br/>Type: Restaurant<br/><br/>Best known for: Exceptional seafood and homemade pasta dishes.<br/><br/>Location context: Not mentioned.<br/><br/>Price level: $40–100 per person<br/><br/>Visit timing: Closed on Tuesdays; dinner service available.<br/><br/>Typical Customers<br/>Demographics: Couples and groups celebrating special occasions.<br/><br/>Group types: Couples, friends, families.<br/><br/>Common occasions: Date night, special occasions.<br/><br/>Vibe & Setting<br/>Atmosphere: Lively yet cozy environment.<br/><br/>Noise level: Moderate.<br/><br/>Decor & setting: Indoor seating with a bar, no specific outdoor mention.<br/><br/>Service style: Attentive and friendly service.<br/><br/>Recommended Dishes<br/>Overall dish consensus<br/>Reviewers frequently praise the ravioli and seafood dishes, suggesting they are must-order items based on multiple recommendations.<br/><br/>How “top dishes” are determined<br/>Top dishes were chosen based on menu listings, user reviews indicating strong preferences, and dishes highlighted as favorites in photos and summaries.<br/><br/>| Rank | Dish                       | Why it stands out                                  | How often it’s mentioned                | Ideal for              |<br/>|------|----------------------------|---------------------------------------------------|-----------------------------------------|-----------------------|<br/>| 1    | Ravioli                   | Highly praised for its homemade quality and flavor.| Mentioned in numerous reviews.        | Lighter option        |<br/>| 2    | Seafood platter           | Commended for variety and freshness.              | Repeatedly called out as a favorite.  | Sharing at the table   |<br/>| 3    | Spinach manicotti         | Noted for its comforting, rich taste.             | Appears in many reviews.              | Hearty main           |<br/><br/>Good alternates / backup choices<br/>- Chicken francaise: Known for its delicious flavor and execution.<br/>- Meatballs: Praised for being well-seasoned and hearty.<br/><br/>Highlights (non-dish positives from reviews)<br/>Atmosphere: Guests appreciate the vibrant city vibe and warm, friendly staff.<br/><br/>Service: Reviews often mention attentive service from staff who make guests feel valued.<br/><br/>Common Issues (from reviews)<br/>Wait times: Some reviews indicate longer waits during busy hours, especially on weekends.<br/><br/>Reservation needs: It may be beneficial to make reservations due to popularity.<br/><br/>Practical Notes<br/>Reservation / wait: Reservations recommended, especially for weekends.<br/><br/>Accessibility: Not mentioned.<br/><br/>Parking / transit: Not mentioned.<br/><br/>Best use case: Great for date nights and special celebrations.<br/><br/>More info: https://www.google.com/maps/place/88+Charles+St+Restaurant/@41.5266312,-74.2409669,830m/data=!3m1!1e3!4m14!1m7!3m6!1s0x89dcd5e863ca4ded:0x7d0039c76cbcb0b!2s88+Charles+St+Restaurant!8m2!3d41.5266312!4d-74.238392!16s%2Fg%2F1tkc7p4d!3m5!1s0x89dcd5e863ca4ded:0x7d0039c76cbcb0b!8m2!3d41.5266312!4d-74.238392!16s%2Fg%2F1tkc7p4d?entry=ttu&g_ep=EgoyMDI2MDYxMy4wIKXMDSoASAFQAw%3D%3D]]></description>
    <styleUrl>#c-red</styleUrl>
