  <Placemark>
    <name>Aba's Falafel Rhinebeck, NY</name>
    <description><![CDATA[Aba's Falafel<br/><br/>📍 Rhinebeck, NY<br/><br/>An Israeli-owned counter-service spot consistently rated Rhinebeck's highest-reviewed restaurant, serving the freshest and most expertly seasoned falafel in the Hudson Valley.<br/><br/>Must Order<br/>- Falafel wrap — made fresh throughout the day — the definitive order<br/>- Hummus bowl — rich and hand-made<br/>- Sabich — fried eggplant sandwich with egg and tahini<br/><br/>Tips<br/>- Expect a line on weekends — moves fast<br/>- Pairs perfectly with a walk through Rhinebeck village<br/><br/>More info: https://www.google.com/maps/search/Aba's+Falafel+Rhinebeck,+NY]]></description>
    <styleUrl>#c-purple</styleUrl>
    <ExtendedData>
