  <Placemark>
    <name>Abby Aldrich Rockefeller Garden Seal Harbor ME</name>
    <description><![CDATA[Abby Aldrich Rockefeller Garden<br/><br/>📍 Peabody Drive, Seal Harbor, ME (unmarked entrance ~0.5 mi off Route 3; coordinate approximate — road geocode, not the actual gate)<br/><br/>Beatrix Farrand-designed garden (1926-1930) for Abby Aldrich and John D. Rockefeller Jr., blending an English flower garden within an Asian-inspired landscape. Peak bloom in August. Open by reservation only, mid-July to early September, Tuesday-Sunday noon-4pm.<br/><br/>Tips<br/>- Reservation required — check gardenpreserve. before planning a visit<br/>- Friday and Sunday are member days]]></description>
    <styleUrl>#c-green</styleUrl>
