  <Placemark>
    <name>Abel's Lobster Somesville ME</name>
    <description><![CDATA[Abel's Lobster<br/><br/>📍 Somesville, Mount Desert Island, ME (Somes Sound shores)<br/><br/>Tucked away on the shores of Somes Sound, Abel's offers classic lobster bakes and casual seafood dining in a forested, waterside setting that feels far removed from the main tourist routes despite being on Mount Desert Island.<br/><br/>Tips<br/>- Located on the scenic fjord side of the island<br/>- Casual, waterfront dining experience<br/>- Classic New England lobster bake setting<br/>- Quieter alternative to downtown Bar Harbor restaurants]]></description>
