    <name>Aekeir Brewing Tasting Room Wiscasset ME</name>
    <description><![CDATA[Aekeir Brewing Tasting Room<br/><br/>📍 111 Main Street, Wiscasset, ME<br/><br/>A craft brewery tasting room on Main Street, specializing in small-batch, kettle-soured beers.<br/><br/>Tips<br/>- Good late-afternoon stop before heading back to Camden.]]></description>
