  <Placemark>
    <name>Albrecht's Dairy Pleasant Valley NY</name>
    <description><![CDATA[Albrecht's Dairy<br/><br/>📍 Route 44, Pleasant Valley, NY<br/><br/>Main house ca. 1797. An early structure on approach to the village.<br/><br/>Tips<br/>- Stop 17 of 26 on the Hyde Park, Clinton & Pleasant Valley Scenic Tour (Tour 3).]]></description>
