  <Placemark>
    <name>Alder Path Trail Schoodic ME</name>
    <description><![CDATA[Alder Path Trail<br/><br/>📍 Blueberry Hill parking area, Schoodic Peninsula, ME<br/><br/>A 1.3-mile easy out-and-back trail through old farmland and alder bushes on the Schoodic Peninsula, starting from the Blueberry Hill parking area. Rated 4.2★ on AllTrails, and well away from the crowds at Schoodic Point itself.<br/><br/>Tips<br/>- Starts at the Blueberry Hill parking area, same general area as the Little Moose Island tide walk<br/>- Grassy, gentle terrain — good easy stop on a Schoodic loop drive]]></description>
    <styleUrl>#c-green</styleUrl>
    <ExtendedData>
