  <Placemark>
    <name>Aldermere Farm Rockport ME</name>
    <description><![CDATA[Aldermere Farm<br/><br/>📍 20 Russell Avenue, Rockport ME<br/><br/>A working farm and preserve known for its Belted Galloway cattle ("Oreo cows") — a herd visible right from the road. A short quarter-mile trail leads to an overlook of Lily Pond, and a separate 0.4-mile path drops down to the shore of Penobscot Bay.<br/><br/>Tips<br/>- Free and easy — flat, family-friendly walking paths.<br/>- The cattle are often visible right from Russell Avenue, even without walking the trails.<br/>- Coordinates above are an approximation (Rockport town center) — worth confirming the exact farm entrance against Google Maps before you go.]]></description>
