  <Placemark>
    <name>Alpine Adventures Lincoln NH</name>
    <description><![CDATA[Alpine Adventures<br/><br/>📍 Barron Mountain, Lincoln, NH<br/><br/>New England's first canopy tour, on Barron Mountain. The original Tree Top Canopy Tour has six ziplines, from 250 to 1,000 feet long and up to 80 feet off the ground; two additional courses round out the offering. Also runs year-round Swiss Army transport vehicle safari and off-roading tours for a different kind of outing.<br/><br/>Tips<br/>- Book ahead in peak summer/fall season.<br/>- A good active complement to a quieter Lincoln day (pair with the Hobo Railroad or Lincoln Woods Trail).<br/><br/>More info: https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=44.0500%2C%20-71.6600]]></description>
