  <Placemark>
    <name>American Flatbread 1 Stowe VT</name>
    <description><![CDATA[American Flatbread in Stowe is a popular pizza restaurant known for its delicious variety of pizzas. It typically attracts families, groups of friends, and gatherings, making it a go-to spot for casual dining experiences. The atmosphere is casual and lively, suitable for group outings. Customers consistently praise the fabulous food and attentive service. The soup of the day is noted for its flavor and heartiness, and the large pizzas offer good value for shared dining. However, some reviews mention that the serving staff can feel overwhelmed during busy times, and there was an instance of reservation mishaps that affected wait times.<br/><br/>More info: https://www.google.com/maps/place/American+Flatbread/@44.4771113,-72.7042647,6585m/data=!3m1!1e3!4m11!3m10!1s0x4cb59755a7ad2741:0x1ffd4393d2454ce2!5m4!1s2026-09-21!2i4!4m1!1i2!8m2!3d44.4750536!4d-72.7025164!16s%2Fg%2F11s7ny929l?entry=ttu&g_ep=EgoyMDI2MDYxMC4wIKXMDSoASAFQAw%3D%3D]]></description>
