  <Placemark>
    <name>American Flatbread Rockport ME</name>
    <description><![CDATA[American Flatbread in Rockport is a casual dining spot best known for its wood-fired pizzas and a menu that incorporates organic and local ingredients. It attracts a diverse clientele, including families and groups of friends, often dining out for occasions such as casual lunches or dinners. The overall vibe of the restaurant is friendly and welcoming, with a comfortable atmosphere that balances casual dining with quality food, making it suitable for a variety of diners from families to couples.<br/><br/>Customers consistently praise the delicious wood-fired pizza, the friendly and helpful staff, and the overall quality of the food, especially highlighting the use of fresh ingredients. However, some reviews mention the limited menu options and that some dishes may come with a higher price point, which could deter budget-conscious diners.<br/><br/>More info: https://www.google.com/maps/place/American+Flatbread/@44.1785551,-69.0839428,5053m/data=!3m1!1e3!4m6!3m5!1s0x4cadd0d19b66cacb:0xd0af367dc1add455!8m2!3d44.1741673!4d-69.0799642!16s%2Fg%2F11btyvkjlx?entry=ttu&g_ep=EgoyMDI2MDYxMC4wIKXMDSoASAFQAw%3D%3D]]></description>
