  <Placemark>
    <name>American Flatbread Waitsfield VT</name>
    <description><![CDATA[American Flatbread<br/><br/>📍 Waitsfield VT<br/><br/>The original Vermont location of the beloved flatbread institution — wood-fired organic flatbread pizzas baked in a clay oven on a working farm.<br/><br/>Must Order<br/>- Wood-fired flatbread with local organic toppings<br/><br/>Tips<br/>- Dinner only on weekends — check the schedule.<br/>- The rustic farm setting is part of the experience.]]></description>
