    <name>Anderson School Staatsburg NY</name>
    <description><![CDATA[Anderson School<br/><br/>📍 Hyde Park, NY<br/><br/>A school for children and young adults with special needs. The house was named Mansewood because it was the original "Manse" of the parish of St. James in Hyde Park.<br/><br/>Tips<br/>- Stop 7 of 26 on the Hyde Park, Clinton & Pleasant Valley Scenic Tour (Tour 3) — a drive-by point of interest, not a public visitor site.]]></description>
