  <Placemark>
    <name>Andre The Seal Statue</name>
    <description><![CDATA[Nina June, located at 24 Central St, is a restaurant offering artistic and creatively plated dishes. Prices range from $60 to $70. It is open for dinner starting at 5 PM and does not specify if it serves alcohol.<br/><br/>More info: https://www.google.com/maps/place/Andre+The+Seal+Statue/@44.1862497,-69.0760483,912m/data=!3m1!1e3!4m11!1m3!2m2!1sThings+to+do!6e1!3m6!1s0x4cadd74a9f6c68c7:0xc864ed8298abc7fd!8m2!3d44.1862136!4d-69.0737224!15sCgxUaGluZ3MgdG8gZG9aDiIMdGhpbmdzIHRvIGRvkgETaGlzdG9yaWNhbF9sYW5kbWFya5oBI0NoWkRTVWhOTUc5blMwVkpRMEZuU1VSMWVWbERiVmwzRUFF4AEA-gEECAAQKQ!16s%2Fg%2F11g0g8pdyr?entry=ttu&g_ep=EgoyMDI2MDcxMy4wIKXMDSoASAFQAw%3D%3D]]></description>
