  <Placemark>
    <name>Angkor Wat Restaurant Woodstock VT</name>
    <description><![CDATA[Angkor Wat Restaurant serves Asian fusion cuisine with a price range of $20–30. It is open for dinner from Thursday to Tuesday, 4 PM to 8:30 PM, and it is noted to be LGBTQ+ friendly.<br/><br/>More info: https://www.google.com/maps/place/Angkor+Wat+Restaurant/@43.6223817,-72.5377723,5128m/data=!3m1!1e3!4m14!1m6!2m5!1srestaurants+with+reservations!5m2!4e9!15saccepts_reservations!6e5!3m6!1s0x89e1d817f66e60a5:0xc39b7802dc45c4e!8m2!3d43.6264244!4d-72.5085355!!16s%2Fg%2F1tmxs08k?entry=ttu&g_ep=EgoyMDI2MDYyMy4wIKXMDSoASAFQAw%3D%3D]]></description>
