  <Placemark>
    <name>Appalachian Trail Crossing Pawling NY</name>
    <description><![CDATA[Appalachian Trail Crossing<br/><br/>📍 Hurd Corners, Pawling, NY 12564<br/><br/>A 2100+ mi. footpath from Maine to Georgia, completed in 1937 and administered by the National Park Service, crosses here. The Harlem Line of Metro-North RR offers limited stops at the train station due west just across Rt. 22.<br/><br/>Tips<br/>- Call 845/454-4936 for AT info, or Metro-North 800/METRO-INFO for train info.<br/>- Historic structures are located at the former Harlem Valley Psychiatric Center nearby.<br/>- Stop 32 of 39 on the Union Vale, Beekman, Pawling & Dover Scenic Tour (Tour 6).]]></description>
