  <Placemark>
    <name>Apple Pie Bakery Cafe CIA Hyde Park, NY</name>
    <description><![CDATA[Apple Pie Bakery Cafe CIA<br/><br/>📍 Hyde Park, NY<br/><br/>The Culinary Institute of America's casual bakery outlet — exceptional pastries, sandwiches, and breads made by culinary students at accessible prices.<br/><br/>Tips<br/>- Great casual lunch stop before or after the Hyde Park historic sites<br/>- Pastry selection changes daily — croissants and seasonal tarts are highlights<br/>- Counter service; no reservations needed<br/><br/>More info: https://www.google.com/maps/search/Apple+Pie+Bakery+Cafe+CIA+Hyde+Park,+NY]]></description>
