  <Placemark>
    <name>Aquinnah Cliffs &amp; Gay Head Light Aquinnah MA</name>
    <description><![CDATA[Aquinnah Cliffs & Gay Head Light<br/><br/>📍 Aquinnah MA<br/><br/>Dramatic multicolored clay cliffs (a National Natural Landmark) with the historic 1856 Gay Head Lighthouse at the western tip of Martha's Vineyard.<br/><br/>Tips<br/>- Worth the drive to the far end of the island — nothing else looks like this.<br/>- The cliffs are protected; stay on the paths and don't touch the clay.]]></description>
