    <name>Aragosta Stonington ME</name>
    <description><![CDATA[Aragosta<br/><br/>📍 Stonington ME<br/><br/>Acclaimed waterfront tasting-menu restaurant spotlighting hyper-local Maine seafood and produce.<br/><br/>Must Order<br/>- <br/><br/>Tips<br/>- Book well ahead — small, in-demand dining room.<br/>- Tasting menu format; plan for a longer meal.]]></description>
