    <description><![CDATA[Arborvine<br/><br/>📍 Blue Hill ME<br/><br/>Romantic, intimate fine dining with creative New American cuisine in a converted historic Cape.<br/><br/>Must Order<br/>- <br/><br/>Tips<br/>- Reservations strongly recommended.<br/>- Good option for a special-occasion dinner.]]></description>
