    <name>Archer's on the Pier Rockland ME</name>
    <description><![CDATA[Archer's on the Pier<br/><br/>📍 Rockland ME<br/><br/>Waterfront dining with classic Maine lobster dinners and harbor views.<br/><br/>Must Order<br/>- The King of Clubs lobster club sandwich<br/><br/>Tips<br/>- Sit outside on the deck for harbor views if weather allows.]]></description>
