  <Placemark>
    <name>Archie's Lobster Southwest Harbor ME</name>
    <description><![CDATA[Archie's Lobster is a casual seafood restaurant known for its delicious lobster rolls and lobster dinners. It typically attracts families and visitors, especially those exploring Acadia National Park. The overall vibe is relaxed and friendly, fitting for a budget-conscious dining experience. Customers consistently praise the tasty food, good value for the price, and the friendly service. Some common downsides mentioned include average flavor in some dishes and the potential for differing hours on holidays.<br/><br/>More info: https://www.google.com/maps/place/Archie's+Lobster/@44.2792746,-68.3409427,9129m/data=!3m1!1e3!4m6!3m5!1s0x4caea35183a4f1d7:0xd9f29b8b74250d1d!8m2!3d44.2511988!4d-68.3480153!16s%2Fg%2F11nnzq37cg?entry=ttu&g_ep=EgoyMDI2MDYxMC4wIKXMDSoASAFQAw%3D%3D]]></description>
