  <Placemark>
    <name>Aroi Thai Rhinebeck, NY</name>
    <description><![CDATA[Aroi Thai<br/><br/>📍 Rhinebeck, NY<br/><br/>A consistently praised Thai restaurant delivering authentic preparations in a relaxed Rhinebeck setting — a perennial local favorite and rare find in the Hudson Valley.<br/><br/>Must Order<br/>- Pad Thai — made to order, not pre-cooked<br/>- Green curry — fragrant and properly spiced<br/>- Crispy duck — a standout specialty<br/><br/>Tips<br/>- Reservations recommended for weekend dinners<br/>- Ask for the heat level you actually want<br/><br/>More info: https://www.google.com/maps/search/Aroi+Thai+Rhinebeck,+NY]]></description>
