  <Placemark>
    <name>Art's Dune Tours Provincetown MA</name>
    <description><![CDATA[Art's Dune Tours<br/><br/>📍 Provincetown MA<br/><br/>Iconic 1.5-hour 4x4 tours through the Cape Cod National Seashore dunes with local history, wildlife, and artist colony heritage.<br/><br/>Tips<br/>- Book ahead — tours sell out in season.<br/>- Sunset tours are especially popular; reserve several days out.]]></description>
