    <description><![CDATA[Ash Mountain<br/><br/>📍 Gouldsboro, ME<br/><br/>A low hill in Gouldsboro, on the Schoodic Peninsula.<br/><br/>Tips<br/>- No maintained public trail documented — treat as a landmark along the drive rather than a hiking destination.<br/><br/>More info: https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=44.4104%2C%20-68.0975]]></description>
