  <Placemark>
    <name>Asticou Azalea Garden Northeast Harbor ME</name>
    <description><![CDATA[Asticou Azalea Garden<br/><br/>📍 Northeast Harbor, Mount Desert Island, ME<br/><br/>Located adjacent to Thuya Garden, the Asticou Azalea Garden is a botanical gem featuring carefully curated collections of native azaleas and other woodland plants. The garden provides a peaceful contrast to the busier parts of Mount Desert Island.<br/><br/>Tips<br/>- Right next to Thuya Garden—visit both in one trip<br/>- Best bloom times are May through early June<br/>- Wheelchair accessible pathways through much of the garden<br/>- Stone walls and winding paths create intimate spaces<br/>- Shaded woodland setting keeps it cool even on warm days<br/>- Very few tourists find this hidden gem]]></description>
