  <Placemark>
    <name>Athens Rooster Athens, NY</name>
    <description><![CDATA[Athens Rooster<br/><br/>📍 Athens, NY<br/><br/>A beloved small-town restaurant serving wood-fired pizza, excellent brunch, and community-gathering energy — the heart of Athens's culinary scene.<br/><br/>Must Order<br/>- Wood-fired pizza — thin-crust, well-blistered<br/>- Brunch plates — farm-sourced and generous<br/><br/>Tips<br/>- Weekends draw crowds from Hudson and Catskill — arrive early for brunch<br/>- Closed one day midweek; check the website<br/><br/>More info: https://www.google.com/maps/search/Athens+Rooster+Athens,+NY]]></description>
