  <Placemark>
    <name>Atlantic Brewing Company Tasting Room Town Hill ME</name>
    <description><![CDATA[Atlantic Brewing Company Tasting Room<br/><br/>📍 15 Knox Road, Town Hill, Bar Harbor, ME<br/><br/>A local brewery tasting room located in Town Hill, west of downtown Bar Harbor. This is a popular bailout spot for avoiding downtown crowds during peak August.<br/><br/>Tips<br/>- West of downtown on Route 3<br/>- Casual brewery atmosphere<br/>- Good for a break or afternoon visit<br/>- Less crowded than downtown dining<br/>- Local craft beer selection]]></description>
