  <Placemark>
    <name>Au Comptoir Woodstock VT</name>
    <description><![CDATA[Au Comptoir is a cocktail bar offering a range of drinks with prices between $20–50 per person. It is open from 3 PM to 10 PM on Thursday to Saturday and has a cozy vibe, serving alcohol.<br/><br/>More info: https://www.google.com/maps/place/Au+Comptoir/@43.6249607,-72.5243349,1203m/data=!3m1!1e3!4m12!1m5!2m4!1srestaurants+with+reservations.+!5m1!4e9!6e5!3m5!1s0x89e1d99b7360666d:0x5c5ce8604b178fe1!8m2!3d43.6249595!4d-72.5175018!16s%2Fg%2F11t80flmqj?entry=ttu&g_ep=EgoyMDI2MDYyMy4wIKXMDSoASAFQAw%3D%3D]]></description>
