    <name>Awosting Falls New Paltz, NY</name>
    <description><![CDATA[Awosting Falls<br/><br/>📍 New Paltz, NY<br/><br/>A short, popular walk within Minnewaska State Park Preserve to a scenic waterfall on the Peter's Kill.<br/><br/>Tips<br/>- Access via Minnewaska State Park Preserve, off Rts 44/55<br/><br/>More info: https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=41.7230%2C%20-74.2440]]></description>
