  <Placemark>
    <name>Baby Stark Mountain Waitsfield VT</name>
    <description><![CDATA[Baby Stark Mountain<br/><br/>📍 Long Trail, north of Appalachian Gap, VT<br/><br/>A Long Trail peak just north of Appalachian Gap, paired with (larger) Stark Mountain — home to Mad River Glen — south of the pass.<br/><br/>Tips<br/>- Accessed via the Long Trail from the Appalachian Gap trailhead — a serious hike, not a roadside stop.<br/><br/>More info: https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=44.2159%2C%20-72.9296]]></description>
