    </Point>
  </Placemark>
  <Placemark>
    <name>Back Lake Pittsburg NH</name>
    <description><![CDATA[Back Lake<br/><br/>📍 Pittsburg, NH<br/><br/>A lake in Pittsburg popular with anglers, ringed by fishing camps and lodges typical of this remote corner of the Great North Woods.<br/><br/>Tips<br/>- A quieter alternative to the larger Connecticut Lakes chain for fishing or a peaceful paddle.<br/><br/>More info: https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=45.0801%2C%20-71.3558]]></description>
