    </Point>
  </Placemark>
  <Placemark>
    <name>Backyard Stowe VT</name>
    <description><![CDATA[Backyard is a casual dining restaurant located in Stowe, known for its approachable menu featuring items like tacos, burgers, and cocktails. It attracts a diverse crowd, including families and groups, especially locals and tourists seeking a cozy dining experience after outdoor activities like skiing or hiking. The atmosphere is friendly and laid-back, ideal for both casual lunches and dinners.<br/><br/>Customers consistently praise the juicy chicken tacos and flavorful local burger, along with the friendly service. However, some reviews mention that while service is good, the food lacks standout quality, and a few experiences noted long waits during busy periods.<br/><br/>More info: https://www.google.com/maps/place/Backyard/@44.4703502,-72.6889683,781m/data=!3m1!1e3!4m6!3m5!1s0x4cb596f83c620291:0x850f850ad853b938!8m2!3d44.470287!4d-72.6883949!16s%2Fm%2F021fwj4?entry=ttu&g_ep=EgoyMDI2MDYxMC4wIKXMDSoASAFQAw%3D%3D]]></description>
