  <Placemark>
    <name>Baker Hill Sullivan ME</name>
    <description><![CDATA[Baker Hill<br/><br/>📍 Punkinville Road, Sullivan, ME (0.2 mi from Route 1N)<br/><br/>58 acres of granite ledges on Baker Hill's southern slope, with views south to Mount Desert Island and north to Schoodic Mountain. Connects to the adjacent Long Ledges Preserve. 0.75-1 mi loop; a guided scavenger-hunt trail for families.<br/><br/>Tips<br/>- Connects directly to Long Ledges Preserve for a longer combined hike]]></description>
