  <Placemark>
    <name>Bald Mountain Yorktown, NY</name>
    <description><![CDATA[Bald Mountain<br/><br/>📍 Yorktown, NY<br/><br/>A minor hill in the Town of Yorktown, part of the cluster of small Westchester County summits toward the southern end of this Taconic Byway list.<br/><br/>Tips<br/>- A minor stop best combined with nearby Cooney Hill and Reynolds Hill.<br/><br/>More info: https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=41.226216,-73.827910]]></description>
