  <Placemark>
    <name>Banners Restaurant</name>
    <description><![CDATA[This breakfast restaurant serves a variety of morning dishes including omelettes, waffles, and fresh juices. It is open from 7 AM to 3 PM daily and does not serve dinner or lunch. Alcohol options like coffee and Bloody Marys are available.<br/><br/>More info: https://www.google.com/maps/place/Banners+Restaurant/@43.9960334,-71.1097388,790m/data=!3m2!1e3!4b1!4m6!3m5!1s0x4cb30992ce2dc0e3:0xfc366dcf5dd5bcba!8m2!3d43.9960334!4d-71.1097388!16s%2Fg%2F1tdp01nk?entry=ttu&g_ep=EgoyMDI2MDcwOC4wIKXMDSoASAFQAw%3D%3D]]></description>
