  <Placemark>
    <name>Bar Harbor Eden Farmers Market Bar Harbor ME</name>
    <description><![CDATA[Bar Harbor's Eden Farmers' Market<br/><br/>📍 Mount Desert Island YMCA, 21 Park Street, Bar Harbor, ME 04609<br/><br/>MDI's main farmers' market, held in the YMCA parking lot at the south end of downtown Bar Harbor, just off Route 3. A broad range of locally produced vegetables, seafood, meats, baked goods, and prepared foods — an easy stop before heading into Acadia National Park.<br/><br/>Tips<br/>- Sundays 9 AM–12 PM, May 10 – October 25, 2026<br/>- Right off Route 3, easy to combine with an Acadia National Park morning<br/>- A smaller Northeast Harbor Farmers Market also runs Thursdays 9 AM–12 PM (June 18–Aug 27) at Harbor Drive on the Town Green, if timing works better for a day trip to Northeast Harbor<br/><br/>More info: https://www.google.com/maps/search/Mount+Desert+Island+YMCA+21+Park+Street+Bar+Harbor+ME]]></description>
