  <Placemark>
    <name>Bar Harbor Lobster Bakes Bar Harbor ME</name>
    <description><![CDATA[What it is: Upscale seafood restaurant specializing in lobster bakes, lobster bisque, steamed mussels, and fresh Maine seafood.<br/><br/>Customers: Families and tourists on Maine trips; groups celebrating special occasions; people seeking memorable dining experiences.<br/><br/>Vibe: Casual-upscale with outdoor waterfront seating; welcoming, warm atmosphere.<br/><br/>Strongest positives:<br/><br/>- Exceptional food quality across all dishes; consistently praised as "best food and service in the Bar Harbor area"<br/>- Friendly, attentive service; staff described as making guests "feel like family"<br/>- Amazing water views and outdoor seating (mentioned in 14+ reviews)<br/>- Signature blueberry cake (mentioned in 54 reviews—standout dessert)<br/>- Accommodating to dietary restrictions (shellfish allergies handled well)<br/><br/>Downsides:<br/><br/>- None consistently mentioned across multiple reviews<br/><br/>More info: https://www.google.com/maps/place/Bar+Harbor+Lobster+Bakes/@44.4147557,-68.2618057,3167m/data=!3m2!1e3!4b1!4m6!3m5!1s0x4caeb94c9524a0df:0x129f1e1505857740!8m2!3d44.4147408!4d-68.251506!16s%2Fg%2F1thhk2_l?entry=ttu&g_ep=EgoyMDI2MDYxMC4wIKXMDSoASAFQAw%3D%3D]]></description>
