  <Placemark>
    <name>Bar Harbor Whale Watch Co ME</name>
    <description><![CDATA[Bar Harbor Whale Watch Co.<br/><br/>📍 Bar Harbor Inn Pier, Bar Harbor, ME<br/><br/>A long-running whale watch operator sailing from the town pier into the Gulf of Maine, with trips aimed at whales, seabirds (including puffins on some routes), seals, and other marine wildlife.<br/><br/>Tips<br/>- Book ahead in peak season; bring layers regardless of the weather in town — it's noticeably colder on the water.<br/>- Reviews are mixed — check current trip reports/sighting rates before committing, since wildlife sightings vary trip to trip.<br/><br/>More info: https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=44.39151%2C%20-68.204605]]></description>
