  <Placemark>
    <name>Bard College Fisher Center Annandale-on-Hudson, NY</name>
    <description><![CDATA[Bard College Fisher Center<br/><br/>📍 Annandale-on-Hudson, NY<br/><br/>A Frank Gehry-designed stainless steel performing arts center on the Bard campus, hosting world-class theater, opera, and music.<br/><br/>Tips<br/>- Check fishercenter.bard. for Sept performances — fall season often active<br/>- The building is worth visiting architecturally even without a performance<br/>- On the same property as Montgomery Place — combine both<br/>- Also stop 13 of 33 on the Rhinebeck, Red Hook & Milan Scenic Tour (Tour 1)<br/><br/>More info: https://www.google.com/maps/search/Bard+College+Fisher+Center+Annandale-on-Hudson,+NY]]></description>
