  <Placemark>
    <name>Barn Door Baking Co Damariscotta ME</name>
    <description><![CDATA[Time: 2026-08-10T16:00:00<br/><br/>Barn Door Baking Co.<br/><br/>📍 212 Main Street, Damariscotta, ME<br/><br/>A scratch bakery and cafe on Main Street known for fresh pastries, bread, and a solid breakfast/lunch menu.<br/><br/>Must Order<br/>- Fresh-baked pastries and bread, made from scratch daily<br/><br/>Tips<br/>- Good breakfast/coffee stop before a day exploring downtown Damariscotta.]]></description>
