  <Placemark>
    <name>Barren's Distillery + Restaurant</name>
    <description><![CDATA[Barren's Distillery + Restaurant<br/><br/>📍 Camden, ME (on the harbor)<br/><br/>An elevated casual American seafood and pub spot with its own on-site distillery — house-made small-batch gin, whiskey, and other spirits feed directly into the cocktail list. Panoramic harbor views from the dining room, Google-rated 4.4, open for lunch and dinner Wednesday–Sunday, noon–8pm. Reviews are mixed on kitchen consistency even though the drinks and setting are consistently praised — go in for the view and cocktails first, food second.<br/><br/>Must Order<br/>- Fresh oysters<br/>- Fish & chips<br/>- Cocktails made with house-distilled gin or vodka — blueberry-infused versions get specific praise<br/>- Lobster bruschetta or the homemade pretzels to start<br/><br/>Tips<br/>- One review specifically flagged the haddock chowder as a weak spot — if you want chowder in Camden, this may not be the place.<br/>- Closed Monday and Tuesday.<br/>- Ask for a table with a harbor view — that's the main draw alongside the cocktails.<br/><br/>More info: https://www.google.com/maps/place/Barren's+Distillery+%2B+Restaurant/@44.2092724,-69.0610791,788m/data=!3m1!1e3!4m14!1m7!3m6!1s0x4cadd7a943d4d653:0xb94729f47d949a9f!2sBarren's+Distillery+%2B+Restaurant!8m2!3d44.2092724!4d-69.0610791!16s%2Fg%2F11t5m4w51s!3m5!1s0x4cadd7a943d4d653:0xb94729f47d949a9f!8m2!3d44.2092724!4d-69.0610791!16s%2Fg%2F11t5m4w51s?entry=ttu&g_ep=EgoyMDI2MDcxMi4wIKXMDSoASAFQAw%3D%3D]]></description>
