    <description><![CDATA[Barton Orchards<br/><br/>📍 63 Apple Tree Ln, Poughquag, NY 12570<br/><br/>One of many farms in the area that offers an opportunity to pick the best of the crop at the moment it is ripe.<br/><br/>Tips<br/>- Stop 15 of 39 on the Union Vale, Beekman, Pawling & Dover Scenic Tour (Tour 6).]]></description>
