  <Placemark>
    <name>Basilica Hudson Hudson, NY</name>
    <description><![CDATA[Basilica Hudson<br/><br/>📍 Hudson, NY<br/><br/>An 1880s industrial landmark repurposed as a premier arts venue hosting music, film, visual art, and the celebrated biannual Basilica Farmstead market.<br/><br/>Tips<br/>- Open during events only — check basilicahudson. for the Sept calendar<br/>- The Farmstead market draws regional artisans and food makers<br/><br/>More info: https://www.google.com/maps/search/Basilica+Hudson+Hudson,+NY]]></description>
