  <Placemark>
    <name>Bass Harbor Marsh Bass Harbor ME</name>
    <description><![CDATA[Bass Harbor Marsh<br/><br/>📍 Near the Hio Fire Road bridge, Bass Harbor, ME<br/><br/>A tidal marsh near Bass Harbor, primarily a birding destination and noticeably less trafficked than the main park attractions on the eastern side of the island.<br/><br/>Tips<br/>- Bring binoculars — birding is the main draw here<br/>- Accessible via the Hio Fire Road bridge crossing]]></description>
