    <description><![CDATA[Bay Road Overlook<br/><br/>📍 1-9 Bay Rd, Camden, ME<br/><br/>A hilltop pull-off with beautiful views — quiet, uncrowded, minimal reviews mean minimal foot traffic. (4.9★, 8 reviews on Google Maps)<br/><br/>Tips<br/>- Low-traffic spot — good if the more famous overlooks feel crowded]]></description>
