  <Placemark>
    <name>Beach House Grill Chatham MA</name>
    <description><![CDATA[Overview<br/>Type: Grill and Seafood Restaurant  <br/>Best known for: Generous portions, flavorful seafood dishes.  <br/>Location context: Located at 297 Shore Rd, Oceanside.  <br/>Price level: $10–70 per person  <br/>Visit timing: Opens for dinner at 5 PM, peak times not specified.  <br/><br/>Typical Customers<br/>Demographics: Mix of locals and tourists, popular among both families and couples.  <br/>Group types: Couples, friends, families, larger groups.  <br/>Common occasions: Casual dinners and special occasions.  <br/><br/>Vibe & Setting<br/>Atmosphere: Casual and lively with a beachside vibe.  <br/>Noise level: Moderate.  <br/>Decor & setting: Offers indoor and outdoor seating, beach views, relaxed atmosphere.  <br/>Service style: Friendly and attentive service.  <br/><br/>Recommended Dishes<br/>Overall dish consensus: Reviewers often praise the Lobster Nachos, which is a standout item; also noted for the fresh seafood and generous portions.  <br/><br/>How “top dishes” are determined: Top dishes are identified based on mentions in user reviews and menu visibility, particularly those frequently praised for flavor and presentation.  <br/><br/>| Rank | Dish                    | Why it stands out                               | How often it’s mentioned          | Ideal for                |<br/>|------|------------------------|------------------------------------------------|-----------------------------------|--------------------------|<br/>| 1    | Lobster Nachos         | A generous appetizer perfect for sharing.     | Mentioned in many reviews.       | Sharing at the table     |<br/>| 2    | Fish and Chips         | Noted for being fresh and well-prepared.      | Appears in several reviews.      | Hearty main              |<br/>| 3    | Crab Cake BLT          | Praised for its flavor and unique twist.      | Repeatedly called out.           | Lighter option           |<br/><br/>Good alternates / backup choices:  <br/>- Clam Chowder: Known for its rich, creamy texture.  <br/>- Sword Fish Tacos: A fresh option with good seasoning.  <br/>- Caesar Salad: A satisfying side loved for its crispness.  <br/><br/>Highlights (non‑dish positives from reviews)<br/>Atmosphere: Beautiful views and a relaxing vibe enhance the dining experience.  <br/>Service quality: Consistent mentions of friendly and efficient staff.  <br/><br/>Common Issues (from reviews)<br/>Service speed: Some reviews mention occasional delays during busy hours.  <br/>Pricing: May be on the higher side for some customers, noted during peak dining times.  <br/><br/>Practical Notes<br/>Reservation / wait: Reservations are recommended, especially for peak dining hours.  <br/>Accessibility: Not mentioned.  <br/>Parking / transit: Not mentioned.  <br/>Best use case: Best for casual dinners with family or friends, especially when sharing dishes.<br/><br/>More info: https://www.google.com/maps/place/Beach+House+Grill/@41.6842288,-69.9541883,353m/data=!3m1!1e3!4m11!1m3!2m2!1sRestaurants!6e5!3m6!1s0x89fb13592bee2b1d:0xcb9b5463b2923497!8m2!3d41.6847856!4d-69.9509982!15sCgtSZXN0YXVyYW50c1oNIgtyZXN0YXVyYW50c5IBDWJhcl9hbmRfZ3JpbGyaAURDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnBLVkdGR1JsZFNNblIxWVVaYVJWVnJXbGRVYTNCUVlURk9WVm93UlJBQuABAPoBBQjCBhBJ!16s%2Fg%2F1hhhhhm51?entry=ttu&g_ep=EgoyMDI2MDYxMC4wIKXMDSoASAFQAw%3D%3D]]></description>
