  <Placemark>
    <name>Beal's Lobster Pier Southwest Harbor ME</name>
    <description><![CDATA[Beal's Lobster is a well-regarded seafood restaurant located in Bar Harbor, known primarily for its lobster dishes, including boiled lobster and lobster rolls. The establishment attracts a diverse clientele, including families, tourists, and seafood enthusiasts who visit for casual dining experiences. The overall vibe is casual and welcoming, making it suitable for family outings and relaxed meals. Positive feedback commonly highlights the high quality of the food, the friendly service, and the pleasant atmosphere. However, some diners have noted a delay in service during busy periods as a common issue.<br/><br/>More info: https://www.google.com/maps/place/Beal's+Lobster+Pier/@44.2778525,-68.3278887,1570m/data=!3m1!1e3!4m6!3m5!1s0x4caebd2245f481a1:0x465999439c937e3e!8m2!3d44.2753704!4d-68.3129377!16s%2Fg%2F1thlz0wn?entry=ttu&g_ep=EgoyMDI2MDYxMC4wIKXMDSoASAFQAw%3D%3D]]></description>
