  <Placemark>
    <name>Bean Island Sorrento ME</name>
    <description><![CDATA[Bean Island<br/><br/>📍 Sorrento Town Dock, Sorrento, ME — water access only (boat, kayak, or canoe)<br/><br/>27-acre wooded island under conservation easement since 1975, former sheep-grazing land. A ~1 mi coastline loop trail passes rocky beaches and lichen-covered forest. Popular for picnicking and primitive camping.<br/><br/>Tips<br/>- Water access only — launch from the Sorrento Town Dock]]></description>
