  <Placemark>
    <name>Bearce Allen and NORGAL Preserves Bristol ME</name>
    <description><![CDATA[Bearce Allen and NORGAL Preserves<br/><br/>📍 19 Austin Rd, off Sproul Hill Rd, Bristol, ME (coordinate approximate — Sproul Hill Rd geocode, Austin Rd itself didn't resolve precisely)<br/><br/>Sustainable-forestry demonstration trail with interpretive signage; the edge of a 1953 forest fire is still visible mid-trail. Noted for lady slipper orchids (late May-June) and genuine solitude. ~1.7 mi, 134 ft gain.<br/><br/>Tips<br/>- Coordinate is approximate — verify against Coastal Rivers' own trail map before relying on it for navigation<br/><br/>More info: https://www.coastalrivers.org/trails/bearce-allen-and-norgal-preserves/]]></description>
    <styleUrl>#c-green</styleUrl>
