  <Placemark>
    <name>Bearsville Theater Woodstock, NY</name>
    <description><![CDATA[Bearsville Theater<br/><br/>📍 Woodstock, NY<br/><br/>A historic music venue on Sawkill Creek at the Bearsville Center arts campus — the heart of Woodstock's live music scene since the 1970s.<br/><br/>Tips<br/>- Check the event calendar — programming ranges from touring artists to local acts<br/>- The outdoor Sawkill Creek setting is particularly lovely in September<br/>- Tinker Street Tavern on the same campus for pre-show drinks<br/><br/>More info: https://www.google.com/maps/search/Bearsville+Theater+Woodstock,+NY]]></description>
