  <Placemark>
    <name>Beaver Brook Falls Wayside Colebrook NH</name>
    <description><![CDATA[Beaver Brook Falls Wayside<br/><br/>📍 Colebrook NH<br/><br/>Roadside 80-foot cascading waterfall in a scenic wayside park in the Great North Woods, with easy viewing access right off Route 145.<br/><br/>Tips<br/>- Easy roadside stop — no hike required for the main view.<br/>- Far north (~48 mi from Littleton) — best combined with other Colebrook stops.]]></description>
