  <Placemark>
    <name>Belfast Armistice Bridge Belfast ME</name>
    <description><![CDATA[Belfast Armistice Bridge<br/><br/>📍 6 Footbridge Rd, Belfast, ME<br/><br/>A pedestrian footbridge across the Passagassawakeag River in Belfast, with benches for sitting and a cool waterfront breeze — a genuinely local, unpolished stop. (4.8★, 246 reviews on Google Maps)<br/><br/>Tips<br/>- Good pairing with a walk along Belfast's working waterfront<br/>- Benches make it a nice rest stop, not just a photo op]]></description>
