  <Placemark>
    <name>Belfast City Park ME</name>
    <description><![CDATA[Belfast City Park<br/><br/>Belfast City Park is a broad public recreation area that gives residents and visitors open space close to the bay. Local travel guides describe it as a good spot for picnics, playground time, and relaxed outdoor use rather than as a highly programmed tourist site.[cite:34]<br/><br/>That low-key character is part of its value. It offers a quieter counterpoint to downtown Belfast and works well for travelers who want harbor air, green space, and an easy local place to unwind.[cite:34]]]></description>
