  <Placemark>
    <name>Belfast Co-op Belfast ME</name>
    <description><![CDATA[Belfast Co-op<br/><br/>📍 123 High St, Belfast, ME 04915<br/><br/>Community-owned natural foods co-op since 1976, with an on-site cafe. Local Maine products (coffee, honey), groceries, vegan/gluten-free deli food. Rated 4.4 on Tripadvisor (205 reviews).<br/><br/>Tips<br/>- Open daily 7/8am-8pm.<br/>- Reddit's original mention: groceries plus "incense, candles, neti pots, hemp granola" — a good stop for trip snacks/supplies, not a dedicated meal destination.<br/><br/>More info: https://belfast.coop]]></description>
