  <Placemark>
    <name>Belfast Farmers Market Belfast ME</name>
    <description><![CDATA[Belfast Farmers' Market<br/><br/>📍 Waterfall Arts, 256 High Street, Belfast, ME 04915<br/><br/>The seasonal Belfast Farmers' Market runs Fridays at the Waterfall Arts campus. Belfast is also home to the United Farmers' Market of Maine, a separate year-round indoor market at 18 Spring Street with 70+ vendors, open Saturdays 9 AM–2 PM — worth knowing about as a rain-or-shine backup regardless of which day you're in town.<br/><br/>Tips<br/>- Friday market: 9 AM–1 PM, May through late October, at Waterfall Arts (confirmed via Maine Federation of Farmers' Markets)<br/>- Year-round Saturday alternative: United Farmers' Market of Maine, 18 Spring Street, 9 AM–2 PM, indoors<br/>- Both accept SNAP/EBT; combine with browsing Belfast's harborside downtown<br/><br/>More info: https://www.google.com/maps/search/Waterfall+Arts+256+High+Street+Belfast+ME]]></description>
