      <coordinates>-71.4687,43.5278,0</coordinates>
    </Point>
  </Placemark>
  <Placemark>
    <name>Bell the Cat Belfast ME</name>
    <description><![CDATA[Time: 2026-08-22T10:30:00<br/><br/>Bell the Cat<br/><br/>📍 15 Belmont Ave, Belfast, ME 04915<br/><br/>From-scratch bakery/cafe, a Belfast staple since 1994 — fresh pastries and made-to-order sandwiches with local ingredients. Rated 4.6 on Google, 4.9 on Restaurant Guru (1,680 reviews).<br/><br/>Tips<br/>- Open daily 7am-3pm — a breakfast/lunch spot, not evening.<br/>- Two separate Reddit recommendations independently named this one.<br/>- Doubles as the earliest option for a Bar Harbor → North Conway lunch break (2026-08-22): Belfast sits directly on the route, roughly 1.5 hours / 65 miles in — an ~10:30am stop if leaving Bar Harbor at 9am, well ahead of the noon cluster of options further along in Auburn/Lewiston.<br/><br/>More info: https://bellthecatinc.com]]></description>
