  </Placemark>
  <Placemark>
    <name>Ben &amp; Jerry's Factory Tour Waterbury VT</name>
    <description><![CDATA[Ben & Jerry's Factory Tour<br/><br/>📍 Waterbury VT<br/><br/>30-minute guided factory tour covering company history and ice cream production, ending with a free scoop sample. Flavor Graveyard and gift shop on-site.<br/><br/>Tips<br/>- Pre-book online — tours sell out in summer.<br/>- The Flavor Graveyard (headstones for discontinued flavors) is a fun free stop even without a tour.]]></description>
