  <Placemark>
    <name>Big Bickford Mountain Franconia Notch NH</name>
    <description><![CDATA[Big Bickford Mountain<br/><br/>📍 Near Franconia Notch, NH<br/><br/>A trail-less 3,000-foot peak near Franconia Notch. Off-trail hikers typically start the bushwhack from the Skookumchuck Trail's Route 3 trailhead, through fairly open woods, sometimes extended to include nearby Scarface Mountain.<br/><br/>Tips<br/>- No maintained trail — for experienced bushwhackers/peakbaggers only, not a general-visitor stop.<br/><br/>More info: https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=44.1967%2C%20-71.6540]]></description>
