  <Placemark>
    <name>Big Fatty's BBQ Hartford VT</name>
    <description><![CDATA[A barbecue restaurant known for its friendly staff and quick service. It serves a variety of smoked meats and offers a salad bar. Prices range from $10 to $20. Open for lunch and dinner, and it offers locally crafted beers.<br/><br/>More info: https://www.google.com/maps/place/Big+Fatty's+BBQ/@43.6461847,-72.320862,795m/data=!3m2!1e3!4b1!4m6!3m5!1s0x4cb4ca509c04c4e5:0x2919955d13aeb40b!8m2!3d43.6461808!4d-72.3182871!16s%2Fg%2F1tgnwty6?entry=ttu&g_ep=EgoyMDI2MDYyMy4wIKXMDSoASAFQAw%3D%3D]]></description>
