  <Placemark>
    <name>Big Top Delicatessen Brunswick ME</name>
    <description><![CDATA[Big Top Delicatessen<br/><br/>📍 70 Maine St, Brunswick, ME<br/><br/>A Brunswick institution "crafting premium sandwiches since 1996" — generous, affordable, made-to-order deli sandwiches and a strong breakfast menu at a small counter-service spot with a big local following.<br/><br/>Must Order<br/>- Reuben — corned beef, sauerkraut, Swiss, 1000 Island, on rye<br/>- Philly Cheese Steak<br/>- Classic Italian — capicola, ham, salami, bologna, provolone<br/>- The Bailey — vegetarian, three cheeses, veggies, cucumber-dill dressing<br/>- Hand-formed 1/3 lb burgers, house bagels<br/><br/>Tips<br/>- Counter service, order at the register; outdoor seating available<br/>- Hours are inconsistent across sources (site says Tue-Sat 10am-4pm; other listings show earlier/later hours) — confirm day-of<br/><br/>More info: https://www.bigtopdeli.com/]]></description>
