  <Placemark>
    <name>Billings Farm &amp; Museum Woodstock VT</name>
    <description><![CDATA[Billings Farm & Museum is a historical museum focused on agriculture and local history. It offers homemade ice cream, seasonal beverages, and is suitable for families. The price for admission is $23. It is open for lunch and dinner, but primarily serves during the day.<br/><br/>More info: https://www.google.com/maps/place/Billings+Farm+%26+Museum/@43.628482,-72.5249256,2212m/data=!3m1!1e3!4m14!1m7!3m6!1s0x89e1d81e634b8e5d:0xe286e927432ae57a!2sMarsh-Billings-Rockefeller+National+Historical+Park!8m2!3d43.6311474!4d-72.5178484!16zL20vMDUzM2Yx!3m5!1s0x89e1d81b8412d4cb:0xda0480210577c0d5!8m2!3d43.6316007!4d-72.5157636!16s%2Fg%2F122qxzvc?entry=ttu&g_ep=EgoyMDI2MDYxNi4wIKXMDSoASAFQAw%3D%3D]]></description>
