  <Placemark>
    <name>Bingham Falls Stowe VT</name>
    <description><![CDATA[Bingham Falls<br/><br/>📍 Stowe VT<br/><br/>Hidden waterfall gorge carved by the West Branch with cascades through sculpted rock, off Route 108 in the Smugglers' Notch corridor.<br/><br/>Tips<br/>- Wear hiking boots — the descent is short but steep and slippery.<br/>- Easy to combine with the Smugglers' Notch scenic drive on Route 108.]]></description>
