    <name>Birch Harbor Pond Gouldsboro ME</name>
    <description><![CDATA[Birch Harbor Pond<br/><br/>📍 Birch Harbor, Gouldsboro, ME<br/><br/>A pond near the village of Birch Harbor, one of several small Down East communities that make up the town of Gouldsboro along the Schoodic Peninsula.<br/><br/>Tips<br/>- A minor landmark along the byway route rather than a planned stop.<br/><br/>More info: https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=44.3917%2C%20-68.0623]]></description>
