  <Placemark>
    <name>Bizibuns Brunswick ME</name>
    <description><![CDATA[Bizibuns<br/><br/>📍 170 Maine St, Brunswick, ME (address as of 2026 — some directories still show a stale "156 Maine St")<br/><br/>Started as a food truck (2023 Press Herald profile), now operating from a fixed Maine Street location — known for craveable fried chicken sandwiches with standout seasoning, plus a rotating globally-inspired menu of bowls and wraps.<br/><br/>Must Order<br/>- Spicy fried chicken sandwich — brioche bun, slaw, hot honey<br/>- Classic fried chicken sandwich<br/>- Smoky lamb & rice bowl<br/>- Falafel wrap — crisp falafel, pickled red onion, dill pickle, salad, sauce<br/>- Tuna poke bowl<br/><br/>Tips<br/>- Counter/takeout service, limited hours (roughly Tue-Fri or Tue-Sat, 9/10am-3pm, closed Sun/Mon)<br/>- Thinnest, most inconsistent web footprint of this batch — confirm current address and hours by phone (617-678-0100) or Instagram @bizibuns before finalizing plans]]></description>
