    <name>Black Cat Spur Pittsburg NH</name>
    <description><![CDATA[Black Cat Spur<br/><br/>📍 Pittsburg, NH<br/><br/>A peak in far-northern Pittsburg, near the Quebec border.<br/><br/>Tips<br/>- No well-documented public trail found — treat as a landmark rather than a planned hike unless you find current access info locally.<br/><br/>More info: https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=45.1812%2C%20-71.1806]]></description>
