  <Placemark>
    <name>Black-Eyed Suzie's Upstate Saugerties, NY</name>
    <description><![CDATA[Black-Eyed Suzie's Upstate<br/><br/>📍 Saugerties, NY<br/><br/>A bold, flavorful contemporary restaurant using farm-direct ingredients with distinctive upstate swagger — one of Saugerties' most exciting recent openings.<br/><br/>Must Order<br/>- Daily specials — built around what arrived from farms that morning<br/>- Seasonal vegetable plates — among the most creative in the area<br/><br/>Tips<br/>- Check social media for current hours — service schedule varies<br/>- Worth the trip from Rhinecliff (~20 min drive)<br/><br/>More info: https://www.google.com/maps/search/Black-Eyed+Suzie's+Upstate+Saugerties,+NY]]></description>
