  </Placemark>
  <Placemark>
    <name>Blarney Dogs Brunswick ME</name>
    <description><![CDATA[Blarney Dogs<br/><br/>📍 16 Station Ave, Suite 102, Brunswick, ME (inside/adjacent to Byrnes Irish Pub, Brunswick Station complex)<br/><br/>A hot-dog-centric concept from the well-regarded Byrnes Irish Pub — natural-casing dogs and red snappers loaded with pub toppings, served in a lively Irish-pub atmosphere near the Amtrak Downeaster station.<br/><br/>Must Order<br/>- Whiskey Dog<br/>- Downtown Dog<br/>- Taco Dog<br/><br/>Tips<br/>- Dine-in only — reported no delivery/takeout<br/>- Hours and reservation policy weren't confirmed online — worth a call ahead, shared location with Byrnes Irish Pub]]></description>
    <styleUrl>#c-purple</styleUrl>
    <ExtendedData>
