  <Placemark>
    <name>Blue Hill At Stone Barns Mount Pleasant NY</name>
    <description><![CDATA[Overview<br/>Type: Fine Dining Restaurant  <br/>Best known for: Impeccable service, fresh vegetables from the farm  <br/>Location context: Stone Barns, New York  <br/>Price level: $100+ per person  <br/>Visit timing: Dinner service only, reservations recommended  <br/><br/>Typical Customers<br/>Demographics: Couples and special occasion diners  <br/>Group types: Couples, families, larger groups for celebrations  <br/>Common occasions: Anniversary celebrations, fine dining experiences  <br/><br/>Vibe & Setting<br/>Atmosphere: Formal, attentive service  <br/>Noise level: Moderate  <br/>Decor & setting: Indoor dining with a cozy atmosphere  <br/>Service style: Highly attentive, professional  <br/><br/>Recommended Dishes<br/>Overall dish consensus  <br/>Reviewers agree on the fresh, seasonal dishes, notably praising the pizzas and vegetable preparations as standout items.  <br/><br/>How “top dishes” are determined  <br/>Top dishes are chosen based on mentions in reviews and the menu, highlighting those praised for flavor and popularity in photos.  <br/><br/>| Rank | Dish                    | Why it stands out                                    | How often it’s mentioned      | Ideal for                  |<br/>|------|-----------------------|----------------------------------------------------|-------------------------------|----------------------------|<br/>| 1    | Personal pizza        | Unique flavor and loved by many reviewers.          | Repeatedly called out as a favorite. | Sharing at the table      |<br/>| 2    | Seasonal vegetables    | Fresh and tastily prepared, highly praised.          | Appears in numerous photos.      | Lighter option            |<br/>| 3    | Vegetable dishes       | Noteworthy for freshness, ideal for veggie lovers.   | Mentioned in many reviews.      | Hearty main               |<br/><br/>Good alternates / backup choices  <br/>- Appetizers: Frequently praised for their creativity and flavor.  <br/>- Desserts: Generally well-received but with less consensus.  <br/><br/>Highlights (non-dish positives from reviews)<br/>Service quality: Many reviewers commend the attentive and warm service provided throughout the meal.  <br/><br/>Ambiance: The atmosphere is described as cozy and welcoming, enhancing the overall dining experience.  <br/><br/>Common Issues (from reviews)<br/>Reservation necessity: It’s noted that reservations are a must, especially on weekends.  <br/><br/>Wait times: Some diners indicated there can be long waits to be seated during peak times.  <br/><br/>Practical Notes<br/>Reservation / wait: Reservations highly recommended.  <br/>Accessibility: Not mentioned.  <br/>Parking / transit: Not mentioned.  <br/>Best use case: Best for special occasions and fine dining experiences.<br/><br/>More info: https://www.google.com/maps/place/Blue+Hill+At+Stone+Barns/@41.1042276,-73.8311315,835m/data=!3m1!1e3!4m14!1m7!3m6!1s0x89c2bff2210f1713:0x386e478ff8aceb5!2sBlue+Hill+At+Stone+Barns!8m2!3d41.1042276!4d-73.8285566!16s%2Fm%2F0zs9tdv!3m5!1s0x89c2bff2210f1713:0x386e478ff8aceb5!8m2!3d41.1042276!4d-73.8285566!16s%2Fm%2F0zs9tdv?entry=ttu&g_ep=EgoyMDI2MDYxMy4wIKXMDSoASAFQAw%3D%3D]]></description>
