  <Placemark>
    <name>Blue Hill Inn Restaurant Blue Hill ME</name>
    <description><![CDATA[Blue Hill Inn Restaurant<br/><br/>📍 Blue Hill ME<br/><br/>Inn dining room serving refined, ingredient-driven New England fare.<br/><br/>Must Order<br/>- <br/><br/>Tips<br/>- Quieter alternative to Arborvine in the same town.]]></description>
