  <Placemark>
    <name>Blue Spoon Rockport ME</name>
    <description><![CDATA[Blue Spoon is a bistro known for its cozy atmosphere and limited yet quality menu, featuring dishes like Bistro Burger and Risotto. It attracts a diverse clientele, including families and couples looking for a casual dining experience. The vibe is relaxed and intimate, making it suitable for both romantic dinners and friendly gatherings. Customers consistently praise the friendly staff, the quality prices for the food, and the cozy ambience. However, some reviews mention the limited menu options and a lack of hearty dishes as potential downsides.<br/><br/>More info: https://www.google.com/maps/place/Blue+Spoon/@44.1900189,-69.0849299,2058m/data=!3m1!1e3!4m6!3m5!1s0x4cb29c5d5c74b07f:0xea32f5e3789d076a!8m2!3d44.1973536!4d-69.0794039!16s%2Fg%2F1tfptwbv?entry=ttu&g_ep=EgoyMDI2MDYxMC4wIKXMDSoASAFQAw%3D%3D]]></description>
