  <Placemark>
    <name>Blueberry Lake Warren VT</name>
    <description><![CDATA[Blueberry Lake<br/><br/>📍 Green Mountain National Forest, East Warren, VT<br/><br/>A small lake in the Green Mountain National Forest near East Warren, a peaceful spot for a quiet paddle or picnic away from the busier Mad River Valley crowds.<br/><br/>Tips<br/>- A good low-key detour if the more popular swimming holes (Warren Falls, Bristol Falls) are too crowded.<br/><br/>More info: https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=44.0812%2C%20-72.8350]]></description>
