  <Placemark>
    <name>Bluefins Sushi &amp; Sake Bar Chatham MA</name>
    <description><![CDATA[Bluefins Sushi & Sake Bar offers sushi and seafood, with prices ranging from $50 to $100 per person. It is open for dinner daily with a closing time at 8:30 PM or 9 PM on weekends. Alcohol is served.<br/><br/>More info: https://www.google.com/maps/place/Bluefins+Sushi+%26+Sake+Bar/@41.6801125,-69.9681313,3321m/data=!3m1!1e3!4m6!3m5!1s0x89fb149fa21e4951:0xa56af4b33b22606f!8m2!3d41.6801225!4d-69.9576711!16s%2Fg%2F11bbsz39xk?hl=en-US&entry=ttu&g_ep=EgoyMDI2MDYxNi4wIKXMDSoASAFQAw%3D%3D]]></description>
