  <Placemark>
    <name>Bonticou Crag New Paltz, NY</name>
    <description><![CDATA[Bonticou Crag<br/><br/>📍 New Paltz, NY<br/><br/>One of the most recognizable natural landmarks along the byway, visible from Rt 299, Springtown Road, and the northern approaches to New Paltz.<br/><br/>Tips<br/>- Accessed via trails within the Mohonk Preserve<br/>- Popular scramble route, not a technical climb<br/><br/>More info: https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=41.7840%2C%20-74.1360]]></description>
