  <Placemark>
    <name>Bowdoin College</name>
    <description><![CDATA[Bowdoin College is a private liberal arts college in Brunswick, Maine, with a historic New England campus open to visitors. On-campus dining is for students, but the grounds and architecture are worth a walk-through.<br/><br/>More info: https://www.google.com/maps/place/Bowdoin+College/@43.9076929,-69.9687607,787m/data=!3m1!1e3!4m10!1m2!2m1!1sbowdoin+college!3m6!1s0x4cad873e343ba803:0xa9b08c7cc377609!8m2!3d43.9076929!4d-69.9639971!15sCg9ib3dkb2luIGNvbGxlZ2WSARJwcml2YXRlX3VuaXZlcnNpdHngAQA!16zL20vMDFjMzMz?entry=ttu&g_ep=EgoyMDI2MDcyOS4wIKXMDSoASAFQAw%3D%3D]]></description>
