  <Placemark>
    <name>Bowen's Tavern Belfast ME</name>
    <description><![CDATA[Bowen's Tavern<br/><br/>📍 181 Waterville Rd, Belfast, ME 04915<br/><br/>Dive-bar-and-restaurant on Belfast's outskirts, called out on Reddit as "the local's spot for live music." Weekend breakfast, Thursday karaoke.<br/><br/>Tips<br/>- No reliable numeric rating found — too few reviews on major platforms (Tripadvisor, OpenTable, BBB) to trust a score. Worth a fresh look closer to the trip.<br/>- This is further from downtown Belfast than the other spots on this list — it's out toward Holmes Mill, not walkable from the harbor.]]></description>
