  <Placemark>
    <name>Bred in the Bone Damariscotta ME</name>
    <description><![CDATA[Bred in the Bone<br/><br/>📍 133 Main St, Damariscotta, ME<br/><br/>A cozy Mediterranean-inspired restaurant with a deliberately short, weekly-changing menu — pappardelle, scallops, and tuna alongside dessert standouts like tiramisu, affogato, and olive cakes. The room leans into deep colors and exposed brick for a charming, thoughtful feel, backed by an extensive wine list. Google rates it 4.8; ranked around #7 of 33 restaurants in Damariscotta.<br/><br/>Must Order<br/>- Pappardelle<br/>- Scallops<br/>- Tiramisu or affogato for dessert<br/><br/>Tips<br/>- Short menu by design — check what's currently running since it changes weekly, plus regular specials.<br/>- Reservations recommended given the small room and short menu (limited covers per night).<br/>- Good wine list — worth asking staff for a pairing if you're ordering the tasting-style small plates.<br/><br/>More info: https://www.bitbmaine.com/]]></description>
