  <Placemark>
    <name>Brewster Flats Brewster MA</name>
    <description><![CDATA[Brewster Flats<br/><br/>📍 Brewster MA<br/><br/>At low tide the bay recedes up to 2 miles, exposing vast sand flats and tide pools — one of the Cape's signature natural experiences.<br/><br/>Tips<br/>- Check a tide chart — you want to arrive 1–2 hours before low tide.<br/>- Access via Linnell Landing, Crosby Landing, or Paines Creek Beach.]]></description>
