  <Placemark>
    <name>Briggs Mountain Red Hook, NY</name>
    <description><![CDATA[Briggs Mountain<br/><br/>📍 495 Academy Hill Rd, Red Hook, NY<br/><br/>A small mountain near Red Hook, marking the northern end of this stretch of the Taconic Byway list and close to the Rhinebeck/Red Hook base of the Hudson Valley leg.<br/><br/>Tips<br/>- Close enough to Red Hook, NY to combine with a stop in town.<br/><br/>More info: https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=41.991746,-73.755426]]></description>
