  <Placemark>
    <name>Bristol Recreational Trail Bristol ME</name>
    <description><![CDATA[Bristol Recreational Trail<br/><br/>📍 Route 130 at Bristol Consolidated School, 2153 Bristol Rd, Bristol, ME<br/><br/>Loops along the tidal Pemaquid River estuary right behind the school — benches, old red oaks, and small brook bridges. One accessible segment, dog-friendly. ~0.7-0.75 mi, ~30 min walk.<br/><br/>Tips<br/>- One accessible segment<br/>- Dog-friendly<br/><br/>More info: https://www.coastalrivers.org/trails/bristol-recreational-trail/]]></description>
