  <Placemark>
    <name>Bub's Burritos Southwest Harbor ME</name>
    <description><![CDATA[Bub's Burritos is a popular choice for Latin American cuisine, particularly favored by a younger crowd and casual diners looking for fresh, flavorful food in generous portions. The vibe is lively and upbeat, ideal for quick meals or casual hangouts. Positive comments often note the quality and freshness of ingredients and the appealing flavors, although the limited hours can be a downside for those wanting late-night options.<br/><br/>More info: https://www.google.com/maps/place/Bub's+Burritos/@44.2797325,-68.3267077,196m/data=!3m1!1e3!4m12!1m5!2m4!1sRestaurants!5m1!4e9!6e5!3m5!1s0x4caebd000b36561d:0xe7f072ceef7662f5!8m2!3d44.2802036!4d-68.3248044!15sCgtSZXN0YXVyYW50c1oNIgtyZXN0YXVyYW50c5IBGWxhdGluX2FtZXJpY2FuX3Jlc3RhdXJhbnSaAURDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMjV3VEZwSGFHcFZSbHB1WkZoQ1NGZHRlRkJWUjA1NFdXdFdVVkp0WXhBQuABAPoBBQjNARBL?entry=ttu&g_ep=EgoyMDI2MDYxMC4wIKXMDSoASAFQAw%3D%3D]]></description>
