  <Placemark>
    <name>Bubble Rock Acadia National Park ME</name>
    <description><![CDATA[Bubble Rock<br/><br/>📍 Park Loop Rd, Acadia National Park, ME<br/><br/>A glacial erratic boulder perched on the edge of South Bubble, with a classic view down onto Jordan Pond — one of Acadia's most photographed hiking rewards. (4.8★, 396 reviews on Google Maps)<br/><br/>Tips<br/>- Reached via a moderate ~1 mi hike from the Bubbles parking area — not a roadside stop<br/>- Can be socked in by fog; check conditions before the climb]]></description>
