  <Placemark>
    <name>Bubble and Bite Brunswick ME</name>
    <description><![CDATA[Bubble and Bite - Boba Tea & Asian Eats<br/><br/>📍 149 Maine St, Tontine Mall, Brunswick, ME (same building as Walter's Cafe)<br/><br/>Hand-crafted boba drinks and bold Asian street food flavors — a combination distinct from typical New England café fare, convenient to Bowdoin College.<br/><br/>Must Order<br/>- Boba flavors — Brown Sugar, Matcha Milk Tea, Classic Taro<br/>- Rice bowls, bao buns<br/>- Japanese-style fries, mochi waffles<br/><br/>Tips<br/>- Prefers pickup orders through their own site (bubblenbite.com); DoorDash also available<br/>- Hours: Sun 11:30am-5pm, Mon-Thu 11:30am-7pm, Fri-Sat 11:30am-8pm<br/>- Newer, smaller business with the thinnest web footprint of this batch — no independent press coverage found; worth a call-ahead confirmation before finalizing plans around it<br/><br/>More info: https://www.bubblenbite.com/]]></description>
    <styleUrl>#c-purple</styleUrl>
    <ExtendedData>
      <Data name="vault_type"><value>Restaurant</value></Data>
