    <description><![CDATA[Burke Hill<br/><br/>📍 Near Donnell Pond Public Reserved Land, Franklin, ME<br/><br/>A hill along the Blackwoods Scenic Byway corridor, near the eastern edge of the Donnell Pond Public Reserved Land.<br/><br/>Tips<br/>- No well-documented public trail found — treat as a landmark rather than a planned hike unless you find current access info locally.<br/><br/>More info: https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=44.5990%2C%20-67.9742]]></description>
