  <Placemark>
    <name>Burlington Waterfront Park Burlington VT</name>
    <description><![CDATA[Burlington Waterfront Park<br/><br/>📍 Burlington VT<br/><br/>Mile-long park on Lake Champlain with bike path, swimming beach, boat docks, and sweeping sunset views west across the lake to the Adirondacks.<br/><br/>Tips<br/>- One of New England's best sunsets — face west over the lake.<br/>- Church Street Marketplace is a short walk east — easy to combine.]]></description>
