  <Placemark>
    <name>Burning Tree Restaurant Otter Creek ME PERMANENTLY CLOSED</name>
    <description><![CDATA[Burning Tree Restaurant<br/><br/>📍 Otter Creek, Bar Harbor, ME<br/><br/>A restaurant located in Otter Creek, south of downtown Bar Harbor. Part of the local pattern of moving south and west out of town for dinner when central Bar Harbor is at peak capacity.<br/><br/>Tips<br/>- South of downtown on Route 3<br/>- Off the main tourist strip<br/>- Good bailout option for avoiding downtown evening crowds<br/>- Locals recommend heading this direction for dinner in August]]></description>
