  </Placemark>
  <Placemark>
    <name>Butler's Pantry Breakfast and Dinner Stowe VT</name>
    <description><![CDATA[The establishment is a restaurant known for its breakfast offerings, particularly popular for eggs Benedict and pastries. It attracts couples and families, often visited for brunch or casual dining experiences. The vibe is casual and welcoming, with reports of friendly service. Reviewers consistently praise the quality of food, prompt meal delivery, and the pleasant environment. Some downsides noted include higher prices and smaller portion sizes for children.<br/><br/>More info: https://www.google.com/maps/place/Butler's+Pantry+Breakfast+and+Dinner/@44.4651613,-72.6893761,895m/data=!3m1!1e3!4m6!3m5!1s0x4cb5965469ce0ddd:0xc4586a474550d8cd!8m2!3d44.4650968!4d-72.6849471!16s%2Fg%2F11fyxdf7mp?entry=ttu&g_ep=EgoyMDI2MDYxMC4wIKXMDSoASAFQAw%3D%3D]]></description>
