  <Placemark>
    <name>Buttermilk Kitchen at Marriner's-Camden Maine Camden ME</name>
    <description><![CDATA[Buttermilk Kitchen at Marriner's<br/><br/>📍 35 Main St, Camden, ME<br/><br/>A breakfast-and-lunch spot from chef Suzanne Vizethann, built around wholesome, scratch-made comfort food — the name is a nod to buttermilk, the byproduct of churning butter, and the kitchen's whole approach. Google-rated 4.8, a standout even among Camden's strong breakfast scene.<br/><br/>Must Order<br/>- Chicken biscuit with red pepper jelly — the most-praised dish by a wide margin<br/>- Buttermilk drop biscuits<br/>- Pimento cheese grits<br/>- Blueberry pancakes and haddock chowder for a more classic Maine breakfast/lunch pick<br/>- Corned beef hash<br/><br/>Tips<br/>- Reasonable prices for the quality — reviewers consistently call it a good value.<br/>- Breakfast/lunch only — plan for morning or midday, not dinner.<br/>- (207) 236-4949 if you want to call ahead about wait times during peak season.<br/><br/>More info: https://www.google.com/maps/place/Buttermilk+Kitchen+at+Marriner's-Camden+Maine/@44.2104565,-69.0675468,516m/data=!3m2!1e3!5s0x4cadd70b8c340ce1:0xb941bb80d4b04e9f!4m13!1m5!2m4!1sRestaurants!5m1!4e9!6e5!3m6!1s0x4cadd70065e5bba7:0xbe9364b64a2dd7da!8m2!3d44.2104565!4d-69.0645939!15sCgtSZXN0YXVyYW50c1oNIgtyZXN0YXVyYW50c5IBE2FtZXJpY2FuX3Jlc3RhdXJhbnSaAURDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnhvWVZkRmVFTlVNRTUzVm10NFJWcFZNWEJqTTJSSlZXMTRWVTFGUlJBQuABAPoBBAghEEg!16s%2Fg%2F11vk7q8s87?entry=ttu&g_ep=EgoyMDI2MDYwOS4wIKXMDSoASAFQAw%3D%3D]]></description>
