  <Placemark>
    <name>Byrdcliffe Arts Colony Woodstock, NY</name>
    <description><![CDATA[Byrdcliffe Arts Colony<br/><br/>📍 Woodstock, NY<br/><br/>America's oldest continuously operating arts and crafts colony (est. 1903) — a National Historic Landmark with artist studios, gallery exhibitions, and tours.<br/><br/>Tips<br/>- Tours of the historic buildings available seasonally<br/>- The gallery shows work by current artists-in-residence<br/>- Short drive up Glasco Turnpike from the village center<br/><br/>More info: https://www.google.com/maps/search/Byrdcliffe+Arts+Colony+Woodstock,+NY]]></description>
