    </Point>
  </Placemark>
  <Placemark>
    <name>Cadillac Summit Road Bar Harbor ME (Visit 2)</name>
    <description><![CDATA[Time: 2026-08-20T09:00:00<br/><br/>See Cadillac Summit Road Bar Harbor ME (Visit 1) for full booking/rules details — same reservation system, second visit this trip.<br/><br/>This Visit<br/><br/>Confirmation #0869855993-1 — Daytime, August 20, 2026, 9:00–9:30 AM entry window. Booked June 15, 2026.<br/><br/>More info: https://www.recreation.gov/timed-entry/400000]]></description>
