  <Placemark>
    <name>Cafe Dim Sum Burlington VT</name>
    <description><![CDATA[Cafe Dim Sum<br/><br/>📍 95 St Paul St, Burlington, VT<br/><br/>A genuine, cart-style dim sum spot near Church Street downtown — nearly 40 items on the menu, described by reviewers as authentic with genuine warmth. Joe Coffee 4.5★ (321 reviews); Sirved 4.7★; Tripadvisor 5.0 (smaller review base).<br/><br/>Must Order<br/>- Pork shumai<br/>- Wonton noodle soup<br/>- Mapo tofu<br/>- Scallion pancakes<br/>- Sesame noodles<br/>- Chicken feet, for the adventurous<br/><br/>Tips<br/>- Limited hours: open Friday-Sunday only, 11am-9pm — closed Mon-Thu, plan around this<br/>- About 35-40 min from Stowe — worth a dedicated trip if the dates line up with the open days<br/><br/>More info: https://www.google.com/maps/place/Cafe+Dim+Sum/@44.4778,-73.214,17z]]></description>
