    <name>Cafe Miranda Rockland ME</name>
    <description><![CDATA[Cafe Miranda<br/><br/>📍 Rockland ME<br/><br/>Quirky, beloved local institution with a huge globally-inspired menu and lively atmosphere.<br/><br/>Must Order<br/>- Globally-inspired entrees<br/><br/>Tips<br/>- Menu is huge — ask staff for their current favorites.<br/>- Can get loud and busy; go early for a quieter meal.]]></description>
