  <Placemark>
    <name>Cafe Mutton 1 Hudson NY</name>
    <description><![CDATA[Overview<br/>Type: Cafe<br/><br/>Best known for: Unique and creative dishes, Friendly staff<br/><br/>Location context: Hudson, LGBTQ+ friendly establishment<br/><br/>Price level: $20–80 per person<br/><br/>Visit timing: Popular for dinner, particularly on weekends<br/><br/>Typical Customers<br/>Demographics: Mix of locals and tourists<br/><br/>Group types: Couples, friends, families<br/><br/>Common occasions: Brunch, casual dinner, special occasions<br/><br/>Vibe & Setting<br/>Atmosphere: Cozy and unpretentious<br/><br/>Noise level: Moderate<br/><br/>Decor & setting: Indoor seating, welcoming bar area<br/><br/>Service style: Friendly and attentive<br/><br/>Recommended Dishes<br/>Overall dish consensus<br/>High praise for the Sticky Bun and Crêpes with Butter and Maple, suggested must-orders by multiple reviewers.<br/><br/>How “top dishes” are determined<br/>Top dishes are selected based on menu mentions and frequent positive feedback in reviews, including those highlighted in photos.<br/><br/>Top dishes to order<br/>| Rank | Dish                          | Why it stands out                                    | How often it’s mentioned           | Ideal for                 |<br/>|------|-------------------------------|------------------------------------------------------|-----------------------------------|---------------------------|<br/>| 1    | Sticky Bun                   | A favorite for its unique flavor and texture.       | Mentioned in many reviews.       | Sharing at the table      |<br/>| 2    | Crêpes with Butter and Maple | Loved for a delightful sweet taste and presentation. | Appears in numerous photos.      | Lighter option            |<br/>| 3    | Pastrami                     | Known for rich flavor and hearty portion sizes.     | Repeatedly called out as a favorite. | Hearty main               |<br/><br/>Good alternates / backup choices<br/>- Savory Porridge: Notable for its comforting flavors.<br/>- Raclette dishes: Praised for their delightful taste.<br/><br/>Highlights (non‑dish positives from reviews)<br/>Service quality: Staff are frequently noted as friendly and accommodating.<br/><br/>Ambiance: Many reviews emphasize a warm and inviting atmosphere.<br/><br/>Unique menu offerings: The creative and seasonally inspired dishes are a highlight.<br/><br/>Common Issues (from reviews)<br/>Timing: Some reviewers mention inconsistent hours on busy weekends.<br/><br/>Wait times: Occasionally noted during peak dining periods.<br/><br/>Practical Notes<br/>Reservation / wait: Reservations recommended during busy hours.<br/><br/>Accessibility: Not mentioned<br/><br/>Parking / transit: Street parking available.<br/><br/>Best use case: Best for brunch with friends or casual dinners.<br/><br/>More info: https://www.google.com/maps/place/Cafe+Mutton/@42.2471202,-73.7829724,820m/data=!3m1!1e3!4m14!1m7!3m6!1s0x89dd9578ed2a7d9b:0x41169cecb2ac3a40!2sCafe+Mutton!8m2!3d42.2471202!4d-73.7803975!16s%2Fg%2F11rc6jz4yz!3m5!1s0x89dd9578ed2a7d9b:0x41169cecb2ac3a40!8m2!3d42.2471202!4d-73.7803975!16s%2Fg%2F11rc6jz4yz?entry=ttu&g_ep=EgoyMDI2MDYxMy4wIKXMDSoASAFQAw%3D%3D]]></description>
