    <description><![CDATA[Overview<br/>Type: Cafe<br/><br/>Best known for: Seasonal ingredients, friendly service<br/><br/>Location context: Not mentioned<br/><br/>Price level: $20–80 per person<br/><br/>Visit timing: Dinner is popular; hours differ for special days like Juneteenth.<br/><br/>Typical Customers<br/>Demographics: Locals and tourists<br/><br/>Group types: Couples, families, friends<br/><br/>Common occasions: Brunch, casual dinner, celebrations<br/><br/>Vibe & Setting<br/>Atmosphere: Casual, cozy<br/><br/>Noise level: Not mentioned<br/><br/>Decor & setting: Indoor seating, cozy ambiance<br/><br/>Service style: Friendly, attentive<br/><br/>Recommended Dishes<br/>Overall dish consensus  <br/>Diners often praise the Crêpes with Butter and Maple and the Sticky Bun as must-order items. The unique flavor combinations receive strong acclaim.  <br/><br/>How “top dishes” are determined  <br/>Top dishes are identified based on reviews and menu mentions. Dishes noted as popular, that appear frequently in photos, or are praised repeatedly are highlighted here.<br/><br/>| Rank | Dish                          | Why it stands out                                      | How often it’s mentioned                | Ideal for                 |<br/>|------|-------------------------------|-------------------------------------------------------|----------------------------------------|---------------------------|<br/>| 1    | Crêpes with Butter and Maple | Unique flavor, highly praised for its presentation     | Mentioned in many reviews              | Sharing at the table      |<br/>| 2    | Sticky Bun                   | Described as comforting and well-prepared             | Repeatedly called out as a favorite    | Lighter option            |<br/>| 3    | Fewer clearly highlighted dishes in reviews |                                               |                                        |                           |<br/><br/>Good alternates / backup choices  <br/>- Pastrami: Noted for its generous portions and good flavor.<br/><br/>Highlights (non‑dish positives from reviews)<br/>Food quality: The food is described as amazing and unique, with thoughtful preparation praising the chef's love for their craft.<br/><br/>Service: Staff are frequently noted as friendly and accommodating.<br/><br/>Common Issues (from reviews)<br/>Wait times: Not mentioned, but suggested to check for busy times during dinner.<br/><br/>Practical Notes<br/>Reservation / wait: Reservations recommended due to popularity.<br/><br/>Accessibility: Not mentioned<br/><br/>Parking / transit: Not mentioned<br/><br/>Best use case: Great for a cozy brunch or dinner with friends and family.<br/><br/>More info: https://www.google.com/maps/place/Cafe+Mutton/@42.2471202,-73.7829724,820m/data=!3m2!1e3!4b1!4m6!3m5!1s0x89dd9578ed2a7d9b:0x41169cecb2ac3a40!8m2!3d42.2471202!4d-73.7803975!16s%2Fg%2F11rc6jz4yz?entry=ttu&g_ep=EgoyMDI2MDYxMy4wIKXMDSoASAFQAw%3D%3D]]></description>
