    <name>Cafe This Way</name>
    <description><![CDATA[Cafe This Way is a cafe located at 14 Mt Desert St, serving breakfast and American cuisine with prices ranging from $10 to $20. It is open for breakfast and lunch, but closes at 1 PM.<br/><br/>More info: https://www.google.com/maps/place/Cafe+This+Way/@44.3836467,-68.2425459,4524m/data=!3m1!1e3!4m13!1m5!2m4!1sRestaurants!5m1!4e9!6e5!3m6!1s0x4caebf64acc2616d:0x887db249252fe6eb!8m2!3d44.3867582!4d-68.205179!15sCgtSZXN0YXVyYW50c1oNIgtyZXN0YXVyYW50c5IBBGNhZmWaASNDaFpEU1VoTk1HOW5TMFZKUTBGblNVTktka3g2ZVZCbkVBReABAPoBBAgAEEs!16s%2Fg%2F1xfsnblf?entry=ttu&g_ep=EgoyMDI2MDcwOC4wIKXMDSoASAFQAw%3D%3D]]></description>
