    <description><![CDATA[Camden Amphitheater<br/><br/>📍 Camden, ME<br/><br/>A serene public spot right on Camden's harbor, with a great view of the boats and waterfront — genuinely relaxing rather than a tourist checkbox stop. (4.7★, 158 reviews on Google Maps)<br/><br/>Tips<br/>- Good quiet spot to sit for a while in downtown Camden]]></description>
