    </Point>
  </Placemark>
  <Placemark>
    <name>Camden Harbor Cruises Camden ME</name>
    <description><![CDATA[Camden Harbor Cruises<br/><br/>📍 15 Public Landing, Camden, ME 04843<br/><br/>Narrated boat tours aboard the restored lobster yacht Lively Lady (the operation also runs Periwinkle), departing Camden's Public Landing to explore Penobscot Bay and the town's working waterfront.<br/><br/>Tips<br/>- Roughly 1-hour trips, family-friendly with shaded seating<br/>- Departs right from Public Landing in downtown Camden — easy to combine with a walk around the harbor<br/><br/>More info: https://www.camdenharborcruises.com/]]></description>
    <styleUrl>#c-purple</styleUrl>
