  <Placemark>
    <name>Camden House of Pizza Camden ME</name>
    <description><![CDATA[Camden House of Pizza<br/><br/>📍 12 Mechanic St, Camden, ME<br/><br/>A family-owned Camden fixture for over two decades, serving pizza alongside Greek cuisine — gyros, pasta dinners, sandwiches, and salads. Consistently strong reviews across every platform (4.3–4.5 depending on the source), with reviewers specifically praising a crust that's light yet firm and generous, well-balanced sauce and cheese. Just off Main Street, warm and casual.<br/><br/>Must Order<br/>- Pizza — the namesake dish, and the one most consistently praised for crust quality<br/>- Gyros<br/>- Greek-style pasta dinners if you want something beyond pizza<br/><br/>Tips<br/>- Good fast, casual option if you want a break from Camden's more upscale harbor dining.<br/>- Friendly service and quick turnaround — a solid choice for a low-key lunch or takeout dinner.<br/>- Takeout available.<br/><br/>More info: https://www.google.com/maps/place/Camden+House+of+Pizza/@44.2098562,-69.0687574,513m/data=!3m1!1e3!4m13!1m5!2m4!1sRestaurants!5m1!4e9!6e5!3m6!1s0x4cadd70c74a9b407:0xda00b86044448fa!8m2!3d44.2099768!4d-69.065448!15sCgtSZXN0YXVyYW50c1oNIgtyZXN0YXVyYW50c5IBEHBpenphX3Jlc3RhdXJhbnSaASRDaGREU1VoTk1HOW5TMFZKUTBGblNVTndlRFpVVXpOblJSQULgAQD6AQQIGhBB!16s%2Fg%2F1tk6_2j0?entry=ttu&g_ep=EgoyMDI2MDYwOS4wIKXMDSoASAFQAw%3D%3D]]></description>
