  <Placemark>
    <name>Camden Opera House Camden ME</name>
    <description><![CDATA[Camden Opera House<br/><br/>📍 29 Elm St, Camden, ME 04843<br/><br/>Multi-use performance venue and municipal building in downtown Camden, hosting concerts, theater, and community events year-round.<br/><br/>Tips<br/>- Check the calendar ahead of the trip — worth building an evening around if something's on<br/><br/>More info: http://camdenoperahouse.com]]></description>
