  <Placemark>
    <name>Camden Overlook Camden ME</name>
    <description><![CDATA[Camden Overlook<br/><br/>📍 Camden, ME<br/><br/>A roadside overlook with a superb view of downtown Camden, the harbor, and Penobscot Bay's islands. (4.9★, 48 reviews on Google Maps)<br/><br/>Tips<br/>- Good quick stop — no hike, just pull off and take in the view]]></description>
