  <Placemark>
    <name>Cape Cod Canal Visitor Center Sandwich MA</name>
    <description><![CDATA[The Cape Cod Canal Visitor Center is a museum that focuses on the history of the Cape Cod Canal. It has no specific food offerings as it primarily serves as an educational center. It operates from 10 AM to 5 PM, but it's closed on Sundays and Mondays. Alcohol is not served.<br/><br/>More info: https://www.google.com/maps/place/Cape+Cod+Canal+Visitor+Center/@41.773208,-70.5476871,8546m/data=!3m1!1e3!4m10!1m2!2m1!1sSandwich+ma+historical!3m6!1s0x89e4ca472ed04269:0xf13c04d401a60efa!8m2!3d41.7732051!4d-70.5000139!15sChZTYW5kd2ljaCBtYSBoaXN0b3JpY2FsWhgiFnNhbmR3aWNoIG1hIGhpc3RvcmljYWySAQZtdXNldW2aASRDaGREU1VoTk1HOW5TMFZKUTBGblNVUjZOSFo2YzJsM1JSQULgAQD6AQQIABBF!16s%2Fg%2F11bx9wwcxd?entry=ttu&g_ep=EgoyMDI2MDYxNi4wIKXMDSoASAFQAw%3D%3D]]></description>
