  <Placemark>
    <name>Cape Cod Museum of Natural History Brewster MA</name>
    <description><![CDATA[Cape Cod Museum of Natural History<br/><br/>📍 Brewster MA<br/><br/>Family-friendly natural history museum with live animals, marsh walking trails to John Wing Island, and access to Brewster Flats.<br/><br/>Tips<br/>- The marsh trail out to John Wing Island is a highlight — allow an extra hour.<br/>- Good rainy-day option combined with the exhibits inside.]]></description>
