  <Placemark>
    <name>Cape Cod National Seashore Truro MA</name>
    <description><![CDATA[Cape Cod National Seashore is a public beach area known for its natural beauty and outdoor activities. The beach offers picnic areas and snack bars but does not have full dining services. Open for lunch, it does not serve dinner. Alcohol is not available.<br/><br/>More info: https://www.google.com/maps/place/Cape+Cod+National+Seashore/@42.0184255,-70.1580862,25753m/data=!3m1!1e3!4m15!1m8!3m7!1s0x89fb5f8d605190e5:0x70889a56ace16faa!2sTruro,+MA!3b1!8m2!3d42.0031966!4d-70.053449!16zL20vMHR5NW0!3m5!1s0x89fb42dcc768c5df:0xa8d1f6c2f162f608!8m2!3d41.9830785!4d-70.0532913!16zL20vMDlyMHI?entry=ttu&g_ep=EgoyMDI2MDYxNi4wIKXMDSoASAFQAw%3D%3D]]></description>
