    <name>Cape Pier Chowder House Cape Porpoise ME</name>
    <description><![CDATA[Cape Pier Chowder House<br/><br/>📍 Cape Porpoise, ME<br/><br/>Longer season with indoor seating and views to Goat Island Light. Extended-season operation with indoor comfort.<br/><br/>Tips<br/>- Longer operating season (indoor seating advantage)<br/>- Goat Island Light views<br/>- Weather-proof indoor seating<br/>- Extended season for shoulder months]]></description>
