  <Placemark>
    <name>Cape Sea Grille Harwich MA</name>
    <description><![CDATA[Overview<br/>Type: Restaurant<br/><br/>Best known for: Fine dining, creative dishes.<br/><br/>Location context: Not mentioned.<br/><br/>Price level: $50–100 per person<br/><br/>Visit timing: Dinner from 5 PM, closed on Monday and Tuesday.<br/><br/>Typical Customers<br/>Demographics: Mix of locals and tourists.<br/><br/>Group types: Couples, families, and larger groups.<br/><br/>Common occasions: Celebrations, special occasions, date nights.<br/><br/>Vibe & Setting<br/>Atmosphere: Formal but welcoming.<br/><br/>Noise level: Moderate.<br/><br/>Decor & setting: Indoor seating with a cozy ambiance.<br/><br/>Service style: Attentive and friendly service.<br/><br/>Recommended Dishes<br/>Overall dish consensus<br/>Reviewers highly recommend the crispy oysters, surf and turf, and grilled salad for their excellent flavors and presentation.<br/><br/>How “top dishes” are determined<br/>Top dishes are chosen based on mentions in reviews, popularity in photos, and strong praise from diners. Dishes frequently highlighted in reviews and labeled as favorites inform the choices.<br/><br/>| Rank | Dish           | Why it stands out                                 | How often it's mentioned        | Ideal for                |<br/>|------|----------------|--------------------------------------------------|--------------------------------|-------------------------|<br/>| 1    | Crispy Oysters | Praised for their texture and taste, a must-try.| Mentioned in many reviews      | Sharing at the table    |<br/>| 2    | Surf N Turf    | Known for delicious preparation and flavors.     | Repeatedly called out as a favorite| Hearty main           |<br/>| 3    | Grilled Salad   | Complimented for freshness and creativity.       | Appears in numerous photos     | Lighter option         |<br/><br/>Good alternates / backup choices<br/>- Pan Seared Fish: Noted for its flaky texture and seasoning.<br/>- Desserts: Frequently mentioned for their delightful taste and presentation.<br/><br/>Highlights (non-dish positives from reviews)<br/>Service Quality: Consistent praise for the attentive and professional waitstaff, enhancing the dining experience.<br/><br/>Presentation: Reviewers appreciate the beautiful plating of dishes, contributing to the fine dining experience.<br/><br/>Common Issues (from reviews)<br/>Wait Times: Some diners experienced longer waits during peak hours when the restaurant is busy.<br/><br/>Practical Notes<br/>Reservation / wait: Reservations recommended, especially on weekends.<br/><br/>Accessibility: Not mentioned.<br/><br/>Parking / transit: Not mentioned. <br/><br/>Best use case: Great for a special date night or celebration dinner.<br/><br/>More info: https://www.google.com/maps/place/Cape+Sea+Grille/@41.6663889,-70.0775749,821m/data=!3m2!1e3!4b1!4m6!3m5!1s0x89fb3e407cb53d33:0x76b40f039d2a4cf1!8m2!3d41.6663889!4d-70.075!16s%2Fg%2F1td4w9g4?entry=ttu&g_ep=EgoyMDI2MDYxMy4wIKXMDSoASAFQAw%3D%3D]]></description>
