    <description><![CDATA[Caper Hill<br/><br/>📍 Near Morrisville, VT<br/><br/>A hill near Morrisville, along the Green Mountain Byway corridor.<br/><br/>Tips<br/>- No well-documented public trail found — treat as a landmark rather than a planned hike unless you find current access info locally.<br/><br/>More info: https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=44.5839%2C%20-72.6960]]></description>
