    <name>Casa Ortega Cornish NH</name>
    <description><![CDATA[Overview  <br/>Type: Restaurant  <br/>  <br/>Best known for: Authentic Mexican cuisine, great atmosphere  <br/>  <br/>Location context: Wappingers Falls, NY  <br/>  <br/>Price level: $20–30 per person  <br/>  <br/>Visit timing: Busy during dinner hours  <br/>  <br/>Typical Customers  <br/>Demographics: Locals  <br/>  <br/>Group types: Couples, families, larger groups  <br/>  <br/>Common occasions: Casual dinner, date night  <br/>  <br/>Vibe & Setting  <br/>Atmosphere: Casual and lively  <br/>  <br/>Noise level: Moderate  <br/>  <br/>Decor & setting: Indoor seating, lively ambiance  <br/>  <br/>Service style: Attentive and friendly  <br/>  <br/>Recommended Dishes  <br/>Overall dish consensus  <br/>Reviewers highly recommend the tacos and entrees, particularly the Shrimp Tacos and Ribeye Tampiqueña for their flavor and quality.  <br/>  <br/>How “top dishes” are determined  <br/>Top dishes are identified based on their frequency in reviews and menu mentions, including those labeled as popular or featured in photos.  <br/>  <br/>| Rank | Dish                          | Why it stands out                               | How often it’s mentioned              | Ideal for                   |  <br/>|------|-------------------------------|------------------------------------------------|-------------------------------------|-----------------------------|  <br/>| 1    | Shrimp Tacos                 | Flavorful and well-prepared, a customer favorite. | Mentioned in numerous reviews       | Spice lovers                |  <br/>| 2    | Ribeye Tampiqueña            | Tender and cooked perfectly, highly praised.    | Repeatedly called out as a favorite | Hearty main                |  <br/>| 3    | Chilaquiles Verdes           | Bright flavor, satisfying and comforting dish.  | Appears in many reviews             | Quick bite                 |  <br/>  <br/>Good alternates / backup choices  <br/>- Quesabirria Tacos: Notable for their rich flavor and generous portions.  <br/>- Sopa Azteca: Comforting and flavorful, a good choice for a light meal.  <br/>  <br/>Highlights (non‑dish positives from reviews)  <br/>Service quality: Great service noted with a friendly and helpful staff.  <br/>  <br/>Ambiance: Many reviewers appreciate the lively atmosphere that enhances the dining experience.  <br/>  <br/>Common Issues (from reviews)  <br/>Busy times: Wait times can be longer during dinner rush, especially on weekends.  <br/>  <br/>Practical Notes  <br/>Reservation / wait: Walk-in friendly, but wait times can occur in peak hours.  <br/>  <br/>Accessibility: Not mentioned  <br/>  <br/>Parking / transit: Street parking available, or public transit options nearby.  <br/>  <br/>Best use case: Great for casual dinners and lively date nights.<br/><br/>More info: https://www.google.com/maps/place/Casa+Ortega/@28.7312326,-108.0448146,7961340m/data=!3m1!1e3!4m10!1m2!2m1!1sCasa+Ortega!3m6!1s0x89dd39519eff6e61:0xe0dd81965171db15!8m2!3d41.5975884!4d-73.9206196!15sCgtDYXNhIE9ydGVnYVoNIgtjYXNhIG9ydGVnYZIBEm1leGljYW5fcmVzdGF1cmFudOABAA!16s%2Fg%2F11nl7snq66?entry=ttu&g_ep=EgoyMDI2MDYxMy4wIKXMDSoASAFQAw%3D%3D]]></description>
