    <description><![CDATA[Overview<br/>Type: Restaurant<br/><br/>Best known for: Unbelievable food and cocktails, excellent service.<br/><br/>Location context: Catskills<br/><br/>Price level: $40–100<br/><br/>Visit timing: Mentioned as good for brunch and dinner.<br/><br/>Typical Customers<br/>Demographics: Locals and visitors, couples, families.<br/><br/>Group types: Couples, families, friends.<br/><br/>Common occasions: Brunch, casual dinners, special occasions.<br/><br/>Vibe & Setting<br/>Atmosphere: Cozy and lively.<br/><br/>Noise level: Moderate.<br/><br/>Decor & setting: Indoor seating, bar area.<br/><br/>Service style: Attentive and friendly.<br/><br/>Recommended Dishes<br/>Overall dish consensus<br/>Reviewers highly recommend the Duck Leg Confit and the Birria, praising their flavor and quality.<br/><br/>How “top dishes” are determined<br/>Top dishes are chosen based on mentions and praise from reviewers, specifically those highlighted on the menu and described frequently in reviews.<br/><br/>| Rank | Dish                | Why it stands out                               | How often it’s mentioned            | Ideal for                 |<br/>|------|---------------------|------------------------------------------------|-----------------------------------|---------------------------|<br/>| 1    | Duck Leg Confit     | Noted for its incredible flavor and texture.   | Mentioned in many reviews       | Hearty main               |<br/>| 2    | Birria              | Praised for its strong flavors and quality.    | Frequently called out by diners | Sharing at the table      |<br/><br/>Good alternates / backup choices<br/>- Scallop Tostada: Appreciated for its fresh taste and presentation.<br/>- Sausage Tamale: Mentioned as a comforting and satisfying option.<br/>- Monk Fish: Highlighted for its excellent preparation and flavor.<br/><br/>Highlights (non‑dish positives from reviews)<br/>Service: Reviewers consistently mention friendly and attentive service, enhancing the overall dining experience.<br/><br/>Atmosphere: The cozy vibe and lively setting contribute to a warm dining experience.<br/><br/>Quality of Ingredients: Diners rave about the use of quality and fresh ingredients in the dishes.<br/><br/>Common Issues (from reviews)<br/>Wait Times: Some diners noted longer waits during peak hours, suggesting arriving early.<br/><br/>Reservation Advice: Reservations are recommended, especially for busy dinner hours.<br/><br/>Practical Notes<br/>Reservation / wait: Reservations recommended.<br/><br/>Accessibility: Not mentioned.<br/><br/>Parking / transit: Not mentioned.<br/><br/>Best use case: Great for brunch with friends or casual dinners.<br/><br/>More info: https://www.google.com/maps/place/Casa+Susanna/@42.1084283,-74.1330219,79116m/data=!3m1!1e3!4m11!1m4!2m3!1sThai+Spice+Cafe+%E2%80%93+Well-liked+Thai+on+Raymond+Avenue!5m1!4e3!3m5!1s0x89ddbd17c23bb081:0x2b3ec0bc2094f1fd!8m2!3d42.2503276!4d-73.8886741!16s%2Fg%2F11twhkk4rh?entry=ttu&g_ep=EgoyMDI2MDYxMy4wIKXMDSoASAFQAw%3D%3D]]></description>
