hoices  <br/>- Weekend Brunch: Known for a great brunch experience with flavorful dishes.<br/>- Sausage Tamale: Praised for its hearty and satisfying nature.<br/><br/>Highlights (non‑dish positives from reviews)<br/>Food Quality: Reviewers frequently highlight the quality and freshness of ingredients, particularly heirloom corn tortillas made in-house.<br/><br/>Service Quality: Many reviews commend the attentive and friendly service that enhances the dining experience.<br/><br/>Common Issues (from reviews)<br/>Wait Times: Some reviewers mention busy times on weekends leading to potential waits for tables.<br/><br/>Practical Notes<br/>Reservation / wait: Recommended to make reservations due to popularity.<br/><br/>Accessibility: Not mentioned.<br/><br/>Parking / transit: Not mentioned.<br/><br/>Best use case: Great for brunch or a casual dinner with friends or family.<br/><br/>More info: https://www.google.com/maps/place/Casa+Susanna/@42.2503276,-73.891249,820m/data=!3m1!1e3!4m14!1m7!3m6!1s0x89ddbd17c23bb081:0x2b3ec0bc2094f1fd!2sCasa+Susanna!8m2!3d42.2503276!4d-73.8886741!16s%2Fg%2F11twhkk4rh!3m5!1s0x89ddbd17c23bb081:0x2b3ec0bc2094f1fd!8m2!3d42.2503276!4d-73.8886741!16s%2Fg%2F11twhkk4rh?entry=ttu&g_ep=EgoyMDI2MDYxMy4wIKXMDSoASAFQAw%3D%3D]]></description>
