    <name>Castaways Bar &amp; Grill at Bridgeview Marina Port Ewen NY</name>
    <description><![CDATA[Overview<br/>Type: Restaurant<br/><br/>Best known for: Delicious food, lively atmosphere with music.<br/><br/>Location context: Near Raymond Avenue<br/><br/>Price level: $10–20 per person<br/><br/>Visit timing: Popular during dinner hours and special events.<br/><br/>Typical Customers<br/>Demographics: Mix of locals and visitors, with an inviting atmosphere for couples and families.<br/><br/>Group types: Couples, friends, families, larger groups.<br/><br/>Common occasions: Casual dinners, gatherings, special occasions.<br/><br/>Vibe & Setting<br/>Atmosphere: Lively and casual, suitable for both relaxed dining and socializing.<br/><br/>Noise level: Moderate to loud.<br/><br/>Decor & setting: Indoor seating with a stocked bar, several screens for entertainment.<br/><br/>Service style: Friendly and attentive, with some reviews mentioning slower service during busy times.<br/><br/>Recommended Dishes<br/>Overall dish consensus<br/>Reviewers frequently praise items like burgers, wings, and appetizers for their quality and flavor. The burger nights and wing nights are especially popular for their unique offerings.<br/><br/>How “top dishes” are determined<br/>Top dishes are chosen based on frequent mentions in reviews, particularly those highlighted as popular or shown in multiple photos, indicating strong customer preference.<br/><br/>| Rank | Dish                   | Why it stands out                                        | How often it’s mentioned      | Ideal for                     |<br/>|------|-----------------------|--------------------------------------------------------|-------------------------------|-------------------------------|<br/>| 1    | Double Blue Burger    | Praised for its flavor; called the "best thing tried".| Mentioned in many reviews     | Hearty main                  |<br/>| 2    | Pulled Pork Nachos    | Noted for generous serving and comfort food appeal.    | Appears in numerous photos     | Sharing at the table         |<br/>| 3    | Crab Cakes            | Frequently recommended for being tasty and well-prepared.| Repeatedly called out as a favorite| Lighter option               |<br/><br/>Good alternates / backup choices<br/>- Onion Rings: Known for being comforting and crispy.<br/>- Quesadilla: Mentioned for its satisfying size and flavor.<br/><br/>Highlights (non-dish positives from reviews)<br/>Atmosphere: Customers enjoy the relaxed yet lively vibe, suitable for gatherings.<br/><br/>Service experience: Despite busy periods, many mentioned the friendly approach of staff.<br/><br/>Common Issues (from reviews)<br/>Service speed: Some patrons experienced slow service during peak hours.<br/><br/>Noise level: The lively atmosphere can lead to loud music, which not everyone appreciates.<br/><br/>Practical Notes<br/>Reservation / wait: Walk-in friendly; no mention of reservations needed.<br/><br/>Accessibility: Not mentioned.<br/><br/>Parking / transit: Not mentioned.<br/><br/>Best use case: Great for casual gatherings with friends or family.<br/><br/>More info: https://www.google.com/maps/place/Castaways+Bar+%26+Grill+at+Bridgeview+Marina/@41.9078616,-73.9860731,3267m/data=!3m1!1e3!4m11!1m4!2m3!1sThai+Spice+Cafe+%E2%80%93+Well-liked+Thai+on+Raymond+Avenue!5m1!4e3!3m5!1s0x89dd0f453ae70723:0x62133f257353dad6!8m2!3d41.9110493!4d-73.9948528!16s%2Fg%2F11vr0zc8pq?entry=ttu&g_ep=EgoyMDI2MDYxMy4wIKXMDSoASAFQAw%3D%3D]]></description>
