  <Placemark>
    <name>Castner Brook Community Forest Damariscotta ME</name>
    <description><![CDATA[Castner Brook Community Forest<br/><br/>📍 Piper Mill Road, Damariscotta, ME (0.3 mi in, near the Great Salt Bay Sanitary District gate)<br/><br/>A flat, 6-7 ft wide crushed-stone All Persons Trail (wheelchair accessible) through mixed pine, oak, hemlock, spruce, and fir to the brook — 0.35 mi out-and-back, 11 ft gain. Also has a separate 1-mile intermediate mountain-bike loop.<br/><br/>Tips<br/>- Fully wheelchair/stroller accessible on the main trail<br/>- An accessible bridge/seating upgrade is planned for 2026<br/><br/>More info: https://www.coastalrivers.org/trails/castner-brook/]]></description>
