    <name>Caterpillar Hill Overlook Blue Hill ME</name>
    <description><![CDATA[Caterpillar Hill Overlook<br/><br/>📍 328 Caterpillar Hill Rd, Sedgwick, ME<br/><br/>Sweeping pull-off view over Walker Pond, Eggemoggin Reach, and Deer Isle from the Blue Hill peninsula — also managed in part as Cooper Farm by Blue Hill Heritage Trust. (5.0★, 23 reviews on Google Maps)<br/><br/>Tips<br/>- Roadside pull-off — no hike required, just stop and look<br/>- Especially good at sunset over the reach and islands]]></description>
