    <description><![CDATA[Catskill Point<br/><br/>📍 Catskill, NY<br/><br/>A waterfront park at the confluence of Catskill Creek and the Hudson River, with views across to Hudson and a quiet spot to watch river traffic.<br/><br/>Tips<br/>- A good 15-minute leg-stretch between Hudson and other destinations<br/>- Fishing pier extends into the river<br/>- Catskill Creek mouth is a productive spot for shorebirds in September<br/><br/>More info: https://www.google.com/maps/search/Catskill+Point+Catskill,+NY]]></description>
