    <name>Causeway Walk Norwood Cove Southwest Harbor ME</name>
    <description><![CDATA[Causeway Walk (Norwood Cove)<br/><br/>📍 Off Fernald Point Rd, Southwest Harbor, ME<br/><br/>A footbridge/causeway crossing Norwood Cove off Fernald Point Road, near Southwest Harbor. Local write-ups specifically call this out as a spot "few visitors to Mount Desert Island ever find" — genuinely off the tourist map.<br/><br/>Tips<br/>- No signage from the main road — look for the Fernald Point Rd turnoff<br/>- Short, easy walk — good for a quick stop rather than a dedicated outing]]></description>
