    <name>Cellardoor Winery Lincolnville ME</name>
    <description><![CDATA[Cellardoor Winery<br/><br/>📍 367 Youngtown Rd, Lincolnville, ME 04849<br/><br/>Vineyard and winery, ranked #1 of 15 things to do in Lincolnville. Tastings, working-winery shuttle tours, trails, cheese/sandwich plates. Rated 4.5 on Tripadvisor.<br/><br/>Tips<br/>- Weekend hours only: Sat/Sun 12-5pm, closed Mon-Fri — plan around this.<br/>- Their original Route 1 tasting room (mentioned in some older reviews/listings) has closed; this Youngtown Rd vineyard location is the current one.]]></description>
