  <Placemark>
    <name>Champlain Mountain Acadia National Park ME</name>
    <description><![CDATA[Champlain Mountain<br/><br/>📍 Champlain North Ridge Trail, Acadia National Park, ME<br/><br/>A real summit hike via the North Ridge Trail with views rated among the best in the park — better, by some accounts, than what many expect from Cadillac. (4.9★, 31 reviews on Google Maps)<br/><br/>Tips<br/>- North Ridge is the more moderate approach; the Precipice Trail also reaches this summit but is a much harder iron-rung climb<br/>- Good alternative to the more crowded Cadillac summit]]></description>
