uality of service: Staff is consistently described as friendly and attentive.<br/><br/>Atmosphere: Diners appreciate the pleasant ambience and cozy setting.<br/><br/>Common Issues (from reviews)<br/>Busy times: Not specifically mentioned, but popular during meal periods.<br/><br/>Practical Notes<br/>Reservation / wait: Walk-in friendly.<br/><br/>Accessibility: Not mentioned.<br/><br/>Parking / transit: Street parking available.<br/><br/>Best use case: Great for casual family dinners.<br/><br/>More info: https://www.google.com/maps/place/Chang+Thai+Cafe/@44.3066146,-71.7779717,793m/data=!3m1!1e3!4m14!1m7!3m6!1s0x4cb46f2d8d8d7741:0x655c417a30beacd!2sChang+Thai+Cafe!8m2!3d44.3066109!4d-71.7731008!16s%2Fg%2F1tg34trv!3m5!1s0x4cb46f2d8d8d7741:0x655c417a30beacd!8m2!3d44.3066109!4d-71.7731008!16s%2Fg%2F1tg34trv?entry=ttu&g_ep=EgoyMDI2MDYxMy4wIKXMDSoASAFQAw%3D%3D]]></description>
