    <name>Chapel of the Holy Cross Holderness NH</name>
    <description><![CDATA[Chapel of the Holy Cross<br/><br/>📍 Shepard Hill, Holderness, NH<br/><br/>A small summer chapel on Shepard Hill, part of the historic Squam Lake summer-colony enclave — one of the first areas developed for summer residences near Squam Lake, dating back to the 1870s–1920s.<br/><br/>Tips<br/>- Sits within the Shepard Hill Historic District — visit both together.<br/><br/>More info: https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=43.7586%2C%20-71.6752]]></description>
