  <Placemark>
    <name>Charlie's Sandwich Shoppe</name>
    <description><![CDATA[Charlie’s Sandwich Shoppe is a diner known for its American breakfast and lunch fare, including pancakes, omelettes, and sandwiches. It ranges from $20–30 per person. It is primarily open for breakfast and lunch, does not serve dinner, and offers a casual dining experience.<br/><br/>More info: https://www.google.com/maps/place/Charlie's+Sandwich+Shoppe/@42.3441271,-71.0803602,812m/data=!3m2!1e3!4b1!4m6!3m5!1s0x89e37a1249741473:0x11b65148ffe2e8f0!8m2!3d42.3441232!4d-71.0777799!16s%2Fm%2F026_571?entry=ttu&g_ep=EgoyMDI2MDYyOS4wIKXMDSoASAFQAw%3D%3D]]></description>
