    <name>Charlotte Rhoades Park and Butterfly Garden Southwest Harbor ME</name>
    <description><![CDATA[Charlotte Rhoades Park and Butterfly Garden<br/><br/>📍 191 Main St, Southwest Harbor, ME 04679<br/><br/>A small waterfront pocket park in downtown Southwest Harbor with a dedicated butterfly garden. Local write-ups describe it as consistently "seldom busy," a nice quiet stop while walking the village.<br/><br/>Tips<br/>- Easy walk-in stop while exploring downtown Southwest Harbor — no real parking planning needed]]></description>
