  <Placemark>
    <name>Charlotte's Legendary Lobster Pound Southwest Harbor ME</name>
    <description><![CDATA[Charlotte's Legendary Lobsters is a seafood establishment best known for its fresh lobster rolls and clam chowder. It attracts a casual crowd of seafood lovers, families, and outdoor diners, often visiting for a laid-back meal after activities like hiking. The vibe is relaxed and friendly, with a focus on outdoor dining and picnic table seating. <br/><br/>The strongest positives consistently praised by customers include the freshness of the food, particularly the lobster roll and fried scallop roll, the friendly and efficient service, and the enjoyable outdoor atmosphere. Common downsides noted include the limited hours of operation, as it's closed on Wednesdays and Thursdays, and the potential for wait times due to the food truck model of service.<br/><br/>More info: https://www.google.com/maps/place/Charlotte's+Legendary+Lobster+Pound/@44.2514225,-68.334502,9150m/data=!3m1!1e3!4m14!1m7!3m6!1s0x4caea349426b9ac1:0x3ca9ed3a9d2836e0!2sCharlotte's+Legendary+Lobster+Pound!8m2!3d44.2446861!4d-68.2986522!16s%2Fg%2F1q6n2glpy!3m5!1s0x4caea349426b9ac1:0x3ca9ed3a9d2836e0!8m2!3d44.2446861!4d-68.2986522!16s%2Fg%2F1q6n2glpy?entry=ttu&g_ep=EgoyMDI2MDYxMC4wIKXMDSoASAFQAw%3D%3D]]></description>
