  <Placemark>
    <name>Chase’s Daily Belfast ME</name>
    <description><![CDATA[Chase’s Daily<br/><br/>Chase’s Daily is known in Belfast as a farm-driven cafe and bakery with a strong seasonal identity. It is widely associated with vegetarian-friendly cooking, produce-forward dishes, and baked goods that reflect the agricultural rhythm of Midcoast Maine.[cite:32][cite:23]<br/><br/>Its appeal comes from the combination of downtown setting and ingredients-led menu, making it a favorite for a lighter lunch or breakfast-oriented stop. Local guides regularly include it among standout Belfast food destinations for visitors exploring Main Street.[cite:32]]]></description>
