    <name>Chatham Fish Pier Chatham MA</name>
    <description><![CDATA[Chatham Fish Pier<br/><br/>📍 Chatham MA<br/><br/>Working fishing pier with a public viewing deck — the best spot in town to watch the day's catch unload and seals congregate at low tide.<br/><br/>Tips<br/>- Catch is typically unloaded mid-afternoon — timing your visit then is most dramatic.<br/>- Free, always open, no parking fee.]]></description>
