    <description><![CDATA[Overview  <br/>Type: Restaurant  <br/>  <br/>Best known for: Great food, friendly service  <br/>  <br/>Location context: 643 Main St  <br/>  <br/>Price level: $10–30  <br/>  <br/>Visit timing: Open until 5 PM  <br/>  <br/>Typical Customers  <br/>Demographics: Mixed (locals and tourists)  <br/>  <br/>Group types: Couples, friends, families  <br/>  <br/>Common occasions: Casual dinners, quick bites  <br/>  <br/>Vibe & Setting  <br/>Atmosphere: Casual, lively  <br/>  <br/>Noise level: Moderate  <br/>  <br/>Decor & setting: Indoor seating, outdoor ambiance mentioned  <br/>  <br/>Service style: Friendly, fast  <br/>  <br/>Recommended Dishes  <br/>Overall dish consensus: Diners praise the food consistently, especially the burgers and seafood dishes.  <br/>  <br/>How “top dishes” are determined: Top dishes are chosen based on mentions in reviews, dishes labeled as popular, and frequent appearance in photos.  <br/>  <br/>| Rank | Dish                 | Why it stands out                                       | How often it’s mentioned                | Ideal for                   |<br/>|------|----------------------|--------------------------------------------------------|----------------------------------------|-----------------------------|<br/>| 1    | Fish Sandwich        | Praised for flavor and freshness.                      | Mentioned in many reviews.            | Quick bite                  |<br/>| 2    | Lobster Roll         | Called out for generous portions and great taste.     | Repeatedly called out as a favorite. | Sharing at the table        |<br/>| 3    | Burgers              | Known for being juicy and well-seasoned.              | Appears in numerous photos.           | Casual dining               |<br/><br/>Good alternates / backup choices  <br/>- Oysters on the Half Shell: Notable for its fresh taste and unique preparation.  <br/>- New England Clam Chowder: Comforting and flavorful, a good option for seafood lovers.  <br/><br/>Highlights (non‑dish positives from reviews)  <br/>Service quality: Staff is friendly and attentive, ensuring a pleasant dining experience.  <br/>  <br/>Atmosphere: The lively environment contributes to a fun dining experience.  <br/>  <br/>Common Issues (from reviews)  <br/>Food temperature: Some reviews mention lukewarm dishes on busy days.  <br/>  <br/>Portion sizes: A few customers felt portions could be small for the price paid.  <br/>  <br/>Practical Notes  <br/>Reservation / wait: Walk-in friendly, often busy.  <br/>  <br/>Accessibility: Not mentioned  <br/>  <br/>Parking / transit: Not mentioned  <br/>  <br/>Best use case: Great for a casual dinner with friends or family.<br/><br/>More info: https://www.google.com/maps/place/Chatham+Squire/@41.6793134,-69.9632776,722m/data=!3m1!1e3!4m13!1m5!2m4!1sRestaurants!5m1!4e9!6e5!3m6!1s0x89fb149fb012085d:0x472d5c42f2b805c2!8m2!3d41.679658!4d-69.957058!15sCgtSZXN0YXVyYW50c1oNIgtyZXN0YXVyYW50c5IBCnJlc3RhdXJhbnSaASNDaFpEU1VoTk1HOW5TMFZKUTBGblNVTmFNbk16YWxSUkVBReABAPoBBAgAEEw!16s%2Fg%2F1ts309fg?entry=ttu&g_ep=EgoyMDI2MDYxMC4wIKXMDSoASAFQAw%3D%3D]]></description>
