    <name>Cheese Louise North Conway</name>
    <description><![CDATA[Cheese Louise in North Conway specializes in grilled cheese sandwiches, soups, and fries. The price range is $10–$20 per person, and they offer quick dining and takeout service. It is open for lunch and dinner, closing at 9 PM, and serves beer and liquor options.<br/><br/>More info: https://www.google.com/maps/place/Cheese+Louise+North+Conway/@44.0527722,-71.1284377,134a,48.2y,0.36t/data=!3m1!1e3!4m14!1m7!3m6!1s0x4cb3a0bf793f9bfb:0x6c5284ed20196b08!2sVia+Roma+Pizza+%26+Mediterranean!8m2!3d44.0363957!4d-71.1223054!16s%2Fg%2F11r9lxtgw!3m5!1s0x4cb3a17387f73ed1:0xf7e87bed181b4fd3!8m2!3d44.0529101!4d-71.1281215!16s%2Fg%2F11vy71cw09?entry=ttu&g_ep=EgoyMDI2MDcxMi4wIKXMDSoASAFQAw%3D%3D]]></description>
