eciate the friendly and helpful staff, particularly the attentiveness of servers like Sam.<br/><br/>Food quality: Mentioned as consistently delicious and well-prepared, making it a popular local choice.<br/><br/>Common Issues (from reviews)<br/>Not mentioned.<br/><br/>Practical Notes<br/>Reservation / wait: Walk-in friendly<br/><br/>Accessibility: Not mentioned<br/><br/>Parking / transit: Not mentioned<br/><br/>Best use case: Good for a casual meal with friends or family.<br/><br/>More info: https://www.google.com/maps/place/Cheese+Louise+Settlers+Green/@44.0227534,-71.1150962,1549m/data=!3m1!1e3!4m6!3m5!1s0x4cb3a1969be46ecd:0x5fc06ba03e6074a!8m2!3d44.0234828!4d-71.1134029!16s%2Fg%2F11jdmmld0x?entry=ttu&g_ep=EgoyMDI2MDYxMy4wIKXMDSoASAFQAw%3D%3D]]></description>
