    <description><![CDATA[Chef's Bistro is an American restaurant located in North Conway, NH. It offers lunch and dinner service with a price range of $20–$30 per person. Alcohol is served, and the restaurant has a cozy ambiance.<br/><br/>More info: https://www.google.com/maps/place/Chef's+Bistro/@44.0538336,-71.1287492,790m/data=!3m2!1e3!4b1!4m6!3m5!1s0x4cb3080037baa3bb:0x3ff720f2b202026e!8m2!3d44.0538336!4d-71.1287492!16s%2Fg%2F1vv2rvlj?entry=ttu&g_ep=EgoyMDI2MDcwOC4wIKXMDSoASAFQAw%3D%3D]]></description>
