    <name>Chleo Kingston, NY</name>
    <description><![CDATA[Chleo<br/><br/>📍 Kingston, NY<br/><br/>A natural wine bar in Kingston's Stockade District serving European-inspired small plates with an outstanding, thoughtfully curated natural wine program.<br/><br/>Must Order<br/>- Seasonal small plates — rotate with availability — always vegetable-forward<br/>- Wine by the glass — exceptional list; ask staff for guidance<br/>- Charcuterie board — carefully sourced<br/><br/>Tips<br/>- No reservations — arrive early or expect a wait<br/>- One of the most exciting spots in Kingston's rapidly evolving dining scene<br/><br/>More info: https://www.google.com/maps/search/Chleo+Kingston,+NY]]></description>
