  <Placemark>
    <name>Circular Hanging Steps Acadia National Park ME</name>
    <description><![CDATA[Circular Hanging Steps<br/><br/>📍 Orange and Black Path, near the Precipice parking lot, Acadia National Park, ME<br/><br/>A historic stone-step trail feature on the Orange and Black Path, near the Precipice parking lot. It's no longer maintained by the park, which keeps it firmly off the beaten path — and like the nearby Precipice Trail, it's closed seasonally for peregrine falcon nesting.<br/><br/>Tips<br/>- Check peregrine falcon closure status before visiting — same seasonal restriction as the Precipice Trail<br/>- Not a maintained park trail — go prepared for rougher, unmarked conditions]]></description>
