    <name>Clarence Fahnestock Memorial State Park Philipstown, NY</name>
    <description><![CDATA[Clarence Fahnestock Memorial State Park<br/><br/>📍 Philipstown, NY<br/><br/>A sprawling Putnam County park of lakes and forested ridgelines, with hiking, swimming, and a section of the Appalachian Trail running through it — a substantial outdoor stop along the southern Taconic Byway corridor.<br/><br/>Tips<br/>- Good option for a longer hike or swim break if breaking up a full byway drive.<br/><br/>More info: https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=41.44813,-73.854656]]></description>
