  <Placemark>
    <name>Clark Point Cafe Southwest Harbor ME</name>
    <description><![CDATA[Clark Point Cafe is a popular brunch spot known for its delicious breakfast offerings, especially the blueberry Dutch Baby Pancake and Smoked Salmon Benedict. It attracts a diverse clientele including families, couples, and tourists visiting Acadia National Park, often for casual dining occasions. The vibe is casual and welcoming, characterized by a cozy atmosphere and friendly service. Reviewers consistently praise the high-quality food, great coffee, and the comforting ambiance, while some mention limited hours as a potential downside.<br/><br/>More info: https://www.google.com/maps/place/Clark+Point+Cafe/@44.2797099,-68.3263769,124m/data=!3m1!1e3!4m13!1m5!2m4!1sRestaurants!5m1!4e9!6e5!3m6!1s0x4caebd222ac4ab45:0xdf39d417079974b4!8m2!3d44.2797227!4d-68.3256279!15sCgtSZXN0YXVyYW50c1oNIgtyZXN0YXVyYW50c5IBBGNhZmWaASRDaGREU1VoTk1HOW5TMFZKUTBGblNVTlVObU0zVEhwM1JSQULgAQD6AQQIUxA_!16s%2Fg%2F11sv08cd7p?entry=ttu&g_ep=EgoyMDI2MDYxMC4wIKXMDSoASAFQAw%3D%3D]]></description>
