  <Placemark>
    <name>Clarks Bears Lincoln NH</name>
    <description><![CDATA[Clark's Trading Post — Bear Show<br/><br/>📍 Lincoln, NH<br/><br/>The trained black bear show at Clark's Trading Post, a classic White Mountains roadside attraction dating back to the 1920s — part vintage Americana, part genuine wildlife education, alongside a steam train ride and other old-school attractions on site.<br/><br/>Tips<br/>- A kitschy, kid-friendly stop rather than a nature experience — set expectations accordingly.<br/>- Combine with the Granite State Scenic Railway and Loon Mountain since all three are minutes apart in Lincoln.<br/><br/>More info: https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=44.0481%2C%20-71.6858]]></description>
