    <name>Clean Slate Eatery Chatham MA</name>
    <description><![CDATA[Clean Slate Eatery<br/><br/>📍 Chatham, MA<br/><br/>Upscale New American restaurant with a multi-course, curated dining experience — expect $100+ per person. Alcohol served. Closed Sundays and Mondays, limited hours other days, open for dinner until 11 PM.<br/><br/>Tips<br/>- Reservations recommended given the tasting-menu-style format and limited operating days.<br/>- Standouts per reviews: scallops and desserts.<br/><br/>More info: https://www.google.com/maps/place/Clean+Slate+Eatery/@41.6674575,-70.3086395,26493m/data=!3m1!1e3!4m13!1m5!2m4!1sRestaurants!5m1!4e9!6e5!3m6!1s0x89fb393f15f40cb7:0x9bd2b23c9d55500b!8m2!3d41.6674575!4d-70.1562042!15sCgtSZXN0YXVyYW50c1oNIgtyZXN0YXVyYW50c5IBCnJlc3RhdXJhbnSaASRDaGREU1VoTk1HOW5TMFZKUTBGblNVUkVielJtY2pkM1JSQULgAQD6AQQIexBF!16s%2Fg%2F11vqyyy3tt?entry=ttu&g_ep=EgoyMDI2MDcxOS4wIKXMDSoASAFQAw%3D%3D]]></description>
