    <description><![CDATA[Clearwater Sports River Tubing<br/><br/>📍 Waitsfield VT<br/><br/>River tubing under the historic Waitsfield Covered Bridge plus kayak and canoe rentals on the Mad River — a quintessential late-summer Vermont experience.<br/><br/>Tips<br/>- Late August / early September is peak tubing season with warm water.<br/>- Combine with a stop at Lawson's Finest Liquids a short drive away.]]></description>
