    <name>Clermont State Historic Site Germantown, NY</name>
    <description><![CDATA[Clermont State Historic Site<br/><br/>📍 Germantown, NY<br/><br/>A seven-generation estate of the Livingston family with sweeping Hudson River views, free grounds access, and seasonal house tours.<br/><br/>Tips<br/>- Grounds free year-round; house tours are ticketed<br/>- The riverside lawn has one of the best unobstructed Hudson views in the valley<br/>- Combine with Montgomery Place or Bard Fisher Center — 15 min south<br/><br/>More info: https://www.google.com/maps/search/Clermont+State+Historic+Site+Germantown,+NY]]></description>
