  <Placemark>
    <name>Cloudland Farm Pomfret VT</name>
    <description><![CDATA[Cloudland Farm is a farm-to-table restaurant that serves locally sourced, flavorful American cuisine. It typically opens for dinner on Friday and Saturday from 5 PM to 9 PM. Alcohol is likely served, enhancing the dining experience.<br/><br/>More info: https://www.google.com/maps/place/Cloudland+Farm/@43.6903898,-72.5025598,794m/data=!3m2!1e3!4b1!4m6!3m5!1s0x4cb4d270b94f8c9b:0xff1ffee63ee8020f!8m2!3d43.6903898!4d-72.4999849!16s%2Fg%2F1tcyx0fw?entry=ttu&g_ep=EgoyMDI2MDYyMy4wIKXMDSoASAFQAw%3D%3D]]></description>
