  <Placemark>
    <name>Coast Guard Beach Eastham MA</name>
    <description><![CDATA[Coast Guard Beach<br/><br/>📍 Eastham MA<br/><br/>NPS-managed beach consistently voted among America's best, with sweeping dune views and strong Atlantic surf.<br/><br/>Tips<br/>- Parking is at the Salt Pond Visitor Center in summer — shuttle runs to the beach.<br/>- Strong surf — excellent for body surfing.]]></description>
