  <Placemark>
    <name>Coast Seafood Palm Beach County FL</name>
    <description><![CDATA[Overview<br/>Type: Seafood restaurant<br/><br/>Best known for: Fresh seafood and excellent service<br/><br/>Location context: South J Street, near local neighborhoods<br/><br/>Price level: $20–60 per person<br/><br/>Visit timing: Not mentioned<br/><br/>Typical Customers<br/>Demographics: Locals and tourists<br/><br/>Group types: Couples, families, friends<br/><br/>Common occasions: Casual dinners, special occasions<br/><br/>Vibe & Setting<br/>Atmosphere: Cozy and intimate<br/><br/>Noise level: Moderate<br/><br/>Decor & setting: Indoor seating with casual decor<br/><br/>Service style: Attentive and friendly<br/><br/>Recommended Dishes<br/>Overall dish consensus<br/>Reviewers frequently praise the fresh seafood dishes, particularly the stone crab claws and shrimp and grits.<br/><br/>How “top dishes” are determined<br/>Top dishes are chosen based on items mentioned in multiple reviews, being frequently ordered or highlighted in descriptions, and receiving positive comments directly associated with the dish.<br/><br/>Top dishes to order<br/>| Rank | Dish                   | Why it stands out                                      | How often it’s mentioned                     | Ideal for               |<br/>|------|------------------------|-------------------------------------------------------|---------------------------------------------|-------------------------|<br/>| 1    | Stone Crab Claws       | Described as fresh and a must-try seafood delight.   | Mentioned in many reviews                  | Sharing at the table    |<br/>| 2    | Shrimp and Grits      | Known for its comforting and flavorful combination.    | Appears in numerous photos                 | Hearty main             |<br/>| 3    | Swordfish              | Praised for being expertly cooked and delicious.      | Repeatedly called out as a favorite        | Special occasions        |<br/><br/>Good alternates / backup choices<br/>- Ahí Tuna Tostada: Notably fresh and flavorful, good for sharing.<br/>- Greek Salad: Light and refreshing, ideal as a starter.<br/>- Caesar Salad with Chicken: A popular choice for those looking for a hearty salad option.<br/><br/>Highlights (non‑dish positives from reviews)<br/>Excellent service: Multiple reviewers compliment the friendly and knowledgeable staff, enhancing the overall dining experience.<br/><br/>Cozy atmosphere: The restaurant is described as having a welcoming and laid-back vibe, perfect for relaxing over dinner.<br/><br/>Common Issues (from reviews)<br/>Not enough seating: Some customers noted a lack of space, which can lead to long waits during peak hours.<br/><br/>Limited operating hours: Reviews mention that the restaurant is closed on certain days, which may affect planning.<br/><br/>Practical Notes<br/>Reservation / wait: Walk-in friendly; reservations recommended, especially during busy times.<br/><br/>Accessibility: Not mentioned<br/><br/>Parking / transit: Street parking is available; check local regulations.<br/><br/>Best use case: Great for casual dinners with friends or family gatherings.<br/><br/>More info: https://www.google.com/maps/place/Coast+Seafood/@26.6154392,-80.0572629,19.52z/data=!4m13!1m5!2m4!1srestaurants!5m1!4e9!6e5!3m6!1s0x88d8d9002418ce15:0x4508d3b2b3bb7386!8m2!3d26.6151384!4d-80.0565203!15sCgtyZXN0YXVyYW50c1oNIgtyZXN0YXVyYW50c5IBEWZhbWlseV9yZXN0YXVyYW50mgFEQ2k5RFFVbFJRVU52WkVOb2RIbGpSamx2VDIxT1VscEhiR3BaVjNReVZXdGpkMVJ1U21GWU1EQjRWak5XY1dJeFJSQULgAQD6AQQIABA9!16s%2Fg%2F11y4h0gmcr?entry=ttu&g_ep=EgoyMDI2MDYxMC4wIKXMDSoASAFQAw%3D%3D]]></description>
