    <name>Colby &amp; Gale Service Station Damariscotta ME</name>
    <description><![CDATA[Colby & Gale Service Station<br/><br/>📍 105 Main Street, Damariscotta, ME<br/><br/>A local Main Street institution — not a sight to visit, but worth knowing about: an old-fashioned full-service gas station known for exceptional, friendly customer service.<br/><br/>Tips<br/>- Practical stop, not a destination — good option if the car needs gas while downtown.]]></description>
