  <Placemark>
    <name>Cold Hollow Cider Mill Waterbury VT</name>
    <description><![CDATA[Cold Hollow Cider Mill<br/><br/>📍 Waterbury VT<br/><br/>Working cider mill with free daily rack-and-cloth pressing demos, cider tastings, legendary cider donuts, and a large Vermont gift shop on Route 100.<br/><br/>Tips<br/>- The cider donuts are the real draw — get them fresh.<br/>- Free to visit; no ticket needed for the tasting and mill viewing.]]></description>
