  <Placemark>
    <name>Community Wellness Trail Rockport ME</name>
    <description><![CDATA[Community Wellness Trail<br/><br/>📍 800 Commercial St, Rockport, ME<br/><br/>A well-groomed local path with genuinely nice views — an easy, low-key stroll away from the harbor crowds. (4.9★, 34 reviews on Google Maps)<br/><br/>Tips<br/>- Groomed, easy walking — good option for a short leg-stretch]]></description>
