    <name>Cooksey Drive Overlook Bar Harbor ME</name>
    <description><![CDATA[Cooksey Drive Overlook<br/><br/>📍 Cooksey Dr, Bar Harbor, ME<br/><br/>A short trail off Cooksey Drive leading to a beautiful rocky-shore coastline view — a genuine local find, not on the main Park Loop Road circuit. (4.8★, 82 reviews on Google Maps)<br/><br/>Tips<br/>- Short walk from the road, not a roadside pull-off<br/>- Quieter than the Park Loop Road overlooks since it's off the main circuit]]></description>
