    <description><![CDATA[Copita is a restaurant that specializes in seafood and meats, offering dishes like halibut and pork chop. Prices range from $40 to $90 per person. It is open for dinner only, from 4 PM to 9 PM, and serves alcohol.<br/><br/>More info: https://www.google.com/maps/place/Copita/@44.2926403,-68.2887328,1102m/data=!3m1!1e3!4m6!3m5!1s0x4caebd63b9a1bba7:0x6d57e27958a53c3e!8m2!3d44.2949009!4d-68.2892824!16s%2Fg%2F11j9d3rs8q?entry=ttu&g_ep=EgoyMDI2MDYxNi4wIKXMDSoASAFQAw%3D%3D]]></description>
