    <name>Corea Heath Gouldsboro ME</name>
    <description><![CDATA[Corea Heath<br/><br/>📍 Route 195 (Corea Road), Gouldsboro, ME (2 mi from Prospect Harbor)<br/><br/>600 acres connecting to a National Wildlife Refuge and Grand Marsh — extensive wetlands, beaver ponds, and jack pine stands. Strong birdwatching for waterfowl and rare plants. 1-1.25 mi loop.<br/><br/>Tips<br/>- Good birding stop — bring binoculars]]></description>
