    <name>Cornell Cooperative Extension of Dutchess County Millbrook NY</name>
    <description><![CDATA[Cornell Cooperative Extension of Dutchess County<br/><br/>📍 2715 Route 44, Millbrook, NY 12545<br/><br/>Provides educational programs for youth, adults, families and communities while enhancing the economic, social, agricultural and natural resources of Dutchess County. Also home to the Dutchess County Farm & Home Center.<br/><br/>Tips<br/>- Call 845/677-3488 for visitor information.<br/>- Stop 1 of 17 on the Washington & Amenia Scenic Tour (Tour 4), near the start of the route off Route 44 East.]]></description>
