    <name>Cosima's Preserve Bristol ME</name>
    <description><![CDATA[Cosima's Preserve<br/><br/>📍 460 Benner Road, Bristol, ME<br/><br/>44.5-acre property (gift 2016) with a ledge overlook on a quiet stretch of the Pemaquid River — 1,100 ft of frontage, old stone walls, and wading-bird/turtle/amphibian habitat. ~0.6-0.8 mi loop, 98 ft gain.<br/><br/>More info: https://www.coastalrivers.org/trails/cosimas-preserve/]]></description>
