    <name>Cosimo's Trattoria &amp; Bar</name>
    <description><![CDATA[Cosimo's is an Italian restaurant offering a variety of dishes, including pizzas and pasta. The price range is $20-$30 per person. It opens for lunch and dinner, serving alcohol.<br/><br/>More info: https://www.google.com/maps/place/Cosimo's+Trattoria+%26+Bar/@41.7110314,-73.960344,5827m/data=!3m1!1e3!4m6!3m5!1s0x89dd3e09b3a52dff:0x1bbd940eb36ff5ad!8m2!3d41.7157833!4d-73.9335667!16s%2Fg%2F1thsscr8?entry=ttu&g_ep=EgoyMDI2MDcwOC4wIKXMDSoASAFQAw%3D%3D]]></description>
