  <Placemark>
    <name>Cottekill Village Rosendale NY</name>
    <description><![CDATA[Cottekill Village<br/><br/>📍 Cottekill, Town of Rosendale, NY<br/><br/>A small hamlet in the northwest part of the Town of Rosendale, home to the Rosendale Town Hall. One of several historic hamlets making up the Town of Rosendale — alongside Binnewater, Bloomington, Bruceville, Creeklocks, and part of High Falls — shaped by the same 19th-century natural-cement boom that built Rosendale and Widow Jane Mine nearby.<br/><br/>Tips<br/>- A quiet drive-through hamlet rather than a visitor attraction — worth a slow pass on the way between Rosendale and High Falls.<br/><br/>More info: https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=41.8534%2C%20-74.1059]]></description>
    <styleUrl>#c-green</styleUrl>
