  <Placemark>
    <name>Covered Bridge Campground Albany NH</name>
    <description><![CDATA[Covered Bridge Campground<br/><br/>📍 Kancamagus Highway, Albany, NH<br/><br/>A White Mountain National Forest campground near the eastern end of the Kancamagus Highway, named for its proximity to the Albany (Swift River) Covered Bridge.<br/><br/>Tips<br/>- Reserve ahead in peak summer/fall — the eastern Kancamagus corridor is one of the busiest stretches of the byway.<br/><br/>More info: https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=44.0041%2C%20-71.2325]]></description>
