  <Placemark>
    <name>Cranberry Lake Preserve North White Plains, NY</name>
    <description><![CDATA[Cranberry Lake Preserve<br/><br/>📍 North White Plains, NY<br/><br/>A quiet Westchester County nature preserve centered on a small glacial lake, with wetland boardwalks and wooded trails — a low-key nature stop at the southern end of this Taconic Byway list, near Kensico Dam Plaza.<br/><br/>Tips<br/>- Nature center on-site has trail maps and info on local wildlife.<br/>- Good pairing with Kensico Dam Plaza, a short drive away.<br/><br/>More info: https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=41.079157,-73.755711]]></description>
