  <Placemark>
    <name>Crawford Notch NH</name>
    <description><![CDATA[Crawford Notch<br/><br/>📍 Route 302, between Bartlett and Bretton Woods, NH<br/><br/>A steep-walled mountain pass carrying Route 302 between the Presidential and Franconia ranges — one of the classic drives in the White Mountains, with waterfalls (Flume Cascade, Silver Cascade, Arethusa Falls) and pull-offs along the way.<br/><br/>Tips<br/>- Slow going with lots of stops if doing it right — budget extra time versus what a map estimates.<br/>- Pairs naturally with a Mount Washington/Bretton Woods day given the direct Route 302 connection.<br/><br/>More info: https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=44.2179%2C%20-71.4112]]></description>
