    <name>Crockett Cove Woods Preserve Deer Isle ME</name>
    <description><![CDATA[Crockett Cove Woods Preserve<br/><br/>📍 Deer Isle ME<br/><br/>98-acre Nature Conservancy preserve of fog-shrouded coastal spruce forest with quiet walking trails.<br/><br/>Tips<br/>- Easy, quiet trail — good for a peaceful midday break.<br/>- Free to visit.]]></description>
