  <Placemark>
    <name>Crowley Cheese Healdville VT</name>
    <description><![CDATA[Crowley Cheese<br/><br/>📍 Healdville VT<br/><br/>America's oldest continuously operating cheese factory, producing a hand-washed colby-style cheese in the same wooden building since 1882, using 19th-century wooden vats and traditional methods unchanged in over a century. A living piece of American food history — not a tourist attraction but an actual working factory where you can watch the process and buy direct.<br/><br/>Tips<br/>- Open Mon–Fri, 8am–4pm; small, no formal tour — just knock and ask.<br/>- The Colby-style cheese is made fresh weekly; the sharp aged version is exceptional.<br/>- 45 minutes south of Woodstock in Healdville — worth combining with a Ludlow or Okemo area visit.<br/>- Call ahead (802-259-2340) to confirm production days if the process is your primary interest.]]></description>
    <styleUrl>#c-green</styleUrl>
