  <Placemark>
    <name>Cucina Woodstock, NY</name>
    <description><![CDATA[Cucina<br/><br/>📍 Woodstock, NY<br/><br/>A converted farmhouse with wraparound porch serving rustic Italian farmhouse cooking driven by the season — considered one of the best overall dinners in the Hudson Valley.<br/><br/>Must Order<br/>- Handmade pasta — changes with what is available<br/>- Roast chicken or pork — farmhouse cooking at its finest<br/><br/>Tips<br/>- Reservations strongly recommended<br/>- The wraparound porch is spectacular in September — request it<br/>- Wine list skews Italian with Hudson Valley additions<br/><br/>More info: https://www.google.com/maps/search/Cucina+Woodstock,+NY]]></description>
