  <Placemark>
    <name>Curtis Island Overlook Camden ME</name>
    <description><![CDATA[Curtis Island Overlook<br/><br/>📍 Bayview Street, Camden, ME<br/><br/>A small, easy-to-miss shoreline viewing spot on Bayview Street offering one of the best land-based views of the historic Curtis Island Lighthouse. Rarely draws a crowd since most harbor visitors stick to the main harbor walk or the known lighthouse parking areas.<br/><br/>Tips<br/>- Located on Bayview Street, easy to drive past<br/>- Excellent lighthouse views without the crowds<br/>- Small parking area, intimate setting<br/>- Good for sunrise or sunset photos<br/>- Locals' secret spot for lighthouse appreciation]]></description>
