    <name>Cushman Preserve Wiscasset ME</name>
    <description><![CDATA[Chewonki's Cushman Preserve<br/><br/>📍 Cushman Preserve Access Rd, Wiscasset, ME<br/><br/>A quiet Chewonki-managed nature preserve with real wildlife-watching potential — ducks, geese, and herons reported by visitors. (4.7★, 9 reviews on Google Maps)<br/><br/>Tips<br/>- Good low-key birding stop — bring binoculars<br/>- Low review count reflects genuine obscurity, not low quality]]></description>
