  <Placemark>
    <name>DaVinci's Eatery Lewiston ME</name>
    <description><![CDATA[Time: 2026-08-22T12:00:00<br/><br/>DaVinci's Eatery<br/><br/>📍 150 Mill St, Lewiston, ME 04240<br/><br/>One of five candidate lunch stops for the Bar Harbor → North Conway drive (2026-08-22) — Auburn/Lewiston sits almost exactly at the noon mark, ~150 miles / 3 hours in. DaVinci's occupies the historic Bates Mill Complex and serves a full Italian-American menu; the strongest pick here if you want an actual sit-down meal rather than a quick counter stop.<br/><br/>Must Order<br/>- Garlic knots — the most consistently praised item<br/>- Lasagna — a house specialty<br/><br/>Tips<br/>- Open Saturdays 11am–10pm, so lunch timing isn't tight<br/>- Located inside the Bates Mill Complex — worth a quick look at the historic building itself<br/><br/>More info: https://www.google.com/maps/place/DaVinci's+Eatery/@44.0936454,-70.2181866,17z]]></description>
