  <Placemark>
    <name>Dahlia's at The Asticou Hotel Northeast Harbor ME</name>
    <description><![CDATA[Dahlia's is a restaurant located at the Asticou Hotel, known for its excellent food and well-trained staff. It attracts a diverse clientele, including travelers and locals, and is popular for various occasions such as family gatherings and casual dining. The overall vibe is upscale yet casual, making it suitable for both quiet meals and lively gatherings. Customers consistently praise the great menu, exceptional service, and the quality of the food, while there are no significant complaints mentioned in recent reviews.<br/><br/>More info: https://www.google.com/maps/place/Dahlia's+at+The+Asticou+Hotel/@44.295516,-68.3002085,3142m/data=!3m1!1e3!4m6!3m5!1s0x4caebd4594324085:0x8566f5c13edbca3c!8m2!3d44.3035123!4d-68.281956!16s%2Fg%2F11zcgvjn_l?entry=ttu&g_ep=EgoyMDI2MDYxMC4wIKXMDSoASAFQAw%3D%3D]]></description>
