  <Placemark>
    <name>Damariscotta Farmers Market Damariscotta ME</name>
    <description><![CDATA[Damariscotta Farmers' Market<br/><br/>📍 Round Top Farm, Damariscotta, ME 04543<br/><br/>Held on the meadows of Round Top Farm, a former dairy farm now run by the Coastal Rivers Conservation Trust, overlooking the Damariscotta River. Vendors include Broad Arrow Farm, Dee's Teas, Goranson Farm, Hootenanny Bakery, and other regional farmers and makers selling vegetables, cheese, honey, meat, seafood, and baked goods. A smaller Monday market also runs in downtown Damariscotta.<br/><br/>Tips<br/>- Fridays 9 AM–12 PM, May 16 – October 31, rain or shine<br/>- Round Top Farm itself has walking trails and river views worth lingering for after shopping<br/>- Damariscotta is well known for oysters — worth combining with a raw bar stop given the market's seafood vendors<br/><br/>More info: https://www.google.com/maps/search/Round+Top+Farm+Damariscotta+ME]]></description>
    <styleUrl>#c-green</styleUrl>
    <ExtendedData>
