    </Point>
  </Placemark>
  <Placemark>
    <name>Damariscotta River Cruises Damariscotta ME</name>
    <description><![CDATA[Damariscotta River Cruises<br/><br/>📍 47 Main St, Damariscotta, ME 04543<br/><br/>Narrated boat cruises on the Damariscotta River, known especially for oyster-farm and wildlife viewing — seals and eagles are common sightings.<br/><br/>Tips<br/>- Good pairing with a stop at Sherman's or Ann's on Main Street before/after<br/><br/>More info: https://damariscottarivercruises.com/]]></description>
