    <name>Damariscotta River Grill Damariscotta ME</name>
    <description><![CDATA[Damariscotta River Grill<br/><br/>📍 Damariscotta ME<br/><br/>Long-running local favorite with river oysters always on the menu and a warm Main Street setting.<br/><br/>Must Order<br/>- River oysters<br/><br/>Tips<br/>- Reliable choice right on Main Street.]]></description>
