  <Placemark>
    <name>Darby's Belfast ME</name>
    <description><![CDATA[Darby's<br/><br/>📍 155 High St, Belfast, ME 04915<br/><br/>Historic downtown "from scratch" restaurant and pub — enhanced comfort food from mac & cheese to a famous pad thai. Rated 4.1 on Tripadvisor (#3 of 35 Belfast restaurants, 498 reviews).<br/><br/>Tips<br/>- Mon-Thu 11:30am-8pm, Fri/Sat 11:30am-8:30pm, closed Sunday.<br/>- One of the few Belfast spots open Mondays per reviewers.<br/><br/>More info: https://www.facebook.com/DarbysRestaurant/]]></description>
