    <description><![CDATA[Overview<br/>Type: American Restaurant<br/><br/>Best known for: Cozy ambiance and elevated diner food.<br/><br/>Location context: Not specified<br/><br/>Price level: $20–30 per person<br/><br/>Visit timing: Popular during dinner hours<br/><br/>Typical Customers<br/>Demographics: Mix of locals and visitors, including families and groups<br/><br/>Group types: Couples, friends, families, larger groups<br/><br/>Common occasions: Casual dinner, date night, quick bite<br/><br/>Vibe & Setting<br/>Atmosphere: Casual and cozy with a lively vibe<br/><br/>Noise level: Moderate<br/><br/>Decor & setting: Indoor seating, vibrant atmosphere<br/><br/>Service style: Friendly and attentive<br/><br/>Recommended Dishes<br/>Overall dish consensus<br/>Reviewers frequently mention the Fried Chicken Sandwich and Burnt Ends as must-try items, noting their flavor and quality.<br/><br/>How “top dishes” are determined<br/>Top dishes are identified based on their popularity in user reviews, including frequent mentions and positive feedback.<br/><br/>Top dishes to order<br/>Rank	Dish	Why it stands out	How often it’s mentioned	Ideal for<br/>1	Fried Chicken Sandwich	Juicy and flavorful, a crowd favorite.	Mentioned in many reviews	Sharing at the table<br/>2	Burnt Ends	Tender and rich, widely praised for taste.	Repeatedly called out as a favorite	Hearty main<br/>(Add rows 3-6 if more dishes are highlighted)<br/><br/>Good alternates / backup choices<br/>Not mentioned.<br/><br/>Highlights (non‑dish positives from reviews)<br/>Atmosphere: Enjoyable ambiance praised by many guests.<br/><br/>Service: Attentive staff enhances the dining experience.<br/><br/>Positive Dishes: Variety caters to both vegan and meat options, pleasing diverse groups.<br/><br/>Common Issues (from reviews)<br/>Not mentioned.<br/><br/>Practical Notes<br/>Reservation / wait: Walk-in friendly; no mentions of long waits.<br/><br/>Accessibility: Not mentioned.<br/><br/>Parking / transit: Not mentioned.<br/><br/>Best use case: Great for casual dinners with friends or family.<br/><br/>More info: https://www.google.com/maps/place/Darlings/@41.8290427,-74.0715703,826m/data=!3m1!1e3!4m14!1m7!3m6!1s0x89dd1b734f281aef:0x9a38952f0af350c7!2sDarlings!8m2!3d41.8290387!4d-74.0689954!16s%2Fg%2F11sz3_56mr!3m5!1s0x89dd1b734f281aef:0x9a38952f0af350c7!8m2!3d41.8290387!4d-74.0689954!16s%2Fg%2F11sz3_56mr?entry=ttu&g_ep=EgoyMDI2MDYxMy4wIKXMDSoASAFQAw%3D%3D]]></description>
