  <Placemark>
    <name>Day Mountain Trail Seal Harbor ME</name>
    <description><![CDATA[Day Mountain Trail<br/><br/>📍 Parking on Route 3/Champlain Rd, near Seal Harbor, ME (~0.8 mi from trail start)<br/><br/>A 2.1-mile easy out-and-back trail up Day Mountain, near Seal Harbor — one of Acadia's lesser-known peaks despite genuinely good summit views. Rated 4.6★ on AllTrails; one hiker reported seeing "no hikers and just a few bikes" during their visit.<br/><br/>Tips<br/>- Also a popular carriage-road biking summit — expect to share the trail with a few cyclists, if anyone<br/>- Parking is on Route 3/Champlain Rd, about 0.8 mi from the actual trail start]]></description>
