  <Placemark>
    <name>Day Ridges Preserve Gouldsboro ME</name>
    <description><![CDATA[Day Ridges Preserve<br/><br/>📍 Route 1, ~0.9 mi east of the Route 195 junction, Gouldsboro, ME<br/><br/>Opened 2021 — bog-bridged nature trails (2 mi) through a cedar swamp with a beaver pond viewpoint, plus a paddler's trail from Lower to Upper West Bay Pond with an onsite canoe-loan program.<br/><br/>Tips<br/>- Onsite canoe loans for the paddler's trail — no need to bring your own boat]]></description>
