  <Placemark>
    <name>Deer Mountain Campground Pittsburg NH</name>
    <description><![CDATA[Deer Mountain Campground<br/><br/>📍 Pittsburg, NH<br/><br/>A campground near First Connecticut Lake, in the far north of Pittsburg close to the Quebec border.<br/><br/>Tips<br/>- Very far north — good base for fishing the Connecticut Lakes chain or exploring the border area.<br/><br/>More info: https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=45.1912%2C%20-71.1920]]></description>
