  <Placemark>
    <name>Deer Mountain Errol NH</name>
    <description><![CDATA[Deer Mountain<br/><br/>📍 Near Errol, NH<br/><br/>A peak near Umbagog Lake and Errol, along the Moose Path Trail corridor. (Not the same Deer Mountain that has a campground named for it up in Pittsburg.)<br/><br/>Tips<br/>- No well-documented public trail found — treat as a landmark rather than a planned hike unless you find current access info locally.<br/><br/>More info: https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=44.7148%2C%20-71.2220]]></description>
