    <description><![CDATA[Delaney's is a bar & grill offering American cuisine with a price range of $20-30 per person. It is open for lunch and dinner, closing at 9 PM.<br/><br/>More info: https://www.google.com/maps/place/Delaney's+Hole+In+the+Wall/@44.0574218,-71.1384499,699m/data=!3m1!1e3!4m14!1m7!3m6!1s0x4cb3a0bf793f9bfb:0x6c5284ed20196b08!2sVia+Roma+Pizza+%26+Mediterranean!8m2!3d44.0363957!4d-71.1223054!16s%2Fg%2F11r9lxtgw!3m5!1s0x4cb3a1bad396287f:0x5a6e34938df807e4!8m2!3d44.0584878!4d-71.1358059!16s%2Fg%2F1tgtf2s8?entry=ttu&g_ep=EgoyMDI2MDcxMi4wIKXMDSoASAFQAw%3D%3D]]></description>
