    <description><![CDATA[Delaney's is a bar & grill serving casual American cuisine, with prices typically ranging from $20 to $30 per person. It is open for lunch and dinner, specifically from 11:30 AM to 9 PM on weekends and select days.<br/><br/>More info: https://www.google.com/maps/place/Delaney's+Hole+In+the+Wall/@44.0584878,-71.1358059,790m/data=!3m2!1e3!4b1!4m6!3m5!1s0x4cb3a1bad396287f:0x5a6e34938df807e4!8m2!3d44.0584878!4d-71.1358059!16s%2Fg%2F1tgtf2s8?entry=ttu&g_ep=EgoyMDI2MDcwOC4wIKXMDSoASAFQAw%3D%3D]]></description>
