  <Placemark>
    <name>Delectables By Danette</name>
    <description><![CDATA[Delectables by Danette is a bakery specializing in cakes and pastries. Prices for baked goods are generally affordable, but specific items weren't listed. The bakery is not open for dinner and has limited hours.<br/><br/>More info: https://www.google.com/maps/place/Delectables+By+Danette/@44.0523908,-71.1286389,593m/data=!3m1!1e3!4m14!1m7!3m6!1s0x4cb3a0bf793f9bfb:0x6c5284ed20196b08!2sVia+Roma+Pizza+%26+Mediterranean!8m2!3d44.0363957!4d-71.1223054!16s%2Fg%2F11r9lxtgw!3m5!1s0x4cb3a0e3272705b1:0xac31b2cbada05ca6!8m2!3d44.0533711!4d-71.125332!16s%2Fg%2F11cnbmd0g8?entry=ttu&g_ep=EgoyMDI2MDcxMi4wIKXMDSoASAFQAw%3D%3D]]></description>
