  <Placemark>
    <name>Delvino’s Grill &amp; Pasta House Belfast ME</name>
    <description><![CDATA[Delvino’s Grill & Pasta House<br/><br/>Delvino’s sits in the heart of downtown Belfast and presents itself as a classic restaurant with a modern twist. Local listings highlight its use of regional flavors, locally sourced produce in season, fresh seafood, and house-made soups, salads, and pasta.[cite:66][cite:69]<br/><br/>The restaurant also occupies a building with local history. According to Delvino’s, the space once housed a hardware store owned by George O. Bailey, a Belfast mayor and Civil War veteran, which adds a layer of historic character to the dining experience.[cite:75]]]></description>
