  <Placemark>
    <name>Dennett's Wharf Castine ME</name>
    <description><![CDATA[Dennett's Wharf<br/><br/>📍 Castine ME<br/><br/>Rebuilt waterfront institution serving classic lobster rolls and pub fare right on the dock.<br/><br/>Must Order<br/>- Lobster roll<br/><br/>Tips<br/>- Dockside seating — great for a casual lunch.]]></description>
