  <Placemark>
    <name>Depuy Canal House High Falls, NY</name>
    <description><![CDATA[Depuy Canal House<br/><br/>📍 High Falls, NY<br/><br/>An 1797 stone tavern — one of the Hudson Valley's most historic dining rooms — serving weekend dinners and Sunday brunch in a genuinely atmospheric setting.<br/><br/>Must Order<br/>- Sunday brunch prix fixe — the signature meal — book well ahead<br/>- Seasonal game and fish — the kitchen leans traditional and local<br/>- House desserts — old-fashioned and excellent<br/><br/>Tips<br/>- Dinner Fri–Sat only; Sunday brunch — confirm current schedule by phone<br/>- Request a table by the fireplace in September<br/>- One of the most historically atmospheric meals in the entire region<br/><br/>More info: https://www.google.com/maps/search/Depuy+Canal+House+High+Falls,+NY]]></description>
