  <Placemark>
    <name>Depuy Canal House Restaurant High Falls, NY</name>
    <description><![CDATA[Depuy Canal House Restaurant<br/><br/>📍 High Falls, NY<br/><br/>Once housing for D&H Canal workers, this stone building on the byway's High Falls stretch is now a well-regarded restaurant in the heart of the hamlet.<br/><br/>Tips<br/>- Rt 213, High Falls<br/>- Pair with a stop at the nearby D&H Canal Museum and Five Locks Walk<br/><br/>More info: https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=41.8297%2C%20-74.1330]]></description>
