    <name>Diana's Baths Bartlett NH</name>
    <description><![CDATA[Diana's Baths<br/><br/>📍 Bartlett NH<br/><br/>Easy 1.2-mile family-friendly hike to a series of cascading granite pools and small waterfalls in White Mountain National Forest.<br/><br/>Tips<br/>- Easy, family-friendly — good for kids.<br/>- Can be combined with the Echo Lake/Cathedral Ledge loop for a longer hike.]]></description>
