  <Placemark>
    <name>Diana's Kitchen &amp; Bar Chatham MA</name>
    <description><![CDATA[Overview<br/>Type: Restaurant<br/><br/>Best known for: Excellent food and service, cozy atmosphere.<br/><br/>Location context: Main St, Chatham<br/><br/>Price level: $10–30<br/><br/>Visit timing: Popular for lunch and dinner.<br/><br/>Typical Customers<br/>Demographics: Locals and visitors, mostly casual diners.<br/><br/>Group types: Couples, families, friends, larger groups.<br/><br/>Common occasions: Casual dinner, quick bite, special occasions.<br/><br/>Vibe & Setting<br/>Atmosphere: Cozy and friendly, casual dining environment.<br/><br/>Noise level: Moderate.<br/><br/>Decor & setting: Indoor seating; casual ambiance.<br/><br/>Service style: Attentive and friendly.<br/><br/>Recommended Dishes<br/>Overall dish consensus<br/>Reviewers highly recommend the half roasted chicken and the arugula and sweet potato salad for their incredible flavors and quality. The Braised Pork Roast is also praised for being excellent. <br/><br/>How “top dishes” are determined<br/>Top dishes are chosen based on mentions from the Google Maps page and user reviews, focusing on popular items highlighted often with strong praise and those featured prominently in the photos.<br/><br/>| Rank | Dish                         | Why it stands out                                | How often it’s mentioned               | Ideal for                    |<br/>|------|------------------------------|--------------------------------------------------|--------------------------------------|------------------------------|<br/>| 1    | Half Roasted Chicken         | Incredible flavor and perfectly cooked.         | Mentioned in multiple reviews.      | Hearty main                  |<br/>| 2    | Arugula and Sweet Potato Salad | Surprising and delightful; highly praised.       | Repeatedly called out as a favorite.| Lighter option               |<br/>| 3    | Braised Pork Roast           | Amazing dish with a great flavor profile.       | Mentioned positively in reviews.    | Hearty main                  |<br/><br/>Good alternates / backup choices<br/>- Hash: Fantastic and worth ordering extra sides.<br/>- Crab Chowder: Perfectly seasoned and delicious.<br/><br/>Highlights (non‑dish positives from reviews)<br/>Service quality: Staff are friendly and professional, contributing to a comfortable dining experience.<br/><br/>Atmosphere: Cozy and inviting, enhancing the overall dining experience.<br/><br/>Common Issues (from reviews)<br/>Not mentioned.<br/><br/>Practical Notes<br/>Reservation / wait: Walk-in friendly; no long waits reported.<br/><br/>Accessibility: Not mentioned.<br/><br/>Parking / transit: Street parking available; transit notes not mentioned.<br/><br/>Best use case: Best for casual dinners and quick bites.<br/><br/>More info: https://www.google.com/maps/place/Diana's+Kitchen+%26+Bar/@41.674299,-69.9654547,3217m/data=!3m1!1e3!4m13!1m5!2m4!1sRestaurants!5m1!4e9!6e5!3m6!1s0x89fb15b56d573311:0x782ebf0d96b39467!8m2!3d41.6824044!4d-69.9610282!15sCgtSZXN0YXVyYW50c1oNIgtyZXN0YXVyYW50c5IBCnJlc3RhdXJhbnSaAURDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnh3TVU1R1JsVlZSR1JwVFRKS2FGUkhNV2hXUlVZd1kwWk9UbFpIWXhBQuABAPoBBAgAEEw!16s%2Fg%2F11ypkqk5rt?entry=ttu&g_ep=EgoyMDI2MDYxMC4wIKXMDSoASAFQAw%3D%3D]]></description>
