  <Placemark>
    <name>Dinsmore Golf Course Staatsburg NY</name>
    <description><![CDATA[Dinsmore Golf Course<br/><br/>📍 5371 Albany Post Rd, Staatsburg, NY 12580<br/><br/>Said to be the nation's second oldest private golf course, the original 9-hole course was used by the River families for their games and tournaments. Brick buildings near the road are part of the Mills' farm complex. Now a public course.<br/><br/>Tips<br/>- Call 845/889-4082 or 845/889-3126 for visitor information.<br/>- Nearby is one of the most beautiful views of the river and mountains in the entire valley, from the Ironwood Grille Restaurant parking area.<br/>- Stop 11 of 26 on the Hyde Park, Clinton & Pleasant Valley Scenic Tour (Tour 3).]]></description>
