  <Placemark>
    <name>Dixville Notch Heritage Trail Colebrook NH</name>
    <description><![CDATA[Dixville Notch Heritage Trail<br/><br/>📍 Dixville Notch, near Colebrook, NH<br/><br/>A trail through Dixville Notch with interpretive stops on the area's history — tied to the once-grand (now-former) Balsams resort and the dramatic granite notch scenery.<br/><br/>Tips<br/>- Combine with Table Rock and Dixville Notch State Park, both right in the same corridor.<br/><br/>More info: https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=44.8765%2C%20-71.3611]]></description>
