  <Placemark>
    <name>Dog Mountain Saint Johnsbury VT</name>
    <description><![CDATA[Dog Mountain<br/><br/>📍 Saint Johnsbury VT<br/><br/>150-acre nonprofit dog park with hiking trails, ponds, and the famous folk-art Dog Chapel built by Stephen Huneck.<br/><br/>Tips<br/>- Free to visit — bring the dog and let them roam off-leash.<br/>- The Dog Chapel is covered wall-to-wall in visitor notes and photos of pets — worth a slow walk through.]]></description>
