    <description><![CDATA[Dogwood Knolls Golf Course<br/><br/>📍 722 Route 376, Fishkill Plains, East Fishkill, NY 12533<br/><br/>Est. 1937, a scenic championship 9-hole course, set among low hills.<br/><br/>Tips<br/>- Call 845/226-7317 for visitor information.<br/>- Stop 36 of 38 on the Beacon & Fishkill Heritage Tour (Tour 7).]]></description>
