    <description><![CDATA[Dos Gatos Gastropub is a restaurant that serves Mexican cuisine, with a price range of $20–30 per person. It is open for dinner, opening at 4:30 PM.<br/><br/>More info: https://www.google.com/maps/place/Dos+Gatos+Gastropub/@44.4221712,-69.0166066,2023m/data=!3m1!1e3!4m13!1m5!2m4!1sRestaurants!5m1!4e9!6e5!3m6!1s0x4cae6fb5d213bc45:0xb879e6321de9b350!8m2!3d44.4263135!4d-69.0065053!15sCgtSZXN0YXVyYW50c1oNIgtyZXN0YXVyYW50c5IBCnJlc3RhdXJhbnSaAURDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnMxYmsxRVRuUmlWbXd5VFZaT2RWb3djRWxVUmtwbVRucEplRlZHUlJBQuABAPoBBAgXEEo!16s%2Fg%2F11vlmrz4q9?entry=ttu&g_ep=EgoyMDI2MDcxMy4wIKXMDSoASAFQAw%3D%3D]]></description>
