  <Placemark>
    <name>Dover Stone Church NY</name>
    <description><![CDATA[Dover Stone Church<br/><br/>📍 Stone Church Path, Dover Plains, NY 12522<br/><br/>Pequot Chief Sassacus is said to have hidden in the cave called Dover Stone Church, escaping English soldiers after the massacre at New London. The site is near the hamlet for future opening.<br/><br/>Tips<br/>- Call Town Hall 845/832-6111 for visitor information.<br/>- Stop 39 of 39 (final stop) on the Union Vale, Beekman, Pawling & Dover Scenic Tour (Tour 6).]]></description>
