  <Placemark>
    <name>Downing Deadwater Franklin ME</name>
    <description><![CDATA[Downing Deadwater<br/><br/>📍 Near Donnell Pond Public Reserved Land, Franklin, ME<br/><br/>A "deadwater" — Maine terminology for a slow, flat, pond-like stretch of a stream — near Donnell Pond Public Reserved Land, likely a quiet spot for paddling or fishing.<br/><br/>Tips<br/>- No well-documented public access info found — verify current conditions/access locally before planning a paddle here.<br/><br/>More info: https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=44.6181%2C%20-68.0233]]></description>
