  <Placemark>
    <name>Doyle Preserve Damariscotta ME</name>
    <description><![CDATA[Doyle Preserve<br/><br/>📍 Castaway Cove Road, off Egypt Road (off Biscay Road), Damariscotta, ME (coordinate approximate — not a confirmed exact trailhead pin)<br/><br/>1994 gift from the Doyle-Finnegan family — 1,200 ft of Pemaquid Pond shoreline, glacial erratics with rock tripe, and a spur to easement-accessible Doyle Finnegan Island. ~1.1 mi loop, 114 ft gain.<br/><br/>Tips<br/>- Coordinate is approximate — verify before relying on it for navigation<br/><br/>More info: https://www.coastalrivers.org/trails/doyle-preserve/]]></description>
