  <Placemark>
    <name>Drifters Chatham MA</name>
    <description><![CDATA[Overview  <br/>Type: Restaurant  <br/>  <br/>Best known for: Fresh oysters and delicious pasta dishes.  <br/>  <br/>Location context: 2642 Main St  <br/>  <br/>Price level: $30–50 per person  <br/>  <br/>Visit timing: Opens at 5 PM daily  <br/>  <br/>Typical Customers  <br/>Demographics: Locals and tourists  <br/>  <br/>Group types: Couples, friends, families  <br/>  <br/>Common occasions: Casual dinner, date night  <br/>  <br/>Vibe & Setting  <br/>Atmosphere: Casual, cozy with a pub vibe  <br/>  <br/>Noise level: Moderate  <br/>  <br/>Decor & setting: Indoor seating, warm ambiance  <br/>  <br/>Service style: Attentive and friendly  <br/>  <br/>Recommended Dishes  <br/>Overall dish consensus  <br/>Reviewers consistently praise the moules frites, wings, and pasta dishes like the short rib pasta.  <br/>  <br/>How “top dishes” are determined  <br/>Top dishes are identified based on items frequently mentioned in reviews, noted as popular, or highlighted in photos.  <br/>  <br/>| Rank | Dish                | Why it stands out                                     | How often it’s mentioned         | Ideal for                  |<br/>|------|--------------------|------------------------------------------------------|----------------------------------|-----------------------------|<br/>| 1    | Moules Frites      | Praised for fresh flavor and perfect preparation.    | Mentioned in many reviews        | Sharing at the table       |<br/>| 2    | Short Rib Pasta    | Celebrated for rich taste and hearty portion size.   | Repeatedly called out as a favorite| Hearty main               |<br/>| 3    | Buffalo Wings      | Known for excellent flavor and crispy texture.       | Appears in numerous reviews      | Casual snacks              |<br/>  <br/>Good alternates / backup choices  <br/>- Jayne Burger: Noted for its satisfying flavor, ideal for burger enthusiasts.  <br/>- Chicken Wings: Consistently good for sharing or as snacks.  <br/>- Espresso Martini: Complimented for a strong, delightful flavor.  <br/>  <br/>Highlights (non‑dish positives from reviews)  <br/>Service quality: Staff is described as personable and knowledgeable, enhancing the dining experience.  <br/>  <br/>Atmosphere: The cozy pub-like environment contributes to a laid-back dining vibe, making it inviting.  <br/>  <br/>Common Issues (from reviews)  <br/>Timing of service: Some reviews mention occasional slower service, but it's not considered a significant issue.  <br/>  <br/>Practical Notes  <br/>Reservation / wait: Walk-in friendly, but reservations are advisable during peak times.  <br/>  <br/>Accessibility: Not mentioned  <br/>  <br/>Parking / transit: Street parking available; not mentioned if there's valet.  <br/>  <br/>Best use case: Great for casual dinner dates or meals with friends.<br/><br/>More info: https://www.google.com/maps/place/Drifters/@41.6784654,-70.0288148,351m/data=!3m1!1e3!4m11!1m3!2m2!1sfresh+oysters!6e5!3m6!1s0x89fb154b06b94e55:0x5c6ec2bf8e3b840b!8m2!3d41.6789929!4d-70.0268719!15sCg1mcmVzaCBveXN0ZXJzWg8iDWZyZXNoIG95c3RlcnOSAQpyZXN0YXVyYW50mgFEQ2k5RFFVbFJRVU52WkVOb2RIbGpSamx2VDJwa05sVlVVbFJqVkZKdlRtMDRkRmt5YkhCT1ZHUjZZbFJzWmxZeFJSQULgAQD6AQUIugEQNA!16s%2Fg%2F11s2l4371s?entry=ttu&g_ep=EgoyMDI2MDYxMC4wIKXMDSoASAFQAw%3D%3D]]></description>
