    <name>Duck Puddle Campgrounds Nobleboro ME</name>
    <description><![CDATA[Duck Puddle Campgrounds<br/><br/>📍 60 Campground Rd, Nobleboro, ME 04555<br/><br/>Waterfront campground on Pemaquid Lake, about 1.5 miles off coastal Route 1 and roughly 5 miles from Damariscotta.<br/><br/>More info: http://www.duckpuddlecampground.com/]]></description>
