  <Placemark>
    <name>Duckfat Portland ME</name>
    <description><![CDATA[Duckfat<br/><br/>📍 43 Middle Street, Portland, ME<br/><br/>Duckfat built its entire reputation on Belgian-style frites — hand-punched and twice-fried in rendered duck fat until impossibly crisp. The sauce sampler alone is worth the visit: truffle ketchup, Thai chili mayo, garlic mayo, horseradish mayo, and a rotating special.<br/><br/>Must Order<br/>- Belgian frites with sauce sampler<br/>- Poutine — duck gravy and Vermont cheese curds<br/>- Duck fat caramel milkshake — sea-salted, rich, and deeply savory-sweet<br/>- Daily panini specials<br/><br/>Tips<br/>- Arrive early or expect a wait — it's consistently one of Portland's most popular lunch spots<br/>- The Duckfat Frites Shack at Oxbow Beer & Bottling is a less crowded alternative for the same frites<br/>- Cash and card accepted; counter service<br/><br/>More info: https://www.google.com/maps/place/Duckfat,+43+Middle+St,+Portland,+ME]]></description>
