  <Placemark>
    <name>Dutchess Community College Poughkeepsie NY</name>
    <description><![CDATA[Dutchess Community College<br/><br/>📍 53 Pendell Rd, Poughkeepsie, NY 12601<br/><br/>Visitors welcome to Main Campus, public programs and the art gallery. In 1957 the Samuel W. Bowne Memorial Hospital on the former Pendell farm became the campus for this 2-year college offering associate degrees in liberal arts and technical fields. Part of the state university system, supported in part by Dutchess County.<br/><br/>Tips<br/>- Call 845/431-8000 for visitor information.<br/>- Stop 31 of 33 on the Poughkeepsie & LaGrange Scenic Tour (Tour 5).]]></description>
