  <Placemark>
    <name>Dutchess County Fairgrounds Rhinebeck NY</name>
    <description><![CDATA[Dutchess County Fairgrounds<br/><br/>📍 Spring Brook Ave, Rhinebeck, NY 12572<br/><br/>Fairs have been held at this site since the mid-1840s. Since 1919 the Dutchess County Fair has been held here annually the third week of August, attracting thousands of visitors from all over the Northeast.<br/><br/>Tips<br/>- Stop 32 of 33 on the Rhinebeck, Red Hook & Milan Scenic Tour (Tour 1).]]></description>
