    <description><![CDATA[Dutchess Day School<br/><br/>📍 415 Route 343, Millbrook, NY 12545<br/><br/>Founded in the 1950s by a group of parents interested in offering their children the advantages of a small-school environment in the Millbrook area.<br/><br/>Tips<br/>- Stop 13 of 17 on the Washington & Amenia Scenic Tour (Tour 4).]]></description>
