  <Placemark>
    <name>Dysart's Great Harbor Marina</name>
    <description><![CDATA[Dysart's Marina is a boat marina with a relaxed atmosphere, offering amenities for boaters. It is not primarily a restaurant, so it does not serve food or alcohol. The marina is open for lunch and dinner for vessel mooring and bathroom facilities but does not have a kitchen.<br/><br/>More info: https://www.google.com/maps/place/Dysart's+Great+Harbor+Marina/@44.2746925,-68.3254994,17z/data=!3m1!4b1!4m6!3m5!1s0x4caebd24cf87220d:0x1b4d6586d14d0322!8m2!3d44.2746887!4d-68.3229245!16s%2Fg%2F1w2yth6z?entry=ttu&g_ep=EgoyMDI2MDcyNy4wIKXMDSoASAFQAw%3D%3D]]></description>
