  <Placemark>
    <name>ECHO Leahy Center for Lake Champlain Burlington VT</name>
    <description><![CDATA[ECHO Leahy Center for Lake Champlain<br/><br/>📍 Burlington VT<br/><br/>Vermont's premier lake science center on Burlington's waterfront with 100+ interactive exhibits, 50 live species, and a 15,000-gallon freshwater aquarium.<br/><br/>Tips<br/>- Great rainy-day option — plan 2+ hours.<br/>- On the waterfront — combine with a walk along Waterfront Park.]]></description>
