  <Placemark>
    <name>Eastside Bevs &amp; Bites Stowe VT</name>
    <description><![CDATA[The place is a casual restaurant and bar known for its lively atmosphere, great food, and delicious drinks. It typically attracts families, couples, and groups of friends, often looking for a fun dining experience or entertainment during their visit, such as live music events.<br/><br/>The overall vibe is casual and welcoming, making it an ideal spot for relaxation and enjoyment. Patrons appreciate the fun decor and the vibrant ambiance, with a focus on social interaction. <br/><br/>The strongest positives highlighted in reviews include: 1) Delicious food and drinks, 2) Great service, often mentioned by staff members who engage positively with guests, 3) A lively atmosphere with enjoyable live music events.  <br/><br/>Common downsides noted by some reviewers include: 1) High prices for the quality of food, perceived as expensive, 2) Some descriptions of the food as basic compared to expectations, 3) Occasional issues with wait times during peak periods.<br/><br/>More info: https://www.google.com/maps/place/Eastside+Bevs+%26+Bites/@44.4731829,-72.6972324,777m/data=!3m1!1e3!4m11!3m10!1s0x4cb5974fc026fab3:0x9be51aac17aa6434!5m4!1s2026-09-21!2i4!4m1!1i2!8m2!3d44.4740796!4d-72.6961106!16s%2Fg%2F11w82475p2?entry=ttu&g_ep=EgoyMDI2MDYxMC4wIKXMDSoASAFQAw%3D%3D]]></description>
    <styleUrl>#c-purple</styleUrl>
