  <Placemark>
    <name>Echo Lake Beach Somesville ME</name>
    <description><![CDATA[Echo Lake Beach<br/><br/>📍 Route 102, near Somesville, Mount Desert Island, ME<br/><br/>A freshwater beach on Echo Lake, on Mount Desert Island's western "quiet side" near Somesville. The water is considerably warmer than the ocean at Sand Beach, and it draws far fewer tourists despite being one of the better swimming spots on the island.<br/><br/>Tips<br/>- Lifeguarded in summer season — good family swimming option<br/>- Echo Lake also has a boat launch and is popular with rock climbers (Beech Cliff) nearby]]></description>
