    <name>Echo Lake State Park North Conway NH</name>
    <description><![CDATA[Echo Lake State Park<br/><br/>📍 North Conway NH<br/><br/>Small, scenic state park centered on a quiet glacial lake beneath Cathedral and Whitehorse Ledges, with swimming, picnicking, and easy walking trails.<br/><br/>Tips<br/>- Good easy/relaxed option if not up for the full ledge loop.<br/>- Swimming spot in summer.]]></description>
