  <Placemark>
    <name>Echo Lake, Cathedral Ledge &amp; Whitehorse Ledge Loop North Conway NH</name>
    <description><![CDATA[Echo Lake, Cathedral Ledge & Whitehorse Ledge Loop<br/><br/>📍 North Conway NH<br/><br/>Challenging 4.9-mile loop connecting Echo Lake, two dramatic cliff-top ledges, and Diana's Baths — outstanding panoramic Mount Washington Valley views.<br/><br/>Tips<br/>- Plan for several hours — it's a full hike, not a quick stop.<br/>- Best views are from the ledges; bring water and good shoes.]]></description>
