    <name>Edgartown Lighthouse Edgartown MA</name>
    <description><![CDATA[Edgartown Lighthouse<br/><br/>📍 Edgartown MA<br/><br/>Historic 1828 lighthouse on a walkable spit at the edge of Edgartown Harbor — a classic photo stop with harbor views.<br/><br/>Tips<br/>- Short walk out on the beach spit — easy and scenic.<br/>- Combine with a stroll through Edgartown village.]]></description>
