    <description><![CDATA[Eegonos<br/><br/>📍 Bar Harbor, ME<br/><br/>A Gilded Age "cottage" in Bar Harbor's historic summer colony, listed on the National Register of Historic Places.<br/><br/>Tips<br/>- Private property — a drive/walk-past landmark, not a stop with public access.<br/><br/>More info: https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=44.4042%2C%20-68.2328]]></description>
