  <Placemark>
    <name>Eisenhower Memorial Wayside Park Bretton Woods NH</name>
    <description><![CDATA[Eisenhower Memorial Wayside Park<br/><br/>📍 Route 302, near Bretton Woods, NH<br/><br/>A seven-acre roadside park established in 1979 as a gift from the Bretton Woods Corporation, honoring President Dwight D. Eisenhower, with panoramic views of the Presidential Range.<br/><br/>Tips<br/>- Free, unstaffed, open year-round — picnic tables make it a good quick lunch stop on a Route 302 drive.<br/><br/>More info: https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=44.2394%2C%20-71.4252]]></description>
