    <name>El Mirador Restaurante 1 Bethlehem NH</name>
    <description><![CDATA[El Mirador is a Latin American restaurant known for its homemade meals including tacos and paella. Prices range from $20 to $30 per person. It is open for lunch and dinner, but has specific hours (closes at 3 PM, reopens at 4 PM on certain days). Alcohol is likely served, although not explicitly mentioned.<br/><br/>More info: https://www.google.com/maps/place/El+Mirador+Restaurante/@44.2777169,-71.7146162,14.61z/data=!4m15!1m8!3m7!1s0x4cb47756dc289165:0x63bc3e728494e263!2sBethlehem,+NH!3b1!8m2!3d44.2803843!4d-71.6875364!16zL20vMHhnNmY!3m5!1s0x4cb46f0325a70d8b:0x7106e795d7efcb7!8m2!3d44.2799545!4d-71.695505!16s%2Fg%2F11t1pkblkx?entry=ttu&g_ep=EgoyMDI2MDYyMy4wIKXMDSoASAFQAw%3D%3D]]></description>
