    <description><![CDATA[El Mirador Restaurante is a Latin American restaurant offering dishes like fish tacos and guacamole, with prices ranging from $20 to $30 per person. It is open for dinner, specifically from 4 PM to 9 PM on Sundays, and serves alcohol.<br/><br/>More info: https://www.google.com/maps/place/El+Mirador+Restaurante/@44.2799545,-71.6980799,782m/data=!3m2!1e3!4b1!4m6!3m5!1s0x4cb46f0325a70d8b:0x7106e795d7efcb7!8m2!3d44.2799545!4d-71.695505!16s%2Fg%2F11t1pkblkx?entry=ttu&g_ep=EgoyMDI2MDYxNi4wIKXMDSoASAFQAw%3D%3D]]></description>
