  <Placemark>
    <name>Eleanor Roosevelt NHS Val-Kill Hyde Park, NY</name>
    <description><![CDATA[Eleanor Roosevelt NHS Val-Kill<br/><br/>📍 Hyde Park, NY<br/><br/>Eleanor Roosevelt's personal retreat and the only NPS site dedicated to a First Lady — an intimate, quietly moving property that reveals the private person behind the public figure.<br/><br/>Tips<br/>- Ranger-led tours only; book timed tickets in advance<br/>- The cottage is small and personal — feels genuinely lived-in<br/>- About 2 miles east of Springwood — plan to visit both in one day<br/>- Also stop 25 of 26 on the Hyde Park, Clinton & Pleasant Valley Scenic Tour (Tour 3)<br/><br/>More info: https://www.google.com/maps/search/Eleanor+Roosevelt+NHS+Val-Kill+Hyde+Park,+NY]]></description>
