    <name>Elixir Hartford VT</name>
    <description><![CDATA[Elixir Restaurant offers American cuisine with prices ranging from $40 to $50 per person. It is open for dinner from Thursday to Tuesday and serves alcohol.<br/><br/>More info: https://www.google.com/maps/place/Elixir/@43.6459584,-72.3204495,17z/data=!3m1!4b1!4m6!3m5!1s0x4cb4ca83f1e21d65:0xca1565e94866ac13!8m2!3d43.6459545!4d-72.3178746!16s%2Fg%2F1v6l72lz?entry=ttu&g_ep=EgoyMDI2MDYyMy4wIKXMDSoASAFQAw%3D%3D]]></description>
