  <Placemark>
    <name>Eliza Kingston, NY</name>
    <description><![CDATA[Eliza<br/><br/>📍 Kingston, NY<br/><br/>A stylish Stockade District bistro celebrated for its roast chicken with malt fries, excellent burger, and house-made bucatini.<br/><br/>Must Order<br/>- Roast chicken with malt fries — the dish people come back for<br/>- Smash burger — among the best in the valley<br/>- Bucatini — house-made, changes with the season<br/><br/>Tips<br/>- Reservations recommended for weekend dinner<br/>- The dining room is beautiful — ask for a window table<br/><br/>More info: https://www.google.com/maps/search/Eliza+Kingston,+NY]]></description>
