    <name>Ellsworth Farmers Market Ellsworth ME</name>
    <description><![CDATA[Ellsworth Farmers' Market<br/><br/>📍 Union River Park, 415 Water Street, Ellsworth, ME 04605<br/><br/>A waterfront market on the Union River, relocated to this site in 2026. Ellsworth sits on Route 1/3, the main road between Bar Harbor and the mainland, making this an easy add-on stop rather than a special trip.<br/><br/>Tips<br/>- Saturdays 9:30 AM–12:30 PM, May 4 – November 15, 2026 (per Maine Federation of Farmers' Markets)<br/>- Accepts credit/debit, EBT, and Harvest Bucks<br/>- Convenient to combine with any Ellsworth grocery/supply run during the Bar Harbor base camp stretch<br/><br/>More info: https://www.google.com/maps/search/Union+River+Park+415+Water+Street+Ellsworth+ME]]></description>
