    <name>Ellsworth Riverwalk Ellsworth ME</name>
    <description><![CDATA[Ellsworth Riverwalk<br/><br/>📍 Behind the Ellsworth Public Library, State Street, Ellsworth, ME<br/><br/>An easy 0.2 mi out-and-back gravel path along the Union River from the library to an accessible overlook — Frenchman Bay Conservancy converted a makeshift path into a sustainable trail minutes from downtown.<br/><br/>Tips<br/>- Quick stop right in downtown Ellsworth — no real trip planning needed]]></description>
