  <Placemark>
    <name>Elwood's Raw Bars Chatham MA</name>
    <description><![CDATA[Overview<br/>Type: Seafood restaurant  <br/>Best known for: Fresh oysters, casual atmosphere  <br/>Location context: 1291 Main Street Route, MA-28  <br/>Price level: $20–30  <br/>Visit timing: Open until 9 PM, busy during dinner<br/><br/>Typical Customers  <br/>Demographics: Locals and tourists  <br/>Group types: Couples, families, larger groups  <br/>Common occasions: Casual dinner, date night<br/><br/>Vibe & Setting  <br/>Atmosphere: Casual, lively  <br/>Noise level: Moderate  <br/>Decor & setting: Indoor seating, raw bar  <br/>Service style: Friendly and attentive<br/><br/>Recommended Dishes  <br/>Overall dish consensus  <br/>Reviewers frequently highlight the oysters as must-orders, particularly praising their freshness and taste. The clams were also favorably mentioned as being light and crispy.<br/><br/>How “top dishes” are determined  <br/>Top dishes are chosen based on Google Maps page content and reviews that specifically mention popularity, frequent appearance in photos, and strong praise in the text.<br/><br/>| Rank | Dish                           | Why it stands out                                     | How often it’s mentioned                        | Ideal for                  |<br/>|------|--------------------------------|------------------------------------------------------|------------------------------------------------|----------------------------|<br/>| 1    | Oysters                        | Praised for freshness and flavor.                    | Mentioned in many reviews.                       | Sharing at the table       |<br/>| 2    | Clams                          | Light, crispy, not greasy.                           | Appears in numerous photos.                      | Hearty main                |<br/>| 3    | Clam chowder                   | Creamy and comforting, a favorite among reviewers.   | Repeatedly called out as a favorite.            | Lighter option             |<br/><br/>Good alternates / backup choices  <br/>- Clam chowder: Creamy and comforting, often recommended.  <br/>- Lobster rolls: Notable for their generous serving size.  <br/><br/>Highlights (non-dish positives from reviews)  <br/>Staff friendliness: The staff is noted for being super friendly, adding to the positive experience.  <br/>Chill location: Many reviews mention the great vibe of the dining space.  <br/><br/>Common Issues (from reviews)  <br/>Busy times: The restaurant gets busy during dinner hours, possibly leading to wait times.  <br/><br/>Practical Notes  <br/>Reservation / wait: Walk-in friendly, but can get busy.  <br/>Accessibility: Not mentioned  <br/>Parking / transit: Not mentioned  <br/>Best use case: Great date-night spot<br/><br/>More info: https://www.google.com/maps/place/Elwood's+Raw+Bars/@41.6695451,-70.097559,28093m/data=!3m1!1e3!4m11!1m3!2m2!1sfresh+oysters!6e5!3m6!1s0x89fb15fb73d213d7:0xd26888ca26653f98!8m2!3d41.6983533!4d-69.9633853!15sCg1mcmVzaCBveXN0ZXJzWg8iDWZyZXNoIG95c3RlcnOSAQpyZXN0YXVyYW50mgFEQ2k5RFFVbFJRVU52WkVOb2RIbGpSamx2VDJ0YVZtUXlWazFTTUdoUFVqRkNibEpGWkRSTldFWlNVeko0ZDAxR1JSQULgAQD6AQQIABAx!16s%2Fg%2F11vywy5zm_?entry=ttu&g_ep=EgoyMDI2MDYxMC4wIKXMDSoASAFQAw%3D%3D]]></description>
