  <Placemark>
    <name>Equinox Guiding Service Camden ME</name>
    <description><![CDATA[Equinox Guiding Service<br/><br/>📍 20 Mechanic St, Camden, ME 04843<br/><br/>AMGA-accredited rock and ice climbing guide service founded in 2017 — the only such outfit headquartered in Camden. Leads guided climbs and instruction on Camden Hills terrain (including Barrett's Cove Cliff) as well as trips further afield to Acadia and Katahdin, for all experience levels.<br/><br/>Tips<br/>- Good option if the trip wants one real adventure/adrenaline day mixed into an otherwise laid-back coastal itinerary<br/>- Book ahead — small guide operation<br/><br/>More info: https://equinoxguidingservice.com/]]></description>
