    <description><![CDATA[Eric E. Soderholtz Cottage<br/><br/>📍 Gouldsboro, ME<br/><br/>A historic cottage in Gouldsboro, listed on the National Register of Historic Places and named for Eric E. Soderholtz, an architectural photographer known around the turn of the 20th century for documenting Colonial New England buildings.<br/><br/>Tips<br/>- Private property — a drive-past landmark rather than a stop with public access.<br/><br/>More info: https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=44.4644%2C%20-68.0942]]></description>
