  <Placemark>
    <name>Escarpment Trail Haines Falls, NY</name>
    <description><![CDATA[Escarpment Trail<br/><br/>📍 Haines Falls, NY<br/><br/>A classic Catskill ridgeline trail with sweeping panoramic views of the Hudson Valley — accessible in partial day sections from North-South Lake.<br/><br/>Tips<br/>- South toward Sunset Rock gives Hudson Valley views within 30 minutes of the trailhead<br/>- Rocky and uneven — proper footwear required<br/>- September offers cool temperatures and excellent visibility<br/><br/>More info: https://www.google.com/maps/search/Escarpment+Trail+Haines+Falls,+NY]]></description>
    <styleUrl>#c-green</styleUrl>
