  <Placemark>
    <name>Esopus Creek Tubing Phoenicia, NY</name>
    <description><![CDATA[Esopus Creek Tubing<br/><br/>📍 Phoenicia, NY<br/><br/>Classic Catskill tubing on the Esopus Creek — a beloved regional tradition with Town Tinker Tube Rental as the go-to outfitter, perfect for a warm September afternoon.<br/><br/>Tips<br/>- Town Tinker handles equipment and shuttles; $20–25 per person<br/>- September water levels can be lower — call ahead to confirm conditions<br/>- The float takes 2–3 hours; bring water shoes and sunscreen<br/><br/>More info: https://www.google.com/maps/search/Esopus+Creek+Tubing+Phoenicia,+NY]]></description>
