  <Placemark>
    <name>FASNY Museum of Firefighting Hudson, NY</name>
    <description><![CDATA[FASNY Museum of Firefighting<br/><br/>📍 Hudson, NY<br/><br/>One of the world's largest firefighting museums, with 60+ historic fire engines and centuries of firefighting artifacts.<br/><br/>Tips<br/>- Allow 1.5–2 hours — the collection is surprisingly deep<br/>- Great for families; interactive exhibits alongside the historic apparatus<br/><br/>More info: https://www.google.com/maps/search/FASNY+Museum+of+Firefighting+Hudson,+NY]]></description>
