    <name>Fairbanks Museum and Planetarium Saint Johnsbury VT</name>
    <description><![CDATA[Fairbanks Museum and Planetarium<br/><br/>📍 Saint Johnsbury VT<br/><br/>Victorian-era natural history museum with 175,000 objects, a large taxidermy collection, and Vermont's only public planetarium.<br/><br/>Tips<br/>- Check the planetarium show schedule ahead of time.<br/>- Good rainy-day option.]]></description>
