    <name>Farnsworth Art Museum Rockland ME</name>
    <description><![CDATA[Farnsworth Art Museum<br/><br/>📍 Rockland ME<br/><br/>Premier collection of American art with deep Maine/Wyeth family connections, spread across six floors in two buildings.<br/><br/>Tips<br/>- Allow at least 2 hours; the Wyeth Center alone is worth a dedicated visit.<br/>- Combine with CMCA a few blocks away.]]></description>
