  <Placemark>
    <name>Fat Puppy Fusion Brunswick ME</name>
    <description><![CDATA[Fat Puppy Fusion<br/><br/>📍 86 Union St, Brunswick, ME (at Brooks Feed & Farm)<br/><br/>A gourmet hot dog truck doing genuinely inventive global riffs — house-made flatbread and toppings pulling from Persian, Welsh, Turkish, and Israeli traditions. The Portland Press Herald called it "a rock concert of flavor." Strong vegetarian options too, unusual for a hot dog stand.<br/><br/>Must Order<br/>- Chili Bandito — quarter-pound all-beef dog, house chili, cheddar, pickled jalapeños, chili-cheese Fritos, sour cream, on house flatbread<br/>- Persian Greyhound — their signature global-fusion dog<br/><br/>Tips<br/>- Seasonal — confirm it's currently open before planning around it (typically Tue-Fri, 11am-2:30pm in season)<br/>- Curbside/takeout only, no indoor seating<br/>- Call (207) 228-4208 for current hours/status<br/><br/>More info: https://www.fatpuppyfusion.com/]]></description>
