  <Placemark>
    <name>Feast &amp; Floret Hudson, NY</name>
    <description><![CDATA[Feast & Floret<br/><br/>📍 Hudson, NY<br/><br/>Currently Hudson's most buzzed-about restaurant, serving inventive seasonal plates driven entirely by Hudson Valley farms.<br/><br/>Must Order<br/>- Seasonal tasting plates — change with what arrived from farms<br/>- Vegetable-forward dishes — among the most creative in the valley<br/><br/>Tips<br/>- Reserve well in advance — tiny room, very high demand<br/>- Follow their Instagram for current menus<br/><br/>More info: https://www.google.com/maps/search/Feast+&+Floret+Hudson,+NY]]></description>
