  <Placemark>
    <name>Five Islands Lobster Co Georgetown ME</name>
    <description><![CDATA[Five Islands Lobster Co.<br/><br/>📍 Georgetown, ME<br/><br/>Island-studded harbor views with 4.82-rated casual lobster dining. One of the highest-rated lobster pounds on the Maine coast with consistent top reviews across platforms (2,368+ reviews).<br/><br/>Tips<br/>- Island-studded harbor setting<br/>- Consistently high ratings (4.82 across sources)<br/>- Casual waterfront dining<br/>- Popular and worth the visit]]></description>
