  <Placemark>
    <name>Five Main on the River North Woodstock NH</name>
    <description><![CDATA[Five Main on the River<br/><br/>📍 North Woodstock NH<br/><br/>Relaxed riverside restaurant and bar near Loon Mountain, known for burgers, ribs, river views, and live music.<br/><br/>Must Order<br/>- Burgers<br/>- Ribs<br/><br/>Tips<br/>- Sit on the riverside deck if available.<br/>- Near Loon Mountain — good post-hike dinner.]]></description>
