  <Placemark>
    <name>Flagler Monument &amp; Halcyon Hall Millbrook NY</name>
    <description><![CDATA[Flagler Monument & Halcyon Hall<br/><br/>📍 Millbrook, NY<br/><br/>The Flagler Monument is the gift of estate owner Harry Harkness Flagler. Halcyon Hall, a late 19th-century resort, became the main building of Bennett School, established 1907 as a women's junior college and closed in the 1970s.<br/><br/>Tips<br/>- Stop 15 of 17 on the Washington & Amenia Scenic Tour (Tour 4).<br/>- No single street address found — coordinates left blank.]]></description>
