  <Placemark>
    <name>Flat Top Mountain Franconia Notch NH</name>
    <description><![CDATA[Flat Top Mountain<br/><br/>📍 Franconia Notch area, NH<br/><br/>A trail-less peak near Franconia Notch, known mainly to bushwhackers pursuing New Hampshire's list of unofficial "trail-less" summits.<br/><br/>Tips<br/>- No maintained trail — not a casual stop; treat as a name on the map rather than a hiking objective unless you're an experienced off-trail hiker.<br/><br/>More info: https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=44.2028%2C%20-71.6056]]></description>
