    </Point>
  </Placemark>
  <Placemark>
    <name>Flume Cascade Crawford Notch NH</name>
    <description><![CDATA[Flume Cascade<br/><br/>📍 Route 302, Crawford Notch, NH<br/><br/>A roadside cascade along Route 302 in Crawford Notch, one of several waterfalls (with Silver Cascade nearby) visible right from pull-offs on the drive through the notch.<br/><br/>Tips<br/>- Easily confused with the much larger, ticketed Flume Gorge in Franconia Notch State Park — this is a free roadside stop, not the same attraction.<br/>- A quick photo stop rather than a hike.<br/><br/>More info: https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=44.2087%2C%20-71.4038]]></description>
