    <name>Fon's Kitchen</name>
    <description><![CDATA[Fon's Kitchen is a Thai restaurant located in Belfast, offering dishes priced between $20 and $30. It serves lunch and dinner, and provides alcohol.<br/><br/>More info: https://www.google.com/maps/place/Fon's+Kitchen/@44.4221712,-69.0166066,2023m/data=!3m1!1e3!4m13!1m5!2m4!1sRestaurants!5m1!4e9!6e5!3m6!1s0x4cae6fb09fb27a6d:0x35aadff6fb8fef2a!8m2!3d44.425928!4d-69.0064951!15sCgtSZXN0YXVyYW50c1oNIgtyZXN0YXVyYW50c5IBD3RoYWlfcmVzdGF1cmFudJoBI0NoWkRTVWhOTUc5blMwVkpRMEZuU1VONE4yVnRSbGhSRUFF4AEA-gEECBgQPg!16s%2Fg%2F11swtvm128?entry=ttu&g_ep=EgoyMDI2MDcxMy4wIKXMDSoASAFQAw%3D%3D]]></description>
