  <Placemark>
    <name>Fort Point State Park Stockton Springs ME</name>
    <description><![CDATA[Fort Point State Park<br/><br/>📍 Stockton Springs ME<br/><br/>Quiet waterfront park with a historic lighthouse, old fort earthworks, and picnic spots.<br/><br/>Tips<br/>- Good picnic stop along US-1.<br/>- Pairs well with the Penobscot Narrows Bridge Observatory.]]></description>
