  <Placemark>
    <name>Franconia Inn Dining Franconia NH</name>
    <description><![CDATA[Sour’s Taverna is a tapas bar offering a variety of small dishes. Price range is $20–60, and it opens for dinner at 5 PM. Alcohol is available.<br/><br/>More info: https://www.google.com/maps/place/Franconia+Inn+Dining/@44.2579295,-71.8722169,12.36z/data=!4m13!1m5!2m4!1sLittleton,+New+Hampshire,+restaurants+that+offer+reservations.+!5m1!15saccepts_reservations!6e5!3m6!1s0x4cb463c555424865:0xd67bc43bb51fe0a4!8m2!3d44.1960911!4d-71.7529243!!16s%2Fg%2F11ptrwrx05?entry=ttu&g_ep=EgoyMDI2MDYyMy4wIKXMDSoASAFQAw%3D%3D]]></description>
