  <Placemark>
    <name>Franklin D Roosevelt State Park Yorktown Heights, NY</name>
    <description><![CDATA[Franklin D Roosevelt State Park<br/><br/>📍 Yorktown Heights, NY<br/><br/>A Westchester County park centered on a lake, with swimming, hiking trails, and picnic areas — a quieter stop toward the southern end of this Taconic Byway list.<br/><br/>Tips<br/>- Less crowded than the Dutchess/Columbia County parks further north on this list.<br/><br/>More info: https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=41.283,-73.809]]></description>
