  <Placemark>
    <name>Frazer Point Picnic Area Schoodic ME</name>
    <description><![CDATA[Frazer Point Picnic Area<br/><br/>📍 Schoodic Peninsula, Acadia National Park, ME<br/><br/>A waterfront picnic area with access to docks and rocky shoreline along Frenchman Bay. Best visited early in the morning (before 9 a.m.) to enjoy the docks and coastal views without crowds.<br/><br/>Tips<br/>- Arrive before 9 a.m. for solitude<br/>- Excellent for early coffee and contemplation<br/>- Waterfront access for photos and exploring tide pools<br/>- Part of the Schoodic Loop but rarely crowded at dawn/early morning<br/>- Good starting point for cycling or walking the Schoodic Bike Path]]></description>
