  <Placemark>
    <name>Freemans Grill Brewster MA</name>
    <description><![CDATA[Overview  <br/>Type: Restaurant  <br/>  <br/>Best known for: Delicious food, particularly popular chicken wings and clam chowder.  <br/>  <br/>Location context: Located at a golf club, accessible to everyone.  <br/>  <br/>Price level: $20–30 per person  <br/>  <br/>Visit timing: Not mentioned  <br/>  <br/>Typical Customers  <br/>Demographics: Locals and families  <br/>  <br/>Group types: Families and groups  <br/>  <br/>Common occasions: Casual dining, family outings  <br/>  <br/>Vibe & Setting  <br/>Atmosphere: Casual and family-friendly  <br/>  <br/>Noise level: Moderate  <br/>  <br/>Decor & setting: Outdoor patio on the golf course  <br/>  <br/>Service style: Attentive and friendly  <br/>  <br/>Recommended Dishes  <br/>Overall dish consensus  <br/>Reviewers highly recommend the Chicken Wings and Captain's Clam Chowder due to their great flavor and freshness.  <br/>  <br/>How “top dishes” are determined  <br/>Top dishes are chosen based on menu highlights and repeated positive reviews focusing on items that receive consistent praise.  <br/>  <br/>| Rank | Dish                      | Why it stands out                                   | How often it’s mentioned                | Ideal for            |  <br/>|------|---------------------------|---------------------------------------------------|-----------------------------------------|----------------------|  <br/>| 1    | Chicken Wings            | Noted for great flavor and satisfaction.          | Mentioned in many reviews               | Sharing at the table |  <br/>| 2    | Captain's Clam Chowder   | Praised for being fresh and hearty.               | Repeatedly called out as a favorite    | Hearty main         |  <br/>| 3    | Sandwiches               | Generally well-received for variety and taste.    | Mentioned sporadically                   | Casual lunch        |  <br/>| 4    | Burgers                  | Noted for delicious taste and generous portions.   | Mentioned in several reviews             | Hearty main         |  <br/>| 5    | Fish Tacos               | Compliments on flavor and presentation.           | A few mentions                           | Quick bite          |  <br/>| 6    | Salads                   | Good vegetarian option with fresh ingredients.    | Mentioned a few times                    | Lighter option      |  <br/>Good alternates / backup choices  <br/>Fewer clearly highlighted dishes in reviews.  <br/>  <br/>Highlights (non‑dish positives from reviews)  <br/>Food quality: Fresh ingredients are consistently praised.  <br/>  <br/>Service: Attentive staff with friendly service noted.  <br/>  <br/>Setting: Beautiful patio view overlooking the golf course.  <br/>  <br/>Common Issues (from reviews)  <br/>Not applicable  <br/>  <br/>Practical Notes  <br/>Reservation / wait: Walk-in friendly  <br/>  <br/>Accessibility: Not mentioned  <br/>  <br/>Parking / transit: Street parking available  <br/>  <br/>Best use case: Best for family outings or casual dining.<br/><br/>More info: https://www.google.com/maps/place/Freemans+Grill/@41.7343307,-70.0210265,820m/data=!3m3!1e3!4b1!5s0x89fb6ae91a994035:0xd319e7606df1d2f4!4m6!3m5!1s0x89fb6b43bd1fe6e1:0x30c767bbc8b03689!8m2!3d41.7343267!4d-70.0184516!16s%2Fg%2F11f780x2kg?entry=ttu&g_ep=EgoyMDI2MDYxMC4wIKXMDSoASAFQAw%3D%3D]]></description>
