  <Placemark>
    <name>Frenchman Bay Lobster Rolls Bar Harbor ME</name>
    <description><![CDATA[Overview  <br/>Frenchman Bay Lobster Rolls is a small takeout seafood establishment located on Main Street in Bar Harbor, Maine. The restaurant is known for its buttery lobster rolls served with generous portions and quality ingredients.<br/><br/>Typical Clientele  <br/>Visitors and cruise passengers passing through Bar Harbor seeking authentic Maine lobster rolls. Both locals and tourists frequent the spot, particularly those looking for casual, quick seafood dining with waterfront access.<br/><br/>Vibe  <br/>Casual, no-frills takeout operation. Customers can order at the counter and eat across the street while enjoying harbor views. Unpretentious, fast-paced, and focused on the food rather than ambiance. Family-friendly and accessible for travelers.<br/><br/>What People Praise<br/><br/>- Quality lobster rolls — Generous portions with buttery, perfectly heated butter that complements the lobster meat<br/>- Speed and efficiency — Fast service with minimal fuss from order to delivery<br/>- Harbor views — Seating across the street offers scenic waterfront vistas while eating<br/>- Small, focused menu — Specializes in lobster rolls and classic Maine seafood items (clam chowder, lobster bisque)<br/><br/>Common Downsides<br/><br/>- Inconsistent flavor quality — Some visitors found their lobster rolls lacked flavor compared to other stops<br/>- Limited dining experience — Takeout-only format means no formal dining amenities; outdoor seating is weather-dependent<br/>- Menu repetition fatigue — For those eating multiple lobster rolls across Maine, this stop ranked lower in comparison<br/><br/>More info: https://www.google.com/maps/place/Frenchman+Bay+Lobster+Rolls/@44.3909182,-68.2076997,1584m/data=!3m1!1e3!4m14!1m7!3m6!1s0x4caebfb63cd9e005:0x7d5efcee0599eeea!2sFrenchman+Bay+Lobster+Rolls!8m2!3d44.3909144!4d-68.2051248!16s%2Fg%2F11y4b12cn1!3m5!1s0x4caebfb63cd9e005:0x7d5efcee0599eeea!8m2!3d44.3909144!4d-68.2051248!16s%2Fg%2F11y4b12cn1?entry=ttu&g_ep=EgoyMDI2MDYxMC4wIKXMDSoASAFQAw%3D%3D]]></description>
    <styleUrl>#c-purple</styleUrl>
    <ExtendedData>
      <Data name="vault_type"><value>Restaurant</value></Data>
      <Data name="icon"><value>sandwich</value></Data>
      <Data name="color"><value>purple</value></Data>
    </ExtendedData>
