    </Point>
  </Placemark>
  <Placemark>
    <name>Fresh and Co Camden ME</name>
    <description><![CDATA[Time: 2026-08-05T18:30:00<br/><br/>Fresh & Co in Camden is a strong pick if you want an upscale-casual dinner with globally inspired food, a lively room, and a menu that goes well beyond standard Maine seafood. The most consistently praised orders are the lobster ravioli, moqueca, mussels, and the house specialties that change with the season.[1][2][3][4]<br/><br/>What to order<br/><br/>The safest “best bets” are:<br/><br/>- Lobster ravioli — repeatedly called a signature dish and a longtime favorite.[3][5]<br/>- Moqueca — a Brazilian coconut-lime seafood stew that reviewers have singled out as outstanding and very fresh.[2][4][6]<br/>- Mussels — one of the restaurant’s most praised dishes, especially because they’re local and well-seasoned.[4][2][3]<br/>- Rigatoni ala vodka — a good non-seafood choice if you want something richer and a little spicy.[6][2]<br/>- Steak frites au poivre — best if you want a more classic, heartier main.[2]<br/><br/>For starters, the house dip with pita, crab & artichoke dip, or mussels are the strongest-sounding options from the current menu. If you want a lighter first course, the green salad or Caesar are fine, but they’re not the standout dishes here.[2]<br/><br/>What to expect<br/><br/>Expect a restaurant that feels more global and chef-driven than typical coastal Maine dining. Fresh & Co describes itself as globally inspired and locally sourced, with the menu shaped by travel, family roots, and local ingredients.[7][8][4]<br/><br/>The setting is part of the appeal: it’s energetic, often busy, and has a polished but not stiff atmosphere; several reviews mention strong service and a fun kitchen/dining-room buzz. Reservations are available, it opens at 5 pm, takeout is offered, and there is some outdoor seating when weather allows.[8][1][3][4]<br/><br/>Best fit for you<br/><br/>If you like adventurous food and don’t mind a menu that mixes Maine seafood with Brazilian, Eastern European, and Mediterranean influences, this is a very good choice. If you want a simple lobster-roll kind of place, it is probably not the best match because the menu is more eclectic and dinner-focused.[4][7][8][2]<br/><br/>For a first visit, I’d order the mussels or house dip to start, then the moqueca or lobster ravioli, and leave room for dessert if the menu leans seasonal that night.[9][3][2]<br/><br/>Sources<br/>[1] FRESH & CO., Camden - Menu, Prices & Restaurant ... https://www.tripadvisor.com/Restaurant_Review-g40550-d2161692-Reviews-Fresh_Co-Camden_Maine.<br/>[2] Sample Menu — Chef Owned https://www.freshcamden.com/menu<br/>[3] Fresh & Co in Camden https://www.mainefamous.com/midcoast-blog/fresh-amp-co-in-camden-3w6x9<br/>[4] FRESH * CO in Camden, Maine https://www.mainefamous.com/fresh-and-co<br/>[5] Fresh & Co (@fresh_and_co_camden) reopens this ... https://www.instagram.com/p/DI9R9ZFR8tl/<br/>[6] FRESH & CO., Camden - Menu, Prices & Restaurant ... https://www.tripadvisor.com/Restaurant_Review-g40550-d2161692-Reviews-or15-Fresh_Co-Camden_Maine.<br/>[7] About Fresh & Co. — Chef Owned https://www.freshcamden.com/our-story<br/>[8] Fresh & Co Camden: Chef Owned https://www.freshcamden.com/<br/>[9] Fresh & Co menu photos https://www.yelp.com/biz/fresh-and-co-camden-2?start=40<br/>[10] Restaurant recommendations in midcoast Camden, ME? https://www.facebook.com/groups/travelmaine/posts/1136524225069900/<br/>[11] Fresh & Co menu photos - Restaurant Reviews https://www.yelp.com/biz/fresh-and-co-camden-2<br/>[12] Anyone tried Fresh and Go at 35th and broadway? : r/astoria https://www.reddit.com/r/astoria/comments/1fh1kql/anyone_tried_fresh_and_go_at_35th_and_broadway/<br/>[13] Fresh and Co, Camden, ME - Reviews, Ratings, Tips and ... https://wanderlog.com/place/details/479295/fresh-and-co<br/>[14] Dinner Menu https://www.camdenmainevacation.com/camden-maine-dining/restaurants/fresh/FreshWinterDinnerMenu.<br/>[15] Fresh & Company | Camden ME https://www.facebook.com/p/Fresh-Company-100090399014628/<br/>[16] Fresh & Co (@fresh_and_co_camden) · Camden, ME https://www.instagram.com/fresh_and_co_camden/<br/>[17] Fresh&Co is a great spot for a healthy yet filling meal! #hosted ... https://www.tiktok.com/@wrightdownmainstreet/video/7061579662580878639<br/>[18] fresh&co | healthy meals for breakfast, lunch, and dinner in the ... https://www.freshandco.com/<br/>[19] Lobster ravioli is vile : r/Costco https://www.reddit.com/r/Costco/comments/rcq1lt/lobster_ravioli_is_vile/<br/>[20] Exceptional Maine lobster ravioli at the print shop restaurant https://www.facebook.com/groups/174874890438219/posts/1390248152234214/<br/><br/>More info: https://www.google.com/maps/place/Fresh+and+Co/@44.2087599,-69.0653899,220m/data=!3m1!1e3!4m13!1m5!2m4!1sRestaurants!5m1!4e9!6e5!3m6!1s0x4cadd70c1c45124f:0x4b9a51c7971fb5d0!8m2!3d44.2091236!4d-69.0638126!15sCgtSZXN0YXVyYW50c1oNIgtyZXN0YXVyYW50c5IBE2FtZXJpY2FuX3Jlc3RhdXJhbnSaASRDaGREU1VoTk1HOW5TMFZKUTBGblNVUmlialZNWlhkQlJSQULgAQD6AQQIABBH!16s%2Fg%2F1tdg7d7v?entry=ttu&g_ep=EgoyMDI2MDYwOS4wIKXMDSoASAFQAw%3D%3D]]></description>
