  <Placemark>
    <name>Freya's Rockport ME</name>
    <description><![CDATA[Freyas is a gelato and crepe shop known for its unique flavor combinations and homemade waffle cones. It attracts families and food enthusiasts looking for a casual dessert experience. The overall vibe is laid-back and friendly, perfect for a quick stop or a family outing. Customers consistently praise the delicious flavors, particularly the dark chocolate gelato and unique sorbet combinations, along with the generous portion sizes. However, some reviews mention a desire for more savory crepe options as a downside.<br/><br/>More info: https://www.google.com/maps/place/Freya's/@44.1866972,-69.0756946,742m/data=!3m1!1e3!4m6!3m5!1s0x4cadd704148ecfdf:0x8d0e45bde1d9ee00!8m2!3d44.1873254!4d-69.0727868!16s%2Fg%2F11s2j40_2x?entry=ttu&g_ep=EgoyMDI2MDYxMC4wIKXMDSoASAFQAw%3D%3D]]></description>
