  <Placemark>
    <name>Friar's Brewhouse Bucksport ME</name>
    <description><![CDATA[Friar's Brewhouse<br/><br/>📍 Bucksport ME<br/><br/>Franciscan-run gastropub and taproom in Bucksport with house beers and elevated pub fare.<br/><br/>Must Order<br/>- House beers<br/><br/>Tips<br/>- Good stop on the way to/from Acadia.]]></description>
