  <Placemark>
    <name>Friends of Sears Island 1</name>
    <description><![CDATA[Friends of Sears Island is a nature preserve located at Sears Island Rd. It offers outdoor activities such as hiking, but does not serve food or alcohol. Visiting hours may vary, so it's advisable to check before you go.<br/><br/>More info: https://www.google.com/maps/place/Friends+of+Sears+Island/@44.4708154,-68.9663774,8069m/data=!3m1!1e3!4m11!1m3!2m2!1sscenic+spot!6e1!3m6!1s0x4cae65da3809b49b:0x9d640fa7f9b613d4!8m2!3d44.4551023!4d-68.8815894!15sCgtzY2VuaWMgc3BvdFoNIgtzY2VuaWMgc3BvdJIBD25hdHVyZV9wcmVzZXJ2ZZoBJENoZERTVWhOTUc5blMwVkpRMEZuU1VSNmVtTXlkSFozUlJBQuABAPoBBAgAEEE!16s%2Fg%2F1w34668c?entry=ttu&g_ep=EgoyMDI2MDcxMy4wIKXMDSoASAFQAw%3D%3D]]></description>
