  <Placemark>
    <name>Friends of Sears Island</name>
    <description><![CDATA[Sears Island Causeway is a popular tourist attraction located on Sears Island Rd. It offers scenic views and opportunities for outdoor activities. There's no food service listed, and it is a nature preserve rather than a dining establishment, so standard dining information like prices, lunch/dinner options, and alcohol availability is not applicable.<br/><br/>More info: https://www.google.com/maps/place/Friends+of+Sears+Island/@44.4707433,-68.9663773,8069m/data=!3m1!1e3!4m13!1m5!2m4!1sattractions!5m1!4e9!6e1!3m6!1s0x4cae65da3809b49b:0x9d640fa7f9b613d4!8m2!3d44.4551023!4d-68.8815894!15sCgthdHRyYWN0aW9uc1oNIgthdHRyYWN0aW9uc5IBD25hdHVyZV9wcmVzZXJ2ZZoBI0NoWkRTVWhOTUc5blMwVkpRMEZuU1VSNE0yOHlURWxCRUFF4AEA-gEFCO4BEDw!16s%2Fg%2F1w34668c?entry=ttu&g_ep=EgoyMDI2MDcxMy4wIKXMDSoASAFQAw%3D%3D]]></description>
