  <Placemark>
    <name>Galyn's</name>
    <description><![CDATA[It looks like you have some information about a place called "Galyn's," and it includes a Google Maps link. If you're looking to know more about Galyn's, it appears to be a restaurant located in Bar Harbor, Maine. The link should direct you to its location on Google Maps, where you can find additional details such as reviews, photos, and directions.<br/><br/>If you need more specific information or have any questions about Galyn's, feel free to ask!What are the best things to order there? <br/><br/>At Galyn's in Bar Harbor, Maine, there are several popular dishes that guests often recommend. While menus can change seasonally, here are some favorites that you might consider trying:<br/><br/>1. Lobster Bisque - A creamy and rich soup that's a local favorite, perfect for seafood lovers.<br/><br/>2. Crab Cakes - Made with fresh local crab, these are often praised for their flavor and texture.<br/><br/>3. Lobster Tail - A classic choice in Maine, often served with drawn butter and sides like steamed vegetables or rice.<br/><br/>4. Steak Tips - For those who prefer meat over seafood, the steak tips are a popular option.<br/><br/>5. Seafood Paella - A dish combining various types of seafood with flavorful rice, offering a taste of the ocean.<br/><br/>6. Blueberry Pie - As a sweet finish to your meal, this dessert highlights Maine's famous blueberries.<br/><br/>Remember to check Galyn's current menu on their website or call ahead to ensure these options are available during your visit. Enjoy your meal!<br/><br/>More info: https://www.google.com/maps/place/Galyn's/@44.3867007,-68.2234216,2242m/data=!3m1!1e3!4m13!1m5!2m4!1sRestaurants!5m1!4e9!6e5!3m6!1s0x4caebf7d21375a8f:0xbc0d105688e2f5fe!8m2!3d44.3907566!4d-68.205095!15sCgtSZXN0YXVyYW50c1oNIgtyZXN0YXVyYW50c5IBEnNlYWZvb2RfcmVzdGF1cmFudJoBRENpOURRVWxSUVVOdlpFTm9kSGxqUmpsdlQyNVdZV0l3YjNSVFIyOTZXREZqTVZKNlNtWmlNa1l6WWtob2RGbHRZeEFC4AEA-gEECAAQTA!16s%2Fg%2F1vlz9z74?entry=ttu&g_ep=EgoyMDI2MDcwOC4wIKXMDSoASAFQAw%3D%3D]]></description>
