  <Placemark>
    <name>Garvan's Gastropub New Paltz, NY</name>
    <description><![CDATA[Garvan's Gastropub<br/><br/>📍 New Paltz, NY<br/><br/>An Irish-influenced New American gastropub where owner Garvan personally greets every table — consistently excellent Hudson Valley sourcing and a genuine community anchor.<br/><br/>Must Order<br/>- Shepherd's pie — with grass-fed local lamb<br/>- Fish and chips — done properly with house-made batter<br/>- Seasonal specials board — always worth asking about<br/><br/>Tips<br/>- Reservations recommended for weekend dinner<br/>- Garvan's hospitality is genuine — one of the most welcoming rooms in the valley<br/><br/>More info: https://www.google.com/maps/search/Garvan's+Gastropub+New+Paltz,+NY]]></description>
    <styleUrl>#c-red</styleUrl>
