  <Placemark>
    <name>Georges River Land Trust</name>
    <description><![CDATA[Georges River Land Trust is a non-profit organization that does not serve food or drinks as it focuses on environmental conservation and hiking. It opens at 10 AM, but does not serve dinner or lunch.<br/><br/>More info: https://www.google.com/maps/place/Georges+River+Land+Trust/@44.0995839,-69.1264774,2564m/data=!3m1!1e3!4m11!1m3!2m2!1seasy+hike!6e1!3m6!1s0x4cadd1d613f76f05:0xa716f61a253461e0!8m2!3d44.1049567!4d-69.1031238!15sCgllYXN5IGhpa2VaCyIJZWFzeSBoaWtlkgEXbm9uX3Byb2ZpdF9vcmdhbml6YXRpb26aASNDaFpEU1VoTk1HOW5TMFZKUTBGblNVTmZkV0ZmVmxOQkVBReABAPoBBAgAED8!16s%2Fg%2F1tdf0yy8?entry=ttu&g_ep=EgoyMDI2MDcxMy4wIKXMDSoASAFQAw%3D%3D]]></description>
