    <description><![CDATA[Gilded Otter Brewing Company<br/><br/>📍 New Paltz, NY<br/><br/>A New Paltz brewery and restaurant on the byway's main entry route, popular for outdoor deck seating with Shawangunk views.<br/><br/>Tips<br/>- Rt 299 (Main Street), New Paltz<br/><br/>More info: https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=41.7466%2C%20-74.0810]]></description>
