    <name>Gillman Hill Meredith NH</name>
    <description><![CDATA[Gillman Hill<br/><br/>📍 Meredith, NH<br/><br/>A hill overlooking Lake Winnipesaukee's western shore near Meredith, part of the rolling terrain that makes this stretch of the byway scenic.<br/><br/>Tips<br/>- No dedicated public trailhead confirmed — treat as a scenic backdrop rather than a planned hike unless you find current access info locally.<br/><br/>More info: https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=43.6859%2C%20-71.4859]]></description>
