  <Placemark>
    <name>Glidden Point Oyster Farms Edgecomb ME</name>
    <description><![CDATA[Time: 2026-08-10T13:30:00<br/><br/>Glidden Point Oyster Farms<br/><br/>📍 637 River Road, Edgecomb, ME<br/><br/>A working oyster farm on the Damariscotta River, widely regarded as producing some of the best oysters in Maine. The seasonal raw bar serves them straight off the water, alongside river views from the farm itself.<br/><br/>Must Order<br/>- Glidden Point oysters — the farm's own harvest, as fresh as it gets<br/><br/>Tips<br/>- Seasonal operation — hours vary, check ahead.<br/>- Outdoor, working-farm setting — casual, no reservations.]]></description>
