  <Placemark>
    <name>Good Wolf Northeast Harbor ME</name>
    <description><![CDATA[Good Wolf is a women-owned restaurant in Northeast Harbor, Maine, known for its flavorful pizza and locally sourced dishes. The establishment attracts a mixed demographic, including friends dining together and those seeking a unique culinary experience. It has a casual yet stylish atmosphere and is regarded as a great addition to the local dining scene, offering a blend of upscale flavors in a friendly environment. Patrons consistently praise the amazing flavor of the pizza, the exceptional service, and the beautiful setting. Some reviews highlight that the restaurant's hours are limited, with several days being closed, which may be seen as a downside by potential diners.<br/><br/>More info: https://www.google.com/maps/place/Good+Wolf/@44.29184,-68.2899484,1355m/data=!3m1!1e3!4m14!1m7!3m6!1s0x4cae97a048849b31:0x6bc7708886a47493!2sSeal+Cove+Auto+Museum!8m2!3d44.3053532!4d-68.4045448!16s%2Fg%2F1tkjkt8t!3m5!1s0x4caebd9b30ec55b5:0x2e9ba70dac6313fe!8m2!3d44.2936954!4d-68.2893107!16s%2Fg%2F11ytzl42w9?entry=ttu&g_ep=EgoyMDI2MDYxMC4wIKXMDSoASAFQAw%3D%3D]]></description>
