  <Placemark>
    <name>Graffam Bros Seafood Market Rockport ME</name>
    <description><![CDATA[Graffam Bros Seafood Market<br/><br/>📍 Rockport, ME<br/><br/>A genuine local favorite seafood market founded in 1946, offering fresh catch sourced and frequented by locals rather than operating as a tourist fish shack. A true working market with authentic local clientele.<br/><br/>Tips<br/>- 75+ year history<br/>- Local working market, not a tourist trap<br/>- Fresh catch from local sources<br/>- Authentic local feel<br/>- Good for picking up fresh seafood]]></description>
