    <name>Granite Hall Store Bristol ME</name>
    <description><![CDATA[Time: 2026-08-07T13:00:00<br/><br/>Granite Hall Store<br/><br/>📍 Round Pond, Bristol, ME<br/><br/>Gift shop offering penny candy, ice cream, and various gifts. Does not serve food for lunch or dinner, nor alcohol.<br/><br/>Tips<br/>- Combine with Round Pond Lobster, just steps away.]]></description>
