  <Placemark>
    <name>Granville Gulf State Reservation Granville VT</name>
    <description><![CDATA[Granville Gulf State Reservation<br/><br/>📍 Route 100, Granville, VT<br/><br/>A 1,171-acre reservation protecting a dramatic 6-mile stretch of Route 100 through a steep, narrow notch — one of the most scenic drives on the whole byway. Includes the Moss Glen Falls Natural Area, a designated 5-acre state natural area centered on the falls.<br/><br/>Tips<br/>- Don't just drive through — the roadside pull-offs along this stretch are worth stopping for, especially the Moss Glen Falls viewing deck.<br/><br/>More info: https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=44.0043%2C%20-72.8490]]></description>
