  <Placemark>
    <name>Granville State Reservation Granville VT</name>
    <description><![CDATA[Granville State Reservation<br/><br/>📍 Granville, VT<br/><br/>A state-protected natural area in Granville, part of the same cluster of preserved land as Granville Gulf and Moss Glen Falls just north.<br/><br/>Tips<br/>- Combine with the Granville Gulf State Reservation and Moss Glen Falls a short drive away.<br/><br/>More info: https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=43.9736%2C%20-72.8430]]></description>
