  <Placemark>
    <name>Great Head Acadia National Park ME</name>
    <description><![CDATA[Great Head<br/><br/>📍 Great Head Trail, Acadia National Park, ME<br/><br/>A headland loop trail above Sand Beach with some of the best coastal views in the park — a real, if short, climb rewarded well. (4.8★, 95 reviews on Google Maps)<br/><br/>Tips<br/>- Starts from the east end of Sand Beach — combine both in one stop<br/>- More effort than a simple overlook, but well worth it per reviewers]]></description>
