  <Placemark>
    <name>Great Island Trail Wellfleet MA</name>
    <description><![CDATA[Great Island Trail<br/><br/>📍 Wellfleet, MA<br/><br/>Great Island is a hiking area located in Cape Cod, ideal for outdoor lovers and families. There's no food service available as it's primarily a nature spot; entry is free, and it's open during daylight hours.<br/><br/>Tips<br/>- Check tide times before heading out — parts of the trail can be hazardous during high tide.<br/>- Visitors consistently praise the stunning coastal views and tranquility.<br/><br/>More info: https://www.google.com/maps/place/Great+Island+Trail/@41.9330223,-70.0762158,1598m/data=!3m1!1e3!4m10!1m2!2m1!1sattractions+pet+friendly!3m6!1s0x89fb5d95e99b6aa1:0x38673301ea211c5d!8m2!3d41.9329068!4d-70.0690516!15sChhhdHRyYWN0aW9ucyBwZXQgZnJpZW5kbHlaGiIYYXR0cmFjdGlvbnMgcGV0IGZyaWVuZGx5kgELaGlraW5nX2FyZWGaASNDaFpEU1VoTk1HOW5TMFZKUTBGblNVUmxjRTF1ZDJGQkVBReABAPoBBAgREB8!16s%2Fg%2F11g6_64y4m?entry=ttu&g_ep=EgoyMDI2MDYxNi4wIKXMDSoASAFQAw%3D%3D]]></description>
