  <Placemark>
    <name>Great Salt Bay Farm Damariscotta ME</name>
    <description><![CDATA[Time: 2026-08-10T11:15:00<br/><br/>Great Salt Bay Farm<br/><br/>📍 Belvedere Road, Damariscotta, ME<br/><br/>A 146-acre wildlife preserve managed by the Coastal Rivers Conservation Trust — one of the few intact saltwater farms left in the Midcoast. The Bayside Trail + Blackstone Trail Loop is 1.6 mi, easy, ~32 min, circling open fields, salt marsh, and freshwater wetlands along Great Salt Bay and the Damariscotta River.<br/><br/>Tips<br/>- Closest hike option to downtown Damariscotta — easy to combine with Main Street.<br/>- Dogs welcome on leash.]]></description>
