  <Placemark>
    <name>Greater Meredith Program Sculpture Walk Meredith NH</name>
    <description><![CDATA[Greater Meredith Program - The Meredith Sculpture Walk<br/><br/>📍 Downtown Meredith, NH<br/><br/>A free, year-round, juried outdoor sculpture exhibition run by the nonprofit Greater Meredith Program — over 30 works by northeastern artists, placed along Main Street, the Mill Falls Marketplace, and the lakeside Hesky and Scenic Parks.<br/><br/>Tips<br/>- Self-guided walk — download the sculpture map from greatermeredith. before setting out.<br/>- Easy to combine with the Meredith Historical Society and Winnipesaukee Scenic Railroad, both nearby.<br/><br/>More info: https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=43.6538%2C%20-71.4992]]></description>
