  <Placemark>
    <name>Green Haven Correctional Facility NY</name>
    <description><![CDATA[Green Haven Correctional Facility<br/><br/>📍 594 NY-216, Stormville, NY 12582<br/><br/>Visible across the fields, the facility was constructed by New York State just prior to WWI, when it was used by the federal government during the war.<br/><br/>Tips<br/>- Viewed from the road only — not a visitor site.<br/>- Stop 16 of 39 on the Union Vale, Beekman, Pawling & Dover Scenic Tour (Tour 6).]]></description>
