    </Point>
  </Placemark>
  <Placemark>
    <name>Grindstone Point Winter Harbor ME</name>
    <description><![CDATA[Grindstone Point<br/><br/>📍 595 Grindstone Ave, Winter Harbor, ME<br/><br/>A quiet, peaceful spot on the Schoodic side to sit and listen to the waves for hours — genuinely uncrowded even by Schoodic's already-quiet standards. (4.8★, 67 reviews on Google Maps)<br/><br/>Tips<br/>- Bring a chair or blanket — this is a linger-and-listen spot, not a quick photo stop]]></description>
