  <Placemark>
    <name>Grinnell Library Wappingers Falls NY</name>
    <description><![CDATA[Grinnell Library<br/><br/>📍 2642 East Main St, Wappingers Falls, NY 12590<br/><br/>The 6th oldest public library in the state, formed 1867. Its Stick style Victorian home was constructed 1887, the gift of Mr. and Mrs. Irving Grinnell.<br/><br/>Tips<br/>- Stop 5 of 38 on the Beacon & Fishkill Heritage Tour (Tour 7).]]></description>
