  <Placemark>
    <name>Grittys Brew Pub Portland ME</name>
    <description><![CDATA[Gritty's Brew Pub<br/><br/>📍 396 Fore Street, Portland, ME<br/><br/>Gritty's served their first beer — "Best Bitter" — in December of 1988 and continues to brew and serve delicious craft beer to this day.<br/><br/>The Portland Gritty's Brew Pub is located inside the "Oxnard Stores" block on Fore Street. You can still see the original brickwork and ceiling beams, which have held fast since the building was constructed in 1837.<br/><br/>More info: https://www.google.com/maps/place/Gritty+McDuff%27s,+396+Fore+St,+Portland,+ME]]></description>
