  <Placemark>
    <name>Hallowell Antique Mall Hallowell ME</name>
    <description><![CDATA[Hallowell Antique Mall<br/><br/>📍 Water Street, Hallowell, ME<br/><br/>An antique mall featuring 80 dealers with a wide variety of vintage and antique items. A major browsing destination along Hallowell's Water Street.<br/><br/>Tips<br/>- 80 dealer booths means variety<br/>- Large enough for extended browsing<br/>- Located on historic Water Street<br/>- Good for collectors and casual browsers<br/>- Pair with other Water Street shops and dining]]></description>
