  <Placemark>
    <name>Hamilton Fish Sr. Newburgh-Beacon Bridge</name>
    <description><![CDATA[Hamilton Fish Sr. Newburgh-Beacon Bridge<br/><br/>📍 I-84 / NY-52, Beacon, NY 12508<br/><br/>A through cantilever truss and continuous truss design, 7855 feet in length. Opened as a single span by the NYS Bridge Authority in 1963, it was increased in capacity by a 2nd span in 1980.<br/><br/>Tips<br/>- Stop 17 of 38 on the Beacon & Fishkill Heritage Tour (Tour 7).]]></description>
