  <Placemark>
    <name>Harbor Dogs Camden ME</name>
    <description><![CDATA[Harbor Dogs<br/><br/>📍 1 Public Landing, Camden, ME (municipal parking lot, waterfront)<br/><br/>A tiny red hot dog shack in Camden's municipal lot that takes hot dogs seriously and also nails fresh seafood — an unusual but well-executed combination. Rated 4.5 on Tripadvisor (#20 of 40 Camden restaurants), 4.4 on Google. Picnic tables right by the water, quick service, reasonable prices.<br/><br/>Must Order<br/>- Harbor Dog — the traditional Maine red hot dog with apple chutney<br/>- BBQ dog or a Reuben dog (beef or veggie)<br/>- Lobster roll — regulars call it among the best in town, unusual for a hot dog shack<br/>- Fish tacos<br/><br/>Tips<br/>- Order at the window, eat at the picnic tables — casual, no-frills setup.<br/>- Good option for a quick waterfront lunch without a sit-down commitment.<br/>- Seafood here tastes genuinely fresh — reviewers note it "came off the boat hours ago."<br/><br/>More info: https://www.google.com/maps/place/Harbor+Dogs/@44.2087471,-69.064961,261m/data=!3m1!1e3!4m13!1m5!2m4!1sRestaurants!5m1!4e9!6e5!3m6!1s0x4cadd70c0855c367:0xc20e6ddf293e04d7!8m2!3d44.2094729!4d-69.0633712!15sCgtSZXN0YXVyYW50c1oNIgtyZXN0YXVyYW50c5IBCnJlc3RhdXJhbnSaASNDaFpEU1VoTk1HOW5TMFZKUTBGblNVUlBjbk5UVDFKQkVBReABAPoBBAguEDM!16s%2Fg%2F11btrsf361?entry=ttu&g_ep=EgoyMDI2MDYwOS4wIKXMDSoASAFQAw%3D%3D]]></description>
