  <Placemark>
    <name>Harbor Park</name>
    <description><![CDATA[**Project Puffin Visitor Center**: A tourist attraction with free entrance (suggested donation $5). It does not serve food or alcohol, as it focuses on education about puffin conservation. Open from 10 AM.<br/><br/>More info: https://www.google.com/maps/place/Harbor+Park/@44.0995597,-69.1264774,2564m/data=!3m1!1e3!4m11!1m3!2m2!1sscenic+spot!6e1!3m6!1s0x4cadce2504eeebaf:0x56cd971919553f74!8m2!3d44.1010858!4d-69.1084041!15sCgtzY2VuaWMgc3BvdFoNIgtzY2VuaWMgc3BvdJIBBHBhcmuaAURDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnN4YUdWVWFEWmhSVTB4VjBkT1psUnNXa1pTUm5CR1lsYzFTVmx1WXhBQuABAPoBBAgAED8!16s%2Fg%2F1tm8dl64?entry=ttu&g_ep=EgoyMDI2MDcxMy4wIKXMDSoASAFQAw%3D%3D]]></description>
