  <Placemark>
    <name>Harbor Table Southwest Harbor ME</name>
    <description><![CDATA[Harbor Table is a casual dining restaurant located at 336 Main St, known for its friendly atmosphere and a variety of dishes including seafood and comfort foods. It attracts a diverse clientele, including locals and visitors, often groups looking for a comfortable dine-out experience. The vibe is casual, budget-friendly, and lively, making it suitable for casual gatherings and meals with friends or family.<br/><br/>Positives:  <br/>- Excellent service and friendly staff  <br/>- Delicious food with praises for specific dishes like sandwiches and dips  <br/>- Cozy atmosphere that enhances the dining experience  <br/>- Good variety of menu options<br/><br/>Common Issues:  <br/>- Some reviews noted slow food service due to limited kitchen staff  <br/>- A few customers felt that prices were a bit high for portion sizes  <br/>- Occasionally, the quality of dishes can be inconsistent, with some items missing the mark  <br/><br/>Overall, Harbor Table is well-regarded for its service and food but faces challenges with food timing and price perceptions.<br/><br/>More info: https://www.google.com/maps/place/Harbor+Table/@44.2802129,-68.3263301,50m/data=!3m1!1e3!4m13!1m5!2m4!1sRestaurants!5m1!4e9!6e5!3m6!1s0x4caebdccc4b84b15:0x1998872e2e19ac7c!8m2!3d44.2802314!4d-68.3261795!15sCgtSZXN0YXVyYW50c1oNIgtyZXN0YXVyYW50c5IBCnJlc3RhdXJhbnSaAURDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMjVzZEdWVk1XaFpibHBaWWtoV1UxbFZhM2RYYTNoTVZtMDFVMVV4UlJBQuABAPoBBAgAEEk!16s%2Fg%2F11qp272bw_?entry=ttu&g_ep=EgoyMDI2MDYxMC4wIKXMDSoASAFQAw%3D%3D]]></description>
