  <Placemark>
    <name>Harborwalk Trail Portland ME</name>
    <description><![CDATA[Harborwalk Trail<br/><br/>Start at 53 Portland Pier — wander past J's Oyster to the pier's end for a view of DiMillo's floating restaurant and marina.<br/><br/>The Fore River winds along the Portland waterfront and into Casco Bay, bringing lobstermen, kayakers, and the occasional seal. Soak in the sights and sounds of Portland's working waterfront from the many wharves and piers along Commercial Street.<br/><br/>Highlights<br/>- DiMillo's floating restaurant and marina at Portland Pier<br/>- Waves & Anchor fence next to Portland Lobster Co. (great photo spot)<br/>- Long Wharf with public art installations and historic monuments<br/>- Views of Casco Bay and working lobster boats<br/><br/>Tips<br/>- Best in the morning when the working waterfront is active<br/>- The full harborwalk connects to Long Wharf and beyond<br/><br/>More info: https://www.google.com/maps/search/Portland+Pier,+Portland,+ME]]></description>
