  <Placemark>
    <name>Hardy Boat New Harbor ME</name>
    <description><![CDATA[View website<br/><br/>Hardy Boat Cruises — New Harbor<br/><br/>📍 129 State Route 32, New Harbor, ME<br/><br/>Ferry service to Monhegan aboard the Hardy III — about 1 hour out, 1.25 hours on the return. Round trip starts around $35/person. Geographically the middle option between Port Clyde (closest to Camden) and Boothbay Harbor (furthest, longest crossing).<br/><br/>Tips<br/>- Online booking strongly encouraged — phone wait times can be long during peak season<br/>- Phone (207) 677-2026 / sales@hardyboat.<br/>- Suitable for all ages per the operator<br/><br/>More info: https://www.hardyboat.com/]]></description>
