    <name>Harkness Preserve Rockport ME</name>
    <description><![CDATA[Harkness Preserve<br/><br/>📍 13 Sea St, Rockport, ME<br/><br/>A small, quiet waterfront preserve right off Rockport's harbor — a peaceful spot to sit and watch the boats. (4.9★, 13 reviews on Google Maps)<br/><br/>Tips<br/>- Small and easy to miss — worth a quick stop while in Rockport village]]></description>
