  <Placemark>
    <name>Harney &amp; Sons Tea Millerton, NY</name>
    <description><![CDATA[Harney & Sons Tea<br/><br/>📍 Millerton, NY<br/><br/>The flagship retail shop and tasting salon for one of America's finest tea companies — a vast selection of teas from around the world with a proper tea service.<br/><br/>Tips<br/>- Open daily; the tasting salon does tea flights and full tea service<br/>- The retail shop carries the full Harney line plus specialty items unavailable elsewhere<br/>- About 30 minutes east of Rhinecliff — worth the drive for tea enthusiasts<br/><br/>More info: https://www.google.com/maps/search/Harney+&+Sons+Tea+Millerton,+NY]]></description>
