    <name>Harraseeket Lunch and Lobster South Freeport ME</name>
    <description><![CDATA[Harraseeket Lunch & Lobster<br/><br/>📍 South Freeport, ME<br/><br/>Extensive menu with working-harbor setting near L.L.Bean. More menu variety than typical lobster shacks, casual waterfront dining.<br/><br/>Tips<br/>- Extensive menu options<br/>- Working-harbor setting<br/>- Near L.L.Bean shopping (if interested)<br/>- Casual waterfront dining]]></description>
