  <Placemark>
    <name>Harrison's Restaurant Stowe VT</name>
    <description><![CDATA[Harrison’s Restaurant is a dining establishment known for its hearty meals and friendly service. It typically attracts families, couples, and groups looking for a relaxed dining experience, often for casual dinners or social gatherings. The overall vibe is casual and friendly, with a comfortable atmosphere, although the restaurant leans towards an upscale price range. Reviewers consistently praise the great tasting food and the attentive service. However, common issues include inconsistent meal quality, with some reviewers experiencing dishes that they found inedible.<br/><br/>More info: https://www.google.com/maps/place/Harrison's+Restaurant/@44.4651613,-72.6893761,895m/data=!3m1!1e3!4m6!3m5!1s0x4cb59655c7acca7f:0xdc6f31115c51270d!8m2!3d44.4656358!4d-72.6869274!16s%2Fg%2F1tjhx820?entry=ttu&g_ep=EgoyMDI2MDYxMC4wIKXMDSoASAFQAw%3D%3D]]></description>
