  <Placemark>
    <name>Hartmann Model Railroad and Toy Museum North Conway NH</name>
    <description><![CDATA[Hartmann Model Railroad & Toy Museum<br/><br/>📍 15 Town Hall Rd, Intervale, Conway, NH<br/><br/>A model railroad and toy museum with roughly a dozen layouts spanning scales from tiny Z to large G, plus a sizeable hobby shop stocked with European brands, alongside varied toy displays.<br/><br/>Tips<br/>- Multiple recent listings (Yelp, Tripadvisor) indicate this museum has closed — call ahead or check current status before including it in a day plan.<br/><br/>More info: https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=44.1028%2C%20-71.1523]]></description>
