    <name>Hartshorn Farm Waitsfield VT</name>
    <description><![CDATA[Hartshorn Farm<br/><br/>📍 Waitsfield, VT<br/><br/>A working farm and scenic landmark in Waitsfield, part of the open farmland that defines the Mad River Valley's classic Vermont landscape.<br/><br/>Tips<br/>- A drive-by scenic landmark rather than a visitor-facing farm stand — enjoy the view from the road.<br/><br/>More info: https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=44.2143%2C%20-72.7935]]></description>
