  <Placemark>
    <name>Harwich Port MA</name>
    <description><![CDATA[Harwich Port, a quaint coastal community in Massachusetts, offers a variety of seafood restaurants featuring dishes like clam chowder and lobster rolls. Prices typically range from $15 to $40 per entree. Many establishments are open for both lunch and dinner and do serve alcohol.<br/><br/>More info: https://www.google.com/maps/place/Harwich+Port,+Harwich,+MA/@41.6726707,-70.1031661,12946m/data=!3m2!1e3!4b1!4m6!3m5!1s0x89fb3fd27c5a9b43:0x9dd90a3f69b90b9b!8m2!3d41.6694978!4d-70.0591278!16zL20vMHR4X2Y?entry=ttu&g_ep=EgoyMDI2MDYxNi4wIKXMDSoASAFQAw%3D%3D]]></description>
