    <name>Heaton Woods Montpelier VT</name>
    <description><![CDATA[Heaton Woods<br/><br/>📍 Montpelier, VT<br/><br/>A wooded park area in Montpelier with a memorial marker.<br/><br/>Tips<br/>- A quiet, low-key green space rather than a major attraction.<br/><br/>More info: https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=44.2597%2C%20-72.5648]]></description>
