  <Placemark>
    <name>Hemlock Catskill, NY</name>
    <description><![CDATA[Hemlock<br/><br/>📍 Catskill, NY<br/><br/>A go-to cocktail bar in Catskill drawing locals and Brooklyn transplants since 2023 — creative, well-executed drinks in an atmospheric setting.<br/><br/>Tips<br/>- No reservations — walk-in bar<br/>- The cocktail list rotates seasonally; always a few classics done properly<br/>- Great for a drink before or after dinner at Phos next door<br/><br/>More info: https://www.google.com/maps/search/Hemlock+Catskill,+NY]]></description>
