  <Placemark>
    <name>Hen of the Wood Burlington VT</name>
    <description><![CDATA[Hen of the Wood<br/><br/>📍 Burlington VT<br/><br/>Sister to the Waterbury original — open wood-fired kitchen with a seasonal New American menu using Vermont producers. One of Burlington's top dinner restaurants.<br/><br/>Must Order<br/>- <br/><br/>Tips<br/>- Reservations recommended.<br/>- Located at 55 Cherry St downtown, walkable from the waterfront.]]></description>
