    <name>Hen of the Wood Waterbury VT</name>
    <description><![CDATA[Hen of the Wood<br/><br/>📍 Waterbury VT<br/><br/>Vermont's most celebrated farm-to-table restaurant in a rustic 1800s mill building overlooking a stream; seasonal New American menu sourced from Vermont farms.<br/><br/>Must Order<br/>- Seasonal tasting menu<br/><br/>Tips<br/>- Reservations essential — book weeks in advance for a weekend dinner.<br/>- The mill setting is magical at dusk.]]></description>
