    <name>Heritage Museums &amp; Gardens Sandwich MA</name>
    <description><![CDATA[Heritage Museums & Gardens<br/><br/>📍 Sandwich MA<br/><br/>100-acre estate combining an antique car collection, rhododendron gardens, folk art museum, and a vintage working carousel.<br/><br/>Tips<br/>- Peak rhododendron bloom is late May/early June — stunning.<br/>- The antique car collection alone justifies the visit.]]></description>
