  <Placemark>
    <name>Heritage Park</name>
    <description><![CDATA[Heritage Park is a waterfront park located at 25 Front St, offering seasonal events and activities like live music. It is open until 6 PM, making it a perfect spot for lunch but not dinner, and does not serve food or alcohol.<br/><br/>More info: https://www.google.com/maps/place/Heritage+Park/@44.4251214,-69.0174097,8075m/data=!3m1!1e3!4m13!1m5!2m4!1sattractions!5m1!4e9!6e1!3m6!1s0x4cae6e5a187e9627:0x478bf6e60ab9faed!8m2!3d44.4276883!4d-69.0033423!15sCgthdHRyYWN0aW9uc1oNIgthdHRyYWN0aW9uc5IBBHBhcmuaASNDaFpEU1VoTk1HOW5TMFZKUTBGblNVUndhVFEzTVVsbkVBReABAPoBBAg1EEE!16s%2Fg%2F1z44b4651?entry=ttu&g_ep=EgoyMDI2MDcxMy4wIKXMDSoASAFQAw%3D%3D]]></description>
