  <Placemark>
    <name>Highland Light Truro MA</name>
    <description><![CDATA[Highland Light<br/><br/>📍 Truro MA<br/><br/>Cape Cod's oldest and tallest lighthouse, with guided tower tours and sweeping Atlantic views from the highest point on the Cape.<br/><br/>Tips<br/>- Guided tower tours available seasonally — check hours.<br/>- The Highland House Museum next door covers Truro history.]]></description>
