    <name>Highseas Bar Harbor ME</name>
    <description><![CDATA[Highseas<br/><br/>📍 Bar Harbor, ME (Frenchman Bay shore)<br/><br/>A Gilded Age "cottage" on Bar Harbor's shore, now owned by the Jackson Laboratory and used as a conference and guest facility.<br/><br/>Tips<br/>- Private property, not open to the public — a drive/walk-past landmark rather than a stop.<br/><br/>More info: https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=44.3558%2C%20-68.1836]]></description>
