    <name>Hillside Methodist Church Rhinebeck NY</name>
    <description><![CDATA[Hillside Methodist Church<br/><br/>📍 Route 9, Rhinebeck, NY (south of the village)<br/><br/>A small, Gothic Revival fieldstone church built in 1855, now an antique store.<br/><br/>Tips<br/>- Stop 1 of 33 on the Rhinebeck, Red Hook & Milan Scenic Tour (Tour 1), the tour's starting point.]]></description>
