  <Placemark>
    <name>Hilton O'Connor Trail Bremen ME</name>
    <description><![CDATA[Hilton O'Connor Trail<br/><br/>📍 Bremen Town House, Route 32, Bremen, ME (trailhead at/adjacent to this building)<br/><br/>47-acre Bremen Town Forest, dedicated to Diane Hilton O'Connor of the Bremen Conservation Commission — a winding salt marsh, mature white ash/red oak, fern alleys, and a hay meadow. ~1.1 mi loop, 108 ft gain.<br/><br/>More info: https://www.coastalrivers.org/trails/hilton-oconnor-trail/]]></description>
