  <Placemark>
    <name>Hio Fire Road and Big Heath Seawall ME</name>
    <description><![CDATA[Hio Fire Road & Big Heath Bog<br/><br/>📍 Near Seawall, western Mount Desert Island, ME<br/><br/>A gated fire road near Seawall on the western side of Mount Desert Island, skirting the Big Heath — a glacial peat bog — through spruce and pine woods. The gates at both ends of the road keep vehicle traffic out entirely, which is a big part of why it stays quiet.<br/><br/>Tips<br/>- Gated at both ends — foot/bike access only<br/>- Good for birding and a genuinely solitary walk]]></description>
