  <Placemark>
    <name>Hodgdon's Seafood Southwest Harbor ME</name>
    <description><![CDATA[Hodgdon's Seafood is a privately-owned seafood restaurant best known for its fresh lobster and seafood offerings. The typical customers include seafood lovers and tourists seeking an authentic Maine experience, making it a popular stop for those looking for quality, freshly caught seafood. The overall vibe is casual and friendly, with a focus on budget-friendly prices, as indicated by customer reviews praising the affordability and quality of the food. Consistently praised positives include the freshness of the seafood, friendly service, great prices, and tasty seasoning. However, the restaurant is currently temporarily closed, which is a notable downside for potential customers.<br/><br/>More info: https://www.google.com/maps/place/Hodgdon's+Seafood/@44.2563809,-68.3637174,11129m/data=!3m1!1e3!4m14!1m7!3m6!1s0x4caea349426b9ac1:0x3ca9ed3a9d2836e0!2sCharlotte's+Legendary+Lobster+Pound!8m2!3d44.2446861!4d-68.2986522!16s%2Fg%2F1q6n2glpy!3m5!1s0x4cae974ca208396d:0x6872533dff284438!8m2!3d44.283144!4d-68.3980696!16s%2Fg%2F11hzjhqlvh?entry=ttu&g_ep=EgoyMDI2MDYxMC4wIKXMDSoASAFQAw%3D%3D]]></description>
