  <Placemark>
    <name>Holbrook's Lobster Grill Cundy's Harbor ME</name>
    <description><![CDATA[Holbrook's Lobster Grill<br/><br/>📍 Cundy's Harbor, ME<br/><br/>Community-run operation with an elevated menu beyond the basics. A step up from typical lobster shacks while maintaining casual character.<br/><br/>Tips<br/>- Community-run establishment<br/>- Menu options beyond basics<br/>- Elevated casual dining<br/>- Local favorite]]></description>
    <styleUrl>#c-red</styleUrl>
