    <name>Home Kitchen Bakery &amp; Cafe Rockland ME</name>
    <description><![CDATA[Home Kitchen Bakery & Café<br/><br/>📍 606 Main Street, Rockland, ME<br/><br/>Famous breakfast and lunch joint renowned for huge cinnamon rolls, sticky buns, huevos rancheros, and scratch pastries. Open for lunch until 3pm, closed for dinner.<br/><br/>Must Order<br/>- Cinnamon rolls and sticky buns<br/>- Huevos rancheros<br/><br/>More info: https://www.google.com/maps/place/Home+Kitchen+Cafe/@44.08514,-69.200832,18853m/data=!3m1!1e3!4m13!1m5!2m4!1sRestaurants!5m1!4e9!6e5!3m6!1s0x4cadd1d63e9160e1:0x3e5b1c9ad8dfce1f!8m2!3d44.1103452!4d-69.1093962!15sCgtSZXN0YXVyYW50c1oNIgtyZXN0YXVyYW50c5IBFGJyZWFrZmFzdF9yZXN0YXVyYW50mgFEQ2k5RFFVbFJRVU52WkVOb2RIbGpSamx2VDJreGNFMUdhR3RpVjJoWVRtcG5kRkZyUlhkVU1VSlhUa1V4VUZOc1JSQULgAQD6AQQIJhBE!16s%2Fg%2F1wc30vcj?entry=ttu&g_ep=EgoyMDI2MDcxMy4wIKXMDSoASAFQAw%3D%3D]]></description>
