  <Placemark>
    <name>Home of FDR NHS (Springwood) Hyde Park, NY</name>
    <description><![CDATA[+Hyde+Park,+NY)<br/><br/>Home of FDR NHS (Springwood)<br/><br/>📍 Hyde Park, NY<br/><br/>FDR's birthplace, lifelong home, and burial site — toured with knowledgeable NPS rangers who bring the family's history vividly to life.<br/><br/>Tips<br/>- Combined ticket covers Springwood, FDR Library, and Val-Kill — best value<br/>- Book timed-entry house tour tickets online in advance<br/>- FDR and Eleanor are buried in the rose garden — quietly moving<br/><br/>More info: https://www.google.com/maps/search/Home+of+FDR+NHS+(Springwood)+Hyde+Park,+NY]]></description>
