  <Placemark>
    <name>Honey Road Burlington VT</name>
    <description><![CDATA[Honey Road<br/><br/>📍 Burlington VT<br/><br/>Eastern Mediterranean small-plates and mezze on Church Street; one of Burlington's most sought-after reservations. James Beard semifinalist recognition.<br/><br/>Must Order<br/>- Mezze sharing plates<br/><br/>Tips<br/>- Book well ahead — small room and consistently in demand.<br/>- Order several small plates to share; the mezze spread is the move.]]></description>
