  <Placemark>
    <name>Honey's Fried Chicken Palace</name>
    <description><![CDATA[Honey's Fried Chicken Palace is a casual restaurant that specializes in fried chicken and comfort food, with prices ranging from $10 to $20. It is open for lunch and dinner, offering no alcohol service.<br/><br/>More info: https://www.google.com/maps/place/Honey's+Fried+Chicken+Palace/@44.08514,-69.200832,18853m/data=!3m1!1e3!4m13!1m5!2m4!1sRestaurants!5m1!4e9!6e5!3m6!1s0x4cadcf7b5a13d003:0x42b6a5f6f52b135a!8m2!3d44.0915908!4d-69.1440061!15sCgtSZXN0YXVyYW50c1oNIgtyZXN0YXVyYW50c5IBCnJlc3RhdXJhbnSaAURDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMjFLV1ZwSFRuVlhXRlo0VTBkM01tRldhelZqV0U1S1YydEdkRmRJWXhBQuABAPoBBAgAED0!16s%2Fg%2F11y33bjmdf?entry=ttu&g_ep=EgoyMDI2MDcxMy4wIKXMDSoASAFQAw%3D%3D]]></description>
