  <Placemark>
    <name>Hood Museum of Art Hanover NH</name>
    <description><![CDATA[Hood Museum of Art<br/><br/>📍 Dartmouth College campus, Hanover, NH<br/><br/>One of the oldest and largest college art museums in the United States, free to visit, with holdings ranging from ancient to contemporary art and particular strength in Native American and African art collections.<br/><br/>Tips<br/>- Free admission — an easy add-on to a Dartmouth campus walk.<br/><br/>More info: https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=43.7020%2C%20-72.2873]]></description>
