  <Placemark>
    <name>Hopewell Junction NY</name>
    <description><![CDATA[Hopewell Junction<br/><br/>📍 Hopewell Junction, NY 12533<br/><br/>Although settled a c. earlier, Hopewell Junction experienced major growth with the coming of the Central New England & Newburgh and Dutchess & Connecticut Railroads, which made it a major freight junction. The road turns quickly through a series of busy intersections that a generation ago crossed rail lines whose tracks have been removed. Now a commercial center for the surrounding suburbs, it retains architectural traces of its earlier past.<br/><br/>Tips<br/>- Stop 37 of 38 on the Beacon & Fishkill Heritage Tour (Tour 7).]]></description>
