  <Placemark>
    <name>Hotel Tivoli Tivoli, NY</name>
    <description><![CDATA[Hotel Tivoli<br/><br/>📍 Tivoli, NY<br/><br/>An artist-run boutique hotel in a restored Victorian building — a beloved cultural gathering spot and weekend destination with a strong creative community.<br/><br/>Tips<br/>- Worth a drink or dinner even if not staying overnight<br/>- Walking distance to Tivoli restaurants<br/>- Frequented by Bard College faculty and artists<br/><br/>More info: https://www.google.com/maps/search/Hotel+Tivoli+Tivoli,+NY]]></description>
