  <Placemark>
    <name>Hudson-Athens Lighthouse Athens, NY</name>
    <description><![CDATA[Hudson-Athens Lighthouse<br/><br/>📍 Athens, NY<br/><br/>An 1874 lighthouse visible from the Athens waterfront, accessible by seasonal boat tours and offering some of the most photogenic Hudson River views in Greene County.<br/><br/>Tips<br/>- Kayak tours to the lighthouse available seasonally through local outfitters<br/>- The waterfront park offers excellent views even without a boat<br/>- Best photographed in afternoon light<br/><br/>More info: https://www.google.com/maps/search/Hudson-Athens+Lighthouse+Athens,+NY]]></description>
