      <coordinates>-68.2189,44.2959,0</coordinates>
    </Point>
  </Placemark>
  <Placemark>
    <name>Hunters Cliffs Seal Harbor ME</name>
    <description><![CDATA[Hunters Cliffs<br/><br/>📍 Route 3, ~0.8 mi east of Seal Harbor village (coordinate is the older Day Mountain lot; a new 12-car lot was built ~1,000 ft east in 2025, exact GPS not found)<br/><br/>167 acres between Day Mountain and Hunters Beach, part of the Land & Garden Preserve's Little Long Pond Natural Lands. The rugged Hunters Cliffs trail offers expansive ocean views descending to the beach. Open year-round, dawn to dusk, no bikes.<br/><br/>Tips<br/>- Coordinate is approximate — a new 2025 parking lot exists ~1,000 ft east of this pin, exact location not confirmed<br/>- Pairs naturally with the existing Little Long Pond and Day Mountain Trail notes nearby]]></description>
