  <Placemark>
    <name>Hyannis Barnstable MA</name>
    <description><![CDATA[Hyannis, located in Barnstable, MA, offers seafood, American cuisine, and beachside dining. Prices range from $119 at budget inns to $256 for 3-star hotels. Many places serve alcohol and offer lunch and dinner services.<br/><br/>More info: https://www.google.com/maps/place/Hyannis,+Barnstable,+MA+02601/@41.6446333,-70.2918978,2688m/data=!3m1!1e3!4m6!3m5!1s0x89fb31ba689f1f55:0xe64440b55b26ad73!8m2!3d41.6524911!4d-70.2881124!16zL20vMDI0MmJ3?entry=ttu&g_ep=EgoyMDI2MDYxNi4wIKXMDSoASAFQAw%3D%3D]]></description>
