    </Point>
  </Placemark>
  <Placemark>
    <name>In Good Company Rockland ME</name>
    <description><![CDATA[In Good Company<br/><br/>📍 415 Main Street, Rockland, ME<br/><br/>An upscale, long-standing wine bar and tapas restaurant housed in a restored bank building, known for daily curated menus, an inventive small-plates list, and a standout cocktail selection. Open for dinner starting at 4:30pm.<br/><br/>Must Order<br/>- Small plates for sharing<br/>- Seasonal cocktail menu<br/><br/>Tips<br/>- Reservations recommended on weekends.<br/>- Walking distance from Farnsworth Art Museum.]]></description>
