  <Placemark>
    <name>Indian Point Ellsworth ME</name>
    <description><![CDATA[Indian Point<br/><br/>📍 Water Street (Route 230S), Ellsworth, ME (~1 mi from Route 1/Main St)<br/><br/>A short 0.75 mi round-trip Union River trail with a scenic overlook of downtown Ellsworth. River otters, eagles, and osprey are regularly seen; bog bridges built by the Maine Conservation Corps.]]></description>
