  <Placemark>
    <name>Inn At Whitefield Littleton NH</name>
    <description><![CDATA[Inn At Whitefield is a restaurant offering American cuisine, with prices ranging from $20-$30 per person. It is open for dinner on Thursdays, Fridays, and Saturdays from 5 PM to 8 PM, and does not serve lunch. Alcohol is likely available based on common restaurant offerings.<br/><br/>More info: https://www.google.com/maps/place/Inn+At+Whitefield/@44.3038348,-71.9598423,94148m/data=!3m1!1e3!4m10!1m2!2m1!1sresstaurants+with+reservations!3m6!1s0x4cb472ad3209b75d:0x2e14856a97c12224!8m2!3d44.3978576!4d-71.5986099!15sCh1yZXN0YXVyYW50cyB3aXRoIHJlc2VydmF0aW9ucyIyUjAvZ2VvL3R5cGUvZXN0YWJsaXNobWVudF9wb2kvYWNjZXB0c19yZXNlcnZhdGlvbnNaGiIYcmVzdGF1cmFudHMgcmVzZXJ2YXRpb25zkgEKcmVzdGF1cmFudJoBJENoZERTVWhOTUc5blMwVkpRMEZuU1VOa04xQjFOVFJuUlJBQuABAPoBBAhrEEw!16s%2Fg%2F1hc1q79b4?entry=ttu&g_ep=EgoyMDI2MDYxNi4wIKXMDSoASAFQAw%3D%3D]]></description>
