  <Placemark>
    <name>Inn at Shelburne Farms Restaurant Shelburne VT</name>
    <description><![CDATA[Inn at Shelburne Farms Restaurant<br/><br/>📍 Shelburne VT<br/><br/>Elegant farm-to-table dining in a 19th-century Vanderbilt-Webb mansion; all produce, meats, and dairy sourced directly from the surrounding farm.<br/><br/>Must Order<br/>- Farm-to-table seasonal tasting menu<br/><br/>Tips<br/>- Reservations required — open seasonally.<br/>- Dinner on the porch of the mansion overlooking the farm is exceptional.]]></description>
