  <Placemark>
    <name>Innisfree Garden Millbrook, NY</name>
    <description><![CDATA[Innisfree Garden<br/><br/>📍 Millbrook, NY<br/><br/>One of the world's ten greatest gardens — a 150-acre landscape garden inspired by Chinese and Japanese traditions, with no two views the same.<br/><br/>Tips<br/>- Seasonal hours May–October; check innisfreegarden. for exact dates and admission<br/>- Allow at least 2–3 hours — the garden reveals itself slowly and rewards patience<br/>- Tram available for mobility-limited visitors; most paths are walkable<br/>- Also stop 17 of 17 on the Washington & Amenia Scenic Tour (Tour 4)<br/><br/>More info: https://www.google.com/maps/search/Innisfree+Garden+Millbrook,+NY]]></description>
