  <Placemark>
    <name>Institute of Ecosystem Studies Millbrook NY</name>
    <description><![CDATA[Institute of Ecosystem Studies (Cary Institute)<br/><br/>📍 2801 Sharon Turnpike (Route 44), Millbrook, NY 12545<br/><br/>Established 1971, this 1,924-acre research campus (now known as the Cary Institute of Ecosystem Studies) lines Route 44. Free visitor permits are available at the Gifford House Visitor and Education Center — nature trails, gardens, exhibits, and classes.<br/><br/>Tips<br/>- Call 845/677-5359 for visitor information.<br/>- Stop 2 of 17 on the Washington & Amenia Scenic Tour (Tour 4).<br/>- Rating (4.7) is estimated from TripAdvisor's review breakdown (10 Excellent + 3 Very Good of 13, zero negative) — no confirmed Google rating available.]]></description>
