    <name>Intervale Scenic Vista North Conway NH</name>
    <description><![CDATA[Intervale Scenic Vista<br/><br/>📍 3654 White Mountain Hwy, Intervale, NH<br/><br/>A well-set-up scenic pull-off on Route 16 north of North Conway with real restrooms — a rare combination on this stretch of road. (4.8★, 713 reviews on Google Maps)<br/><br/>Tips<br/>- Has actual restrooms, unlike most roadside pull-offs on this route<br/>- Good quick stop heading toward or from Pinkham Notch]]></description>
