    <name>Irving Farm Coffee Roasters Millerton Millerton, NY</name>
    <description><![CDATA[Irving Farm Coffee Roasters Millerton<br/><br/>📍 Millerton, NY<br/><br/>The Hudson Valley-based specialty roaster's anchor location, serving excellent single-origin coffees and espresso drinks.<br/><br/>Tips<br/>- Combine with Harney & Sons next door for a complete Millerton morning<br/>- Ask what's on the rotating single-origin pour-over bar<br/>- Millerton's small commercial district has several other good shops worth browsing<br/><br/>More info: https://www.google.com/maps/search/Irving+Farm+Coffee+Roasters+Millerton+Millerton,+NY]]></description>
