  <Placemark>
    <name>Isla &amp; Co. West Palm Beach FL</name>
    <description><![CDATA[Overview<br/>Type: Restaurant<br/><br/>Best known for: Excellent atmosphere and food, unique dish offerings<br/><br/>Location context: West Palm Beach<br/><br/>Price level: Not mentioned<br/><br/>Visit timing: Not mentioned<br/><br/>Typical Customers<br/>Demographics: Locals and tourists, couples, small groups<br/><br/>Group types: Couples, friends<br/><br/>Common occasions: Brunch, casual meals, date night<br/><br/>Vibe & Setting<br/>Atmosphere: Casual, relaxed, backyard vibe<br/><br/>Noise level: Moderate<br/><br/>Decor & setting: Indoor and outdoor seating, bar area<br/><br/>Service style: Attentive but occasionally slow<br/><br/>Recommended Dishes<br/>Overall dish consensus<br/>Reviewers highly recommend the crispy chicken sandwich and Scarlett Rose martini, both praised for unique flavors. The fries are noted for being well-cooked and a great appetizer. <br/><br/>How “top dishes” are determined<br/>Top dishes are selected based on popularity as referenced in the menu and reviewed frequently with strong positive feedback from patrons. Items frequently mentioned and highlighted in user photos are also considered.<br/><br/>Top dishes to order<br/>| Rank | Dish                   | Why it stands out                             | How often it’s mentioned          | Ideal for               |<br/>|------|------------------------|----------------------------------------------|----------------------------------|-------------------------|<br/>| 1    | Crispy Chicken Sandwich | Great flavors and a labor of love in cooking | Mentioned in many reviews        | Hearty main            |<br/>| 2    | Scarlett Rose Martini  | Unique and flavorful combination             | Appears in numerous photos       | Fun drink to share      |<br/>| 3    | Sticky Date Pudding    | Praised for beautiful flavor and texture    | Repeatedly called out as a favorite | Sweet finish           |<br/><br/>Good alternates / backup choices<br/>- Eggs Benedict: Notable for its flavors, great for brunch.<br/>- Quinoa: Healthy and praised as a lighter option.<br/>- Chicken Parmesan: Comforting dish that is well-received.<br/><br/>Highlights (non‑dish positives from reviews)<br/>Atmosphere: Reviewers note a cozy and inviting space, enhancing the dining experience.<br/><br/>Service: Staff is friendly and attentive, contributing to a positive dining atmosphere.<br/><br/>Common Issues (from reviews)<br/>Service Speed: Some reviewers noted slower service during busy times, especially when full.<br/><br/>Portion Sizes: A few guests felt that the portion sizes were small for the price.<br/><br/>Practical Notes<br/>Reservation / wait: Reservations are recommended due to high traffic, especially on weekends.<br/><br/>Accessibility: Not mentioned<br/><br/>Parking / transit: Not mentioned<br/><br/>Best use case: Best for a casual brunch or a laid-back date night.<br/><br/>More info: https://www.google.com/maps/place/Isla+%26+Co.+West+Palm+Beach/@26.6985946,-80.0663114,17z/data=!3m1!4b1!4m6!3m5!1s0x88d8d7e6e7facae9:0x96d3a56fb8c1c1f2!8m2!3d26.6985946!4d-80.0637365!16s%2Fg%2F11t69p2f46?entry=ttu&g_ep=EgoyMDI2MDYxMC4wIKXMDSoASAFQAw%3D%3D]]></description>
