  <Placemark>
    <name>Islesford Dock Restaurant Little Cranberry Island ME</name>
    <description><![CDATA[Islesford Dock Restaurant<br/><br/>📍 Little Cranberry Island (Islesford), ME<br/><br/>Reached by mail boat or water taxi from Northeast Harbor, this restaurant sits right on the working pier with panoramic views back toward Acadia's mountains. The journey itself is part of the experience—a quiet escape from downtown Bar Harbor crowds.<br/><br/>Tips<br/>- Hop on the mail boat or water taxi from Northeast Harbor<br/>- Call ahead to confirm operating hours and ferry schedules<br/>- Local seafood prepared fresh<br/>- The pier setting offers stunning mountain and water views]]></description>
