  <Placemark>
    <name>Isola Wine and Tapas Kinderhook NY</name>
    <description><![CDATA[Overview<br/>Type: Restaurant<br/><br/>Best known for: Unique wine list, stellar food and atmosphere<br/><br/>Location context: Not mentioned<br/><br/>Price level: $30–50<br/><br/>Visit timing: Not mentioned<br/><br/>Typical Customers<br/>Demographics: Not mentioned<br/><br/>Group types: Couples, friends<br/><br/>Common occasions: Memorable meals, date nights<br/><br/>Vibe & Setting<br/>Atmosphere: Cozy, inviting<br/><br/>Noise level: Not mentioned<br/><br/>Decor & setting: Indoor seating<br/><br/>Service style: Friendly, attentive<br/><br/>Recommended Dishes<br/>Overall dish consensus<br/>Diners frequently praise small plates like Beef Tartare and various unique wine pairings. <br/><br/>How “top dishes” are determined<br/>Top dishes are based on the Google Maps place page and its reviews, considering popular mentions and frequently praised dishes.<br/><br/>| Rank | Dish                                  | Why it stands out                                | How often it’s mentioned               | Ideal for                |<br/>|------|---------------------------------------|-------------------------------------------------|--------------------------------------|--------------------------|<br/>| 1    | Beef Tartare                          | Notable flavors and presentation.                | Repeatedly called out as a favorite. | Sharing at the table     |<br/>| 2    | Scallops with Puréed Tomatoes        | Deliciously prepared, highly praised.            | Appears in numerous reviews.         | Hearty main              |<br/>| 3    | Lemon Crème Brûlée                   | Unique dessert, often highlighted.               | Mentioned in many reviews.           | Sweet indulgence         |<br/><br/>Good alternates / backup choices<br/>- Chocolate Pudding with Sweet Ricotta: Comforting dessert.<br/>- Croquetas with Anchovy: Notable for flavor and texture.<br/>- Green Beans with Tahini Whip: Good for those seeking lighter options.<br/><br/>Highlights (non-dish positives from reviews)<br/>Service: Extremely friendly staff enhances dining experience.<br/><br/>Ambiance: Cozy lighting and lovely music create a memorable atmosphere.<br/><br/>Common Issues (from reviews)<br/>Parking: Parking lot in the back not well known and could use better signage.<br/><br/>Practical Notes<br/>Reservation / wait: Not mentioned<br/><br/>Accessibility: Not mentioned<br/><br/>Parking / transit: 20 car parking lot available, not widely known.<br/><br/>Best use case: Great for memorable dinners with friends or loved ones.<br/><br/>More info: https://www.google.com/maps/place/Isola+Wine+and+Tapas/@42.3946405,-73.6991559,414m/data=!3m1!1e3!4m14!1m7!3m6!1s0x89ddef90c36f0663:0x466d6fc29839bb9d!2sThe+Aviary+Kinderhook!8m2!3d42.3948641!4d-73.698253!16s%2Fg%2F11t7r439ly!3m5!1s0x89ddef8f37e90707:0x6c809272475d3165!8m2!3d42.3942346!4d-73.6975132!16s%2Fg%2F11vlv2qzls?entry=ttu&g_ep=EgoyMDI2MDYxMy4wIKXMDSoASAFQAw%3D%3D]]></description>
