    <description><![CDATA[J-Town Deli Country Store<br/><br/>📍 Jackson NH<br/><br/>Casual country-store deli serving breakfast sandwiches, subs, and baked goods — a local favorite grab-and-go stop.<br/><br/>Must Order<br/>- Breakfast sandwiches<br/>- Subs<br/><br/>Tips<br/>- Good grab-and-go stop before a hike.]]></description>
