  <Placemark>
    <name>Jackson Falls Jackson NH</name>
    <description><![CDATA[Jackson Falls<br/><br/>📍 Jackson NH<br/><br/>A series of cascading granite ledges and pools on Wildcat Brook, popular for wading and photos with easy roadside access near the village.<br/><br/>Tips<br/>- Easy roadside access — good for a quick stop.<br/>- Popular wading spot in summer; arrive early to beat crowds.]]></description>
