  <Placemark>
    <name>James Baird State Park Pleasant Valley, NY</name>
    <description><![CDATA[James Baird State Park<br/><br/>📍 14 Maintenance Ln, Pleasant Valley, NY<br/><br/>A well-regarded state park directly off the Taconic State Parkway, popular for its 18-hole golf course in summer and cross-country skiing and sledding in winter, with picnic groves and open fields in between.<br/><br/>Tips<br/>- Easy on/off access from the Taconic Parkway makes it a convenient rest stop on a byway drive.<br/>- Golf course and winter sports facilities mean it draws crowds on weekends in-season.<br/><br/>More info: https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=41.686202,-73.797793]]></description>
