  <Placemark>
    <name>Jesup Path and Hemlock Path Loop Acadia National Park ME</name>
    <description><![CDATA[Jesup Path and Hemlock Path Loop<br/><br/>📍 2 Sieur de Monts Rd, Bar Harbor, ME 04609<br/><br/>A 1.6-mile easy loop through birch and hemlock wetland at Sieur de Monts, largely on boardwalk. Rated 4.6★ on AllTrails across 1,500+ reviews, and described as "one of the most underrated day hikes in Acadia" — genuinely easy walking with real scenic payoff.<br/><br/>Tips<br/>- Boardwalk sections mean it's stroller/wheelchair-friendlier than most Acadia trails<br/>- Pairs naturally with Wild Gardens of Acadia, right next door at Sieur de Monts]]></description>
