  <Placemark>
    <name>Johan's Joe Swedish Restaurant West Palm Beach FL</name>
    <description><![CDATA[Overview<br/>Type: Cafe<br/><br/>Best known for: Friendly service and high-quality drinks and pastries.<br/><br/>Location context: Not mentioned.<br/><br/>Price level: $10–20 per person.<br/><br/>Visit timing: Not mentioned.<br/><br/>Typical Customers<br/>Demographics: Locals and tourists.<br/><br/>Group types: Couples, friends, families.<br/><br/>Common occasions: Brunch, casual meals.<br/><br/>Vibe & Setting<br/>Atmosphere: Casual and cozy.<br/><br/>Noise level: Moderate.<br/><br/>Decor & setting: Indoor seating; a comfortable atmosphere ideal for conversations.<br/><br/>Service style: Attentive and friendly. <br/><br/>Recommended Dishes<br/>Overall dish consensus<br/>Reviewers frequently praise the Smoked Salmon Croissant Sandwich and Swedish Pancakes for their quality and flavor. They are highlighted as must-try items.<br/><br/>How “top dishes” are determined<br/>Top dishes are based on mentions in reviews, including items labeled as popular, frequently seen in photos, and repeatedly praised by customers.<br/><br/>| Rank | Dish                          | Why it stands out                              | How often it’s mentioned                     | Ideal for                  |<br/>|------|-------------------------------|------------------------------------------------|---------------------------------------------|-----------------------------|<br/>| 1    | Smoked Salmon Croissant Sandwich | Noted for its freshness and flavor, described as a standout item. | Mentioned in many reviews | Hearty main               |<br/>| 2    | Swedish Pancakes              | Praised for being delicious and authentic, often highlighted as a favorite. | Repeatedly called out as a favorite | Lighter option            |<br/><br/>Good alternates / backup choices<br/>- Cappuccino: Mentioned for its top quality.<br/>- Oatmeal: Received positive remarks on being comforting.<br/><br/>Highlights (non‑dish positives from reviews)<br/>Friendly service: Reviewers consistently note the warm and welcoming attitude of the staff.<br/><br/>Relaxing atmosphere: Many comments describe the cafe as a great place for conversation, with pleasant music in the background.<br/><br/>Common Issues (from reviews)<br/>Occasional quality concerns: A customer expressed disappointment regarding stale pastries, though this was not a widespread issue.<br/><br/>Practical Notes<br/>Reservation / wait: Walk-in friendly.<br/><br/>Accessibility: Not mentioned.<br/><br/>Parking / transit: Not mentioned.<br/><br/>Best use case: Great for casual brunch with friends.<br/><br/>More info: https://www.google.com/maps/place/Johan's+Joe+Swedish+Restaurant/@26.7104598,-80.0591579,1166m/data=!3m1!1e3!4m14!1m7!3m6!1s0x88d8d7fb48bbaeb1:0x5f4b07a1cd861d58!2sFern!8m2!3d26.7105457!4d-80.0557448!16s%2Fg%2F11fkt5t8mj!3m5!1s0x88d8d661de89b7d5:0x651d8d477b47bb60!8m2!3d26.7101526!4d-80.0537299!16s%2Fg%2F11ggk0sgqq?entry=ttu&g_ep=EgoyMDI2MDYxMC4wIKXMDSoASAFQAw%3D%3D]]></description>
