  <Placemark>
    <name>John A Lafevre House and School Gardiner NY</name>
    <description><![CDATA[John A. Lafevre House and School<br/><br/>📍 Forest Glen hamlet, Gardiner, NY<br/><br/>A house-and-schoolhouse pairing on the same Forest Glen family estate as the neighboring Abraham and Maria LeFevre House, tied to the LeFevre family's long presence in this corner of Gardiner.<br/><br/>Tips<br/>- Private property — visit alongside the Abraham and Maria LeFevre House a short distance away.<br/><br/>More info: https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=41.6958%2C%20-74.1217]]></description>
