    <name>John Innes Kane Cottage Bar Harbor ME</name>
    <description><![CDATA[John Innes Kane Cottage<br/><br/>📍 Bar Harbor, ME<br/><br/>A Gilded Age "cottage" built for the Kane family, one of Bar Harbor's prominent turn-of-the-century summer residents, listed on the National Register of Historic Places.<br/><br/>Tips<br/>- Private property — a drive/walk-past landmark, not a stop with public access.<br/><br/>More info: https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=44.3858%2C%20-68.1981]]></description>
