  <Placemark>
    <name>John R. Kirk Planetarium New Paltz NY</name>
    <description><![CDATA[John R. Kirk Planetarium<br/><br/>📍 SUNY New Paltz campus, New Paltz, NY<br/><br/>A public planetarium on the SUNY New Paltz campus, offering star shows and astronomy programs open to visitors alongside its role in the university's science curriculum.<br/><br/>Tips<br/>- Check the SUNY New Paltz events calendar for public show times — not open daily.<br/>- Easy pairing with the Samuel Dorsky Museum of Art on the same campus.<br/><br/>More info: https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=41.7385%2C%20-74.0882]]></description>
