  <Placemark>
    <name>Jordan Homestead Ellsworth ME</name>
    <description><![CDATA[Jordan Homestead<br/><br/>📍 169 Bayside Road, Ellsworth, ME<br/><br/>31 acres with 3,000 ft of Union River frontage plus Whittaker Brook, a historic family cemetery, and heritage garden. The 1-mi lollipop trail (built 2019) has bog bridging, stone stairs, and wooden bridges.]]></description>
