  <Placemark>
    <name>Josephs Hall Block Portland ME</name>
    <description><![CDATA[Joseph's (Joseph Hall Block)<br/><br/>📍 410 Fore Street, Portland, ME<br/><br/>Originally known as the Joseph Hall Block, 410 Fore Street was built in 1833 and still features the original sea wall. Over the years it has housed a wine importer, vegetable packing company, paper company, and confectioner.<br/><br/>Joseph Redman takes pride in the stunning restoration that proudly honors Portland's nautical history. Today the building houses upscale clothing retailer Joseph's.<br/><br/>More info: https://www.google.com/maps/place/410+Fore+St,+Portland,+ME]]></description>
