  <Placemark>
    <name>Just Barb's</name>
    <description><![CDATA[Just Barb's is a seafood restaurant offering casual dining. It has a price range of $10–20 per person and is open for lunch but closed on Mondays and Tuesdays. It does not explicitly state if it serves alcohol.<br/><br/>More info: https://www.google.com/maps/place/Just+Barb's/@44.4731832,-68.9256635,9359m/data=!3m1!1e3!4m10!1m3!2m2!1sscenic+spot!6e1!3m5!1s0x4cae67cb84eb9ff9:0xa049e5615a3d5e5a!8m2!3d44.4861926!4d-68.8639129!16s%2Fg%2F1tf6521f?entry=ttu&g_ep=EgoyMDI2MDcxMy4wIKXMDSoASAFQAw%3D%3D]]></description>
