    <name>Ka Chai Thai Street Food</name>
    <description><![CDATA[Ka Chai Thai Street Food offers Thai cuisine with prices ranging from $20 to $30 per person. It is closed on Mondays and opens for lunch at 11:30 AM and for dinner on weekends, but not during the week. Alcohol service is not specified.<br/><br/>More info: https://www.google.com/maps/place/Ka+Chai+Thai+Street+Food/@44.08514,-69.200832,18853m/data=!3m2!1e3!5s0x4cadce2592cee3cd:0xe4f6e8c1c23f2d8!4m13!1m5!2m4!1sRestaurants!5m1!4e9!6e5!3m6!1s0x4cadcfd0ae6caadb:0x4e06ead89f808e30!8m2!3d44.0773023!4d-69.1951177!15sCgtSZXN0YXVyYW50c1oNIgtyZXN0YXVyYW50c5IBD3RoYWlfcmVzdGF1cmFudJoBJENoZERTVWhOTUc5blMwVkpRMEZuU1VOb2NVbEhkM05SUlJBQuABAPoBBAgwED8!16s%2Fg%2F11s8k707v_?entry=ttu&g_ep=EgoyMDI2MDcxMy4wIKXMDSoASAFQAw%3D%3D]]></description>
