  <Placemark>
    <name>Kelder Farm &amp; U-Pick Kerhonkson, NY</name>
    <description><![CDATA[Kelder Farm & U-Pick<br/><br/>📍 Kerhonkson, NY<br/><br/>Watch draft horses pull wagons and plows in the traditional style, get lost in the seasonal corn maze, and pick your own fruit and vegetables.<br/><br/>Tips<br/>- Best visited in fall for the corn maze and draft-horse demonstrations<br/>- Rt 209, Kerhonkson<br/><br/>More info: https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=41.7810%2C%20-74.2810]]></description>
