  <Placemark>
    <name>Kennebec River Rail Trail Augusta ME</name>
    <description><![CDATA[Kennebec River Rail Trail<br/><br/>📍 Augusta waterfront → Hallowell → Gardiner, ME<br/><br/>A paved rail trail connecting Augusta's waterfront through Hallowell to Gardiner. Perfect for a walk or bike ride between towns, offering Kennebec River views and a flat, easy route.<br/><br/>Tips<br/>- Paved surface suitable for walking or biking<br/>- Connects Augusta, Hallowell, and Gardiner<br/>- Flat, easy trail<br/>- Excellent for a casual waterfront walk<br/>- Good alternative to or complement to downtown shopping<br/>- Access points in Augusta, Hallowell, Gardiner]]></description>
