    <name>Kerhonkson Lookout NY</name>
    <description><![CDATA[Kerhonkson Lookout<br/><br/>📍 Kerhonkson, NY<br/><br/>A tourist attraction known for stunning views and a scenic vibe. Open during the day; does not serve food or alcohol.<br/><br/>Tips<br/>- Good for stargazing and a chance to see the Northern Lights on clear nights.]]></description>
