    <description><![CDATA[Kettleborough Schoolhouse<br/><br/>📍 Gardiner, NY<br/><br/>A red clapboard schoolhouse from 1832, preserved along a stretch of Rt 208 known for some of the byway's best mountain views.<br/><br/>Tips<br/>- Rt 208, north of Phillies Bridge Road<br/><br/>More info: https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=41.7060%2C%20-74.1460]]></description>
