    <description><![CDATA[King Eider's Pub<br/><br/>📍 Damariscotta ME<br/><br/>Casual American pub well known for fresh local oysters and a lively bar scene.<br/><br/>Must Order<br/>- Fresh local oysters<br/><br/>Tips<br/>- Lively bar atmosphere — good for an evening drink and apps.]]></description>
