    <name>King Ro Market Round Pond ME</name>
    <description><![CDATA[Time: 2026-08-07T13:00:00<br/><br/>King Ro Market<br/><br/>📍 1414 Route 32, Round Pond, ME<br/><br/>An old-fashioned general store at the center of Round Pond village, selling groceries, beer, wine, pizza, deli sandwiches, and gas. Fresh donuts and pastries each morning, and live concerts on Monday evenings in season.<br/><br/>Tips<br/>- Rating in question: listed at 4.8, but Tripadvisor shows 4.2 — a real gap, though Google reviews for a beloved local general store like this one plausibly run higher.<br/>- Good stop for picnic supplies before a Round Pond harbor walk or a Pemaquid Point day.]]></description>
