    <name>Kingston Point Beach &amp; Rail Trail Kingston, NY</name>
    <description><![CDATA[Kingston Point Beach & Rail Trail<br/><br/>📍 Kingston, NY<br/><br/>A Hudson River waterfront park with beach access and a rail trail connecting to the Rondout Creek area — one of the most accessible points of direct river contact in Kingston.<br/><br/>Tips<br/>- Small sandy beach suitable for wading or picnicking<br/>- The rail trail is paved and good for a gentle walk or bike ride<br/>- Stunning views across the river toward the Catskill Mountains<br/><br/>More info: https://www.google.com/maps/search/Kingston+Point+Beach+&+Rail+Trail+Kingston,+NY]]></description>
