    <description><![CDATA[Kitty's Market<br/><br/>📍 Hudson, NY<br/><br/>A neighborhood market and cafe beloved for egg sandwiches, locally sourced groceries, and excellent coffee — one of Hudson's most-loved morning stops.<br/><br/>Tips<br/>- Arrive early — egg sandwiches sell out<br/>- The espresso drinks are serious; one of Hudson's best coffee programs<br/><br/>More info: https://www.google.com/maps/search/Kitty's+Market+Hudson,+NY]]></description>
