    <name>Kream N' Kone - Chatham MA</name>
    <description><![CDATA[Overview<br/>Type: Seafood restaurant  <br/>Best known for: Great seafood selection, delicious ice cream  <br/>Location context: Chatham  <br/>Price level: $10–20 per person  <br/>Visit timing: Not mentioned  <br/><br/>Typical Customers<br/>Demographics: Locals  <br/>Group types: Families, couples  <br/>Common occasions: Casual dinner  <br/><br/>Vibe & Setting<br/>Atmosphere: Casual  <br/>Noise level: Moderate  <br/>Decor & setting: Indoor seating; Not mentioned  <br/>Service style: Attentive and friendly  <br/><br/>Recommended Dishes<br/>Overall dish consensus  <br/>Reviewers have highlighted the Fried Whole Belly Clams and Fried Shrimp as must-try items, both praised for their quality and taste.  <br/><br/>How “top dishes” are determined  <br/>Top dishes are compiled based on mentions in reviews, popularity in photos, and recurring praise.  <br/><br/>| Rank | Dish                     | Why it stands out                                       | How often it’s mentioned         | Ideal for                 |<br/>|------|--------------------------|----------------------------------------------------------|----------------------------------|----------------------------|<br/>| 1    | Fried Whole Belly Clams  | Known for great flavor and texture.                      | Mentioned in many reviews        | Sharing at the table      |<br/>| 2    | Fried Shrimp             | Frequently mentioned for its taste and freshness.        | Repeatedly called out as a favorite | Hearty main              |<br/>| 3    | Fried Scallops           | Praised for being very good.                             | Mentioned in several reviews     | Lighter option            |<br/><br/>Good alternates / backup choices  <br/>- Lobster roll: Noted for a satisfying flavor.  <br/>- Onion rings: Mentioned but noted for being greasy.  <br/><br/>Highlights (non‑dish positives from reviews)<br/>Service: Staff are described as super friendly and attentive.  <br/>Quality: Fresh food with great portion sizes based on multiple reviews.  <br/><br/>Common Issues (from reviews)<br/>Grease issues: Some reviewers noted that the onion rings tended to be greasy.  <br/><br/>Practical Notes<br/>Reservation / wait: Walk-in friendly  <br/>Accessibility: Not mentioned  <br/>Parking / transit: Not mentioned  <br/>Best use case: Best for casual family dinners<br/><br/>More info: https://www.google.com/maps/place/Kream+N'+Kone+-+Chatham/@41.6776876,-70.0022647,1603m/data=!3m1!1e3!4m6!3m5!1s0x89fb14e43d7231b3:0x63f484d18749806a!8m2!3d41.6823019!4d-69.9949369!16s%2Fg%2F1tdng91h?entry=ttu&g_ep=EgoyMDI2MDYxMC4wIKXMDSoASAFQAw%3D%3D]]></description>
