    <description><![CDATA[LOLA Kingston<br/><br/>📍 Kingston, NY<br/><br/>A lively Kingston restaurant serving wood-fired pizzas, handmade pastas, and natural wines in a convivial neighborhood setting.<br/><br/>Must Order<br/>- Wood-fired pizza — char-blistered, well-sourced toppings<br/>- House pastas — change seasonally<br/>- Natural wine list — fun and accessible<br/><br/>Tips<br/>- Reservations recommended<br/>- Good for groups; the room is lively and communal<br/><br/>More info: https://www.google.com/maps/search/LOLA+Kingston+Kingston,+NY]]></description>
