    <description><![CDATA[Laan-Xang Cafe is a Laotian restaurant offering dishes priced around $20–30. It serves lunch and dinner, opening at 11:30 AM and closing at varying times. The restaurant does serve alcohol.<br/><br/>More info: https://www.google.com/maps/place/Laan-Xang+Cafe/@44.4221712,-69.0166066,2023m/data=!3m1!1e3!4m13!1m5!2m4!1sRestaurants!5m1!4e9!6e5!3m6!1s0x4cae6e5a2d795eed:0x42c82810cb10ee!8m2!3d44.4280642!4d-69.005169!15sCgtSZXN0YXVyYW50c1oNIgtyZXN0YXVyYW50c5IBEmxhb3RpYW5fcmVzdGF1cmFudJoBRENpOURRVWxSUVVOdlpFTm9kSGxqUmpsdlQyczVabFpYV25oa2JrSnNZbFpLUkdRd1ZuRlViSEJTVkROdk1tUlZSUkFC4AEA-gEECEgQSA!16s%2Fg%2F1v44p_yb?entry=ttu&g_ep=EgoyMDI2MDcxMy4wIKXMDSoASAFQAw%3D%3D]]></description>
