    <name>Lake Chocorua (Chocorua Lake Basin) Tamworth NH</name>
    <description><![CDATA[Lake Chocorua (Chocorua Lake Basin)<br/><br/>📍 Tamworth NH<br/><br/>Iconic motor-free lake with the classic photo view of Mount Chocorua from the Narrows Bridge; public access via Chocorua Lake Conservancy, free admission.<br/><br/>Tips<br/>- Free public access.<br/>- Best photo spot is the Narrows Bridge.<br/>- No motorboats — quiet and scenic.]]></description>
