  <Placemark>
    <name>Lake Francis State Park Pittsburg NH</name>
    <description><![CDATA[Lake Francis State Park<br/><br/>📍 Pittsburg, NH<br/><br/>A 45-site campground (9 with water/electric hookups, 9 set up for ATV camping) on Lake Francis, a 2,000-acre lake near the Connecticut Lakes. Coin-op showers, laundry, and a dishwashing station; a boat launch for canoeing, kayaking, and fishing; OHV trails connect directly into Coös County's 1,000-mile network. Open May 15 through October 24.<br/><br/>Tips<br/>- Reservations open 11 months ahead at 8am (9am weekends) — book early for peak summer weekends.<br/>- Good base if combining a Pittsburg fishing/paddling trip with OHV riding.<br/><br/>More info: https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=45.0597%2C%20-71.3028]]></description>
