  <Placemark>
    <name>Lake Maratanza Ellenville NY</name>
    <description><![CDATA[Lake Maratanza<br/><br/>📍 Sam's Point Preserve, Ellenville, NY<br/><br/>The highest lake on the Shawangunk Ridge at 2,245 feet, within Sam's Point Preserve. Man-made, originally dammed for an old mountaintop hotel and later rebuilt as a backup water supply for the Village of Ellenville — it still serves that role today.<br/><br/>Tips<br/>- Reached via trail from the Sam's Point Preserve parking area; pairs naturally with the Ice Caves Trail loop.<br/><br/>More info: https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=41.6803%2C%20-74.3521]]></description>
