    <name>Lake St. George State Park Liberty ME</name>
    <description><![CDATA[Lake St. George State Park<br/><br/>📍 Liberty, ME (~16 mi / 30 min west of Belfast)<br/><br/>Spring-fed lake, exceptionally clear water, lifeguard-supervised swimming area (mid-June to mid-August). Also canoeing, fishing, picnicking. Rated 4.6 on Google, 4.7 on Yelp.<br/><br/>Tips<br/>- This is an inferred match, not a confirmed name. A Reddit comment described "a great state park with swimming about 20 minutes west of Belfast... crystal clear... bring a mask and snorkel, swim with some nice Bass" without naming it. This is the closest match found (distance, clarity of water, swimming area) — worth a quick verify closer to the trip rather than treating as certain.<br/>- Small marked swimming area per reviews, not a big beach.]]></description>
