    <name>Lake Taghkanic State Park Hudson, NY</name>
    <description><![CDATA[Lake Taghkanic State Park<br/><br/>📍 1528 Route 82, Hudson, NY<br/><br/>A popular Columbia County state park built around a glacial lake, with two swimming beaches, canoe and kayak rentals, and campgrounds — a natural stop on the northern Taconic Byway drive near Hudson, NY.<br/><br/>Tips<br/>- Swimming beaches get busy on summer weekends; arrive early for parking.<br/>- Campground and cabins available if extending the byway drive into an overnight stop.<br/><br/>More info: https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=42.095724,-73.715631]]></description>
