    <description><![CDATA[Lake Waukewan<br/><br/>📍 Meredith, NH<br/><br/>A smaller lake just west of downtown Meredith that serves as the town's drinking-water supply — quieter than Winnipesaukee, with a public beach on its eastern shore.<br/><br/>Tips<br/>- A good option if Meredith's Winnipesaukee-side beaches feel crowded.<br/><br/>More info: https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=43.6596%2C%20-71.5237]]></description>
