    <description><![CDATA[Lake Winnipesaukee Historical Society Museum<br/><br/>📍 Laconia, NH<br/><br/>A small museum preserving the maritime, industrial, and community history of the Lake Winnipesaukee area — a good complement to a Weirs Beach visit or M/S Mount Washington cruise.<br/><br/>Tips<br/>- Check current hours before visiting — small local historical society museums often keep limited seasonal schedules.<br/><br/>More info: https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=43.6122%2C%20-71.4759]]></description>
