    <name>Land Ho! Orleans MA</name>
    <description><![CDATA[Overview<br/>Type: Restaurant<br/><br/>Best known for: Reasonably priced food and friendly service.<br/><br/>Location context: Orleans, Cape Cod.<br/><br/>Price level: $20–30 per person<br/><br/>Visit timing: Casual dining, popular during peak hours.<br/><br/>Typical Customers<br/>Demographics: Locals and tourists.<br/><br/>Group types: Families, couples, groups, and solo diners.<br/><br/>Common occasions: Casual dinners and quick bites.<br/><br/>Vibe & Setting<br/>Atmosphere: Casual with a cozy bar area.<br/><br/>Noise level: Moderate.<br/><br/>Decor & setting: Indoor seating with a large bar; cozy environment.<br/><br/>Service style: Friendly, albeit brisk during busy times.<br/><br/>Recommended Dishes<br/>Overall dish consensus  <br/>Clam Strips and Beer are recommended for their flavor and quality, while the Clam Pie also receives positive mentions for its uniqueness.  <br/><br/>How “top dishes” are determined  <br/>Top dishes are based on items that are frequently highlighted in reviews, particularly those that receive strong praise and appear in photos on the Google Maps page. <br/><br/>| Rank | Dish           | Why it stands out                                | How often it’s mentioned             | Ideal for               |<br/>|------|----------------|--------------------------------------------------|-------------------------------------|-------------------------|<br/>| 1    | Clam Strips    | Praised for being fried perfectly and flavorful.  | Mentioned in many reviews           | Sharing at the table    |<br/>| 2    | Clam Pie       | Unique entry with positive feedback on taste.    | Repeatedly called out as a favorite | Lighter option          |<br/>| 3    | Fish and Chips | Known for crispy batter and hearty portion sizes. | Appears in numerous photos          | Hearty main             |<br/><br/>Good alternates / backup choices  <br/>- Biscuits and gravy: Comforting and generous portions.<br/>- Oyster: Notable for freshness and flavor.<br/><br/>Highlights (non‑dish positives from reviews)<br/>Friendly service: The staff is frequently described as friendly and attentive.  <br/><br/>Fun decor: The restaurant features a quirky, interesting decor that enhances the dining experience.  <br/><br/>Common Issues (from reviews)<br/>Busy times: Service can become brisk during peak hours, which may affect the overall experience.<br/><br/>Practical Notes<br/>Reservation / wait: Walk-in friendly, reservations not mentioned.<br/><br/>Accessibility: Not mentioned.<br/><br/>Parking / transit: Not mentioned.<br/><br/>Best use case: Great for casual dinners with friends.<br/><br/>More info: https://www.google.com/maps/place/Land+Ho!/@41.7416715,-70.0315548,15344m/data=!3m1!1e3!4m19!1m7!3m6!1s0x89fb6b2c2c9eb68d:0x43679028a22560c6!2stwenty-eight+Atlantic!8m2!3d41.7228283!4d-69.9953197!16s%2Fg%2F1tjfc93k!3m10!1s0x89fb697ca892a1df:0x50f555e5821d5fef!5m4!1s2026-09-21!2i4!4m1!1i2!8m2!3d41.7881743!4d-69.9912418!16s%2Fg%2F1tdxlxs7?entry=ttu&g_ep=EgoyMDI2MDYxMC4wIKXMDSoASAFQAw%3D%3D]]></description>
