    <description><![CDATA[Lawson's Finest Liquids<br/><br/>📍 Waitsfield VT<br/><br/>Destination craft brewery producing world-class IPAs and maple-inflected beers; taproom with pub food and outdoor seating. One of Vermont's most revered breweries.<br/><br/>Tips<br/>- Sippin' Sunshine IPA is the flagship — don't skip it.<br/>- Outdoor seating is beautiful in early September.]]></description>
