    <name>Le Petit Bistro Rhinebeck, NY</name>
    <description><![CDATA[Le Petit Bistro<br/><br/>📍 Rhinebeck, NY<br/><br/>A cozy, romantic French bistro serving classic duck confit, steak frites, and excellent daily seafood specials in an intimate Rhinebeck village setting.<br/><br/>Must Order<br/>- Duck confit — the signature — rendered perfectly<br/>- Steak frites — textbook bistro execution<br/>- Moules marinières — when in season<br/><br/>Tips<br/>- Reserve for dinner — small room fills fast<br/>- BYO wine policy; bring a good bottle<br/><br/>More info: https://www.google.com/maps/search/Le+Petit+Bistro+Rhinebeck,+NY]]></description>
