  <Placemark>
    <name>Ledgeview Grille Conway NH</name>
    <description><![CDATA[Overview<br/>Type: Restaurant<br/><br/>Best known for: Fresh ingredients, great service<br/><br/>Location context: North Conway Village, part of a golf course<br/><br/>Price level: $10–20<br/><br/>Visit timing: Not mentioned<br/><br/>Typical Customers<br/>Demographics: Locals and tourists<br/><br/>Group types: Couples, families, friends<br/><br/>Common occasions: Brunch, casual dinner<br/><br/>Vibe & Setting<br/>Atmosphere: Cozy and casual, lively<br/><br/>Noise level: Moderate<br/><br/>Decor & setting: Indoor/outdoor seating, balcony with a mountain view<br/><br/>Service style: Attentive and friendly<br/><br/>Recommended Dishes<br/>Overall dish consensus<br/>Reviewers frequently praise the Lobster Roll and sausage, egg, and cheese sandwich for their fresh flavors and quality ingredients. <br/><br/>How “top dishes” are determined<br/>Top dishes are based solely on the Google Maps page and reviews, focusing on popularity, photo appearances, and strong praise from customers. <br/><br/>Top dishes to order<br/><br/>| Rank | Dish                       | Why it stands out                                | How often it’s mentioned                           | Ideal for              |<br/>|------|---------------------------|--------------------------------------------------|---------------------------------------------------|-----------------------|<br/>| 1    | Lobster Roll              | Fresh with great flavor, a must-try.            | Mentioned in many reviews.                          | Sharing at the table  |<br/>| 2    | Sausage, egg, and cheese sandwich | Described as the best in a while, very fresh. | Repeatedly called out as a favorite.               | Hearty main          |<br/><br/>Good alternates / backup choices<br/><br/>- Bloody Mary: A popular drink choice.<br/><br/>Highlights (non‑dish positives from reviews)<br/>Atmosphere: Many reviewers highlight the stunning venue and mountain views.<br/><br/>Service: Consistently mentioned as exceptional and friendly.<br/><br/>Common Issues (from reviews)<br/>Not mentioned.<br/><br/>Practical Notes<br/>Reservation / wait: Walk-in friendly.<br/><br/>Accessibility: Not mentioned.<br/><br/>Parking / transit: Not mentioned.<br/><br/>Best use case: Great for brunch with friends.<br/><br/>More info: https://www.google.com/maps/place/Ledgeview+Grille/@44.0502159,-71.1287968,1006m/data=!3m1!1e3!4m6!3m5!1s0x4cb3a18efcaaaa3d:0x9e70a205df3d50ef!8m2!3d44.0506178!4d-71.1281204!16s%2Fg%2F11qbss51n3?entry=ttu&g_ep=EgoyMDI2MDYxMy4wIKXMDSoASAFQAw%3D%3D]]></description>
