  <Placemark>
    <name>Levon Helm Studios Woodstock, NY</name>
    <description><![CDATA[Levon Helm Studios<br/><br/>📍 Woodstock, NY<br/><br/>The legendary barn music venue started by The Band's Levon Helm, hosting ~70 intimate Ramble concerts per year in an unparalleled acoustic setting steeped in music history.<br/><br/>Tips<br/>- Check the Sept 21–25 calendar immediately at levonhelm. — sells out months ahead<br/>- Tickets typically $30–50; BYOB; exceptional sound<br/>- 5 minutes from Woodstock village center<br/><br/>More info: https://www.google.com/maps/search/Levon+Helm+Studios+Woodstock,+NY]]></description>
