  <Placemark>
    <name>Liberal Cup Brewpub Hallowell ME</name>
    <description><![CDATA[Liberal Cup Brewpub<br/><br/>📍 115 Water Street, Hallowell, ME<br/><br/>A brewpub in Hallowell's historic Water Street district, combining local craft beer and casual dining. Part of the local character that makes Hallowell distinct from touristy alternatives.<br/><br/>Tips<br/>- Located on Water Street antique district<br/>- Craft beer selection<br/>- Casual brewpub atmosphere<br/>- Good for afternoon or evening visit<br/>- Historic building setting]]></description>
