  <Placemark>
    <name>Library Park South Bristol ME</name>
    <description><![CDATA[Library Park<br/><br/>📍 Behind Rutherford Library, 2000 State Route 129, South Bristol, ME (coordinate approximate — library address geocode)<br/><br/>16-acre shorefront woodland with views of Johns Bay and Witch Island — a steep Shore Loop or an easier Inner Loop. Connects directly to Tracy Shore Preserve via a 2004 trail link. ~0.5 mi loop.<br/><br/>Tips<br/>- Combine with Tracy Shore Preserve via the connecting trail — one parking stop, two preserves<br/><br/>More info: https://www.coastalrivers.org/trails/library-park/]]></description>
