  <Placemark>
    <name>Lil Deb's Oasis Hudson, NY</name>
    <description><![CDATA[Lil Deb's Oasis<br/><br/>📍 Hudson, NY<br/><br/>A joyful, tropical-inflected restaurant celebrating Caribbean and Latin flavors with a serious natural wine list — one of the most talked-about restaurants in the Hudson Valley.<br/><br/>Must Order<br/>- Whole fried fish — with citrus sauce, the signature<br/>- Seasonal cocktails — creative and well-made<br/><br/>Tips<br/>- Dinner only, closed Mon–Tue; check website<br/>- The natural wine list is exceptional<br/>- A destination dining experience worth planning the evening around<br/><br/>More info: https://www.google.com/maps/search/Lil+Deb's+Oasis+Hudson,+NY]]></description>
