  <Placemark>
    <name>Limon Grille Bar Harbor ME</name>
    <description><![CDATA[Limon Grille<br/><br/>📍 Bar Harbor, ME — a short walk from the Base Camp 4 lodging (across the street, per Tom)<br/><br/>Casual Mediterranean and American restaurant, open for lunch and dinner, serving alcohol. Cozy, relaxed atmosphere. $10–20/person.<br/><br/>Must Order<br/>- Greek salad — frequently praised<br/>- Chicken kabobs — frequently praised<br/><br/>Tips<br/>- Right across the street from where Tom is staying in Bar Harbor — a strong backup option for a night without a dinner reservation<br/>- Takeout available<br/>- Some reviewers recommend avoiding the beef dishes (reported dry/salty)<br/>- No reservation currently held here — this is a walk-in/takeout candidate, not a booked night<br/><br/>More info: https://www.google.com/maps/place/Limon+Grille/@44.3884952,-68.2068281,271a,35y,125.7h,44.9t/data=!3m1!1e3!4m15!1m8!3m7!1s0x4caebe4815802593:0x88e91a6528cad91b!2sBar+Harbor,+ME!3b1!8m2!3d44.3875617!4d-68.2042989!16zL20vMDJnMDZr!3m5!1s0x4caebfe4e7eaa5bd:0x68968915d18a7f84!8m2!3d44.3857857!4d-68.2036616!16s%2Fg%2F11ydn884s5?entry=ttu&g_ep=EgoyMDI2MDYxMC4wIKXMDSoASAFQAw%3D%3D]]></description>
