    <name>Lincoln Covered Bridge Woodstock VT</name>
    <description><![CDATA[Lincoln Covered Bridge<br/><br/>📍 Near Woodstock, VT<br/><br/>A historic covered bridge over the Ottauquechee River near Woodstock — one of several covered bridges strung along this stretch of the byway.<br/><br/>Tips<br/>- Combine with a broader Woodstock covered-bridge tour, alongside the Taftsville and Middle Bridge crossings.<br/><br/>More info: https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=43.6007%2C%20-72.5689]]></description>
