  <Placemark>
    <name>Lincoln Theater Damariscotta ME</name>
    <description><![CDATA[Lincoln Theater<br/><br/>📍 2 Theater Street, Damariscotta, ME<br/><br/>A historic community theater dating to 1875, in the heart of downtown Damariscotta. Today it screens independent and mainstream films and hosts live music and community performances.<br/><br/>Tips<br/>- Coordinates are approximate (downtown Damariscotta, near Chapman-Hall House) — the exact address didn't resolve via geocoding; verify on arrival.<br/>- Check the site for current film/event schedule before planning a visit.<br/><br/>More info: https://www.lctheater.org/]]></description>
