    <name>Lincolnville Beach Lincolnville ME</name>
    <description><![CDATA[Lincolnville Beach<br/><br/>📍 Lincolnville ME<br/><br/>Small, scenic pebble beach next to the Islesboro ferry terminal — good for a quick coastal stop.<br/><br/>Tips<br/>- Good quick stop while waiting for the ferry.]]></description>
