    <name>Linden Terrace Rutland VT</name>
    <description><![CDATA[Linden Terrace<br/><br/>📍 191 Grove Street, Rutland, VT<br/><br/>Built in 1912 as a summer estate for a prominent local businessman. Listed on the National Register of Historic Places in 2007.<br/><br/>Tips<br/>- Private property — a drive-past landmark rather than a stop with public access.<br/><br/>More info: https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=43.6186%2C%20-72.9850]]></description>
