  <Placemark>
    <name>Little Cinco De Mayo Saugerties NY</name>
    <description><![CDATA[Overview<br/>Type: Restaurant<br/><br/>Best known for: Delicious homemade corn tortillas; generous portions of flavorful tacos and enchiladas.<br/><br/>Location context: Not mentioned<br/><br/>Price level: $10–30 per person<br/><br/>Visit timing: Not mentioned<br/><br/>Typical Customers<br/>Demographics: Not mentioned<br/><br/>Group types: Families, couples, friends<br/><br/>Common occasions: Casual dinner, quick bite<br/><br/>Vibe & Setting<br/>Atmosphere: Casual, cozy<br/><br/>Noise level: Moderate<br/><br/>Decor & setting: Indoor seating; cozy ambiance<br/><br/>Service style: Friendly, attentive<br/><br/>Recommended Dishes<br/>Overall dish consensus  <br/>Reviewers agree that the homemade corn tortillas and generously portioned tacos are must-tries, especially the lengua and shrimp tacos.<br/><br/>How “top dishes” are determined  <br/>Top dishes are chosen based on mentions in reviews for their exceptional flavor, dishes labeled as popular, and those that appear frequently in photos.<br/><br/>| Rank | Dish               | Why it stands out                          | How often it’s mentioned                       | Ideal for              |<br/>|------|--------------------|------------------------------------------|------------------------------------------------|-----------------------|<br/>| 1    | Lengua Tacos       | Tender and flavorful, praised as a favorite. | Repeatedly called out as a favorite.           | Sharing at the table  |<br/>| 2    | Shrimp Tacos       | Generously portioned, noted for great taste. | Appears in numerous photos.                    | Hearty main          |<br/>| 3    | Cheese Enchiladas  | Loved for comforting flavors and texture.  | Mentioned in many reviews.                      | Casual dinner        |<br/><br/>Good alternates / backup choices  <br/>- Al Pastor: Known for its rich flavors.<br/>- Guacamole: Fresh and tasty, great for sharing.<br/><br/>Highlights (non-dish positives from reviews)<br/>Friendly staff: Guests appreciate the attentive and welcoming service from the staff.  <br/><br/>Homemade salsa: The homemade salsa is frequently praised for having the perfect amount of heat and freshness.<br/><br/>Common Issues (from reviews)<br/>Limited alcohol options: Currently does not serve alcohol, which may disappoint some diners.<br/><br/>Practical Notes<br/>Reservation / wait: Walk-in friendly.<br/><br/>Accessibility: Not mentioned.<br/><br/>Parking / transit: Not mentioned.<br/><br/>Best use case: Great for casual dinners with family or friends.<br/><br/>More info: https://www.google.com/maps/place/Little+Cinco+De+Mayo/@42.075803,-73.9553294,615m/data=!3m1!1e3!4m11!1m4!2m3!1sThai+Spice+Cafe+%E2%80%93+Well-liked+Thai+on+Raymond+Avenue!5m1!4e3!3m5!1s0x89dda70071eb4285:0xe84ab4a2caf1180!8m2!3d42.0775472!4d-73.9543631!16s%2Fg%2F11lz2dtprn?entry=ttu&g_ep=EgoyMDI2MDYxMy4wIKXMDSoASAFQAw%3D%3D]]></description>
