  <Placemark>
    <name>Little Squam Lake Holderness NH</name>
    <description><![CDATA[Little Squam Lake<br/><br/>📍 Holderness, NH<br/><br/>Connected to the larger Squam Lake by a short channel under Route 3, Little Squam is quieter and less developed — a peaceful counterpoint to Squam Lake's summer-colony bustle, part of the same watershed made famous by On Golden Pond.<br/><br/>Tips<br/>- Good put-in spot for a quiet paddle if Squam Lake itself feels busy.<br/><br/>More info: https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=43.7204%2C%20-71.6008]]></description>
