  <Placemark>
    <name>Little Tunk Pond Sullivan ME</name>
    <description><![CDATA[Little Tunk Pond<br/><br/>📍 Route 183 (Tunk Lake Road), Sullivan, ME (~4.7 mi north of Route 1)<br/><br/>55 acres of woodlands and abandoned fields with a ~400 ft sand beach on Little Tunk Pond — swimming, and views to Black Mountain. Managed for woodcock habitat via alder thicket restoration. 0.4 mi one-way.<br/><br/>Tips<br/>- Sand beach and swimming — good warm-weather stop]]></description>
