  <Placemark>
    <name>Littleton Freehouse Taproom &amp; Eatery 1 Littleton NH</name>
    <description><![CDATA[Overview<br/>Type: Restaurant<br/><br/>Best known for: Excellent salmon and a great selection of beer.<br/><br/>Location context: Littleton, NH<br/><br/>Price level: $20–30 per person<br/><br/>Visit timing: Not mentioned<br/><br/>Typical Customers<br/>Demographics: Families and groups.<br/><br/>Group types: Couples, friends, families, larger groups.<br/><br/>Common occasions: Casual dinner, family outings.<br/><br/>Vibe & Setting<br/>Atmosphere: Casual and family-friendly.<br/><br/>Noise level: Moderate.<br/><br/>Decor & setting: Indoor seating with a bar area.<br/><br/>Service style: Attentive and friendly.<br/><br/>Recommended Dishes<br/>Overall dish consensus<br/>Reviewers highlight the macaroni and cheese, chicken sandwich, and ahi tuna tacos as must-order items due to their flavor and presentation.<br/><br/>How “top dishes” are determined<br/>Top dishes are selected based on their appearance in menu items, reviews mentioning their quality, and their presence in photographs shared by visitors.<br/><br/>| Rank | Dish                    | Why it stands out                                      | How often it’s mentioned      | Ideal for                |<br/>|------|-------------------------|------------------------------------------------------|------------------------------|--------------------------|<br/>| 1    | Macaroni and cheese     | Creamy texture and rich flavor, often praised.       | Mentioned in many reviews    | Sharing at the table     |<br/>| 2    | Ahi tuna tacos          | Fresh and full of flavor, called a favorite.         | Repeatedly called out as a favorite | Light meal option        |<br/>| 3    | Chicken sandwich        | Tender chicken with great seasoning.                  | Appears in numerous photos   | Hearty main              |<br/><br/>Good alternates / backup choices<br/>- Chicken wings: Known for being crispy and flavorful.<br/>- Hamburger: Generous portions and well-cooked.<br/><br/>Highlights (non‑dish positives from reviews)<br/>Great selection of beer: Many reviewers enjoy the variety and quality of beer available.<br/><br/>Friendly service: Staff consistently praised for being welcoming and attentive.<br/><br/>Common Issues (from reviews)<br/>Slower service during peak hours: Some reviews mention longer wait times when the restaurant is busy.<br/><br/>Practical Notes<br/>Reservation / wait: Walk-in friendly.<br/><br/>Accessibility: Not mentioned.<br/><br/>Parking / transit: Street parking available.<br/><br/>Best use case: Great for family dinners or casual outings with friends.<br/><br/>More info: https://www.google.com/maps/place/Littleton+Freehouse+Taproom+%26+Eatery/@44.3032808,-71.7697128,616m/data=!3m1!1e3!4m15!1m8!3m7!1s0x4cb469b6187f15c7:0xa9594392bb590b7f!2sLittleton,+NH+03561!3b1!8m2!3d44.3060969!4d-71.7703012!16zL20vMDFtOTV0!3m5!1s0x4cb46fbe7c871e43:0xcacc403553108b64!8m2!3d44.3051537!4d-71.7701103!16s%2Fg%2F11g22yf8qr?entry=ttu&g_ep=EgoyMDI2MDYxMy4wIKXMDSoASAFQAw%3D%3D]]></description>
