    <description><![CDATA[Overview<br/>Type: Restaurant<br/><br/>Best known for: Excellent salmon, great selection of beer<br/><br/>Location context: Littleton, New Hampshire<br/><br/>Price level: $20–30 per person<br/><br/>Visit timing: Not mentioned<br/><br/>Typical Customers<br/>Demographics: Mixed<br/><br/>Group types: Families, couples, friends<br/><br/>Common occasions: Casual dinner, family-friendly outings<br/><br/>Vibe & Setting<br/>Atmosphere: Casual, friendly<br/><br/>Noise level: Moderate<br/><br/>Decor & setting: Indoor and outdoor seating, bar area<br/><br/>Service style: Attentive and friendly<br/><br/>Recommended Dishes<br/>Overall dish consensus<br/>Popular dishes include the salmon, chicken wing, and bacon habanero burger, noted for their flavors and serving sizes. Reviewers specifically mentioned the enjoyment of food and drinks.<br/><br/>How “top dishes” are determined<br/>Top dishes are chosen based on those frequently highlighted in reviews and visible in photos, alongside being frequently praised. <br/><br/>| Rank | Dish                        | Why it stands out                       | How often it’s mentioned         | Ideal for                 |<br/>|------|-----------------------------|-----------------------------------------|----------------------------------|---------------------------|<br/>| 1    | Salmon                      | Excellent flavor and preparation        | Mentioned in several reviews     | Hearty main               |<br/>| 2    | Bacon Habanero Burger       | Unique flavor, well-loved by patrons   | Repeatedly called out as a favorite | Spice lovers              |<br/>| 3    | Chicken Wings               | Tasty and well-cooked                  | Appears in numerous photos      | Sharing at the table      |<br/><br/>Good alternates / backup choices<br/>- Ahi Tuna Tacos: Notably delicious and praised for its flavor.<br/>- Beet and Goat Cheese Salad: Mixed reviews; some found it mediocre.<br/><br/>Highlights (non‑dish positives from reviews)<br/>Service: Short wait time, attentive staff noted across reviews.<br/><br/>Atmosphere: Family-friendly ambiance has been frequently praised.<br/><br/>Common Issues (from reviews)<br/>Quality inconsistency: Some dishes, like the beet salad, received mixed feedback.<br/><br/>Practical Notes<br/>Reservation / wait: Not mentioned<br/><br/>Accessibility: Not mentioned<br/><br/>Parking / transit: Not mentioned<br/><br/>Best use case: Good for family dinners and casual gatherings.<br/><br/>More info: https://www.google.com/maps/place/Littleton+Freehouse+Taproom+%26+Eatery/@44.3051537,-71.7726852,793m/data=!3m2!1e3!4b1!4m6!3m5!1s0x4cb46fbe7c871e43:0xcacc403553108b64!8m2!3d44.3051537!4d-71.7701103!16s%2Fg%2F11g22yf8qr?entry=ttu&g_ep=EgoyMDI2MDYxMy4wIKXMDSoASAFQAw%3D%3D]]></description>
