    <name>Lone Oak Trailhead Haverhill NH</name>
    <description><![CDATA[Lone Oak Trailhead<br/><br/>📍 Near Woodsville, Haverhill, NH<br/><br/>A trailhead near Woodsville, right along the River Heritage Trail byway corridor.<br/><br/>Tips<br/>- Right next to the Haverhill-Bath Covered Bridge — easy to combine both stops.<br/><br/>More info: https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=44.1562%2C%20-72.0328]]></description>
