  <Placemark>
    <name>Long Cove Headwaters Preserve</name>
    <description><![CDATA[Tips<br/>- Blue Loop (1.1 mi round-trip, dirt old woods road, easy) or Orange Loop (2.4 mi round-trip, dirt footpath, easy)<br/>- Good for birding — a real diversity of habitat types in one preserve<br/><br/>More info: https://www.google.com/maps/place/Long+Cove+Headwaters+Preserve/@44.4707433,-68.9663773,8069m/data=!3m1!1e3!4m13!1m5!2m4!1sattractions!5m1!4e9!6e1!3m6!1s0x4cae68550c046a7b:0x5b1d771ec3543b77!8m2!3d44.4988369!4d-68.9307424!15sCgthdHRyYWN0aW9uc1oNIgthdHRyYWN0aW9uc5IBD25hdHVyZV9wcmVzZXJ2ZZoBJENoZERTVWhOTUc5blMwVkpRMEZuU1VSV2RUUmlkbnBCUlJBQuABAPoBBAgAEBg!16s%2Fg%2F11h45sp__f?entry=ttu&g_ep=EgoyMDI2MDcxMy4wIKXMDSoASAFQAw%3D%3D]]></description>
