  <Placemark>
    <name>Long Grain Camden ME</name>
    <description><![CDATA[Long Grain<br/><br/>📍 20 Washington St, Camden, ME<br/><br/>A genuinely excellent Thai restaurant — reviewers specifically note it "would be a success in a big city, let alone Camden." Handmade noodles, real curry and stir-fry technique, not a tourist-town approximation of Thai food. Rated 4.4 on Restaurant Guru across 1,800+ reviews — one of the most reviewed restaurants in Camden.<br/><br/>Must Order<br/>- Crab fried rice<br/>- Street Chicken Wings<br/>- Wide Rice Noodles<br/>- Steamed Mussels in Spicy Coconut Lemongrass Broth<br/>- Pad Pak and Pad Kee Mao — both specifically praised for spice and flavor balance<br/><br/>Tips<br/>- Open Tuesday–Saturday, 11:30am–2:30pm and 4:30pm–9pm; closed Sunday and Monday.<br/>- Reservations recommended for both lunch and dinner — this place draws a real crowd.<br/>- Good vegan/vegetarian coverage if needed.<br/>- Call ahead: (207) 236-9001 or (207) 230-8735.<br/><br/>More info: https://www.google.com/maps/place/Long+Grain/@44.2089092,-69.0712165,620m/data=!3m1!1e3!4m13!1m5!2m4!1sRestaurants!5m1!4e9!6e5!3m6!1s0x4cadd70c6a6d7657:0xa7d1153fdd07ec09!8m2!3d44.2095556!4d-69.0662639!15sCgtSZXN0YXVyYW50c1oNIgtyZXN0YXVyYW50c5IBD3RoYWlfcmVzdGF1cmFudJoBJENoZERTVWhOTUc5blMwVkpRMEZuU1VOa2NVdDFRMjFSUlJBQuABAPoBBAgAED8!16s%2Fg%2F1tflm0gt?entry=ttu&g_ep=EgoyMDI2MDYwOS4wIKXMDSoASAFQAw%3D%3D]]></description>
