  <Placemark>
    <name>Long Ledges Sullivan ME</name>
    <description><![CDATA[Long Ledges<br/><br/>📍 Punkinville Road, Sullivan, ME (0.6 mi from Route 1)<br/><br/>318 acres of granite outcroppings and glacial erratic boulders, plus a small, overgrown historic granite quarry. A 4.4 mi trail network connects to Baker Hill and Schoodic Bog.<br/><br/>Tips<br/>- Connects to Baker Hill and Schoodic Bog for a longer combined hike]]></description>
