  <Placemark>
    <name>Long Pond Fire Road Mount Desert ME</name>
    <description><![CDATA[Long Pond & Long Pond Fire Road<br/><br/>📍 Pretty Marsh Rd, western Mount Desert Island, ME<br/><br/>Mount Desert Island's largest freshwater lake, on the western side of the island. It sits in the shadow of its more popular neighbor, Echo Lake, and as a result stays noticeably quiet — one write-up notes "you won't come across many people" along its fire road.<br/><br/>Tips<br/>- Good for a quiet paddle or lakeside walk without Echo Lake's crowds<br/>- Coordinate given is the pond centroid — no single trailhead pin was confirmable]]></description>
