  <Placemark>
    <name>Long Trail Brewing Company Bridgewater VT</name>
    <description><![CDATA[A brewery offering a casual dining experience with a focus on American pub food including burgers, wings, and salads. Prices are moderate, typically ranging from $10 to $20 per dish. It is open for lunch and dinner, closing at 8 PM on weekdays and 6 PM on Sundays, and serves alcohol including its own craft beers.<br/><br/>More info: https://www.google.com/maps/place/Long+Trail+Brewing+Company/@43.5884479,-72.6622299,796m/data=!3m2!1e3!4b1!4m6!3m5!1s0x89e1d3822b637bc7:0x2a35d432dc23f592!8m2!3d43.588444!4d-72.659655!16s%2Fg%2F1tcv79tl?entry=ttu&g_ep=EgoyMDI2MDYyMy4wIKXMDSoASAFQAw%3D%3D]]></description>
