  <Placemark>
    <name>Look Lobster Quoddy Bay Eastport ME</name>
    <description><![CDATA[Look Lobster Quoddy Bay<br/><br/>📍 Eastport, ME<br/><br/>Easternmost lobster shack in the U.S. with Passamaquoddy Bay views. The geographic endpoint and definition of Downeast Maine.<br/><br/>Tips<br/>- Easternmost lobster shack in continental U.S.<br/>- Passamaquoddy Bay views<br/>- True Downeast Maine experience<br/>- Geographic destination in itself]]></description>
