    <name>Lower Breakneck Pond Acadia National Park ME</name>
    <description><![CDATA[Lower Breakneck Pond<br/><br/>📍 Carriage road network, Acadia National Park, ME<br/><br/>A quiet pond along Acadia's carriage road system, a peaceful stop for anyone biking or walking the carriage roads in this part of the park.<br/><br/>Tips<br/>- Best reached as part of a longer carriage-road bike or walk, not a standalone drive-up stop.<br/><br/>More info: https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=44.3859%2C%20-68.2558]]></description>
