  <Placemark>
    <name>Lower Hadlock Pond Loop Trail Northeast Harbor ME</name>
    <description><![CDATA[Lower Hadlock Pond Loop Trail<br/><br/>📍 Parkman Mountain / Norumbega parking area, Route 198, near Northeast Harbor, ME<br/><br/>A 1.6-mile easy loop around Lower Hadlock Pond, further west than the busier core of the park near Northeast Harbor. Rated 4.6★ on AllTrails across 800+ reviews; one reviewer specifically noted seeing "only one other family" during their visit.<br/><br/>Tips<br/>- Access via the Parkman Mountain/Norumbega parking area on Route 198<br/>- Good easy add-on if visiting Asticou or Thuya Gardens nearby]]></description>
