  <Placemark>
    <name>Lower Harbor Trail Schoodic ME</name>
    <description><![CDATA[Lower Harbor Trail<br/><br/>📍 Schoodic Woods Campground, 54 Farview Dr, Winter Harbor, ME<br/><br/>A 2.4-mile easy out-and-back trail from Schoodic Woods Campground, described as a "mellow coastal path" with rocky coastline views toward Norris and Sargent Islands. Rated 4.5★ on AllTrails.<br/><br/>Tips<br/>- Starts right from Schoodic Woods Campground — easy to combine with a Schoodic Bike Path Network ride<br/>- Coordinate given is the campground entrance, not a separate trailhead pin]]></description>
