  <Placemark>
    <name>Lucky Catskills Kingston NY</name>
    <description><![CDATA[Lucky Catskills (Kingston)<br/><br/>📍 43 North Front St, Kingston, NY<br/><br/>From Patty Wu and David Schneider (of Lucky Catskills and Tabla in Tannersville) — opened Oct 2025 in the former Kingston Bread + Bar space, uptown Kingston. Not a strict dim-sum-only restaurant, but genuinely brings real dim-sum-style dumplings and buns to the Hudson Valley — quickly become a popular local spot.<br/><br/>Must Order<br/>- Steamed char siu bao<br/>- Soup dumplings<br/>- Pork & chives dumplings<br/>- Miso ramen or Dan Dan noodles<br/>- Congee<br/>- Black sesame taro milk latte / hojicha oat latte for drinks<br/><br/>Tips<br/>- Open Thu-Tue, 8am-6pm (closed Wednesday)<br/>- Self-bussing, cafe-style ordering — casual, not full-service sit-down<br/>- A few reviews note small portions for the price — go in with realistic expectations, it's a café not a banquet<br/><br/>More info: https://www.google.com/maps/place/Lucky+Catskills/@41.9267,-74.0197,17z]]></description>
