    <description><![CDATA[Lunch on the Wharf<br/><br/>📍 Corea, ME<br/><br/>Sixth-generation lobsterman-run operation in a historic working harbor. Authentic Maine tradition embodied—family business spanning generations.<br/><br/>Tips<br/>- Sixth-generation family business<br/>- Historic working harbor setting<br/>- Genuine local operation<br/>- Authentic Maine experience]]></description>
