    <description><![CDATA[Lunt's Dockside Deli<br/><br/>📍 Frenchboro Island, ME (ferry-access)<br/><br/>Remote ferry-access wharf on a working-boat harbor. Extreme isolation that rewards with authenticity—a genuine off-the-grid Maine experience.<br/><br/>Tips<br/>- Ferry-access only (extreme remoteness)<br/>- Working-boat harbor setting<br/>- Genuine isolation experience<br/>- Effort required, authentic reward]]></description>
