  <Placemark>
    <name>MDI Lobster &amp; BBQ Southwest Harbor ME</name>
    <description><![CDATA[MDI Lobster & BBQ is a seafood and barbecue restaurant located near the water, well-known for its lobster dishes and variety of menu options. It attracts families and casual diners looking for a laid-back dining experience. The vibe is casual and friendly, with outdoor seating available. Patrons consistently praise the generous portions, friendly service, and great food quality, especially the lobster and ribs. Some common issues include infrequent reports of average side dishes, like potato salad, and the fact that the restaurant is currently temporarily closed.<br/><br/>More info: https://www.google.com/maps/place/MDI+Lobster+%26+BBQ/@44.2783185,-68.3208779,707m/data=!3m1!1e3!4m6!3m5!1s0x4caebd0691b4f6d3:0x486c24fae53b6732!8m2!3d44.2773208!4d-68.3162384!16s%2Fg%2F11jv1pbrj5?entry=ttu&g_ep=EgoyMDI2MDYxMC4wIKXMDSoASAFQAw%3D%3D]]></description>
