  <Placemark>
    <name>MOMO GARDEN</name>
    <description><![CDATA[MOMO GARDEN is a Nepalese restaurant offering dishes in the $20–30 price range. It is open for lunch and dinner, serving alcohol with a focus on a cozy atmosphere.<br/><br/>More info: https://www.google.com/maps/place/MOMO+GARDEN/@41.7000092,-73.9560658,12622m/data=!3m1!1e3!4m11!1m3!2m2!1sRestaurants!6e5!3m6!1s0x89dd3f55e2103cf1:0xf22dbe2dd8b7464!8m2!3d41.7000207!4d-73.8866515!15sCgtSZXN0YXVyYW50c1oNIgtyZXN0YXVyYW50c5IBE25lcGFsZXNlX3Jlc3RhdXJhbnSaASRDaGREU1VoTk1HOW5TMFZKUTBGblNVTm1kSEp0UlRCUlJSQULgAQD6AQQIABA-!16s%2Fg%2F11lv_t0vj5?entry=ttu&g_ep=EgoyMDI2MDcwOC4wIKXMDSoASAFQAw%3D%3D]]></description>
