  <Placemark>
    <name>Mac's Chatham Fish &amp; Lobster MA</name>
    <description><![CDATA[Overview<br/>Type: Seafood restaurant<br/><br/>Best known for: Quality seafood dishes like Lobster roll and Fish & Chips<br/><br/>Location context: Chatham, noted as a casual dining option<br/><br/>Price level: $20–30 per person<br/><br/>Visit timing: Not mentioned<br/><br/>Typical Customers<br/>Demographics: Mix of locals and tourists<br/><br/>Group types: Couples, families, and friends<br/><br/>Common occasions: Casual dinner, quick bite<br/><br/>Vibe & Setting<br/>Atmosphere: Casual and laid back<br/><br/>Noise level: Moderate<br/><br/>Decor & setting: Indoor seating, ordering at counter\ <br/><br/>Service style: Attentive and friendly<br/><br/>Recommended Dishes<br/>Overall dish consensus<br/>Reviewers consistently recommend the Lobster roll and Fish & Chips as standout items. Many mention the flavorful clam chowder and Scallops as well.<br/><br/>How “top dishes” are determined<br/>Top dishes are selected based on mentions in reviews, photos showcasing popular items, and strong praise for specific dishes.<br/><br/>| Rank | Dish                     | Why it stands out            | How often it’s mentioned                 | Ideal for            |<br/>|------|--------------------------|-------------------------------|-----------------------------------------|----------------------|<br/>| 1    | Lobster roll             | Highly praised for its flavor | Repeatedly called out as a favorite    | Sharing at the table  |<br/>| 2    | Fish & Chips             | Noted for being crispy and satisfying | Mentioned in many reviews      | Hearty main         |<br/>| 3    | Clam chowder             | Loved for its creamy texture  | Frequently highlighted by reviewers      | Comfort food        |<br/><br/>Good alternates / backup choices  <br/>- Scallops: Often praised for their tenderness and flavor.  <br/>- Fried shrimp: Mentioned for its pleasant crunch and taste.  <br/>- Poke: Recognized for being a lighter option.  <br/><br/>Highlights (non‑dish positives from reviews)<br/>Service quality: Many reviews commend the attentive staff and prompt service.<br/><br/>Cleanliness: Multiple reviews highlight the clean environment and well-maintained bathrooms.<br/><br/>Common Issues (from reviews)<br/>Portion sizes: Some reviewers note that portions can be smaller relative to the price.<br/><br/>Inconsistency in dish quality: A few mentions suggest that some menu items can vary in quality during different visits.<br/><br/>Practical Notes<br/>Reservation / wait: Walk-in friendly, no reservations needed.  <br/><br/>Accessibility: Not mentioned.  <br/><br/>Parking / transit: Not mentioned.  <br/><br/>Best use case: Great for casual dining with family or friends.<br/><br/>More info: https://www.google.com/maps/place/Mac's+Chatham+Fish+%26+Lobster/@41.6781048,-70.00501,5409m/data=!3m1!1e3!4m6!3m5!1s0x89fb14ea5e83403f:0x1c35c2231dab974!8m2!3d41.6840591!4d-69.9818793!16s%2Fg%2F1tk8pmmj?entry=ttu&g_ep=EgoyMDI2MDYxMC4wIKXMDSoASAFQAw%3D%3D]]></description>
