  <Placemark>
    <name>Mac's Downeast Seafood Auburn ME</name>
    <description><![CDATA[Time: 2026-08-22T12:00:00<br/><br/>Mac's Downeast Seafood<br/><br/>📍 910 Minot Ave, Auburn, ME 04210<br/><br/>One of five candidate lunch stops for the Bar Harbor → North Conway drive (2026-08-22) — Auburn/Lewiston sits almost exactly at the noon mark, ~150 miles / 3 hours in. Mac's is Auburn's #1-ranked restaurant on Tripadvisor, a no-frills counter-service seafood shack with a strong local reputation for fresh, never-frozen catch.<br/><br/>Must Order<br/>- Lobster roll — the signature order here<br/>- Homemade chowder — frequently called out in reviews<br/><br/>Tips<br/>- Order at the counter — fastest option of the bunch if you want to minimize the stop<br/>- Open daily 11am–7pm<br/><br/>More info: https://www.google.com/maps/place/Mac's+Downeast+Seafood/@44.0807045,-70.2674974,17z]]></description>
