  <Placemark>
    <name>Mac's Grill Auburn ME</name>
    <description><![CDATA[Time: 2026-08-22T12:00:00<br/><br/>Mac's Grill<br/><br/>📍 1052 Minot Ave, Auburn, ME 04210<br/><br/>One of five candidate lunch stops for the Bar Harbor → North Conway drive (2026-08-22) — Auburn/Lewiston sits almost exactly at the noon mark, ~150 miles / 3 hours in. A 25-year Auburn institution, hand-cutting steaks in-house daily; the pick here if you want something heartier than seafood or Italian.<br/><br/>Must Order<br/>- Hand-cut steak — cut fresh in-house daily, the restaurant's signature<br/><br/>Tips<br/>- Open Saturdays 11:30am–10pm<br/>- Large, well-established local following — reviews note some inconsistency at busy times, so it's a solid rather than flawless pick<br/><br/>More info: https://www.google.com/maps/place/Mac's+Grill/@44.0804470,-70.2739478,17z]]></description>
