  <Placemark>
    <name>Mad River Glass Gallery Waitsfield VT</name>
    <description><![CDATA[Mad River Glass Gallery<br/><br/>📍 Waitsfield, VT<br/><br/>A working glassblowing studio and gallery in Waitsfield, where visitors can watch pieces being made and shop the finished handblown glass.<br/><br/>Tips<br/>- Check whether glassblowing demonstrations are happening during your visit — watching the process is the main draw beyond the gallery itself.<br/><br/>More info: https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=44.1918%2C%20-72.8223]]></description>
