  <Placemark>
    <name>Mad River Valley Rural Historic District Waitsfield VT</name>
    <description><![CDATA[Mad River Valley Rural Historic District<br/><br/>📍 Between Waitsfield and Moretown, VT<br/><br/>A protected rural landscape of open farmland and 19th-century farmsteads along the Mad River, illustrating the valley's continuous agricultural history.<br/><br/>Tips<br/>- Best appreciated as a scenic drive through open farmland rather than a single stop.<br/><br/>More info: https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=44.2203%2C%20-72.7895]]></description>
