    <description><![CDATA[Madeline's Deli<br/><br/>📍 Jackson NH<br/><br/>Small local deli/cafe in Jackson village praised for fresh sandwiches and friendly service.<br/><br/>Must Order<br/>- Fresh sandwiches<br/><br/>Tips<br/>- Quieter alternative to the bigger inn restaurants in the village.]]></description>
