  <Placemark>
    <name>Main Stream Preserve Stockton Springs ME</name>
    <description><![CDATA[Main Stream Preserve<br/><br/>📍 Sherer Rd, Stockton Springs, ME (off Old County Rd/Green Valley Rd, via Harris Rd by Just Barb's Restaurant)<br/><br/>A discontinued-road trail through riparian habitat, dense fir forest, black cherry floodplains, fields, and hemlock groves on the site of several former homestead settlements — watch for woodcock, deer, coyotes, beaver, even bears. Acquired from Central Maine Power in 2010, with additions from Thomas Donaldson in 2013 and 2021.<br/><br/>Tips<br/>- 0.7-1 mi out and back, easy, dirt footpath<br/><br/>More info: https://www.coastalmountains.org]]></description>
