  <Placemark>
    <name>Maine Lighthouse Museum Rockland ME</name>
    <description><![CDATA[Maine Lighthouse Museum<br/><br/>📍 1 Park Drive, Rockland ME<br/><br/>The largest collection of lighthouse, life-saving, and U.S. Coast Guard artifacts in the country, on the waterfront in downtown Rockland overlooking the harbor and Rockland Breakwater. A good rainy-day pairing with the nearby Farnsworth Art Museum.<br/><br/>Tips<br/>- Walking distance from Farnsworth Art Museum and downtown Rockland's gallery scene — easy to combine.<br/>- Good option if the weather turns during your Rockland day.<br/>- Coordinates above are an approximation (near the Rockland Breakwater) — worth confirming against Google Maps before you go.]]></description>
