  <Placemark>
    <name>Maine Lobster Club brand  Alaskan Captain brand</name>
    <description><![CDATA[Sub Somboon Street Food offers delicious street food with prices ranging from $10–20. It is open for lunch and dinner, with a positive review about its atmosphere and customer service, but it doesn't specifically mention serving alcohol.<br/><br/>More info: https://www.google.com/maps/place/Maine+Lobster+Club+brand+%2F+Alaskan+Captain+brand/@44.08514,-69.200832,18853m/data=!3m1!1e3!4m13!1m5!2m4!1sRestaurants!5m1!4e9!6e5!3m6!1s0x4cadcf32b809fa57:0x961bb3c20faa639f!8m2!3d44.1011962!4d-69.1255874!15sCgtSZXN0YXVyYW50c1oNIgtyZXN0YXVyYW50c5IBEnNlYWZvb2Rfd2hvbGVzYWxlcpoBRENpOURRVWxSUVVOdlpFTm9kSGxqUmpsdlQyMVNZVTFJVlhwVGFsWkxWRWRXTkZnd2RFTk9WVlpQWVZaQmRHRlZSUkFC4AEA-gEECAAQNQ!16s%2Fg%2F11fr57926d?entry=ttu&g_ep=EgoyMDI2MDcxMy4wIKXMDSoASAFQAw%3D%3D]]></description>
