  <Placemark>
    <name>Maine Street Bistro Brunswick ME</name>
    <description><![CDATA[Maine Street Bistro<br/><br/>📍 148 Maine Street, Brunswick, ME<br/><br/>Opened May 2023 by Chef John Holm — an intimate, unpretentious French bistro praised in a 2023 Portland Press Herald "Dine Out Maine" review for getting French bistro classics right, using locally-sourced Maine ingredients.<br/><br/>Must Order<br/>- Raw bar selections — oysters and shellfish<br/>- French bistro classics — check the current seasonal dinner menu<br/><br/>Tips<br/>- Reservations recommended via Resy — small, intimate space<br/>- Hours vary slightly by source (roughly Thu-Sat or Tue-Sat, 5-9pm) — confirm before going<br/><br/>More info: https://mainestreetbistro.com/]]></description>
