    <name>Maine Tasting Center Wiscasset ME</name>
    <description><![CDATA[Maine Tasting Center<br/><br/>📍 506 Old Bath Rd, Wiscasset, ME 04578<br/><br/>Interactive education center exploring Maine's food and drink industries through exhibits, guided tastings, classes, and public events.<br/><br/>Tips<br/>- Good rainy-day option on the way in/out of Wiscasset on Route 1<br/><br/>More info: https://www.mainetastingcenter.com/]]></description>
