  <Placemark>
    <name>Mancini's Italian Deli Lewiston ME</name>
    <description><![CDATA[Time: 2026-08-22T12:00:00<br/><br/>Mancini's Italian Deli<br/><br/>📍 5 Park St, Lewiston, ME 04240<br/><br/>One of five candidate lunch stops for the Bar Harbor → North Conway drive (2026-08-22) — Auburn/Lewiston sits almost exactly at the noon mark, ~150 miles / 3 hours in. A small Italian microdeli — the pick here if you want something fast and light rather than a sit-down meal. No confirmed aggregate star rating was found (small review sample), so weigh that against the other four candidates.<br/><br/>Must Order<br/>- Focaccia sandwich — the specialty<br/><br/>Tips<br/>- Open Saturdays 11am–7pm<br/>- Grab-and-go format — good option if the group wants to eat in the car or at a nearby park rather than sit down<br/><br/>More info: https://www.google.com/maps/place/Mancini's+Italian+Deli/@44.0992238,-70.2172130,17z]]></description>
