  <Placemark>
    <name>Mangalitsa Woodstock VT</name>
    <description><![CDATA[Mangalitsa is a farm-to-table restaurant specializing in American cuisine, known for its use of Mangalitsa pork. It is currently temporarily closed. Typically, it operates for dinner service. The restaurant is known to serve alcohol.<br/><br/>More info: https://www.google.com/maps/place/Mangalitsa/@43.6255418,-72.5163748,146m/data=!3m2!1e3!5s0x89e1d821c0bf85f9:0x104c9f0578ee2d0d!4m6!3m5!1s0x89e1d821c1b66ab5:0xe9210bdc5c9beae9!8m2!3d43.6257705!4d-72.5163879!16s%2Fg%2F11fzf5dql7?entry=ttu&g_ep=EgoyMDI2MDYyMy4wIKXMDSoASAFQAw%3D%3D]]></description>
