    <name>Marconi Beach Wellfleet MA</name>
    <description><![CDATA[Marconi Beach<br/><br/>📍 Wellfleet MA<br/><br/>Dramatic National Seashore ocean beach atop high sand cliffs, near the site of Marconi's first transatlantic wireless transmission.<br/><br/>Tips<br/>- The cliff-top overlook has a historical marker about the Marconi station.<br/>- Strong surf and fewer crowds than Coast Guard Beach.]]></description>
