  <Placemark>
    <name>Margaret Lewis Norrie State Park &amp; Marina Staatsburg NY</name>
    <description><![CDATA[Margaret Lewis Norrie State Park & Marina<br/><br/>📍 Norrie Point, Staatsburg, NY 12580<br/><br/>One of 5 state parks in Dutchess County, bordering the Hudson parallel to the hamlet of Staatsburg. Operated by the NYS Office of Parks, Recreation and Historic Preservation, Taconic Region. The property includes educational/recreational facilities, a yacht basin, picnic and overnight camping grounds, children's play areas, and a network of marked trails. The center, museum, and freshwater aquarium are housed in a fieldstone structure at the water's edge.<br/><br/>Tips<br/>- Call 845/889-4100 for visitor information.<br/>- Stop 8 of 26 on the Hyde Park, Clinton & Pleasant Valley Scenic Tour (Tour 3).<br/>- Combine with Staatsburgh State Historic Site, just south — same general area, different character.]]></description>
