  <Placemark>
    <name>Mariaville Falls ME</name>
    <description><![CDATA[Mariaville Falls<br/><br/>📍 Route 181, Mariaville, ME (gravel access road to a lot/kiosk)<br/><br/>600 acres with a dramatic stair falls on the West Branch of the Union River, visible from a trailside overlook. Site of an early-1800s Bingham mill village (mills, tannery) now entirely vanished. 1.4 mi trail network.<br/><br/>Tips<br/>- Furthest-flung of this batch — well inland, north of Ellsworth]]></description>
