  <Placemark>
    <name>Marist College Poughkeepsie NY</name>
    <description><![CDATA[Marist College<br/><br/>📍 3399 North Rd, Poughkeepsie, NY 12601<br/><br/>Visitors welcome to grounds, galleries, and public programs. The main campus entrance is near the Lowell Thomas Communications Center (1987), dedicated to broadcasting pioneer Lowell Thomas. Two tiny Victorian bracketed stone and brick gatehouses from the early 20th century nestle among newer buildings. Students pursue business and liberal arts studies; the modern McCann Recreation Center (1977) overlooks the Hudson beyond the football field.<br/><br/>Tips<br/>- Call 845/575-3000 for visitor information.<br/>- Stop 1 of 33 on the Poughkeepsie & LaGrange Scenic Tour (Tour 5), the tour's starting point.]]></description>
