  <Placemark>
    <name>Marsh River Bog Newcastle ME</name>
    <description><![CDATA[Marsh River Bog<br/><br/>📍 565 US Route 1, Newcastle, ME (behind Mexicali Blues)<br/><br/>73-acre wetland preserve centered on a dwarf spruce bog with wild cranberries and pitcher plants. ~1.6 mi out-and-back plus loop.<br/><br/>Tips<br/>- Ticks noted as abundant — check thoroughly after visiting<br/><br/>More info: https://www.coastalrivers.org/trails/marsh-river-bog/]]></description>
