  <Placemark>
    <name>Marsh-Billings-Rockefeller National Historical Park 1 Woodstock VT</name>
    <description><![CDATA[Carriage Barn Visitor Center is a historical landmark offering educational tours about dairy farming. It does not appear to serve food. The information about lunch or dinner service is not available. It does not specify alcohol service.<br/><br/>More info: https://www.google.com/maps/place/Marsh-Billings-Rockefeller+National+Historical+Park/@43.628482,-72.5249256,2212m/data=!3m1!1e3!4m14!1m7!3m6!1s0x89e1d81e634b8e5d:0xe286e927432ae57a!2sMarsh-Billings-Rockefeller+National+Historical+Park!8m2!3d43.6311474!4d-72.5178484!16zL20vMDUzM2Yx!3m5!1s0x89e1d81e634b8e5d:0xe286e927432ae57a!8m2!3d43.6311474!4d-72.5178484!16zL20vMDUzM2Yx?entry=ttu&g_ep=EgoyMDI2MDYxNi4wIKXMDSoASAFQAw%3D%3D]]></description>
