  <Placemark>
    <name>Marshall Wharf Brewing Company Belfast ME</name>
    <description><![CDATA[Marshall Wharf Brewing Company<br/><br/>📍 36 Marshall Wharf, Belfast, ME 04915<br/><br/>Waterfront craft brewery with a lively beer garden, harbor views, live music, and local staples like oysters and lobster rolls. Rated 4.6 on Google (mixed lower on Restaurant Guru/BeerAdvocate/Tripadvisor, all still respectable).<br/><br/>Tips<br/>- This is the still-open brewery/beer-garden side of the Three Tides waterfront complex — the indoor Three Tides restaurant building itself is closed for reconstruction through at least late 2026, past this trip's Aug 5-15 Camden ME dates. This note covers the part that's actually visitable.<br/>- Hours as of last check: Tue-Thu noon-9pm, Fri-Sat noon-10pm, Sun noon-9pm.<br/><br/>More info: https://www.marshallwharfbrewing.com]]></description>
