  <Placemark>
    <name>Mass Audubon Wellfleet Bay Wildlife Sanctuary Wellfleet MA</name>
    <description><![CDATA[Mass Audubon Wellfleet Bay Wildlife Sanctuary<br/><br/>📍 Wellfleet MA<br/><br/>1,000+ acre Mass Audubon sanctuary with salt marsh and woodland trails, exceptional birding, horseshoe crabs, and Cape Cod Bay views.<br/><br/>Tips<br/>- Pick up a trail map at the nature center at the entrance.<br/>- Horseshoe crab spawning (May–June) and fall shorebird migration are peak times.]]></description>
