  <Placemark>
    <name>Maverick Concerts Woodstock, NY</name>
    <description><![CDATA[Maverick Concerts<br/><br/>📍 Woodstock, NY<br/><br/>America's oldest chamber music festival (est. 1916), presenting weekend concerts in a rustic woodland concert hall that is itself a Woodstock landmark.<br/><br/>Tips<br/>- Check maverickconcerts. for Sept 21–25 dates<br/>- The forest setting is magical; arrive early and walk the grounds<br/>- Affordable tickets; handmade wooden hall with no assigned seating<br/><br/>More info: https://www.google.com/maps/search/Maverick+Concerts+Woodstock,+NY]]></description>
