  <Placemark>
    <name>May Kelly's Cottage</name>
    <description><![CDATA[May Kelly's Cottage is an Irish restaurant that serves traditional fare with menu items like Chicken Pot Pie and Fish and Chips. It's priced between $20–30 per person and is open for lunch and dinner on weekends, but closed on most weekdays. Alcohol is served.<br/><br/>More info: https://www.google.com/maps/place/May+Kelly's+Cottage/@44.0589761,-71.1366616,790m/data=!3m2!1e3!4b1!4m6!3m5!1s0x4cb3a1bad40ad7cb:0xdd0755f381117a67!8m2!3d44.0589761!4d-71.1366616!16s%2Fg%2F1tfny5qh?entry=ttu&g_ep=EgoyMDI2MDcwOC4wIKXMDSoASAFQAw%3D%3D]]></description>
