  <Placemark>
    <name>McCabe Mountain Franklin ME</name>
    <description><![CDATA[McCabe Mountain<br/><br/>📍 Near Donnell Pond Public Reserved Land, Franklin, ME<br/><br/>A peak near Donnell Pond Public Reserved Land, along the Blackwoods Scenic Byway corridor.<br/><br/>Tips<br/>- No well-documented public trail found — treat as a landmark rather than a planned hike unless you find current access info locally.<br/><br/>More info: https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=44.6290%2C%20-68.0528]]></description>
