  <Placemark>
    <name>McLoon's Lobster Shack Spruce Head ME</name>
    <description><![CDATA[McLoon's Lobster Shack<br/><br/>📍 Spruce Head, ME<br/><br/>Off-the-beaten-path lobster shack with spruce-island views and house-made desserts. Specifically noted as rewarding the extra driving effort with far fewer crowds than marquee names.<br/><br/>Tips<br/>- Off-the-beaten-path location<br/>- Spruce-island views<br/>- House-made desserts (distinction from typical shacks)<br/>- Worth the extra drive for solitude]]></description>
    <styleUrl>#c-red</styleUrl>
