    </Point>
  </Placemark>
  <Placemark>
    <name>Megunticook Falls Camden ME</name>
    <description><![CDATA[Megunticook Falls<br/><br/>📍 Behind Main St shops, Camden, ME 04843<br/><br/>A waterfall where the Megunticook River drops over a dam directly into Camden Harbor, viewable from a small park tucked right behind the Main Street shops. Free, quick, and easy to fold into a downtown Camden walk.<br/><br/>Tips<br/>- Look for the small access path behind the Main St shops near the harbor<br/>- Flow is more dramatic after rain / spring snowmelt]]></description>
