    </Point>
  </Placemark>
  <Placemark>
    <name>Megunticook Market and Catering</name>
    <description><![CDATA[Megunticook Market and Catering<br/><br/>📍 2 Gould St, Camden, ME<br/><br/>A neighborhood market and deli that also runs a serious catering operation — good selection of meats, local produce, an eclectic sandwich menu, plus pizza and pre-made meals for a quick grab. Rated 4.4 on Restaurant Guru, #23 of 41 Camden restaurants on Tripadvisor. Reviews are genuinely mixed: strong on the deli/catering side, more inconsistent on the pre-made and online-order side.<br/><br/>Must Order<br/>- Deli sandwiches, made to order<br/>- Wood-fired pizza<br/>- Locally sourced produce and meats if you're provisioning rather than eating on-site<br/><br/>Tips<br/>- Better bet for in-person ordering (sandwiches, deli counter) than pre-made grab-and-go or online orders, per reviews.<br/>- Useful as a grocery/provisions stop for the base camp, not just a sit-down meal.<br/>- Their catering service is well-regarded if you need something for a group.<br/><br/>More info: https://www.google.com/maps/place/Megunticook+Market+and+Catering/@44.2169568,-69.0804957,787m/data=!3m3!1e3!4b1!5s0x4cadd777e4eedb83:0x1f7f830b36c25b33!4m6!3m5!1s0x4cadd777e1c84d67:0x818b02a6f6b90500!8m2!3d44.216953!4d-69.0779208!16s%2Fg%2F1tgp0d8w?entry=ttu&g_ep=EgoyMDI2MDcwOC4wIKXMDSoASAFQAw%3D%3D]]></description>
