  <Placemark>
    <name>Melaza Bistro Woodstock VT</name>
    <description><![CDATA[Melaza Bistro is a temporarily closed tapas restaurant offering dishes in the $30–50 price range. It is expected to serve alcohol and operates during dinner hours.<br/><br/>More info: https://www.google.com/maps/place/Melaza+Bistro/@43.6223817,-72.5377723,5128m/data=!3m1!1e3!4m14!1m6!2m5!1srestaurants+with+reservations!5m2!4e9!15saccepts_reservations!6e5!3m6!1s0x89e1d821ef1725db:0x4ee824ad0c900df!8m2!3d43.62607!4d-72.515553!!16s%2Fg%2F1xn_pcw_?entry=ttu&g_ep=EgoyMDI2MDYyMy4wIKXMDSoASAFQAw%3D%3D]]></description>
