  <Placemark>
    <name>Meredith Historical Society NH</name>
    <description><![CDATA[Meredith Historical Society<br/><br/>📍 Meredith, NH<br/><br/>A small local-history museum in downtown Meredith, one of the most walkable and popular stops on the Lakes Region Tour, with Mill Falls Marketplace and the Sculpture Walk nearby.<br/><br/>Tips<br/>- Easy to combine with the Meredith Sculpture Walk and Winnipesaukee Scenic Railroad depot, both a short walk away.<br/><br/>More info: https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=43.6566%2C%20-71.5011]]></description>
