  <Placemark>
    <name>Merryspring Nature Center Camden ME</name>
    <description><![CDATA[Merryspring Nature Center<br/><br/>📍 30 Conway Road, Camden ME<br/><br/>A 66-acre free nature park and garden sanctuary just south of downtown Camden, with display gardens (daylilies, herbs, roses, perennials) and an interpretive nature trail. Frequently described in reviews as a quiet "hidden gem."<br/><br/>Tips<br/>- Free admission, open daily during daylight hours.<br/>- Flat and easy — a nice low-key break between hikes.<br/>- Coordinates above are an approximation (based on the general Conway Road area) — worth confirming against Google Maps before you go.]]></description>
