    </Point>
  </Placemark>
  <Placemark>
    <name>Mid-Hudson Children's Museum Poughkeepsie NY</name>
    <description><![CDATA[Mid-Hudson Children's Museum<br/><br/>📍 75 North Water St, Poughkeepsie, NY 12601<br/><br/>Provides hands-on experience with permanent and rotating exhibits that combine science and art for children up to age 12.<br/><br/>Tips<br/>- Call 845/471-0589 for visitor information.<br/>- Stop 3 of 33 on the Poughkeepsie & LaGrange Scenic Tour (Tour 5).]]></description>
