  <Placemark>
    <name>Midcoast Kayak Damariscotta ME</name>
    <description><![CDATA[Midcoast Kayak<br/><br/>📍 47 Main St, Damariscotta, ME 04543 (retail; tours depart Muscongus Harbor, Bremen)<br/><br/>Sea kayak rentals, instruction, and full/half-day guided eco-tours — including daily sunset tours — with Registered Maine Guides, mainly on Muscongus Bay and the Damariscotta River. Also rents paddleboards and canoes.<br/><br/>Tips<br/>- Retail shop is on Main St, Damariscotta; guided tours actually depart from Muscongus Harbor in Bremen — confirm meeting point when booking<br/><br/>More info: https://midcoastkayak.com/]]></description>
