  <Placemark>
    <name>Mill House Brewing New Paltz New Paltz, NY</name>
    <description><![CDATA[Mill House Brewing New Paltz<br/><br/>📍 New Paltz, NY<br/><br/>A New Paltz craft brewery with elevated American dishes influenced by Korean and Southern comfort cooking — one of the most interesting brewery restaurants in the Hudson Valley.<br/><br/>Tips<br/>- The Korean-Southern fusion dishes are the real draw, not just the beer<br/>- The IPAs and lagers are consistently well-made<br/>- Good for lunch or an early dinner; outdoor seating available<br/><br/>More info: https://www.google.com/maps/search/Mill+House+Brewing+New+Paltz+New+Paltz,+NY]]></description>
    <styleUrl>#c-green</styleUrl>
