  <Placemark>
    <name>Millbrook Vineyards and Winery NY</name>
    <description><![CDATA[Millbrook Vineyards and Winery<br/><br/>📍 26 Wing Road, Millbrook, NY 12545<br/><br/>A critically acclaimed 130-acre estate winery, founded 1982 by John Dyson, open year-round with complimentary and informative tours offering an insider's view of the entire winemaking process. Cabernet Franc, Chardonnay, Pinot Noir, Tocai Friulano, and Riesling among the estate wines.<br/><br/>Tips<br/>- Call 845/677-8383 or 800/662-WINE for visitor information — www.millbrookwine.com.<br/>- Take a break from driving with a guided tour and wine tasting; world-class wines paired with amazing views.<br/>- Stop 8 of 17 on the Washington & Amenia Scenic Tour (Tour 4).<br/>- Marked purple on curatorial judgment, not a numeric Rating — 94% Facebook recommend (2,740 reviews), voted Best Winery in the Hudson Valley 30 consecutive years. No confirmed Google or TripAdvisor star figure found.]]></description>
