  <Placemark>
    <name>Mills Overlook Preserve Newcastle ME</name>
    <description><![CDATA[Mills Overlook Preserve<br/><br/>📍 Academy Hill Road, opposite St. Patrick's Church, Damariscotta Mills, Newcastle, ME<br/><br/>17-acre property (1999 gift) — fern-draped outcrops lead to a viewpoint over the fish-ladder shed, Great Salt Bay, and on clear days the Camden Hills. Short but genuinely steep for its size. ~0.5-0.8 mi loop.<br/><br/>Tips<br/>- Good pairing with the nearby Damariscotta Mills Fish Ladder<br/>- Short but described as 'strenuous' for its length — real elevation packed in<br/><br/>More info: https://www.coastalrivers.org/trails/mills-overlook-preserve/]]></description>
