  <Placemark>
    <name>Mimi's on the Beach Pemaquid ME</name>
    <description><![CDATA[Mimi's on the Beach<br/><br/>📍 Pemaquid Beach Park, New Harbor, Bristol, ME<br/><br/>A family-owned restaurant right inside Pemaquid Beach Park, tracing back to a 1980s beach shack run by the founders' mother. Serves seafood, burgers, sandwiches, and a kids menu — casual, right off the sand.<br/><br/>Tips<br/>- Rating in question: shows 4.7 on Yelp, but from only 3 reviews — far too thin a sample to trust on its own, even though what's there is glowing.<br/>- Opening hours are weather-dependent — check their Facebook before counting on it being open.<br/>- Natural pairing with a beach day at Pemaquid Beach Park.<br/><br/>More info: https://pemaquidbeach.com/]]></description>
