  <Placemark>
    <name>Mirador Kingston, NY</name>
    <description><![CDATA[Mirador<br/><br/>📍 Kingston, NY<br/><br/>An Andalusian tapas bar in the Stockade District with world-class Spanish wines, sherries, and vermouths alongside expertly crafted seasonal tapas.<br/><br/>Must Order<br/>- Jamon iberico — carved to order<br/>- Croquetas — crisp, creamy, essential<br/>- Sherry and vermouth program — the staff knows their stuff<br/><br/>Tips<br/>- One of the very best wine programs in the Hudson Valley<br/>- Early evening aperitivo hour is a great entry point<br/>- Small room — reservations essential for weekend dinner<br/><br/>More info: https://www.google.com/maps/search/Mirador+Kingston,+NY]]></description>
