  <Placemark>
    <name>Miss SaiGon</name>
    <description><![CDATA[Miss Saigon is a Vietnamese restaurant offering a variety of traditional dishes, including Pho and Spring Rolls. The expected price range is $20–30 per person. It is open for lunch and dinner, but closed on Wednesdays. Alcohol is not mentioned.<br/><br/>More info: https://www.google.com/maps/place/Miss+SaiGon/@41.6924133,-73.9011005,226m/data=!3m2!1e3!5s0x89dd3e50095b8e2f:0x83d652a09d56ca42!4m14!1m7!3m6!1s0x89dcd5e863ca4ded:0x7d0039c76cbcb0b!2s88+Charles+St+Restaurant!8m2!3d41.5266312!4d-74.238392!16s%2Fg%2F1tkc7p4d!3m5!1s0x89dd3fad97e5a4d7:0xf65c2b5d0ae7a98a!8m2!3d41.6927548!4d-73.9003154!16s%2Fg%2F11srr8v2q6?entry=ttu&g_ep=EgoyMDI2MDcwOC4wIKXMDSoASAFQAw%3D%3D]]></description>
    <styleUrl>#c-purple</styleUrl>
    <ExtendedData>
      <Data name="vault_type"><value>Restaurant</value></Data>
