  <Placemark>
    <name>Mitchell Cove Bass Harbor ME</name>
    <description><![CDATA[Mitchell Cove<br/><br/>📍 Off Lopaus Point Rd (unmarked dirt turnoff), near Bass Harbor, ME<br/><br/>A specific, unsigned beach access point off Lopaus Point Road near Bass Harbor, distinct from the main Lopaus Point overlook. There are homes in the area but genuinely no signs pointing visitors to the beach itself.<br/><br/>Tips<br/>- Coordinate is approximate — the original source explicitly notes it's "not precise, but it will get you in the area"<br/>- Combine with the Bass Harbor Head Lighthouse / Lopaus Point stop nearby]]></description>
