  <Placemark>
    <name>Mixed Greens Camden ME</name>
    <description><![CDATA[Mixed Greens<br/><br/>📍 15 Main St, downtown Camden, ME<br/><br/>A fast-casual salad spot built on fresh, local, organic ingredients — genuinely well-regarded, not just "healthy but bland." Rated 4.8 on Restaurant Guru across 127 reviews. Big vegetarian/vegan selection alongside the salads.<br/><br/>Must Order<br/>- Rainbow Salad — the most-praised item, called out for vibrant flavor and fresh vegetables<br/>- Super Greens Salad<br/>- Cobb Salad<br/><br/>Tips<br/>- Open Monday–Saturday, 11am–3pm; closed Sundays — lunch-only, plan accordingly.<br/>- Portions are generous but prices run a bit higher than a typical quick-lunch spot — worth it per reviews, just budget for it.<br/>- Good pick if the group wants something lighter after a big breakfast or before a bigger dinner.<br/><br/>More info: https://www.google.com/maps/place/Mixed+Greens/@44.2104565,-69.0675468,516m/data=!3m1!1e3!4m13!1m5!2m4!1sRestaurants!5m1!4e9!6e5!3m6!1s0x4cadd7cabd390b05:0xe8129bdb45be8913!8m2!3d44.210079!4d-69.064673!15sCgtSZXN0YXVyYW50c1oNIgtyZXN0YXVyYW50c5IBCnNhbGFkX3Nob3CaASNDaFpEU1VoTk1HOW5TMFZKUTBGblNVUk1jeTFmT1ZkUkVBReABAPoBBAgAECo!16s%2Fg%2F11q278n4q4?entry=ttu&g_ep=EgoyMDI2MDYwOS4wIKXMDSoASAFQAw%3D%3D]]></description>
