  <Placemark>
    <name>Moat Mountain Brewing Company</name>
    <description><![CDATA[Moat Mountain Brewing Company is a BBQ and brewery located in North Conway. It serves elevated comfort food with house-smoked meats and craft beer. Prices range from $20 to $30 per person, and it is open for both lunch and dinner.<br/><br/>More info: https://www.google.com/maps/place/Moat+Mountain+Brewing+Company/@44.068537,-71.1461466,789m/data=!3m2!1e3!4b1!4m6!3m5!1s0x4cb3a196558e24e5:0x6bfd66398bffc5a4!8m2!3d44.0685332!4d-71.1435717!16s%2Fg%2F11b6_c8rdv?entry=ttu&g_ep=EgoyMDI2MDcwOC4wIKXMDSoASAFQAw%3D%3D]]></description>
