  <Placemark>
    <name>Monhegan Island Ferry Boothbay ME</name>
    <description><![CDATA[View website<br/><br/>Balmy Days Cruises — Boothbay Harbor<br/><br/>📍 Boothbay Harbor, ME<br/><br/>A 1.5-hour crossing each way aboard the Balmy Days II, on a fixed schedule: departs 9:30 AM, returns 4:15 PM, giving about 3h45m on the island. The longest crossing of the three departure options, but includes an optional 30-minute cruise circumnavigating Monhegan at 2 PM (weather permitting) — the only option with a built-in scenic extra beyond the crossing itself.<br/><br/>Tips<br/>- Reservations required — call (207) 633-2284 if booking online has issues<br/>- Furthest of the three departure towns from Camden (~46 mi, ~1h11m drive)<br/>- Fixed schedule means a full, structured day — less flexibility than the other two options, but the 2 PM circumnavigation cruise is a nice bonus if timing works<br/><br/>More info: https://balmydayscruises.com/]]></description>
