    <name>Monomoy National Wildlife Refuge Chatham MA</name>
    <description><![CDATA[Monomoy National Wildlife Refuge<br/><br/>📍 Chatham MA<br/><br/>7,600-acre barrier island refuge south of Chatham with hiking, kayaking, and exceptional birding and seal viewing; visitor center on Main St.<br/><br/>Tips<br/>- Stop at the visitor center first for maps and current conditions.<br/>- Guided boat tours to the islands are the best way to see seals up close.]]></description>
