    <name>Montgomery Place Annandale-on-Hudson, NY</name>
    <description><![CDATA[Montgomery Place<br/><br/>📍 Annandale-on-Hudson, NY<br/><br/>A 19th-century Livingston family riverside estate managed by Bard College, with walking trails through historic orchards and Hudson River views.<br/><br/>Tips<br/>- Free to walk the grounds; house tours may be seasonal<br/>- The trail system connects to the Hudson shoreline<br/>- Combine with a Bard Fisher Center visit — same campus<br/>- Also stop 10 of 33 on the Rhinebeck, Red Hook & Milan Scenic Tour (Tour 1)<br/><br/>More info: https://www.google.com/maps/search/Montgomery+Place+Annandale-on-Hudson,+NY]]></description>
