    <name>Montpelier (Knox Mansion Museum) Thomaston ME</name>
    <description><![CDATA[Time: 2026-08-10T10:00:00<br/><br/>Montpelier (Knox Mansion Museum)<br/><br/>📍 Thomaston ME<br/><br/>Reconstructed Federal-style mansion of Revolutionary War Gen. Henry Knox, with period tours.<br/><br/>Tips<br/>- Guided tours run seasonally — check hours before visiting.]]></description>
