    <name>Moon Dog Excursions</name>
    <description><![CDATA[Nina June is a restaurant located at 24 Central St, serving artistic dishes with a price range of $60–70. It is closed and opens at 5 PM, serving dinner only and does not specify if it serves alcohol.<br/><br/>More info: https://www.google.com/maps/place/Moon+Dog+Excursions/@44.1834243,-69.0818261,2626m/data=!3m1!1e3!4m11!1m3!2m2!1sThings+to+do!6e1!3m6!1s0x4cadd717dd245f35:0x9061623888777c!8m2!3d44.185528!4d-69.0743781!15sCgxUaGluZ3MgdG8gZG9aDiIMdGhpbmdzIHRvIGRvkgEQYm9hdF90b3VyX2FnZW5jeZoBRENpOURRVWxSUVVOdlpFTm9kSGxqUmpsdlQycGtNR0l6UVRCWmJFSktZbTVrTkZneFdrTlJhemxzVlVSR05rNUhZeEFC4AEA-gEFCIIBEEQ!16s%2Fg%2F11pz2dq6n5?entry=ttu&g_ep=EgoyMDI2MDcxMy4wIKXMDSoASAFQAw%3D%3D]]></description>
