  <Placemark>
    <name>Moose Brook State Park Gorham NH</name>
    <description><![CDATA[Moose Brook State Park<br/><br/>📍 Jimtown Road, Gorham, NH<br/><br/>A 770-acre state park just outside Gorham, built around a swimming pond fed by Moose Brook with a sandy beach, picnic areas, and a small campground — a quiet local spot for a swim or picnic rather than a major attraction.<br/><br/>Tips<br/>- A good low-key stop to cool off after a hike in the surrounding White Mountains/North Country.<br/><br/>More info: https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=44.4078%2C%20-71.2306]]></description>
