  <Placemark>
    <name>Moose Point State Park Searsport ME</name>
    <description><![CDATA[Moose Point State Park<br/><br/>📍 Searsport, ME (Route 1, between Belfast and Searsport)<br/><br/>Small coastal day-use park — picnics, short walks, clean restrooms, modern playground. Trails rated 4.7 average on AllTrails (346 reviews).<br/><br/>Tips<br/>- Good low-commitment stop, not a full-hike destination — pairs well with a Belfast/Searsport driving day.]]></description>
