  <Placemark>
    <name>Morning Moose Coffee Topsham ME</name>
    <description><![CDATA[Morning Moose Coffee<br/><br/>📍 11 Main St, Topsham, ME (across the Androscoggin River from downtown Brunswick — essentially twin downtowns)<br/><br/>Started in 2021 as a single pink coffee trailer, now grown into a brick-and-mortar community favorite known for creative signature drinks and fresh made-to-order hot mini donuts. Distinctly local, not a chain.<br/><br/>Must Order<br/>- Popham Palm — their most popular signature drink<br/>- Mocha Moose Cold Brew<br/>- Blueberry Bliss<br/>- Banana Bread Latte<br/>- Fresh hot mini donuts and bagels<br/><br/>Tips<br/>- Counter service only, no sit-down dining<br/>- Hours: Mon-Fri 6am-2pm, Sat 7am-3pm, closed Sunday<br/>- Weekly specials posted Mondays on Facebook<br/>- There's also an original trailer location in Richmond, ME, but that's further away and not walkable to Brunswick<br/><br/>More info: https://morningmooseco.com/]]></description>
