  <Placemark>
    <name>Mosaic Restaurant Camden ME</name>
    <description><![CDATA[Mosaic<br/><br/>📍 31 Elm St, Camden, ME<br/><br/>A cozy Mexican/Mediterranean fusion spot decorated with locally made artwork — an unusual, well-executed combination rather than a straightforward taqueria. Rated 4.7 on Restaurant Guru (283 reviews) and 4.8 on Tripadvisor (#12 of 40 Camden restaurants). Service is consistently called excellent and friendly, prices reasonable.<br/><br/>Must Order<br/>- Enchiladas<br/>- Fish tacos<br/>- Korean BBQ bowl — the fusion angle at its most distinctive<br/><br/>Tips<br/>- Open daily, 11:30am–9pm.<br/>- Good gluten-free coverage — burrito bowls, enchiladas, tacos, and dessert all have GF options.<br/>- Reserve ahead in peak season: (207) 230-8380.<br/><br/>More info: https://www.google.com/maps/place/Mosaic+Restaurant/@44.2090611,-69.0674547,246m/data=!3m1!1e3!4m13!1m5!2m4!1sRestaurants!5m1!4e9!6e5!3m6!1s0x4cadd715e97c814b:0x8b79bf15f56e5eab!8m2!3d44.2090648!4d-69.065927!15sCgtSZXN0YXVyYW50c1oNIgtyZXN0YXVyYW50c5IBCnJlc3RhdXJhbnSaAURDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMjB4ZUdFeVpGbE9iV1EyVFRORk5WUlhkRlpWYkVveFdWVmtibHB1WXhBQuABAPoBBAgAEDU!16s%2Fg%2F11stpz7p2w?entry=ttu&g_ep=EgoyMDI2MDYwOS4wIKXMDSoASAFQAw%3D%3D]]></description>
