    <name>Mostly Muffins Colebrook NH</name>
    <description><![CDATA[Mostly Muffins<br/><br/>📍 Colebrook NH<br/><br/>Bakery/breakfast spot known for muffins and casual morning fare.<br/><br/>Must Order<br/>- Muffins<br/><br/>Tips<br/>- Good breakfast stop before exploring Beaver Brook Falls.]]></description>
