  <Placemark>
    <name>Moultonborough Historical Society NH</name>
    <description><![CDATA[Moultonborough Historical Society<br/><br/>📍 Moultonborough, NH<br/><br/>A small local-history museum preserving artifacts and stories from Moultonborough's past, one of the towns ringing the northern shore of Lake Winnipesaukee.<br/><br/>Tips<br/>- Typically open limited seasonal hours — check ahead rather than planning a dedicated stop.<br/><br/>More info: https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=43.7525%2C%20-71.3997]]></description>
