  <Placemark>
    <name>Mount Blue North Woodstock NH</name>
    <description><![CDATA[Mount Blue<br/><br/>📍 Near North Woodstock, NH<br/><br/>A mountain near North Woodstock along the River Heritage Trail byway route through the southern White Mountains. (Not to be confused with Mount Blue State Park in Maine.)<br/><br/>Tips<br/>- Treat as a scenic landmark along the drive rather than a confirmed hiking destination — verify current trail access locally before planning a hike here.<br/><br/>More info: https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=44.0309%2C%20-71.8204]]></description>
