    <name>Mount Hitchcock Kancamagus NH</name>
    <description><![CDATA[Mount Hitchcock<br/><br/>📍 White Mountain National Forest, along the Kancamagus Highway<br/><br/>A peak in the White Mountain National Forest, visible from points along the Kancamagus Highway corridor.<br/><br/>Tips<br/>- Treat as a scenic backdrop along the drive rather than a confirmed hiking destination.<br/><br/>More info: https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=44.0745%2C%20-71.5392]]></description>
