    <name>Mount Hunger via Waterbury Trail Waterbury VT</name>
    <description><![CDATA[Mount Hunger via Waterbury Trail<br/><br/>📍 Waterbury VT<br/><br/>Strenuous 3.8-mile out-and-back to an exposed rocky summit with one of Vermont's finest 360° views — a local favorite for serious hikers.<br/><br/>Tips<br/>- One of Vermont's best summit views for the effort.<br/>- Trailhead off Route 2 near Waterbury center.]]></description>
