      <coordinates>-71.6444,44.1607,0</coordinates>
    </Point>
  </Placemark>
  <Placemark>
    <name>Mount Mansfield Loop Trail Stowe VT</name>
    <description><![CDATA[Mount Mansfield Loop Trail<br/><br/>📍 Stowe VT<br/><br/>Vermont's highest peak (4,393 ft) via a loop route with exposed scrambling near the Chin summit and above-treeline ridge walking. Multiple access options.<br/><br/>Tips<br/>- Full day commitment — start early.<br/>- The Long Trail follows the ridge; Taft Lodge is a shelter en route for breaks.<br/>- Combine with the Auto Toll Road for a one-way descent option.]]></description>
