  <Placemark>
    <name>Mount Mansfield State Forest Stowe VT</name>
    <description><![CDATA[Mount Mansfield State Forest<br/><br/>📍 Chittenden/Lamoille Counties, VT<br/><br/>The state forest surrounding Mount Mansfield and Smugglers' Notch — Vermont's largest contiguous protected forest block, encompassing the trails, backcountry, and campgrounds around the state's highest peak.<br/><br/>Tips<br/>- The umbrella landscape behind most of the Stowe area's hiking — see the Mount Mansfield Loop Trail note for the actual summit hike.<br/><br/>More info: https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=44.4918%2C%20-72.8186]]></description>
