  <Placemark>
    <name>Mount Mansfield Trailhead Stowe VT</name>
    <description><![CDATA[Mount Mansfield (Trailhead)<br/><br/>📍 Stowe, VT<br/><br/>The byway's source list included two separate "Mount Mansfield" entries at different coordinates — this one, tagged as a hiking trailhead, sits south and east of the main summit and Long Trail route already documented in the Mount Mansfield Loop Trail note. Its exact trail identity (possibly a lower-elevation access point or a different approach route) isn't confirmed.<br/><br/>Tips<br/>- For the main summit hike, see the separate Mount Mansfield Loop Trail note — this entry is kept only because it's a distinct pin in the source data.<br/>- Verify what trail actually starts here before planning around it specifically.<br/><br/>More info: https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=44.4990%2C%20-72.7447]]></description>
