  <Placemark>
    <name>Mount Washington Golf Course Bretton Woods NH</name>
    <description><![CDATA[Mount Washington Golf Course<br/><br/>📍 Omni Mount Washington Resort, Bretton Woods, NH<br/><br/>The golf course at the Omni Mount Washington Resort, played against the backdrop of the Presidential Range.<br/><br/>Tips<br/>- Resort guests and the public can typically book tee times — check the Omni's own booking system rather than walking up.<br/><br/>More info: https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=44.2552%2C%20-71.4448]]></description>
