  <Placemark>
    <name>Mount Washington Observatory Gorham NH</name>
    <description><![CDATA[Mount Washington Observatory (Gorham)<br/><br/>📍 Near Gorham, NH<br/><br/>The Mount Washington Observatory runs the weather station on the summit itself, and operates the public Weather Discovery Center museum in North Conway (2779 White Mountain Highway) — not here. This pin's exact significance at this Gorham-area location isn't clearly documented; it may be an office, trailhead sign, or a general regional marker rather than a standalone visitor site.<br/><br/>Tips<br/>- If you want the actual public museum experience — interactive exhibits, live video chat with a summit scientist — head to the Weather Discovery Center in North Conway instead.<br/>- Verify what's actually here before planning a stop specifically for this point.<br/><br/>More info: https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=44.3921%2C%20-71.1992]]></description>
