    <name>Mountain Moose Noodles &amp; Asian Street Food Conway NH</name>
    <description><![CDATA[Overview<br/>Type: Fast casual Asian restaurant  <br/>Best known for: Friendly staff, diverse menu options  <br/>Location context: Settler's Green plaza  <br/>Price level: $10–20 per person  <br/>Visit timing: Not mentioned  <br/><br/>Typical Customers  <br/>Demographics: Not mentioned  <br/>Group types: Solo, couples, friends, families  <br/>Common occasions: Casual dinner, quick bite  <br/><br/>Vibe & Setting  <br/>Atmosphere: Casual, spacious  <br/>Noise level: Moderate  <br/>Decor & setting: Indoor seating, ample space  <br/>Service style: Friendly, attentive staff  <br/><br/>Recommended Dishes  <br/>Overall dish consensus  <br/>Khao Soi and Lemongrass Pork Bun are frequently highlighted in reviews for their flavor and quality, particularly liked for their textures and preparation.  <br/><br/>How “top dishes” are determined  <br/>Top dishes are chosen based only on the Google Maps page and its reviews, focusing on items labeled as popular or appearing often in positive mentions and photos.  <br/><br/>| Rank | Dish                      | Why it stands out                                        | How often it’s mentioned              | Ideal for                 |<br/>|------|---------------------------|---------------------------------------------------------|---------------------------------------|---------------------------|<br/>| 1    | Khao Soi                 | Rich flavor, noted for its distinct taste.             | Repeatedly called out as a favorite. | Hearty main              |<br/>| 2    | Lemongrass Pork Bun      | Juicy pork and soft bun texture praised by many.       | Mentioned in many reviews.           | Sharing at the table      |<br/>| 3    | Satay Bowl               | Generous portions with great flavors.                   | Appears in numerous photos.          | Quick bite               |<br/><br/>Good alternates / backup choices  <br/>- Orange Chicken Rice Bowl: Comforting and generous portions noted.  <br/><br/>Highlights (non-dish positives from reviews)  <br/>Positive staff interactions: Customers report the staff are friendly and treat patrons exceptionally well.  <br/><br/>Diverse menu options: The restaurant offers a variety of Asian dishes appealing to different tastes.  <br/><br/>Common Issues (from reviews)  <br/>Service timing issues: Some customers noted haphazard meal timing with dishes arriving at different intervals.  <br/><br/>Practical Notes  <br/>Reservation / wait: Not mentioned  <br/>Accessibility: Not mentioned  <br/>Parking / transit: Not mentioned  <br/>Best use case: Great for casual dinners and quick bites.<br/><br/>More info: https://www.google.com/maps/place/Mountain+Moose+Noodles+%26+Asian+Street+Food/@44.0227534,-71.1150962,1549m/data=!3m1!1e3!4m6!3m5!1s0x4cb3a1f9e7b5b869:0x8db3bbbfda1a9258!8m2!3d44.0238243!4d-71.1124854!16s%2Fg%2F11ksbcjtcs?entry=ttu&g_ep=EgoyMDI2MDYxMy4wIKXMDSoASAFQAw%3D%3D]]></description>
