    <name>Museum Of The White Mountains Plymouth NH</name>
    <description><![CDATA[Museum Of The White Mountains<br/><br/>📍 Plymouth State University, Plymouth, NH<br/><br/>A free university museum exploring how people have shaped, painted, climbed, and settled the White Mountains over time — historic art, artifacts, and changing exhibitions on the region's cultural and environmental history.<br/><br/>Tips<br/>- Free admission; check PSU's academic calendar for closures around breaks.<br/><br/>More info: https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=43.7584%2C%20-71.6917]]></description>
