  <Placemark>
    <name>Myrtle Street Tavern Rockland ME</name>
    <description><![CDATA[Myrtle Street Tavern<br/><br/>📍 12 Myrtle St, Rockland, ME 04841<br/><br/>Genuine local dive-pub with year-round live music — reviewers say it's one of the only coastal spots with music every week, not just seasonally. Rated ~4.3-4.5 across Tripadvisor and other platforms.<br/><br/>Tips<br/>- Open Tue-Sat 11:30am-1am; closed Sun/Mon. Food served till midnight.<br/>- Directly matches the Reddit rec ("Myrtle St Tavern") for "a real taste of Rockland."<br/><br/>More info: https://myrtlestreettavern.com]]></description>
