    <name>NICHOLSON MUIR Boynton Beach FL</name>
    <description><![CDATA[Overview<br/>Type: Restaurant<br/><br/>Best known for: High quality food and ingredients; Impeccable atmosphere and service.<br/><br/>Location context: Not mentioned<br/><br/>Price level: $100+<br/><br/>Visit timing: Slow on Fridays, reservations recommended.<br/><br/>Typical Customers<br/>Demographics: Mix of locals and visitors, not distinctly mentioned.<br/><br/>Group types: Couples, friends, families.<br/><br/>Common occasions: Casual dinner, date night, special occasions.<br/><br/>Vibe & Setting<br/>Atmosphere: Cozy, reminiscent of a speakeasy.<br/><br/>Noise level: Quiet to moderate.<br/><br/>Decor & setting: Indoor seating with European-inspired decor.<br/><br/>Service style: Attentive and friendly.<br/><br/>Recommended Dishes<br/>Overall dish consensus<br/>Reviewers frequently praise dishes such as Sea Bass and Wagyu Nigiri as must-order items for their high quality and flavor. The ambiance enhances the overall dining experience.<br/><br/>How “top dishes” are determined<br/>Top dishes are chosen based solely on the Google Maps place page and its reviews, focusing on popular mentions, photo appearances, and strong praise from guests.<br/><br/>| Rank | Dish                 | Why it stands out                                                                  | How often it’s mentioned          | Ideal for             |<br/>|------|----------------------|----------------------------------------------------------------------------------|------------------------------------|-----------------------|<br/>| 1    | Sea Bass             | Known for its freshness and excellence in flavor.                               | Mentioned in many reviews          | Hearty main           |<br/>| 2    | Wagyu Nigiri         | Praised for its rich taste and quality; a standout for meat lovers.             | Appears in numerous photos         | Sharing at the table  |<br/>| 3    | Fewer clearly highlighted dishes in reviews | Not mentioned                  | Not mentioned         |<br/><br/>Good alternates / backup choices<br/>- Not mentioned<br/><br/>Highlights (non‑dish positives from reviews)<br/>Atmosphere: The ambiance is described as cozy and inviting, creating a warm dining experience.<br/><br/>Service: The staff is noted for being attentive, checking in frequently to ensure a good dining experience.<br/><br/>Common Issues (from reviews)<br/>Table change policy: Some guests expressed frustration over not being able to change tables despite availability. <br/><br/>Wait times: Not mentioned.<br/><br/>Practical Notes<br/>Reservation / wait: Reservations are recommended, especially during busy times.<br/><br/>Accessibility: Not mentioned<br/><br/>Parking / transit: Not mentioned<br/><br/>Best use case: Best for a cozy date night with quality dining experience.<br/><br/>More info: https://www.google.com/maps/place/NICHOLSON+MUIR/@26.526557,-80.0604795,592m/data=!3m1!1e3!4m14!1m7!3m6!1s0x88d8df951215afbb:0x7f93e498ea7545d4!2sPaloma+Mexican+Restaurant!8m2!3d26.5269824!4d-80.0585403!16s%2Fg%2F11lyc85vky!3m5!1s0x88d8df0796dac471:0xd0348cb9cc0f3d8f!8m2!3d26.5269803!4d-80.0596169!16s%2Fg%2F11spxsrfsv?entry=ttu&g_ep=EgoyMDI2MDYxMC4wIKXMDSoASAFQAw%3D%3D]]></description>
