    <description><![CDATA[Nannau<br/><br/>📍 Bar Harbor, ME<br/><br/>One of the surviving Gilded Age "cottages" from Bar Harbor's turn-of-the-century summer colony, listed on the National Register of Historic Places.<br/><br/>Tips<br/>- Private property — a drive/walk-past landmark, not a stop with public access.<br/><br/>More info: https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=44.3753%2C%20-68.1958]]></description>
