    <description><![CDATA[Nantucket Whaling Museum<br/><br/>📍 Nantucket MA<br/><br/>Immersive museum covering Nantucket's whaling era with a full sperm whale skeleton, scrimshaw collection, and historic artifacts.<br/><br/>Tips<br/>- Allow 2+ hours — it's more substantial than it looks from outside.<br/>- The rooftop lookout has good harbor views.]]></description>
