    <name>Nauset Beach Orleans MA</name>
    <description><![CDATA[Nauset Beach<br/><br/>📍 Orleans MA<br/><br/>Iconic 10-mile barrier beach on the Atlantic side with strong surf, rolling dunes, and a classic clam shack at the entrance.<br/><br/>Tips<br/>- Strong surf — good for boogie boarding but swim near lifeguards.<br/>- The clam shack at the entrance is a classic Cape Cod stop for fried clams.]]></description>
