    <description><![CDATA[Nauset Light<br/><br/>📍 Eastham MA<br/><br/>Historic 1923 red-and-white lighthouse adjacent to Coast Guard Beach — the image on Cape Cod potato chip bags. Volunteer-run tours available.<br/><br/>Tips<br/>- Combine with Coast Guard Beach next door — easy half-day.<br/>- The Three Sisters Lighthouses are a short walk away.]]></description>
