  <Placemark>
    <name>Next Level Sports Lounge Southwest Harbor ME</name>
    <description><![CDATA[Next Level Sports Lounge is a sports bar that draws in locals and sports enthusiasts looking for a relaxed place to enjoy games with friends. It has a casual, sometimes noisy atmosphere with many TVs, making it lively and perfect for game nights. Reviews highlight the tasty food, generous portion sizes, and good service. Common issues include occasional unavailability of menu items and the quality of certain sauces, which some find lacking.<br/><br/>More info: https://www.google.com/maps/place/Next+Level+Sports+Lounge/@44.2795449,-68.3275342,475m/data=!3m1!1e3!4m13!1m5!2m4!1sRestaurants!5m1!4e9!6e5!3m6!1s0x4caebd88171550fb:0x7836e485994fa01b!8m2!3d44.2779956!4d-68.3257552!15sCgtSZXN0YXVyYW50c1oNIgtyZXN0YXVyYW50c5IBCnJlc3RhdXJhbnSaAURDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMjVvYjFwVk9WWlRWM0IwVWxaQ05WTklSbkJrUlU1T1VUTm9lbUV4UlJBQuABAPoBBQjHARAx!16s%2Fg%2F11jnmm6tt2?entry=ttu&g_ep=EgoyMDI2MDYxMC4wIKXMDSoASAFQAw%3D%3D]]></description>
