  <Placemark>
    <name>Nickerson State Park Brewster MA</name>
    <description><![CDATA[Nickerson State Park<br/><br/>📍 Brewster MA<br/><br/>1,900-acre park with kettle ponds, 8 miles of paved bike trails, swimming, and camping.<br/><br/>Tips<br/>- Rent bikes in town and ride the trail through the park.<br/>- Flax Pond and Cliff Pond are the best swimming spots inside the park.]]></description>
