  <Placemark>
    <name>Nocturnem Draft Haus Bangor ME</name>
    <description><![CDATA[Nocturnem Draft Haus<br/><br/>📍 56 Main St, Bangor, ME 04401<br/><br/>German-themed downtown Bangor bar, extensive beer list, described by one reviewer as "THE bar to know in Bangor." Rated 4.4 on Tripadvisor (#16 of 124 Bangor restaurants), 4.41 on BeerAdvocate.<br/><br/>Tips<br/>- This week's hours 4-10pm — evening-focused, check current hours before planning around it.]]></description>
