  <Placemark>
    <name>Noodle Village</name>
    <description><![CDATA[Noodle Village is a Vietnamese restaurant offering a menu focused on Asian cuisine. It operates primarily for dinner, serving from 3 PM to 9 PM on weekdays and has a lunch service on Saturdays from 12 PM to 9 PM. Alcohol is available.<br/><br/>More info: https://www.google.com/maps/place/Noodle+Village/@44.0524023,-71.129966,595m/data=!3m1!1e3!4m14!1m7!3m6!1s0x4cb3a0bf793f9bfb:0x6c5284ed20196b08!2sVia+Roma+Pizza+%26+Mediterranean!8m2!3d44.0363957!4d-71.1223054!16s%2Fg%2F11r9lxtgw!3m5!1s0x4cb3a129ccaf8811:0xd19ec75193f7f24f!8m2!3d44.0529871!4d-71.1271239!16s%2Fg%2F11ywtmdwvd?entry=ttu&g_ep=EgoyMDI2MDcxMi4wIKXMDSoASAFQAw%3D%3D]]></description>
