  <Placemark>
    <name>Norrie Point Environmental Center Staatsburg, NY</name>
    <description><![CDATA[Norrie Point Environmental Center<br/><br/>📍 Staatsburg, NY<br/><br/>A Hudson River waterfront park with boat launches, nature trails, and direct river access — part of Margaret Lewis Norrie State Park.<br/><br/>Tips<br/>- Free to enter; small fee for boat launch<br/>- The trail connecting Norrie Point to Mills Mansion grounds is excellent<br/>- Good bird-watching along the river edge in early morning<br/><br/>More info: https://www.google.com/maps/search/Norrie+Point+Environmental+Center+Staatsburg,+NY]]></description>
