  <Placemark>
    <name>North Beacon Oyster</name>
    <description><![CDATA[North Beacon Oyster is an oyster bar restaurant that specializes in seafood dishes, with prices typically ranging from $40 to $50 per person. It is open for dinner starting at 11:30 AM but remains closed on Mondays and Tuesdays. The restaurant is casual and friendly, catering to seafood enthusiasts. They serve alcohol, featuring various wines to complement their menu.<br/><br/>More info: https://www.google.com/maps/place/North+Beacon+Oyster/@44.08514,-69.200832,18853m/data=!3m1!1e3!4m13!1m5!2m4!1sRestaurants!5m1!4e9!6e5!3m6!1s0x4cadcf7c4b9d4d23:0xf5f187e05c1b147c!8m2!3d44.1047836!4d-69.1090908!15sCgtSZXN0YXVyYW50c1oNIgtyZXN0YXVyYW50c5IBFW95c3Rlcl9iYXJfcmVzdGF1cmFudJoBI0NoWkRTVWhOTUc5blMwVkpRMEZuU1VOd2QyVnFYMlpSRUFF4AEA-gEECAAQRg!16s%2Fg%2F11ghpydv8n?entry=ttu&g_ep=EgoyMDI2MDcxMy4wIKXMDSoASAFQAw%3D%3D]]></description>
