  <Placemark>
    <name>North Gully Falls Ellenville, NY</name>
    <description><![CDATA[North Gully Falls<br/><br/>📍 Ellenville, NY<br/><br/>A small but scenic waterfall right at the edge of the village — easy to combine with a stroll along Canal Street and the D&H Canal visitor center.<br/><br/>Tips<br/>- End of Canal Street, Ellenville<br/><br/>More info: https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=41.7160%2C%20-74.3880]]></description>
