  <Placemark>
    <name>North-South Lake State Campground Haines Falls, NY</name>
    <description><![CDATA[North-South Lake State Campground<br/><br/>📍 Haines Falls, NY<br/><br/>Two glacial lakes with swimming beaches at 2,000 feet elevation — trailhead for the Escarpment Trail and the historic Catskill Mountain House site.<br/><br/>Tips<br/>- Day-use fee applies; beach swimmable through September on warm days<br/>- Escarpment Trail toward South Mountain is the classic walk from here<br/>- Interpretive signs mark the site of the legendary Catskill Mountain House, demolished 1963<br/><br/>More info: https://www.google.com/maps/search/North-South+Lake+State+Campground+Haines+Falls,+NY]]></description>
