  <Placemark>
    <name>Nye Block Johnson VT</name>
    <description><![CDATA[Nye Block<br/><br/>📍 Downtown Johnson, VT<br/><br/>A historic 40-by-120-foot commercial building in downtown Johnson, whose ground floor originally housed a general store. Listed on the National Register of Historic Places; a detailed scale model of the building has been donated to the Johnson Historical Society.<br/><br/>Tips<br/>- A downtown Johnson landmark rather than a ticketed stop — pair with the Johnson Historical Society if researching further.<br/><br/>More info: https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=44.6350%2C%20-72.6790]]></description>
