  <Placemark>
    <name>Ogden Point Acadia National Park ME</name>
    <description><![CDATA[Ogden Point<br/><br/>📍 Frenchman Bay shoreline, near Bar Harbor, ME<br/><br/>A shoreline point along Frenchman Bay near Bar Harbor.<br/><br/>Tips<br/>- Treat as a minor shoreline waypoint rather than a planned stop — no strong documentation of a specific visitor draw here beyond the coastal views shared by this whole stretch of shore.<br/><br/>More info: https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=44.3792%2C%20-68.1931]]></description>
