  <Placemark>
    <name>Olana State Historic Site Hudson, NY</name>
    <description><![CDATA[Olana State Historic Site<br/><br/>📍 Hudson, NY<br/><br/>Persian-inspired hilltop estate of Hudson River School painter Frederic Church, with panoramic Hudson Valley views and ticketed house tours.<br/><br/>Tips<br/>- Grounds free year-round; house tours book in advance online<br/>- The hilltop view toward the Hudson River is among the finest in the valley<br/>- Combine with Warren Street — 10 min away<br/><br/>More info: https://www.google.com/maps/search/Olana+State+Historic+Site+Hudson,+NY]]></description>
