    </Point>
  </Placemark>
  <Placemark>
    <name>Old Pond Railway Trail and Kilkenny Cove Hancock ME</name>
    <description><![CDATA[Old Pond Railway Trail and Kilkenny Cove<br/><br/>📍 East trailhead: Point Road, Hancock, ME, 1 mi south of the bridge (across from Town Hall); west trailhead: Old Route 1<br/><br/>A former railway corridor crossing a saltwater bay — 7.5-acre Kilkenny Cove plus a 3.25 mi one-way trail. Excellent birding for migrating songbirds and shorebirds, plus ocean/clam-worm access. Jointly managed by three land trusts.]]></description>
