  <Placemark>
    <name>Old Roundtop Dutchess County, NY</name>
    <description><![CDATA[Old Roundtop<br/><br/>📍 Dutchess County, NY<br/><br/>A wooded hill along the Taconic Byway corridor between Briggs Mountain and Sheldon Hill, part of the rolling ridgeline that defines this stretch of the drive.<br/><br/>Tips<br/>- A minor stop best combined with nearby Sheldon Hill or Briggs Mountain.<br/><br/>More info: https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=41.922301,-73.754869]]></description>
