  <Placemark>
    <name>Old Village Bakery</name>
    <description><![CDATA[Old Village Bakery is a bakery specializing in baked goods like bread, pastries, and pizza. Prices typically range from $1 to $30 per person. It is open for breakfast and lunch but closed for dinner.<br/><br/>More info: https://www.google.com/maps/place/Old+Village+Bakery/@44.0523908,-71.1286389,593m/data=!3m1!1e3!4m14!1m7!3m6!1s0x4cb3a0bf793f9bfb:0x6c5284ed20196b08!2sVia+Roma+Pizza+%26+Mediterranean!8m2!3d44.0363957!4d-71.1223054!16s%2Fg%2F11r9lxtgw!3m5!1s0x4cb3a0e3156560db:0xae9f6dbfd88a1482!8m2!3d44.0526597!4d-71.1248276!16s%2Fg%2F1vxcw07h?entry=ttu&g_ep=EgoyMDI2MDcxMi4wIKXMDSoASAFQAw%3D%3D]]></description>
