  <Placemark>
    <name>Opechee Bay Laconia NH</name>
    <description><![CDATA[Opechee Bay<br/><br/>📍 Laconia, NH<br/><br/>A compact lake right in downtown Laconia, linked to Lake Winnisquam and feeding the Winnipesaukee River. Bond Beach sits on its shore, and it's a quieter counterpart to the bustle of nearby Weirs Beach on the main lake.<br/><br/>Tips<br/>- Pairs naturally with a stop at Belknap Mill, a short walk from the water.<br/><br/>More info: https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=43.5475%2C%20-71.4747]]></description>
