    <name>Opera House Arts (Stonington Opera House) Stonington ME</name>
    <description><![CDATA[Opera House Arts (Stonington Opera House)<br/><br/>📍 Stonington ME<br/><br/>Beautifully restored 1912 opera house hosting film, music, and theater year-round.<br/><br/>Tips<br/>- Check the events calendar for what's playing during the trip.]]></description>
