  <Placemark>
    <name>Orvis Sandanona Shooting Preserve Millbrook NY</name>
    <description><![CDATA[Orvis Sandanona Shooting Preserve<br/><br/>📍 3047 Sharon Turnpike Road, Millbrook, NY 12545<br/><br/>The oldest permitted shooting club in the US, now used as a venue for the Orvis Shooting and Flyfishing Schools. The main clubhouse dates back to the presidency of Thomas Jefferson; the 400-acre property has hosted wingshooters ever since.<br/><br/>Tips<br/>- Call 845/677-9701 for visitor information.<br/>- Stop 3 of 17 on the Washington & Amenia Scenic Tour (Tour 4).<br/>- Marked purple on curatorial judgment, not a numeric Rating — 98% Facebook recommend (372 reviews), consistently glowing reviews, oldest permitted shooting club in the US. No confirmed Google or TripAdvisor star figure found.]]></description>
