    <name>Osborn Finch Wildlife Sanctuary Waldoboro ME</name>
    <description><![CDATA[Osborn Finch Wildlife Sanctuary<br/><br/>📍 Dutch Neck Road, 2.5 mi down (grassy parking area), Waldoboro, ME<br/><br/>11-acre preserve — 2 acres of field plus 9 acres of moss-draped woods holding some of the Midcoast's oldest spruce, with 300 ft of Medomak River shorefront and a rustic former cabin. ~0.4-0.6 mi out and back.<br/><br/>Tips<br/>- Furthest-flung of this batch — ~13 mi from Damariscotta<br/><br/>More info: https://www.coastalrivers.org/trails/osborn-finch-wildlife-sanctuary/]]></description>
