  <Placemark>
    <name>Osteria by Capri Palm Beach County FL</name>
    <description><![CDATA[Overview<br/>Type: Restaurant<br/><br/>Best known for: Amazing food, excellent service<br/><br/>Location context: Attached to the Hilton hotel<br/><br/>Price level: $20–70<br/><br/>Visit timing: Not mentioned<br/><br/>Typical Customers<br/>Demographics: Mostly couples and larger groups<br/><br/>Group types: Couples, friends, families, larger groups<br/><br/>Common occasions: Date night, casual dinner, special occasions<br/><br/>Vibe & Setting<br/>Atmosphere: Casual, lively, family-friendly<br/><br/>Noise level: Moderate<br/><br/>Decor & setting: Indoor seating, bar<br/><br/>Service style: Attentive and friendly<br/><br/>Recommended Dishes<br/>Overall dish consensus<br/>Reviewers highlight the Tomahawk Steak and Rigatoni as must-order items, with the Tiramisu also receiving strong praise.<br/><br/>How “top dishes” are determined<br/>Top dishes are identified based on mentions in reviews, popularity in photos, and specific recommendations from customers detailing their experiences.<br/><br/>| Rank | Dish               | Why it stands out                                      | How often it’s mentioned          | Ideal for              |<br/>|------|-------------------|-------------------------------------------------------|-----------------------------------|------------------------|<br/>| 1    | Tomahawk Steak    | Exceptional flavor and presentation                   | Repeatedly called out as a favorite | Hearty main           |<br/>| 2    | Rigatoni          | A showstopper dish with great flavor                  | Mentioned in many reviews          | Sharing at the table   |<br/>| 3    | Tiramisu          | Notable dessert, praised for its texture and taste    | Appears in numerous photos         | Sweet finish           |<br/><br/>Good alternates / backup choices<br/>- Lemon Drop: Notable as a refreshing cocktail choice.<br/>- Canoli: Praised for being a delightful dessert option.<br/><br/>Highlights (non‑dish positives from reviews)<br/>Service: Reviewers consistently mention friendly and prompt service from the staff.<br/><br/>Atmosphere: The restaurant's lively and welcoming vibe enhances the dining experience.<br/><br/>Handling large groups: The staff is noted for efficiently serving large parties without delays.<br/><br/>Common Issues (from reviews)<br/>Food quality inconsistency: Some reviewers mentioned issues with certain dishes, like the salmon, which was reported as tasting bad.<br/><br/>Occasional wait times: Although many reviews praise the quick service, some guests reported longer waits during busier periods.<br/><br/>Practical Notes<br/>Reservation / wait: Not mentioned<br/><br/>Accessibility: Not mentioned<br/><br/>Parking / transit: Not mentioned<br/><br/>Best use case: Great for date nights and special occasions.<br/><br/>More info: https://www.google.com/maps/place/Osteria+by+Capri/@26.6795325,-80.0791668,15.24z/data=!4m14!1m7!3m6!1s0x88d8d783ebb25119:0x22d70db95097a1d5!2sOsteria+by+Capri!8m2!3d26.6781745!4d-80.0726993!16s%2Fg%2F11w8ksh8z6!3m5!1s0x88d8d783ebb25119:0x22d70db95097a1d5!8m2!3d26.6781745!4d-80.0726993!16s%2Fg%2F11w8ksh8z6?entry=ttu&g_ep=EgoyMDI2MDYxMC4wIKXMDSoASAFQAw%3D%3D]]></description>
