    <name>Ottauquechee Yacht Club Woodstock VT</name>
    <description><![CDATA[Ottauquechee Yacht Club serves American cuisine with comfort food options, pricing around $20-30 per person. It is open for dinner until 9 PM and serves alcohol.<br/><br/>More info: https://www.google.com/maps/place/Ottauquechee+Yacht+Club/@43.6187904,-72.5455909,6145m/data=!3m1!1e3!4m13!1m5!2m4!1srestaurants+with+reservations!5m1!4e9!6e5!3m6!1s0x89e1d9a7942a1531:0x856eccc3bf9740d4!8m2!3d43.6287615!4d-72.5063864!15sCh1yZXN0YXVyYW50cyB3aXRoIHJlc2VydmF0aW9ucyIyUjAvZ2VvL3R5cGUvZXN0YWJsaXNobWVudF9wb2kvYWNjZXB0c19yZXNlcnZhdGlvbnNaDSILcmVzdGF1cmFudHOSAQpyZXN0YXVyYW50mgEjQ2haRFNVaE5NRzluUzBWSlEwRm5TVVJmY3poSGRsQlJFQUXgAQD6AQQIABA6!16s%2Fg%2F11vklg4mcz?entry=ttu&g_ep=EgoyMDI2MDYyMy4wIKXMDSoASAFQAw%3D%3D]]></description>
