  <Placemark>
    <name>Otter Bog Mountain Franklin ME</name>
    <description><![CDATA[Otter Bog Mountain<br/><br/>📍 Near Franklin, ME<br/><br/>A peak near the western edge of the Donnell Pond area, along the Blackwoods Scenic Byway corridor.<br/><br/>Tips<br/>- No well-documented public trail found — treat as a landmark rather than a planned hike unless you find current access info locally.<br/><br/>More info: https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=44.6195%2C%20-68.1453]]></description>
