    <name>Otyokwa Cabins Bremen ME</name>
    <description><![CDATA[Otyokwa Cabins<br/><br/>📍 244 Nobleboro Rd, Bremen, ME 04551<br/><br/>Historic lakeside cabin retreat on Lake Pemaquid with private shoreline and a cluster of preserved early-20th-century camp buildings. Also offers houseboat rentals.<br/><br/>More info: https://www.otyokwamaine.com/]]></description>
