  <Placemark>
    <name>Outer Bar Harwich MA</name>
    <description><![CDATA[Overview<br/>Type: Restaurant<br/><br/>Best known for: Great food and exceptional service; beautiful waterfront views.<br/><br/>Location context: Wequassett Resort area.<br/><br/>Price level: $30–50 per person<br/><br/>Visit timing: Not mentioned<br/><br/>Typical Customers<br/>Demographics: Couples and tourists.<br/><br/>Group types: Couples, families, groups.<br/><br/>Common occasions: Casual dinner, special occasions, dining with scenic views.<br/><br/>Vibe & Setting<br/>Atmosphere: Casual with a lively environment.<br/><br/>Noise level: Moderate.<br/><br/>Decor & setting: Indoor and outdoor seating; beautiful views of the pool and ocean.<br/><br/>Service style: Attentive and professional.<br/><br/>Recommended Dishes<br/>Overall dish consensus<br/>Reviewers frequently recommend the Fish Tacos and Crispy Calamari, praising their flavor and presentation. The Fish and Chips also receives strong mentions for its quality.<br/><br/>How “top dishes” are determined<br/>Top dishes are based on frequent mentions and high praise in reviews, along with popularity in visual content provided by the place page.<br/><br/>| Rank | Dish             | Why it stands out                                         | How often it’s mentioned                       | Ideal for                     |<br/>|------|------------------|---------------------------------------------------------|------------------------------------------------|---------------------------------|<br/>| 1    | Fish Tacos       | Known for excellent flavor and presentation.            | Mentioned in numerous reviews.                 | Sharing at the table           |<br/>| 2    | Crispy Calamari  | Praised for its crispy texture and taste.              | Frequently called out as a favorite.           | Appetizer for groups           |<br/>| 3    | Fish and Chips   | Exceptional quality and popular among diners.           | Repeatedly called out in reviews.               | Hearty main                    |<br/><br/>Good alternates / backup choices<br/>- Shrimp: Noted for its delightful taste.<br/>- Clam Chowder: Mentioned as a comforting option.<br/><br/>Highlights (non-dish positives from reviews)<br/>View: Incredible views of the ocean praised in multiple reviews.<br/><br/>Service: Attentive service consistently mentioned as a strong point.<br/><br/>Common Issues (from reviews)<br/>Price: Considered expensive by some diners.<br/><br/>Busy Times: Not mentioned.<br/><br/>Practical Notes<br/>Reservation / wait: Not mentioned.<br/><br/>Accessibility: Not mentioned.<br/><br/>Parking / transit: Not mentioned.<br/><br/>Best use case: Great for couples or special occasions seeking scenic waterfront dining.<br/><br/>More info: https://www.google.com/maps/place/Outer+Bar/@41.7228283,-69.9978946,820m/data=!3m2!1e3!5s0x89fb6b2475017db5:0x47735e9ff8720dc2!4m14!1m7!3m6!1s0x89fb6b2c2c9eb68d:0x43679028a22560c6!2stwenty-eight+Atlantic!8m2!3d41.7228283!4d-69.9953197!16s%2Fg%2F1tjfc93k!3m5!1s0x89fb6b26b3fe43ad:0x1c4690cc7e9a6c88!8m2!3d41.7215545!4d-69.9949875!16s%2Fg%2F1232kg048?entry=ttu&g_ep=EgoyMDI2MDYxMC4wIKXMDSoASAFQAw%3D%3D]]></description>
