  <Placemark>
    <name>Overlook Mountain Trail Woodstock, NY</name>
    <description><![CDATA[Overlook Mountain Trail<br/><br/>📍 Woodstock, NY<br/><br/>A 4.6-mile out-and-back trail to a Catskill fire tower via 19th-century mountaintop hotel ruins — one of the most popular and rewarding hikes in the Catskills.<br/><br/>Tips<br/>- Trailhead parking fills by 9 AM weekends — arrive early<br/>- Hotel ruins at 1.5 miles; fire tower at summit (2.3 miles); 1,400 ft gain<br/>- Allow 3–4 hours round trip; moderate difficulty<br/><br/>More info: https://www.google.com/maps/search/Overlook+Mountain+Trail+Woodstock,+NY]]></description>
    <styleUrl>#c-purple</styleUrl>
