  <Placemark>
    <name>Owls Head General Store</name>
    <description><![CDATA[Owls Head General Store is a casual hamburger restaurant with prices ranging from $10 to $20. It is open daily from 7 AM to 7 PM except Tuesdays, and they do not serve alcohol.<br/><br/>More info: https://www.google.com/maps/place/Owls+Head+General+Store/@44.08514,-69.200832,18853m/data=!3m1!1e3!4m13!1m5!2m4!1sRestaurants!5m1!4e9!6e5!3m6!1s0x4cadcdeadda01e2f:0x98cb8630b1f6c5fa!8m2!3d44.0823809!4d-69.0574331!15sCgtSZXN0YXVyYW50c1oNIgtyZXN0YXVyYW50c5IBFGhhbWJ1cmdlcl9yZXN0YXVyYW50mgFEQ2k5RFFVbFJRVU52WkVOb2RIbGpSamx2VDI1b05rOVlhRmxSYWxsNFlXcEdOV014Y0hCa1JFcFNVakowUjFsdVl4QULgAQD6AQQIABAs!16s%2Fg%2F11b7r62wjk?entry=ttu&g_ep=EgoyMDI2MDcxMy4wIKXMDSoASAFQAw%3D%3D]]></description>
