    <description><![CDATA[Owls Head Light State Park<br/><br/>📍 Owls Head ME<br/><br/>Classic 1825 lighthouse on a short wooded walk with sweeping Penobscot Bay views.<br/><br/>Tips<br/>- Short, family-friendly walk to the lighthouse.<br/>- Great sunset spot.]]></description>
