    <name>Owls Head Transportation Museum Owls Head ME</name>
    <description><![CDATA[Owls Head Transportation Museum<br/><br/>📍 Owls Head ME<br/><br/>World-class operating collection of pre-1940 cars, aircraft, and engines, with seasonal flying and driving demonstrations.<br/><br/>Tips<br/>- Check the event calendar — flying/driving demo days are the best time to visit.<br/>- Pair with Owls Head Light for a half-day trip.]]></description>
