  <Placemark>
    <name>Owls Head Transportation Museum</name>
    <description><![CDATA[The Owls Head Transportation Museum is primarily a museum focused on vintage cars, bikes, and planes. There is no mention of food service, so it's likely not a dining establishment. The museum has an admission price of $14.00 and opens at 10 AM. Dinner service is not applicable since it is a museum.<br/><br/>More info: https://www.google.com/maps/place/Owls+Head+Transportation+Museum/@44.0700465,-69.1052271,6972m/data=!3m1!1e3!4m15!1m8!3m7!1s0x4cadcc4c5f4aa20d:0x7a26e129ee369379!2sOwls+Head,+ME!3b1!8m2!3d44.082303!4d-69.0572612!16zL20vMHRxaHA!3m5!1s0x4cadce814f7b9b37:0x156067790879abb6!8m2!3d44.0655817!4d-69.1025709!16s%2Fg%2F1tdpr7wc?entry=ttu&g_ep=EgoyMDI2MDcxMy4wIKXMDSoASAFQAw%3D%3D]]></description>
