  <Placemark>
    <name>Oxbow Brewing Company Newcastle ME</name>
    <description><![CDATA[Time: 2026-08-10T17:00:00<br/><br/>Oxbow Brewing Company<br/><br/>📍 Rural Newcastle, ME (dirt driveway location)<br/><br/>A farmhouse tasting room tucked down a dirt driveway in rural Newcastle, described as a "low-key rural brewpub" with pond-side outdoor seating. Brews Belgian-style farmhouse ales on-site—a genuine farm brewery experience without the tourist polish.<br/><br/>Tips<br/>- Rural location, down dirt driveway<br/>- Farmhouse brewery atmosphere<br/>- Pond-side seating<br/>- Belgian-style farmhouse ales<br/>- Very low-key, locals' spot<br/>- Worth seeking out for authentic brewery experience]]></description>
