  <Placemark>
    <name>Oysterhead Pizza Damariscotta ME</name>
    <description><![CDATA[Oysterhead Pizza Co.<br/><br/>📍 189 Main St, Damariscotta, ME<br/><br/>Wood-fired pizza with a distinctly Damariscotta twist — local oysters and craft beer alongside handcrafted pies, right on Main Street with river views. Rated 4.7 on Google.<br/><br/>Must Order<br/>- Wood-fired pizza, any of the local-ingredient specials<br/>- Local oysters<br/>- Craft beer on tap<br/><br/>Tips<br/>- Closed Mondays; open Tuesday–Saturday, 11:30am–7pm.<br/>- River-view seating is worth requesting.<br/>- Good pairing with a walk along Main Street's historic district, right outside the door.<br/><br/>More info: https://www.oysterheadpizzaco.com/]]></description>
