    <description><![CDATA[Page Hill<br/><br/>📍 Near Lancaster, NH<br/><br/>A hill near Lancaster, along the Woodland Heritage Scenic Byway corridor.<br/><br/>Tips<br/>- No well-documented public trail found — treat as a landmark rather than a planned hike unless you find current access info locally.<br/><br/>More info: https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=44.5176%2C%20-71.5395]]></description>
