  <Placemark>
    <name>Papa Jack’s</name>
    <description><![CDATA[Sub Somboon Street Food, located at 1084 Commercial St, offers delicious Southeast Asian street food with prices ranging from $10 to $20. It opens for lunch and dinner, but it's currently closed and reopens at 11:30 AM. It does not serve alcohol.<br/><br/>More info: https://www.google.com/maps/place/Papa+Jack%E2%80%99s/@44.08514,-69.200832,18853m/data=!3m1!1e3!4m13!1m5!2m4!1sRestaurants!5m1!4e9!6e5!3m6!1s0x4caddb6c743ce5d7:0x3b3bb0e7ca1531e2!8m2!3d44.1559802!4d-69.1846692!15sCgtSZXN0YXVyYW50c1oNIgtyZXN0YXVyYW50c5IBDW1lYWxfdGFrZWF3YXmaASNDaFpEU1VoTk1HOW5TMFZKUTBGblNVTjRhRTVRWjFKUkVBReABAPoBBAgAECE!16s%2Fg%2F11rwykph8w?entry=ttu&g_ep=EgoyMDI2MDcxMy4wIKXMDSoASAFQAw%3D%3D]]></description>
