    <name>Paradise Hill Overlook Bar Harbor ME</name>
    <description><![CDATA[Paradise Hill Overlook<br/><br/>📍 Paradise Hill Rd, Bar Harbor, ME<br/><br/>A perfectly serene spot reviewers specifically call out for sunrise — quiet and off the main Park Loop Road circuit. (4.7★, 47 reviews on Google Maps)<br/><br/>Tips<br/>- Good sunrise spot per reviews — worth an early start<br/>- Distinct from the Cadillac Mountain summit, further down Paradise Hill Rd]]></description>
