  <Placemark>
    <name>Parish Cafe &amp; Bar</name>
    <description><![CDATA[Parish Café & Bar serves American cuisine with a variety of unique sandwiches, burgers, and craft beers. Prices range from $20–30, and it is open for both lunch and dinner, serving alcohol.<br/><br/>More info: https://www.google.com/maps/place/Parish+Cafe+%26+Bar/@42.3502957,-71.0797847,3054m/data=!3m1!1e3!4m6!3m5!1s0x89e37a74e3c3b6d5:0xa365d79110179ce5!8m2!3d42.3518585!4d-71.0716663!16s%2Fg%2F11b6g9wgsz?entry=ttu&g_ep=EgoyMDI2MDYyOS4wIKXMDSoASAFQAw%3D%3D]]></description>
