  </Placemark>
  <Placemark>
    <name>Parking - Pemaquid Point Lighthouse ME</name>
    <description><![CDATA[Time: 2026-08-07T08:15:00<br/><br/>Parking — Pemaquid Point Lighthouse<br/><br/>📍 Pemaquid Point Lighthouse Park, New Harbor, ME<br/><br/>The park's own lot, right at the site. This is the most crowded single stop on the peninsula — ~100,000 visitors/year through a small lot.<br/><br/>Tips<br/>- Arrive before 10am, especially on sunny summer weekends — the lot fills and overflow options are limited.<br/>- $4/person park admission at the gate.<br/>- If the lot is full, there's no good nearby overflow — better to circle back later in the day (after 4-5pm) than wait.]]></description>
    <styleUrl>#c-gray</styleUrl>
