    <name>Pascal Hall</name>
    <description><![CDATA[Nina June is a restaurant located at 24 Central St, offering various dishes with prices ranging from $60 to $70. It is closed during lunch and opens for dinner at 5 PM; it does not specify if it serves alcohol.<br/><br/>More info: https://www.google.com/maps/place/Pascal+Hall/@44.1848602,-69.0837524,1225m/data=!3m1!1e3!4m10!1m3!2m2!1sThings+to+do!6e1!3m5!1s0x4cadd7d622a201ff:0x4fc701807f28fe19!8m2!3d44.18486!4d-69.0764101!16s%2Fg%2F11tjd556wx?entry=ttu&g_ep=EgoyMDI2MDcxMy4wIKXMDSoASAFQAw%3D%3D]]></description>
