  <Placemark>
    <name>Peacham Village Historic District Peacham VT</name>
    <description><![CDATA[Peacham Village Historic District<br/><br/>📍 Peacham VT<br/><br/>Designated one of New England's best villages by Yankee Magazine — an iconic 1794 Federal-style church and Greek Revival homes overlooking rolling hills with White Mountains views, one of the most photographed villages in New England.<br/><br/>Tips<br/>- Best for a scenic drive-through and photos — quiet, residential village.<br/>- Combine with a Northeast Kingdom scenic loop.]]></description>
