  <Placemark>
    <name>Peekytoe Provisions</name>
    <description><![CDATA[Dinner is an American restaurant located at 135 Cottage St, with prices ranging from $30 to $70. It is closed now and opens at 5 PM, and serves alcohol.<br/><br/>More info: https://www.google.com/maps/place/Peekytoe+Provisions/@44.3867007,-68.2234216,2242m/data=!3m1!1e3!4m13!1m5!2m4!1sRestaurants!5m1!4e9!6e5!3m6!1s0x4caebf64f35c1743:0xabb9bffcff5a72d2!8m2!3d44.3859521!4d-68.20366!15sCgtSZXN0YXVyYW50c1oNIgtyZXN0YXVyYW50c5IBEnNlYWZvb2RfcmVzdGF1cmFudJoBRENpOURRVWxSUVVOdlpFTm9kSGxqUmpsdlQydFdSRlpWVVhoYWF6RjZaVzFLUWxaRVFUUlJWVVpNVkc1Q1RWRllZeEFC4AEA-gEFCM8BEDY!16s%2Fg%2F11b6gjwdtb?entry=ttu&g_ep=EgoyMDI2MDcwOC4wIKXMDSoASAFQAw%3D%3D]]></description>
