  <Placemark>
    <name>Penobscot Marine Museum Searsport ME</name>
    <description><![CDATA[Penobscot Marine Museum<br/><br/>The Penobscot Marine Museum in nearby Searsport is one of the region’s best resources for understanding the maritime world of Penobscot Bay. Travel guides describe it as a museum complex with historic buildings and exhibits devoted to ships, seafaring, and coastal Maine history.[cite:35][cite:34]<br/><br/>Its significance goes beyond Belfast itself because it provides wider context for the working harbor culture visitors encounter along the bay. For anyone exploring Belfast’s waterfront, the museum deepens the story behind the boats, shipping traditions, and coastal communities of the area.[cite:35][cite:37]]]></description>
