  <Placemark>
    <name>Penobscot Marine Museum</name>
    <description><![CDATA[The Penobscot Marine Museum is a museum focused on maritime history. It has interactive exhibits suitable for all ages, offering a variety of displays related to boats and small watercraft. The museum is open on Thursdays, Fridays, Tuesdays, and Wednesdays from 10 AM to 5 PM, and closed on Mondays and Sundays. It does not serve food or alcohol.<br/><br/>More info: https://www.google.com/maps/place/Penobscot+Marine+Museum/@44.4707433,-68.9663773,8069m/data=!3m1!1e3!4m13!1m5!2m4!1sattractions!5m1!4e9!6e1!3m6!1s0x4cae68b3041fa30d:0x392b74d33c661147!8m2!3d44.4588134!4d-68.9253486!15sCgthdHRyYWN0aW9uc1oNIgthdHRyYWN0aW9uc5IBBm11c2V1bZoBI0NoWkRTVWhOTUc5blMwVkpRMEZuU1VOMWNqVjJkRkZSRUFF4AEA-gEFCI0BEDk!16zL20vMGMwY3Bx?entry=ttu&g_ep=EgoyMDI2MDcxMy4wIKXMDSoASAFQAw%3D%3D]]></description>
