  <Placemark>
    <name>Perry's Lobster Shack Surry ME</name>
    <description><![CDATA[Perry's Lobster Shack<br/><br/>📍 Surry, ME<br/><br/>Remote location with waitstaff-served dining and views to Mount Desert Island's peaks. Off-the-beaten-path reward for extra driving effort.<br/><br/>Tips<br/>- Remote location, off main tourist routes<br/>- Waitstaff service (more formal than typical shacks)<br/>- Mount Desert Island peak views<br/>- Worth the drive for solitude and scenery]]></description>
