  <Placemark>
    <name>Peter Ott's on the Water Camden ME</name>
    <description><![CDATA[Peter Ott's on the Water<br/><br/>📍 16 Bayview Lndg, Camden, ME<br/><br/>A Camden institution — over 40 years serving the harbor, with panoramic water views and a menu spanning American classics: steaks, pastas, and local seafood. Rated 4.3 on Google (one of the most-reviewed restaurants in town — Restaurant Guru shows a notably higher 4.8, but Google is the more commonly checked figure and the one used here). Some reports of inconsistency (a burnt burger, thin chowder here and there) match the more middling Google number better than Restaurant Guru's.<br/><br/>Must Order<br/>- Lobster fettuccine alfredo<br/>- Lobster roll<br/>- Haddock sandwich<br/>- Steamed clams or oysters on the half shell to start<br/>- Sweet potato fries<br/><br/>Tips<br/>- Open Mon–Thu 11:30am–9pm, Fri–Sat until 10pm, Sun until 9pm.<br/>- Reserve ahead, especially for a water-view table: use the online booking link or call directly.<br/>- A dependable, crowd-pleasing pick if the group can't agree on something more adventurous — broad menu, reliable execution, real harbor views.<br/><br/>More info: https://www.google.com/maps/place/Peter+Ott's+on+the+Water/@44.2087471,-69.064961,261m/data=!3m1!1e3!4m13!1m5!2m4!1sRestaurants!5m1!4e9!6e5!3m6!1s0x4cadd70c1ac04bc3:0xdd18fdf602b6d9e0!8m2!3d44.2094341!4d-69.0632552!15sCgtSZXN0YXVyYW50c1oNIgtyZXN0YXVyYW50c5IBEnNlYWZvb2RfcmVzdGF1cmFudJoBJENoZERTVWhOTUc5blMwVkpRMEZuU1VOd05qbHRVVEpCUlJBQuABAPoBBAgAEEo!16s%2Fg%2F1ttq1q2m?entry=ttu&g_ep=EgoyMDI2MDYwOS4wIKXMDSoASAFQAw%3D%3D]]></description>
