  <Placemark>
    <name>Phoenicia Diner Phoenicia, NY</name>
    <description><![CDATA[Phoenicia Diner<br/><br/>📍 Phoenicia, NY<br/><br/>A famous retro diner serving elevated diner classics that has become a destination in its own right — appeared in Severance and draws visitors from NYC specifically for the experience.<br/><br/>Tips<br/>- Arrive before 9 AM or after 2 PM on weekends to avoid long waits<br/>- The breakfast burrito and pancakes are standouts<br/>- A quintessential Catskills photo stop even without eating<br/><br/>More info: https://www.google.com/maps/search/Phoenicia+Diner+Phoenicia,+NY]]></description>
