  <Placemark>
    <name>Phos Catskill, NY</name>
    <description><![CDATA[Phos<br/><br/>📍 Catskill, NY<br/><br/>An upscale Greek-Mediterranean restaurant in Catskill with impeccable service, sophisticated Mediterranean dishes, and one of Greene County's most serious cocktail programs.<br/><br/>Must Order<br/>- Whole grilled fish — prepared with classic Mediterranean simplicity<br/>- Lamb dishes — Greek-inflected and expertly seasoned<br/>- Mezze spread — an excellent way to begin<br/><br/>Tips<br/>- Reservations essential — small room, very popular<br/>- Just across the river from Hudson — easy to combine with an Olana visit<br/><br/>More info: https://www.google.com/maps/search/Phos+Catskill,+NY]]></description>
