  <Placemark>
    <name>Pie In The Sky Bakery &amp; Cafe Woods Hole MA</name>
    <description><![CDATA[Pie In The Sky Bakery & Cafe<br/><br/>📍 Woods Hole MA<br/><br/>Beloved scratch bakery/cafe steps from the Martha's Vineyard ferry terminal — a destination for pastries and coffee before the boat.<br/><br/>Must Order<br/>- Pastries<br/>- Coffee<br/><br/>Tips<br/>- Arrive a few minutes before the ferry — great pre-boarding stop.<br/>- Lines move quickly; order at the counter.]]></description>
