  <Placemark>
    <name>Pilgrim Monument &amp; Provincetown Museum Provincetown MA</name>
    <description><![CDATA[Pilgrim Monument & Provincetown Museum<br/><br/>📍 Provincetown MA<br/><br/>The tallest all-granite structure in the US, commemorating the Mayflower's first landing; museum covers maritime, LGBTQ+, and Wampanoag history.<br/><br/>Tips<br/>- The climb to the top (116 steps + ramps) is worth it for panoramic Cape views.<br/>- Allow about 90 minutes for monument + museum.]]></description>
