    <name>Pine Brook Covered Bridge Waitsfield VT</name>
    <description><![CDATA[Pine Brook Covered Bridge<br/><br/>📍 Near Waitsfield, VT<br/><br/>A historic covered bridge over Pine Brook near Waitsfield, listed on the National Register of Historic Places.<br/><br/>Tips<br/>- A quick photo stop, easily combined with a Waitsfield village visit.<br/><br/>More info: https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=44.2057%2C%20-72.7921]]></description>
