  <Placemark>
    <name>Pisces Coastal Kitchen Chatham MA</name>
    <description><![CDATA[Overview<br/>Type: Seafood Restaurant  <br/>Best known for: Mediterranean-flecked seafood dishes and a cozy atmosphere. Known for excellent service.  <br/>Location context: Chatham area, known for seafood spots.  <br/>Price level: $50–100  <br/>Visit timing: Dinner service available, opens at 5 PM.<br/><br/>Typical Customers  <br/>Demographics: Locals and tourists, couples, and families.  <br/>Group types: Couples, families, and larger groups.  <br/>Common occasions: Casual dinners and date nights.<br/><br/>Vibe & Setting  <br/>Atmosphere: Cozy and casual, with a warm and welcoming feel.  <br/>Noise level: Moderate.  <br/>Decor & setting: Indoor seating in a quaint space, typical of a charming house.  <br/>Service style: Attentive and friendly service.<br/><br/>Recommended Dishes  <br/>Overall dish consensus: Reviewers rave about the Rib Eye Steak and Fisherman's Platter, highlighting their freshness and quality. The mussels and seafood dishes are praised as well.  <br/>How “top dishes” are determined: Dishes are selected based on frequent mentions in user reviews and their positive reception, particularly those highlighted in remarks about their flavor and presentation.<br/><br/>| Rank | Dish                               | Why it stands out                                         | How often it’s mentioned                  | Ideal for               |<br/>|------|------------------------------------|----------------------------------------------------------|------------------------------------------|-------------------------|<br/>| 1    | Rib Eye Steak                      | Cooked perfectly with great flavor and tenderness.      | Repeatedly called out as a favorite.    | Hearty main.           |<br/>| 2    | Fisherman's Platter                | A diverse selection of seafood, fresh and well-prepared. | Appears in numerous reviews.             | Sharing at the table.   |<br/>| 3    | Mussels                            | Tasty and well-received, great for starters.            | Mentioned in many reviews.               | Appetizer for sharing.  |<br/><br/>Good alternates / backup choices  <br/>- Tres Leches Cake: Notable for its flavor and creaminess.  <br/>- Roasted Salmon and Sea Scallops: Praised for its freshness.  <br/>- Caesar Salad: Good as a lighter option.<br/><br/>Highlights (non‑dish positives from reviews)  <br/>Service quality: Consistently praised for attentive and friendly service.  <br/>Atmosphere: Many find it warm and cozy, creating a comfortable dining experience.  <br/><br/>Common Issues (from reviews)  <br/>Spacing: The restaurant is described as having tight spacing between tables, which some may find uncomfortable.  <br/><br/>Practical Notes  <br/>Reservation / wait: Reservations recommended, especially during peak times.  <br/>Accessibility: Not mentioned.  <br/>Parking / transit: Not mentioned.  <br/>Best use case: Great for a date night or a special occasion with family or friends.<br/><br/>More info: https://www.google.com/maps/place/Pisces+Coastal+Kitchen/@41.6785634,-70.0449677,3220m/data=!3m1!1e3!4m11!1m3!2m2!1sfresh+oysters!6e5!3m6!1s0x89fb1574c7ec727d:0xacddf608ee5c2d78!8m2!3d41.6785636!4d-70.0272869!15sCg1mcmVzaCBveXN0ZXJzWg8iDWZyZXNoIG95c3RlcnOSARJzZWFmb29kX3Jlc3RhdXJhbnSaAURDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMjFOTWs5VlNsbFdNVGd5WkZVeGJGUXpWa1ZqVldNeVQxUkdTVk50WXhBQuABAPoBBAhLEEc!16s%2Fg%2F1tdx0l4c?entry=ttu&g_ep=EgoyMDI2MDYxMC4wIKXMDSoASAFQAw%3D%3D]]></description>
