  <Placemark>
    <name>Pizza Shark Chatham MA</name>
    <description><![CDATA[Overview<br/>Type: Pizza Restaurant  <br/>Best known for: Delicious pizza options and a friendly vibe  <br/>Location context: Chatham, Cape Cod  <br/>Price level: $10–20 per person  <br/>Visit timing: Not mentioned  <br/><br/>Typical Customers<br/>Demographics: Locals and tourists  <br/>Group types: Families, couples, and friends  <br/>Common occasions: Casual dinner and quick bites  <br/><br/>Vibe & Setting<br/>Atmosphere: Casual, with a lively vibe  <br/>Noise level: Moderate  <br/>Decor & setting: Indoor seating with a cozy ambiance  <br/>Service style: Attentive and friendly  <br/><br/>Recommended Dishes<br/>Overall dish consensus  <br/>Reviewers highly recommend the Great White Pizza and Chicken Ranch for their flavor and generous portion sizes. Both dishes appear frequently in reviews and photos, suggesting strong popularity.<br/><br/>How “top dishes” are determined  <br/>Top dishes are identified based on mentions in the reviews, with specific items receiving repeated praise and marked as popular in the menu.  <br/><br/>| Rank | Dish                    | Why it stands out                               | How often it’s mentioned           | Ideal for                             |<br/>|------|------------------------|------------------------------------------------|-------------------------------------|---------------------------------------|<br/>| 1    | Great White Pizza      | Amazing flavor and often considered a must-try. | Repeatedly called out as a favorite | Sharing at the table                  |<br/>| 2    | Chicken Ranch          | Generous portion size and delicious taste.      | Mentioned in many reviews           | Hearty main                           |<br/>| 3    | Steak n Cheese         | Well-received for being fulfilling and tasty.   | Appears in numerous photos          | Quick bite                            |<br/><br/>Good alternates / backup choices  <br/>- Cheese Pizza: Known for its crispy texture and fresh flavor.  <br/>- Salad: A lighter option, noted for its freshness.  <br/><br/>Highlights (non‑dish positives from reviews)<br/>Atmosphere: The place has a great vibe, making it a pleasant dining experience.  <br/>Service: Staff are reported to be kind and attentive, enhancing the overall visit.  <br/><br/>Common Issues (from reviews)<br/>Parking: Some reviews mention that parking can be tight in the area.  <br/>Seating: Limited booth seating means it can fill up quickly during peak times.  <br/><br/>Practical Notes<br/>Reservation / wait: Walk-in friendly; no mention of reservations needed.  <br/>Accessibility: Not mentioned  <br/>Parking / transit: Public lot nearby, but parking can be tight.  <br/>Best use case: Great for casual dinners and quick bites with friends.<br/><br/>More info: https://www.google.com/maps/place/Pizza+Shark+Chatham/@41.6815996,-69.9626855,511m/data=!3m1!1e3!4m6!3m5!1s0x89fb152bb675307b:0xb4d1fd3e53844c36!8m2!3d41.6822557!4d-69.9607566!16s%2Fg%2F11pkkw_09l?entry=ttu&g_ep=EgoyMDI2MDYxMC4wIKXMDSoASAFQAw%3D%3D]]></description>
