  <Placemark>
    <name>Pizzeria Posto Rhinebeck, NY</name>
    <description><![CDATA[Pizzeria Posto<br/><br/>📍 Rhinebeck, NY<br/><br/>A wood-fired Neapolitan pizza restaurant with a laser-focused menu and lovely outdoor patio.<br/><br/>Must Order<br/>- Margherita — the benchmark — beautifully charred crust<br/>- Fennel sausage pizza — one of the signature specials<br/><br/>Tips<br/>- Outdoor patio is the best seat on a warm evening<br/>- Arrive early or expect a wait on weekends<br/><br/>More info: https://www.google.com/maps/search/Pizzeria+Posto+Rhinebeck,+NY]]></description>
