    <description><![CDATA[Hiking area, private location; not applicable for food or alcohol, primarily a nature spot for walking and enjoying the outdoors.<br/><br/>More info: https://www.google.com/maps/place/Plaisted+Preserve/@44.0739557,-69.0754495,7572a,35y,2.71t/data=!3m1!1e3!4m15!1m8!3m7!1s0x4cadcc4c5f4aa20d:0x7a26e129ee369379!2sOwls+Head,+ME!3b1!8m2!3d44.082303!4d-69.0572612!16zL20vMHRxaHA!3m5!1s0x4cadcddaa640a927:0x58c83f016c0a1f25!8m2!3d44.0848238!4d-69.0624918!16s%2Fg%2F11gl20bxlh?entry=ttu&g_ep=EgoyMDI2MDcxMy4wIKXMDSoASAFQAw%3D%3D]]></description>
