    <name>Pleasant Plains Presbyterian Church Clinton NY</name>
    <description><![CDATA[Pleasant Plains Presbyterian Church<br/><br/>📍 Clinton, NY<br/><br/>At the (Y) intersection, this white frame Greek Revival structure is a hamlet landmark dating from the organization of the congregation in 1837. 18th- and 19th-century farms line the road to the Hollow and Hibernia Mills, a main east-west artery in this area.<br/><br/>Tips<br/>- Stop 13 of 26 on the Hyde Park, Clinton & Pleasant Valley Scenic Tour (Tour 3).]]></description>
