  <Placemark>
    <name>Pleasant Valley Presbyterian Church &amp; Burial Ground NY</name>
    <description><![CDATA[Pleasant Valley Presbyterian Church & Burial Ground<br/><br/>📍 Pleasant Valley, NY<br/><br/>The congregation, formed 1765, constructed its first church in 1770. The present brick Greek Revival structure was built in 1848. The adjacent burial ground contains many early stones.<br/><br/>Tips<br/>- Stop 20 of 26 on the Hyde Park, Clinton & Pleasant Valley Scenic Tour (Tour 3).]]></description>
