  <Placemark>
    <name>Poets' Walk Park Red Hook NY</name>
    <description><![CDATA[Poets' Walk Park<br/><br/>📍 River Rd (CR 103), Red Hook, NY<br/><br/>A romantic landscape park reflecting 19th century American landscape design, featuring two miles of walking trails through woods and open fields, with rustic cedar pavilions.<br/><br/>Tips<br/>- Stop 7 of 33 on the Rhinebeck, Red Hook & Milan Scenic Tour (Tour 1).<br/>- Rating is TripAdvisor's figure (37 reviews) — ranked #1 of 23 attractions in Red Hook.]]></description>
