  <Placemark>
    <name>Polish Princess Bakery Lancaster NH</name>
    <description><![CDATA[Polish Princess Bakery<br/><br/>📍 Lancaster NH<br/><br/>European-style bakery on Main St known for kolaches, pierogi, artisan breads, and espresso.<br/><br/>Must Order<br/>- Kolaches<br/>- Pierogi<br/><br/>Tips<br/>- Good breakfast/coffee stop on the way through Lancaster.]]></description>
