  <Placemark>
    <name>Pond Hill Gorham NH</name>
    <description><![CDATA[Pond Hill<br/><br/>📍 Near Gorham, NH<br/><br/>A hill near Gorham, along the Woodland Heritage Scenic Byway corridor.<br/><br/>Tips<br/>- No well-documented public trail found — treat as a landmark rather than a planned hike unless you find current access info locally.<br/><br/>More info: https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=44.4187%2C%20-71.3548]]></description>
