  <Placemark>
    <name>Poore Family Homestead Historic Farm Museum Colebrook NH</name>
    <description><![CDATA[Poore Family Homestead Historic Farm Museum<br/><br/>📍 Colebrook, NH<br/><br/>A remarkable 100-acre time capsule: one family's working farm from the 1830s through the 1980s, preserved with its original buildings, artifacts, and land largely untouched by modern development. A rare, authentic look at 150 years of rural North Country life through a single family's story.<br/><br/>Tips<br/>- Check current open hours/season before visiting — small rural museums like this often run limited schedules.<br/><br/>More info: https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=44.9022%2C%20-71.4910]]></description>
    <styleUrl>#c-green</styleUrl>
