  <Placemark>
    <name>Port Clyde ME</name>
    <description><![CDATA[View website<br/><br/>Monhegan Boat Line — Port Clyde<br/><br/>📍 880 Port Clyde Road, Port Clyde, ME<br/><br/>The only year-round ferry service to Monhegan Island, a 10-mile crossing of Muscongus Bay. Port Clyde is the closest of the three mainland departure points to Camden (~45 min drive) and the most established/reliable option.<br/><br/>Tips<br/>- Phone (207) 372-8848 for current schedule/fares; book online via their ticketing system<br/>- Check the Ferry Schedule page for current departure times<br/>- Closest departure point to Camden of the three options (Port Clyde, New Harbor, Boothbay Harbor)<br/><br/>More info: https://monheganboat.com/]]></description>
