      <coordinates>-70.2573592,43.6592404,0</coordinates>
    </Point>
  </Placemark>
  <Placemark>
    <name>Portland Farmers Market Portland ME</name>
    <description><![CDATA[Portland Farmers' Market<br/><br/>📍 Deering Oaks Park, Portland, ME 04101<br/><br/>Portland's flagship farmers' market runs every Wednesday and Saturday in Deering Oaks Park, a short walk from the Old Port. Vendors sell exclusively Maine-grown and -produced goods — fresh produce, meats, dairy, baked goods, flowers, and artisan crafts — making it one of the most established markets in the state.<br/><br/>Tips<br/>- Wednesdays and Saturdays, 7 AM–1 PM (8 AM start once November hits); season runs April 18 – November 25, 2026<br/>- Cash and card both widely accepted; some vendors take EBT/Harvest Bucks<br/>- Combine with a walk around Deering Oaks Park's pond and rose garden, or continue on to Old Port<br/><br/>More info: https://www.google.com/maps/search/Portland+Farmers+Market+Deering+Oaks+Park+Portland+ME]]></description>
    <styleUrl>#c-green</styleUrl>
    <ExtendedData>
      <Data name="vault_type"><value>Farm</value></Data>
