  <Placemark>
    <name>Potters Ledge Stark NH</name>
    <description><![CDATA[Potters Ledge<br/><br/>📍 Near Stark, NH<br/><br/>A peak near Stark, along the Woodland Heritage Scenic Byway corridor.<br/><br/>Tips<br/>- No well-documented public trail found — treat as a landmark rather than a planned hike unless you find current access info locally.<br/><br/>More info: https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=44.6348%2C%20-71.4276]]></description>
