  <Placemark>
    <name>Poughkeepsie Gateway Murals NY</name>
    <description><![CDATA[Poughkeepsie Gateway Murals<br/><br/>📍 41 Main St, Poughkeepsie, NY<br/><br/>A community mural project at the Route 9 underpass on Main Street, part of Poughkeepsie's downtown arts revitalization.<br/><br/>Tips<br/>- Walk south from the Poughkeepsie Railroad Station along Main St. to reach the underpass.<br/>- Combine with Poughkeepsie Railroad Station and Union Street Historic District.]]></description>
