  <Placemark>
    <name>Pretty Marsh Picnic Area Mount Desert ME</name>
    <description><![CDATA[Pretty Marsh Picnic Area<br/><br/>📍 Route 102, western Mount Desert Island, ME<br/><br/>A quiet picnic spot on the western side of Mount Desert Island, overlooking Pretty Marsh Harbor with views toward Bartlett, Folly, and Hardwood Islands. Consistently flagged in local write-ups as one of the least-visited picnic areas in the entire park.<br/><br/>Tips<br/>- Good sunset spot — faces west over the harbor<br/>- Combine with Long Pond or the Hio Fire Road area, both nearby on the quiet side]]></description>
