  <Placemark>
    <name>Profile Lake Franconia Notch NH</name>
    <description><![CDATA[Profile Lake<br/><br/>📍 Franconia Notch State Park, NH<br/><br/>A small lake directly below the cliff where the Old Man of the Mountain stood until its collapse in 2003 — its name comes from how the rock profile once reflected in the water. A quiet, easy stop right off the Franconia Notch Parkway.<br/><br/>Tips<br/>- Pair with the Old Man of the Mountain Historic Site, right next to the lake, for the full story of the collapsed formation.<br/><br/>More info: https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=44.1660%2C%20-71.6780]]></description>
