  <Placemark>
    <name>Project Puffin Visitor Center</name>
    <description><![CDATA[Project Puffin Visitor Center is a small museum dedicated to the puffin bird and its conservation. Entrance is free, but donations of $5 per person are suggested. It primarily opens during the day, from 10 AM to 5 PM, and does not serve food or alcohol.<br/><br/>More info: https://www.google.com/maps/place/Project+Puffin+Visitor+Center/@44.0995597,-69.1264774,2564m/data=!3m1!1e3!4m11!1m3!2m2!1sscenic+spot!6e1!3m6!1s0x4cadce28ab120975:0xff4ac2c6d1a25c38!8m2!3d44.1024885!4d-69.1088382!15sCgtzY2VuaWMgc3BvdFoNIgtzY2VuaWMgc3BvdJIBBm11c2V1bZoBI0NoWkRTVWhOTUc5blMwVkpRMEZuU1VOMU1qUmlRVWxuRUFF4AEA-gEFCLABEEM!16s%2Fg%2F1tjmd7w3?entry=ttu&g_ep=EgoyMDI2MDcxMy4wIKXMDSoASAFQAw%3D%3D]]></description>
