  <Placemark>
    <name>Provincetown MA</name>
    <description><![CDATA[Provincetown, located at the northern tip of Cape Cod, offers seafood and New England cuisine. Prices range from $25 for casual dining to $335 for upscale restaurant experiences. Many places serve both lunch and dinner and offer alcohol.<br/><br/>More info: https://www.google.com/maps/place/Provincetown,+MA/@42.0513071,-70.2395659,12870m/data=!3m2!1e3!4b1!4m6!3m5!1s0x89fca780cf83c821:0xd8d2863ae0f05eda!8m2!3d42.0547136!4d-70.1846012!16zL20vMDlyMTI?entry=ttu&g_ep=EgoyMDI2MDYxNi4wIKXMDSoASAFQAw%3D%3D]]></description>
