  <Placemark>
    <name>Quechee Bridge Quechee VT</name>
    <description><![CDATA[Quechee Bridge<br/><br/>📍 Quechee, VT<br/><br/>The bridge over the Ottauquechee River right in Quechee village, near the head of Quechee Gorge — combines village, river, and gorge views in one easy stop.<br/><br/>Tips<br/>- Pair with a walk along the gorge rim, just downstream from the bridge.<br/><br/>More info: https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=43.6455%2C%20-72.4190]]></description>
