  <Placemark>
    <name>Quiet Side Cafe and Ice Cream Shop Southwest Harbor ME</name>
    <description><![CDATA[Quiet Side Cafe and Ice Cream Shop is a casual eatery best known for its homemade pies and diverse menu that includes pizza, lobster rolls, and fried clams. It typically attracts families and casual diners looking for a friendly atmosphere, particularly during lunch hours. The vibe is laid-back and budget-friendly, making it a great spot for a quick meal or ice cream treat. Customers consistently praise the amazing food, particularly the pies, and the exceptional service. There are mentions of it being temporarily closed, which could inconvenience potential visitors.<br/><br/>More info: https://www.google.com/maps/place/Quiet+Side+Cafe+and+Ice+Cream+Shop/@44.2827245,-68.341844,3288m/data=!3m1!1e3!4m13!1m5!2m4!1sRestaurants!5m1!4e9!6e5!3m6!1s0x4caebd5d51aeaa81:0x2f2b5e0bd386244e!8m2!3d44.2883305!4d-68.3301074!15sCgtSZXN0YXVyYW50c1oNIgtyZXN0YXVyYW50c5IBE2FtZXJpY2FuX3Jlc3RhdXJhbnSaASRDaGREU1VoTk1HOW5TMFZKUTBGblNVTmxiVGt0ZVdkM1JSQULgAQD6AQQIZBA1!16s%2Fg%2F11nmhz0mhs?entry=ttu&g_ep=EgoyMDI2MDYxMC4wIKXMDSoASAFQAw%3D%3D]]></description>
