  <Placemark>
    <name>Quietside Snacks Southwest Harbor ME</name>
    <description><![CDATA[Quiet Side Snacks is a food truck known for its delicious fried chicken sandwiches and smash burgers. It attracts a variety of customers, including tourists and locals, often looking for a casual meal during hikes or outdoor activities. The vibe is laid-back and casual, with an atmosphere that encourages customers to relax and enjoy their food. Consistent positives highlighted in reviews include the quality of food, friendly service, and a delightful outdoor space. However, some customers noted that service could be a bit slow, especially at peak times, and that the place has limited operating hours.<br/><br/>More info: https://www.google.com/maps/place/Quietside+Snacks/@44.2514225,-68.334502,9150m/data=!3m1!1e3!4m14!1m7!3m6!1s0x4caea349426b9ac1:0x3ca9ed3a9d2836e0!2sCharlotte's+Legendary+Lobster+Pound!8m2!3d44.2446861!4d-68.2986522!16s%2Fg%2F1q6n2glpy!3m5!1s0x4caea3ecb94cd729:0x40b21d85c8f8f047!8m2!3d44.2467316!4d-68.3610792!16s%2Fg%2F11nm9njtd0?entry=ttu&g_ep=EgoyMDI2MDYxMC4wIKXMDSoASAFQAw%3D%3D]]></description>
