  <Placemark>
    <name>Race Point Beach Provincetown MA</name>
    <description><![CDATA[Race Point Beach<br/><br/>📍 Provincetown MA<br/><br/>Wide, wild Atlantic-facing National Seashore beach at the very tip of the Cape — prime for seal and whale sightings from shore.<br/><br/>Tips<br/>- Very exposed — bring wind protection even in summer.<br/>- Whale spouts are sometimes visible from the beach during migration season.]]></description>
