  <Placemark>
    <name>Rail Explorers Phoenicia Phoenicia, NY</name>
    <description><![CDATA[Rail Explorers Phoenicia<br/><br/>📍 Phoenicia, NY<br/><br/>Electric-assist rail bikes gliding through the Catskills along Esopus Creek — widely called one of the most enjoyable outdoor experiences in the region.<br/><br/>Tips<br/>- Book at railexplorers. at least 2–3 weeks ahead for September weekends<br/>- The 6-mile round-trip takes about 2 hours; electric assist makes hills effortless<br/>- Helmets provided; no experience needed<br/><br/>More info: https://www.google.com/maps/search/Rail+Explorers+Phoenicia+Phoenicia,+NY]]></description>
