    <description><![CDATA[**Nina June** (Restaurant) - Price range: $60–70. Cuisine: Artistic dishes with creative plating. Open for dinner (closes at 9 PM) but not for lunch. Serves alcohol.<br/><br/>More info: https://www.google.com/maps/place/Ralston+Gallery/@44.1834243,-69.0818261,2626m/data=!3m1!1e3!4m11!1m3!2m2!1sThings+to+do!6e1!3m6!1s0x4cadd73007636b51:0xf92746392a300cf2!8m2!3d44.1876232!4d-69.0729398!15sCgxUaGluZ3MgdG8gZG9aDiIMdGhpbmdzIHRvIGRvkgEMcGhvdG9ncmFwaGVymgFEQ2k5RFFVbFJRVU52WkVOb2RIbGpSamx2VDIxek5HTXpVWGRPUjJRMFRVYzFhbFpyTlUxTlJrNVRWMFYwUlZkdVl4QULgAQD6AQUIsQIQHw!16s%2Fg%2F1hc83xqqv?entry=ttu&g_ep=EgoyMDI2MDcxMy4wIKXMDSoASAFQAw%3D%3D]]></description>
