  <Placemark>
    <name>Ram &amp; Bull Brunswick ME</name>
    <description><![CDATA[Ram & Bull<br/><br/>📍 123 Maine St, Brunswick, ME<br/><br/>Opened May 2025 by restaurateurs Khristine and Zac Leeman (of two previously successful Maine restaurants) — a large modern tavern the Portland Press Herald called "off to a strong start," with a kitchen doing creative twists on classic tavern food.<br/><br/>Must Order<br/>- Hand-breaded cheese curds with blueberry-sriracha BBQ sauce<br/>- Poutine with demi-glace<br/>- Bangs Island mussels in garlic butter<br/>- Jonah crab cakes with Cajun remoulade<br/>- Blackened Maine haddock (singled out by the Press Herald review)<br/>- The "Juicy Lucy" burger<br/><br/>Tips<br/>- Reservations via Toast; takeout also available<br/>- Open Mon/Wed/Thu 11:30am-8pm, Fri-Sat 11:30am-9pm, Sun 11:30am-8pm; closed Tuesday<br/><br/>More info: https://www.theramandbull.com/]]></description>
