    <name>Ramunto's Brick &amp; Brew Pizza Bridgewater VT</name>
    <description><![CDATA[The restaurant is Ramunto's Brick & Brew Pizza, a pizza place offering New York-style thin crust pizza and various wing flavors. Prices are in the $10–20 range, and it is open for lunch and dinner, closing at 9 PM. Alcohol is available.<br/><br/>More info: https://www.google.com/maps/place/Ramunto's+Brick+%26+Brew+Pizza/@43.5739428,-72.7564646,34876m/data=!3m1!1e3!4m13!1m5!2m4!1srestaurants+with+reservations.+!5m1!4e9!6e5!3m6!1s0x89e1d3f8acba98ab:0xe22180245c54873c!8m2!3d43.5869745!4d-72.6207185!15sCh5yZXN0YXVyYW50cyB3aXRoIHJlc2VydmF0aW9ucy4iMlIwL2dlby90eXBlL2VzdGFibGlzaG1lbnRfcG9pL2FjY2VwdHNfcmVzZXJ2YXRpb25zWg0iC3Jlc3RhdXJhbnRzkgEQcGl6emFfcmVzdGF1cmFudJoBI0NoWkRTVWhOTUc5blMwVkpRMEZuVFVSbk5qbFVWa05uRUFF4AEA-gEECAAQMg!16s%2Fg%2F1tdkstc6?entry=ttu&g_ep=EgoyMDI2MDYyMy4wIKXMDSoASAFQAw%3D%3D]]></description>
