    <name>Red Hen Baking Co. Middlesex VT</name>
    <description><![CDATA[Red Hen Baking Co.<br/><br/>📍 Middlesex VT<br/><br/>Artisan bakery widely regarded as one of Vermont's best — sourdough, pastries, and breakfast sandwiches. Located in Middlesex, 5 minutes from Montpelier center.<br/><br/>Must Order<br/>- Sourdough loaves<br/>- Pastries<br/><br/>Tips<br/>- Get there early — popular items sell out by mid-morning.<br/>- A 5-minute drive west of Montpelier on Route 2.]]></description>
