    <name>Red Hook Golf Course NY</name>
    <description><![CDATA[Red Hook Golf Course<br/><br/>📍 650 State Highway 199, Red Hook, NY 12571<br/><br/>An 18-hole championship golf course with restaurant and pro shop, on the last leg of the tour between Rock City and Red Hook Village.<br/><br/>Tips<br/>- Call 845/758-8652 for visitor information.<br/>- Part of the Rhinebeck, Red Hook & Milan Scenic Tour (Tour 1), near stop 25 (Rock City).]]></description>
