  <Placemark>
    <name>Red Onion Saugerties, NY</name>
    <description><![CDATA[Red Onion<br/><br/>📍 Saugerties, NY<br/><br/>A charming historic farmhouse restaurant serving locally sourced seasonal New American cuisine with original cocktails — one of the most romantic dinner destinations in the Catskills.<br/><br/>Must Order<br/>- Seasonal fish — always fresh and well-prepared<br/>- Short rib — a recurring comfort-food anchor<br/>- Original cocktails — inventive and well-balanced<br/><br/>Tips<br/>- Reservations essential — fills fast on weekends<br/>- The farmhouse setting is beautiful; September foliage is spectacular<br/><br/>More info: https://www.google.com/maps/search/Red+Onion+Saugerties,+NY]]></description>
