    <name>Rhinebeck Farmers Market Rhinebeck, NY</name>
    <description><![CDATA[Rhinebeck Farmers Market<br/><br/>📍 Rhinebeck, NY<br/><br/>One of the Hudson Valley's premier farmers markets, running Sundays May through November at the East Market Street municipal lot.<br/><br/>Tips<br/>- Sundays 10 AM–2 PM — arrive early for best selection<br/>- Bread Alone Bakery, Migliorelli Farm, and several cheese makers are regulars<br/>- Park on East Market Street — lot fills by 10:30 AM<br/><br/>More info: https://www.google.com/maps/search/Rhinebeck+Farmers+Market+Rhinebeck,+NY]]></description>
