  <Placemark>
    <name>Rice Thai &amp; Asian Boynton Beach FL</name>
    <description><![CDATA[Overview<br/>Type: Thai restaurant<br/><br/>Best known for: Generous portions, flavorful dishes<br/><br/>Location context: Not mentioned<br/><br/>Price level: $10–20 per person<br/><br/>Visit timing: Not mentioned<br/><br/>Typical Customers<br/>Demographics: Locals, families<br/><br/>Group types: Families, friends<br/><br/>Common occasions: Casual dinner<br/><br/>Vibe & Setting<br/>Atmosphere: Cozy and welcoming<br/><br/>Noise level: Moderate<br/><br/>Decor & setting: Comfortable indoor seating<br/><br/>Service style: Attentive and friendly<br/><br/>Recommended Dishes<br/>Overall dish consensus<br/>Reviewers recommend the Pad Thai and Shrimp Pad Thai, often praising their flavor and freshness. Many mentions highlight the excellent quality of the food.<br/><br/>How “top dishes” are determined<br/>Top dishes are based on popularity indicated in reviews, including frequently praised items and those appearing in photos.<br/><br/>| Rank | Dish               | Why it stands out                               | How often it’s mentioned                | Ideal for                  |<br/>|------|--------------------|------------------------------------------------|---------------------------------------|----------------------------|<br/>| 1    | Pad Thai           | Flavorsome and well-balanced, highly praised.  | Mentioned in many reviews            | Sharing at the table       |<br/>| 2    | Shrimp Pad Thai    | Fresh and savory, a standout among diners.     | Repeatedly called out as a favorite | Hearty main               |<br/>| 3    | Green Curry        | Rich flavor, great for those who enjoy spice.  | Mentioned in several reviews         | Spice lovers               |<br/><br/>Good alternates / backup choices<br/>- Chicken Soup: Notable for its comforting quality.<br/>- Fried Rice: Received praise for its generous portions.  <br/><br/>Highlights (non‑dish positives from reviews)<br/>Friendly Service: Many reviews comment on the staff being super friendly and attentive.<br/><br/>Clean Atmosphere: Customers appreciate the cleanliness of the restaurant, enhancing their dining experience.<br/><br/>Common Issues (from reviews)<br/>Long Waits: Some reviewers noted longer wait times during busy hours.<br/><br/>Forgetfulness: A few guests mentioned that their requests sometimes get overlooked.<br/><br/>Practical Notes<br/>Reservation / wait: Walk-in friendly<br/><br/>Accessibility: Not mentioned<br/><br/>Parking / transit: Not mentioned<br/><br/>Best use case: Great for casual dinners with friends or family.<br/><br/>More info: https://www.google.com/maps/place/Rice+Thai+%26+Asian/@26.5288705,-80.0922324,17z/data=!3m1!4b1!4m6!3m5!1s0x88d8df1e984bba5b:0x2e4ec4abaaae6a75!8m2!3d26.5288657!4d-80.0896575!16s%2Fg%2F12630br01?entry=ttu&g_ep=EgoyMDI2MDYxMC4wIKXMDSoASAFQAw%3D%3D]]></description>
