    <name>Rising Tide Co-op Damariscotta ME</name>
    <description><![CDATA[Rising Tide Co-op<br/><br/>📍 323 Main Street, Damariscotta, ME<br/><br/>A natural foods co-op and grocer on Main Street since 1978 — hot bar, prepared foods, organic/local groceries, local beer and wine. This is the everyday grocery store locals actually shop at, not a tourist attraction, which is exactly the appeal.<br/><br/>Tips<br/>- Good stop for picnic provisions or a quick prepared-food lunch.<br/>- Coordinates are an estimate (no precise geocode found) — use the Google Maps link above for actual navigation.<br/><br/>More info: https://risingtide.coop/]]></description>
