  <Placemark>
    <name>Ristorante Caterina de’ Medici Hyde Park NY</name>
    <description><![CDATA[Overview<br/>Type: Italian restaurant offering student-prepared dishes.<br/><br/>Best known for: Classic Italian dishes, excellent service training for Culinary Institute students.<br/><br/>Location context: Hyde Park, New York.<br/><br/>Price level: $40–90 per person.<br/><br/>Visit timing: Not mentioned.<br/><br/>Typical Customers<br/>Demographics: Mixed clientele; some reviews mention tourists and locals.<br/><br/>Group types: Couples, families, larger groups.<br/><br/>Common occasions: Special occasions, dinner, casual dining.<br/><br/>Vibe & Setting<br/>Atmosphere: Elegant and welcoming.<br/><br/>Noise level: Moderate.<br/><br/>Decor & setting: Indoor dining, cozy environment.<br/><br/>Service style: Professional but occasionally lacking.<br/><br/>Recommended Dishes<br/>Overall dish consensus  <br/>Reviewers agree on the quality of the food, particularly noting dishes like arancini and truffle sauce.<br/><br/>How “top dishes” are determined  <br/>Top dishes are identified based on mentions in reviews and on the menu. Popular items are frequently noted for their quality and appearance in photos.<br/><br/>| Rank | Dish                   | Why it stands out                                          | How often it’s mentioned              | Ideal for                    |<br/>|------|------------------------|-----------------------------------------------------------|--------------------------------------|------------------------------|<br/>| 1    | Arancini               | Perfectly crispy with a rich truffle sauce.              | Mentioned in many reviews            | Sharing at the table         |<br/>| 2    | Tuna crudo             | Fresh and bright with citrus and mint.                    | Repeatedly called out as a favorite  | Lighter option               |<br/>| 3    | Pepperoni pizza        | A favorite for its bold flavors and perfect bake.        | Appears in numerous photos           | Sharing at the table         |  <br/><br/>Good alternates / backup choices  <br/><br/> Tiramisu: Notably creamy and decadent.  <br/> Tagliatelle: Recommended for its rich flavor.  <br/><br/>Highlights (non-dish positives from reviews)<br/>Service quality: The attentive service enhances the dining experience.  <br/><br/>Atmosphere: The venue provides a congenial and welcoming ambiance.  <br/><br/>Common Issues (from reviews)<br/>Service consistency: A few mentions of unsatisfactory service on busy days.  <br/><br/>Practical Notes<br/>Reservation / wait: Reservations are needed.  <br/><br/>Accessibility: Not mentioned.  <br/><br/>Parking / transit: Not mentioned.  <br/><br/>Best use case: Best for special occasions with family and friends.<br/><br/>More info: https://www.google.com/maps/reserve/v/dine/c/nQOno4jQKDE?source=pa&opi=79508299&hl=en-US&gei=bElSaoitGeHpptQPuODd0Q4&ahbb=1&sourceurl=https://www.google.com/maps/preview/place?authuser%3D0%26hl%3Den%26gl%3Dus%26pb%3D!1m19!1s0x89dd15e0f0d92f7b:0xd8bb7190a0423d6f!2s!3m9!1m3!1d751.6679681600814!2d-73.9341184!3d41.7449149!2m0!3m2!1i1728!2i929!4f35!4m2!3d41.745269463685254!4d-73.93247567117214!5e4!15m2!1m1!4s/g/1tf03gtv!13m50!2m2!1i408!2i240!3m2!2i10!5b1!7m33!1m3!1e1!2b0!3e3!1m3!1e2!2b1!3e2!1m3!1e2!2b0!3e3!1m3!1e8!2b0!3e3!1m3!1e10!2b0!3e3!1m3!1e10!2b1!3e2!1m3!1e10!2b0!3e4!1m3!1e9!2b1!3e2!2b1!9b0!15m8!1m7!1m2!1m1!1e2!2m2!1i195!2i195!3i20!14m4!1sS0lSaqesJpbJp84Piuz48Ao!3b1!7e81!15i10555!15m47!1m8!4e2!18m5!3b0!6b0!14b1!17b1!20b1!20e2!4b1!10m1!8e3!11m1!3e1!17b1!20m2!1e3!1e6!24b1!25b1!26b1!29b1!30m1!2b1!36b1!43b1!52b1!55b1!56m1!1b1!65m5!3m4!1m3!1m2!1i224!2i298!98m3!1b1!2b1!3b1!107m2!1m1!1e1!114m3!1b1!2m1!1b1!22m1!1e81!29m0!30m6!3b1!6m1!2b1!7m1!2b1!9b1!32b1!37i785%26q%3D*%26pf%3Dt]]></description>
