    <name>River House Damariscotta ME</name>
    <description><![CDATA[River House<br/><br/>📍 27 Main Street, Damariscotta, ME<br/><br/>Upscale riverside dining right on Main Street, with a seasonal, seafood-forward menu and views over the Damariscotta River.<br/><br/>Must Order<br/>- Seasonal seafood specials — menu changes with what's fresh<br/><br/>Tips<br/>- Rating sources are split — OpenTable shows 4.8, Tripadvisor shows 4.3; listed here at 4.7 as a middle estimate, worth a fresh check closer to the trip.<br/>- Reservations recommended for prime river-view seating.]]></description>
