    <name>Riverfront Park Athens Athens, NY</name>
    <description><![CDATA[Riverfront Park Athens<br/><br/>📍 Athens, NY<br/><br/>A quiet waterfront green with direct Hudson River views — one of the most peaceful river overlooks in the valley, perfect for a sunset stop.<br/><br/>Tips<br/>- Free to visit; benches along the waterfront<br/>- Combine with Athens Rooster next door for a complete Athens visit<br/>- The river channel between Athens and Hudson is historically the busiest section of the Hudson<br/><br/>More info: https://www.google.com/maps/search/Riverfront+Park+Athens+Athens,+NY]]></description>
