    <name>Rock City Milan NY</name>
    <description><![CDATA[Rock City<br/><br/>📍 Route 199 at Route 308, Milan, NY 12571<br/><br/>Taking its name from the rocky terrain, this area was a site of several 18th and 19th century manufacturing enterprises, producing everything from textiles to whiskey. From here to Red Hook is the last leg of one of the oldest roads in the county.<br/><br/>Tips<br/>- Stop 25 of 33 on the Rhinebeck, Red Hook & Milan Scenic Tour (Tour 1).]]></description>
