  <Placemark>
    <name>Rockland Farmers Market Rockland ME</name>
    <description><![CDATA[Rockland Farmers' Market<br/><br/>📍 Harbor Park, 1 Pleasant Street, Rockland, ME 04841<br/><br/>A waterfront market at Harbor Park, a short drive from Camden, with local produce, seafood, meats, cheeses, artisan goods, and regular live music. During the town's Lobsterfest the market temporarily relocates to Snow Marine Park.<br/><br/>Tips<br/>- Thursdays 9 AM–1 PM, May through October (winter version moves indoors to the Flanagan Community Center)<br/>- Pair with a walk along the harbor or a stop at the Rockland gallery district<br/>- Good seafood selection here specifically — worth checking against Graffam Bros in nearby Rockport<br/><br/>More info: https://www.google.com/maps/search/Rockland+Farmers+Market+Harbor+Park+1+Pleasant+Street+Rockland+ME]]></description>
