    <name>Rockland Harbor Trail</name>
    <description><![CDATA[Rockland Harbor Trail is a park located at 5 Laurel St, open 24 hours. It serves no food or alcohol but is known for its walking trails with scenic harbor views.<br/><br/>More info: https://www.google.com/maps/place/Rockland+Harbor+Trail/@44.0995839,-69.1264774,2564m/data=!3m1!1e3!4m11!1m3!2m2!1seasy+hike!6e1!3m6!1s0x4cadcf94fb47e783:0x4e0c3cece8209f5!8m2!3d44.0994847!4d-69.1072097!15sCgllYXN5IGhpa2VaCyIJZWFzeSBoaWtlkgEEcGFya5oBI0NoWkRTVWhOTUc5blMwVkpRMEZuU1VSdWEyWlFZMEZuRUFF4AEA-gEECFsQEg!16s%2Fg%2F11h77t_j8k?entry=ttu&g_ep=EgoyMDI2MDcxMy4wIKXMDSoASAFQAw%3D%3D]]></description>
