  <Placemark>
    <name>Rockport Garden Club Public Gardens Network Rockport ME</name>
    <description><![CDATA[Rockport Garden Club Public Gardens Network<br/><br/>📍 Throughout Rockport, ME<br/><br/>13 distinct public garden sites maintained by the Rockport Garden Club, distributed throughout town including:<br/>- Rockport Opera House gardens<br/>- Rockport Post Office gardens<br/>- West Rockport Post Office gardens<br/>- Aldermere Farm gardens<br/>- Goose River Bridge plantings<br/>- And 8 additional sites<br/><br/>A scattered network of beautifully tended small gardens that almost no visitor treats as a cohesive destination—you discover them while walking the town.<br/><br/>Tips<br/>- 13 sites spread throughout Rockport<br/>- All maintained by local Garden Club volunteers<br/>- Free to visit<br/>- Discover while walking town<br/>- Seasonally beautiful plantings<br/>- Community-driven gardens<br/>- Perfect for a walking tour combining multiple sites]]></description>
