  <Placemark>
    <name>Rockport Harbor Limestone Kilns Rockport ME</name>
    <description><![CDATA[Rockport Harbor Limestone Kilns<br/><br/>📍 Rockport Harbor, Rockport, ME<br/><br/>A little-visited remnant of Rockport's 19th-century lime-and-ice industry, tucked right along the walkable village loop. A historic industrial site most visitors overlook while focusing on the harbor itself—good for understanding Rockport's maritime heritage.<br/><br/>Tips<br/>- Part of the village loop walk<br/>- Historic lime industry evidence<br/>- 19th-century industrial heritage<br/>- Easy to miss if not looking for it<br/>- Educational local history]]></description>
