    <name>Rockport Marine Park</name>
    <description><![CDATA[18 Central Oyster Bar & Grill is a grill restaurant offering coastal cuisine with prices ranging from $50 to $100. It is open for dinner starting at 5 PM and serves alcohol.<br/><br/>More info: https://www.google.com/maps/place/Rockport+Marine+Park/@44.1834243,-69.0818261,2626m/data=!3m1!1e3!4m11!1m3!2m2!1sThings+to+do!6e1!3m6!1s0x4cadd7805a766ead:0xef87115c1de3f64a!8m2!3d44.185528!4d-69.0743781!15sCgxUaGluZ3MgdG8gZG9aDiIMdGhpbmdzIHRvIGRvkgEEcGFya5oBI0NoWkRTVWhOTUc5blMwVkpRMEZuU1VOc01tRnBUV1YzRUFF4AEA-gEFCNABEDY!16s%2Fg%2F11j37c9_rd?entry=ttu&g_ep=EgoyMDI2MDcxMy4wIKXMDSoASAFQAw%3D%3D]]></description>
