  <Placemark>
    <name>Rollie's Bar and Grill Belfast ME</name>
    <description><![CDATA[Rollie's Bar and Grill<br/><br/>📍 37 Main St, Belfast, ME 04915<br/><br/>Casual, divey Main Street sports bar/gastropub — burgers, nachos, a big beer selection, and a pool table. Rated 3.9 on Tripadvisor (#9 of 32 Belfast restaurants, 351 reviews).<br/><br/>Tips<br/>- Closed Mon/Tue. Wed 3-9pm, Thu 12-9pm, Fri/Sat 12-10pm, Sun 12-8pm (verify before visiting).<br/>- Reddit locals describe it as "more locals/divey but safe" — a good pick for a low-key evening.<br/><br/>More info: https://www.rolliesmaine.com]]></description>
