    <name>Rondout Creek Waterfront Kingston, NY</name>
    <description><![CDATA[Rondout Creek Waterfront<br/><br/>📍 Kingston, NY<br/><br/>Kingston's 19th-century maritime neighborhood along Rondout Creek — galleries, restaurants, the Hudson River Maritime Museum, and beautifully preserved industrial waterfront.<br/><br/>Tips<br/>- About a mile south of the Stockade District — walkable or short drive<br/>- Kingston Lighthouse visible from the waterfront; boat tours available seasonally<br/>- Several excellent restaurants have opened here in recent years<br/><br/>More info: https://www.google.com/maps/search/Rondout+Creek+Waterfront+Kingston,+NY]]></description>
