  <Placemark>
    <name>Rose Eden Lobster Bar Harbor ME</name>
    <description><![CDATA[Rose Eden Lobster<br/><br/>📍 864 State Hwy 3, Bar Harbor, ME 04609<br/><br/>Takeout-only seafood shack at Rose Eden Cottages, distinct from (and formerly confused with) The Travelin' Lobster, a separate business. Started to feed cottage guests and grew into a well-known budget lobster stop. Seasonal: open Memorial Day weekend through early October.<br/><br/>Must Order<br/>- Lobster roll — generous portions, frequently cited as some of the freshest on the island<br/>- Whole lobster — live or cooked to order, among the most affordable on Mount Desert Island<br/><br/>Tips<br/>- Takeout only — limited outdoor picnic-table seating on site<br/>- Good backup option for a night without a dinner reservation during the Bar Harbor base camp stay<br/><br/>More info: https://www.google.com/maps/place/Rose+Eden+Lobster/@44.435357,-68.313006,15z]]></description>
