  <Placemark>
    <name>Rough Draft Bar &amp; Books Kingston, NY</name>
    <description><![CDATA[Rough Draft Bar & Books<br/><br/>📍 Kingston, NY<br/><br/>A beloved combination independent bookshop and craft beer bar in the Stockade District — community-driven and exactly the kind of place every city wishes it had.<br/><br/>Tips<br/>- Check their event calendar — frequent author readings and community events<br/>- Book selection is well-curated with strong literary fiction and local history sections<br/>- A great afternoon stop during a Stockade District walk<br/><br/>More info: https://www.google.com/maps/search/Rough+Draft+Bar+&+Books+Kingston,+NY]]></description>
