    <description><![CDATA[Round Mountain<br/><br/>📍 Near Donnell Pond Public Reserved Land, Franklin, ME<br/><br/>A peak near Donnell Pond Public Reserved Land, along the Blackwoods Scenic Byway corridor.<br/><br/>Tips<br/>- No well-documented public trail found — treat as a landmark rather than a planned hike unless you find current access info locally.<br/><br/>More info: https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=44.5979%2C%20-68.0047]]></description>
