  <Placemark>
    <name>Round Pond Coffee Round Pond ME</name>
    <description><![CDATA[Round Pond Coffee<br/><br/>📍 1440 Route 32, Round Pond, ME<br/><br/>A specialty coffee shop and espresso bar in the small harbor village of Round Pond, open since 2016. Serves coffee, espresso drinks, smoothies, and pastries baked by Barn Door Baking Co. — enjoy indoors or on the harbor-view deck.<br/><br/>Tips<br/>- Rating in question: the source list paired this with a "C.P. Rankins" name I could find no evidence of anywhere — likely a fabricated or confused attribution. The real business is simply Round Pond Coffee; no independent numeric rating could be confirmed for it either, listed at 4.8 per source only.<br/>- Good stop combined with Round Pond's working harbor and lobster docks.<br/><br/>More info: http://rp-coffee.com/]]></description>
