    <name>Round Pond Lobster Bristol ME</name>
    <description><![CDATA[Time: 2026-08-07T12:15:00<br/><br/>Round Pond Lobster<br/><br/>📍 Round Pond, Bristol, ME<br/><br/>A seafood restaurant offering fresh lobsters, clams, and beer, with meal deals around $34. Open for lunch and dinner until 7 PM, and serves alcohol.<br/><br/>Tips<br/>- Expect long waits at peak times given the demand.]]></description>
