  <Placemark>
    <name>Round Top Ice Cream Stand Damariscotta ME</name>
    <description><![CDATA[Round Top Ice Cream Stand<br/><br/>📍 526 Main Street, Damariscotta, ME<br/><br/>Homemade ice cream since 1924 — a genuine Damariscotta institution, generous portions, wide flavor variety. Further down Main St than the downtown core, so it doesn't get the same tourist foot traffic as the waterfront spots.<br/><br/>Tips<br/>- Coordinates are an estimate (no precise geocode found) — use the Google Maps link above for actual navigation.<br/><br/>More info: https://roundtopicecream.com/]]></description>
