    <name>Rue 77 Damariscotta ME</name>
    <description><![CDATA[Rue 77<br/><br/>📍 77 Main Street, Damariscotta, ME<br/><br/>Specialty espresso drinks (Stumptown coffee), fresh-baked pastries, and gelato on Main Street.<br/><br/>Tips<br/>- Good mid-walk coffee/gelato break between the bookstores and the waterfront.]]></description>
