  <Placemark>
    <name>Runa Bistro New Paltz, NY</name>
    <description><![CDATA[Runa Bistro<br/><br/>📍 New Paltz, NY<br/><br/>A creative Latin-inflected New American restaurant with one of the valley's most distinctive menus and a rapidly growing reputation.<br/><br/>Must Order<br/>- Ceviche — bright and properly acidulated<br/>- Roasted chicken — with Latin spice rubs and seasonal sides<br/><br/>Tips<br/>- Reserve for weekend dinner<br/>- The cocktail program is strong — start with one of their house originals<br/><br/>More info: https://www.google.com/maps/search/Runa+Bistro+New+Paltz,+NY]]></description>
