    <name>Rutherford Island Preserve South Bristol ME</name>
    <description><![CDATA[Rutherford Island Preserve<br/><br/>📍 2 Atlantic Ave, off West Side Rd, South Bristol, ME<br/><br/>15-acre preserve (built 2014 by Coastal Rivers Trail Tamers) winding among stone walls and coastal spruce to a bench overlooking the lower Damariscotta River, with whimsical touches added by a neighbor. 0.4 mi one way.<br/><br/>More info: https://www.coastalrivers.org/trails/rutherford-island-preserve/]]></description>
