    <name>Rutland Historical Society VT</name>
    <description><![CDATA[Rutland Historical Society<br/><br/>📍 Rutland, VT<br/><br/>A local-history museum preserving Rutland's history, including the marble industry that built the city.<br/><br/>Tips<br/>- Check current hours before visiting — small local historical societies often keep limited seasonal schedules.<br/><br/>More info: https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=43.6069%2C%20-72.9737]]></description>
