  <Placemark>
    <name>Saco River Brewing Taphaus</name>
    <description><![CDATA[Saco River Brewing Taphaus in North Conway, NH, is an elevated casual restaurant serving American fare and craft beers. It is open for lunch and dinner, with prices ranging from $10 to $20 per person.<br/><br/>More info: https://www.google.com/maps/place/Saco+River+Brewing+Taphaus/@44.0527722,-71.1284377,134a,48.2y,0.36t/data=!3m1!1e3!4m14!1m7!3m6!1s0x4cb3a0bf793f9bfb:0x6c5284ed20196b08!2sVia+Roma+Pizza+%26+Mediterranean!8m2!3d44.0363957!4d-71.1223054!16s%2Fg%2F11r9lxtgw!3m5!1s0x4cb3a1001c1fd98d:0x30e5c54b008ae9b5!8m2!3d44.052959!4d-71.1281524!16s%2Fg%2F11l_1krd09?entry=ttu&g_ep=EgoyMDI2MDcxMi4wIKXMDSoASAFQAw%3D%3D]]></description>
