    <name>Salt Pond Visitor Center Eastham MA</name>
    <description><![CDATA[Salt Pond Visitor Center<br/><br/>📍 Eastham MA<br/><br/>Main Cape Cod National Seashore visitor center with exhibits, ranger programs, films, and trailheads for multiple park trails.<br/><br/>Tips<br/>- Start any Cape Cod National Seashore day here — rangers are excellent.<br/>- The Salt Pond Trail and Nauset Marsh Trail depart from the visitor center.]]></description>
