    <description><![CDATA[Sammi's Family Entertainment<br/><br/>📍 402 Friendship Rd, Waldoboro, ME 04572<br/><br/>Family entertainment center offering candlepin bowling, arcade games, pool tables, and a small food/drink menu, in Waldoboro (roughly 13 miles from Damariscotta).<br/><br/>More info: https://sammis-family-entertainment-center.square.site/]]></description>
