  <Placemark>
    <name>Sammy's Deluxe Rockland ME</name>
    <description><![CDATA[Sammy's Deluxe<br/><br/>📍 252 Main Street, Rockland, ME<br/><br/>An acclaimed, cozy bistro serving creative, unpretentious, seasonal Maine comfort food and local seafood — fun and funky, with great music.<br/><br/>Must Order<br/>- Cod and crab toast<br/><br/>Tips<br/>- Reservations via Tock, dinner only.<br/><br/>More info: https://www.google.com/maps/place/Sammy's+Deluxe/@44.10602,-69.1121499,17z/data=!3m1!4b1!4m6!3m5!1s0x4cadce28f1411477:0x8772e51cc7d5c29d!8m2!3d44.10602!4d-69.109575!16s%2Fg%2F11bzz4t52_?entry=ttu&g_ep=EgoyMDI2MDYyNC4wIKXMDSoASAFQAw%3D%3D]]></description>
