    <name>Samovar Tea Shop and Tasting Room Damariscotta ME</name>
    <description><![CDATA[Samovar Tea Shop & Tasting Room<br/><br/>📍 Damariscotta, ME<br/><br/>A local tea shop and tasting room in Damariscotta that stays well below the Boothbay-level tourist traffic. A quiet spot for tea and snacks without the crowding of busier coastal destinations.<br/><br/>Tips<br/>- Quiet tea shop atmosphere<br/>- Local favorite, minimal tourist traffic<br/>- Tasting room offerings<br/>- Good alternative to busier spots<br/>- Calm, meditative setting]]></description>
