  <Placemark>
    <name>Samuel Dorsky Museum of Art New Paltz NY</name>
    <description><![CDATA[Samuel Dorsky Museum of Art<br/><br/>📍 SUNY New Paltz campus, New Paltz, NY<br/><br/>A free-admission university art museum on the SUNY New Paltz campus — one of the largest college art museums in New York State, with a permanent collection and rotating contemporary exhibitions.<br/><br/>Tips<br/>- Free admission; closed Mondays and Tuesdays (check current hours before visiting).<br/>- Combine with the John R. Kirk Planetarium on the same campus.<br/><br/>More info: https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=41.7412%2C%20-74.0834]]></description>
