  <Placemark>
    <name>Sand Beach Overlook Acadia National Park ME</name>
    <description><![CDATA[Sand Beach Overlook<br/><br/>📍 Park Loop Rd, Acadia National Park, ME<br/><br/>A pull-off above Sand Beach with a wide view down onto the beach, Great Head, and the open Atlantic — good even when the beach itself is packed. (4.9★, 107 reviews on Google Maps)<br/><br/>Tips<br/>- Especially dramatic when fog rolls in over the ocean<br/>- Distinct from the beach parking lot itself — a short walk up from it]]></description>
