    <description><![CDATA[Sandwich Glass Museum<br/><br/>📍 Sandwich MA<br/><br/>Showcases the town's 19th-century glassmaking history with an impressive collection and live glassblowing demonstrations.<br/><br/>Tips<br/>- Live glassblowing demos run on a schedule — check the daily times at the front desk.<br/>- Combine with Heritage Museums & Gardens a few minutes away.]]></description>
