  <Placemark>
    <name>Sandy Point Beach Alton NH</name>
    <description><![CDATA[Sandy Point Beach<br/><br/>📍 Alton Bay, Alton, NH<br/><br/>Part of the Sandy Point Beach Resort, assembled by Albric Ouellette starting in 1928 and built up over decades into a family resort with 2,000 feet of Lake Winnipesaukee waterfront, private beaches, boat ramp and docking, and a range of motel and cottage lodging.<br/><br/>Tips<br/>- Close to Mount Major (a popular short hike with lake views) and Alton Bay Park.<br/><br/>More info: https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=43.4821%2C%20-71.2407]]></description>
