  <Placemark>
    <name>Saugerties Lighthouse Saugerties, NY</name>
    <description><![CDATA[Saugerties Lighthouse<br/><br/>📍 Saugerties, NY<br/><br/>An 1869 lighthouse accessible only by a half-mile tidal path through a nature preserve along the Hudson — also functions as a B&B with two rooms.<br/><br/>Tips<br/>- Check tide tables before visiting — the path floods at high tide; plan within 2 hours of low tide<br/>- Free parking at the trailhead off Lighthouse Drive<br/>- Book one of the two B&B rooms for a genuinely unique overnight<br/><br/>More info: https://www.google.com/maps/search/Saugerties+Lighthouse+Saugerties,+NY]]></description>
