    <description><![CDATA[Saunderskill Farm<br/><br/>📍 Accord, NY<br/><br/>A working farm market with the Catskill Mountains visible behind the fields, on the fertile soil along the Rondout that has supported vegetable farming for generations.<br/><br/>Tips<br/>- Rt 209, Accord<br/>- Combine with a stop at Stone Window Gallery on Main Street<br/><br/>More info: https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=41.8000%2C%20-74.2340]]></description>
