    <name>Savage Oakes Vineyard &amp; Winery Union ME</name>
    <description><![CDATA[Savage Oakes Vineyard & Winery<br/><br/>📍 175 Barrett Hill Road, Union ME<br/><br/>A 200-year-old family farm and winery growing estate grapes and Maine wild blueberries, with open-air concerts featuring nationally known musicians in season. Open mid-May through December.<br/><br/>Tips<br/>- Open daily 11am-5pm May-October; Fri/Sat/Sun only Nov 1-Dec 25.<br/>- Check ahead for concert schedule if you want to combine wine tasting with live music.<br/>- This is the destination note's own namesake attraction ("Union - Farms & Antiques") — previously had no Place note at all.]]></description>
