    <description><![CDATA[Overview<br/>Type: American restaurant<br/><br/>Best known for: Great ambience and quality seafood dishes.<br/><br/>Location context: Cape Cod area<br/><br/>Price level: $20–60 per person<br/><br/>Visit timing: Open daily from 11 AM to 9 PM <br/><br/>Typical Customers<br/>Demographics: Popular among locals and tourists<br/><br/>Group types: Couples, families, groups<br/><br/>Common occasions: Casual dinner, date night<br/><br/>Vibe & Setting<br/>Atmosphere: Cozy, lively with a friendly staff<br/><br/>Noise level: Moderate<br/><br/>Decor & setting: Indoor seating, bar area<br/><br/>Service style: Attentive and friendly<br/><br/>Recommended Dishes<br/>Overall dish consensus<br/>Reviewers highly recommend the Tuna Martini, Lobster Mac n' Cheese, and the Chowder. These items consistently receive positive remarks for their quality and flavor.<br/><br/>How “top dishes” are determined<br/>Top dishes are chosen based on mentions in reviews, popularity in photos, and repeated strong endorsements from diners on the Google Maps page.<br/><br/>| Rank | Dish                          | Why it stands out                                   | How often it’s mentioned      | Ideal for            |<br/>|------|-------------------------------|---------------------------------------------------|------------------------------|----------------------|<br/>| 1    | Tuna Martini                 | Praised for its unique flavor and presentation.    | Mentioned in many reviews    | Sharing at the table |<br/>| 2    | Lobster Mac n' Cheese        | Known for its rich taste and generous portion.     | Repeatedly called out as a favorite | Hearty main        |<br/>| 3    | Clam Chowder                 | Celebrated for its comforting and creamy texture.   | Appears in numerous photos   | Comfort food         |<br/><br/>Good alternates / backup choices<br/>- Shrimp Scampi Flatbread: Noted for its delicious combination of flavors.<br/>- Fritto Misto: Enjoyed for being crispy 