  <Placemark>
    <name>Scenic Flights Of Acadia Trenton ME</name>
    <description><![CDATA[Scenic Flights Of Acadia<br/><br/>📍 1044 Bar Harbor Rd, Trenton, ME<br/><br/>Sightseeing air-tour operator flying over Acadia, Frenchman Bay, and the Porcupine Islands — the only way to see the park's full coastline and island pattern from above. (5.0★, 574 reviews on Google Maps)<br/><br/>Tips<br/>- Book ahead in peak season — small planes, limited daily seats<br/>- Best on a clear morning for calm air and maximum visibility]]></description>
