  <Placemark>
    <name>Schilling Beer Co. Littleton NH</name>
    <description><![CDATA[Overview<br/>Type: Brewery and Restaurant<br/><br/>Best known for: Wood-fired pizza and a cozy atmosphere.<br/><br/>Location context: Littleton, NH.<br/><br/>Price level: Not mentioned.<br/><br/>Visit timing: Not mentioned.<br/><br/>Typical Customers<br/>Demographics: Tourists and locals, couples.<br/><br/>Group types: Couples and friends.<br/><br/>Common occasions: Casual dinner and date night.<br/><br/>Vibe & Setting<br/>Atmosphere: Casual and cozy.<br/><br/>Noise level: Moderate.<br/><br/>Decor & setting: Indoor seating with a homey feel.<br/><br/>Service style: Friendly and attentive.<br/><br/>Recommended Dishes<br/>Overall dish consensus<br/>Reviewers highly recommend the wood-fired pizzas, especially those with unique toppings such as chicken, bacon, apples, and maple syrup.<br/><br/>How “top dishes” are determined<br/>Top dishes are selected based on mentions in reviews and the menu. Popular items are highlighted through frequent praise and visual representation in customer photos.<br/><br/>| Rank | Dish               | Why it stands out                       | How often it’s mentioned                     | Ideal for           |<br/>|------|--------------------|----------------------------------------|----------------------------------------------|---------------------|<br/>| 1    | Gabagool pizza     | Unique flavor combination; very tasty. | Repeatedly called out as a favorite.       | Sharing at the table|<br/>| 2    | Bratwurst plate    | Delicious and well-prepared.          | Mentioned in some reviews.                    | Hearty main        |<br/>| 3    | Wood-fired pizza    | High quality and comforting.          | Appears in numerous photos.                   | Casual dinner      |<br/><br/>Good alternates / backup choices<br/>- Pretzel roll: Crispy outside, soft inside, praised for its texture.<br/>- Chicken, bacon, and apple pizza: Noted for its sweet and savory mix.<br/><br/>Highlights (non‑dish positives from reviews)<br/>Atmosphere: The brewery offers a cozy home-like feel which is appreciated by patrons.<br/><br/>Customer Service: Guests frequently comment on the friendly and knowledgeable staff.<br/><br/>Common Issues (from reviews)<br/>Wait times: Some reviews mention longer wait times during busy periods, especially weekends.<br/><br/>Practical Notes<br/>Reservation / wait: Walk-in friendly; not mentioned if reservations are needed.<br/><br/>Accessibility: Not mentioned.<br/><br/>Parking / transit: Not mentioned.<br/><br/>Best use case: Great for casual dinners with friends or a date night.<br/><br/>More info: https://www.google.com/maps/place/Schilling+Beer+Co./@44.305925,-71.7758702,874m/data=!3m1!1e3!4m6!3m5!1s0x4cb46f2e07241205:0xe617d706cfd9dc28!8m2!3d44.3059539!4d-71.7728488!16s%2Fg%2F11b5pjxgby?entry=ttu&g_ep=EgoyMDI2MDYxMy4wIKXMDSoASAFQAw%3D%3D]]></description>
