  <Placemark>
    <name>Schoodic Bog Sullivan ME</name>
    <description><![CDATA[Schoodic Bog<br/><br/>📍 Schoodic Bog Road, via Punkinville Rd/Punkin Ledge Rd off Route 1, Sullivan, ME<br/><br/>500 acres including a 150-acre bog at the base of Schoodic Mountain, connecting to the State of Maine's Donnell Pond Unit trail system. 4 mi of trail.<br/><br/>Tips<br/>- Connects directly into the much larger Donnell Pond Public Reserved Land trail system]]></description>
