  <Placemark>
    <name>Schoodic Connector Trail Sullivan ME</name>
    <description><![CDATA[Schoodic Connector Trail<br/><br/>📍 Punkinville Road, Sullivan, ME (3.4 mi north of the Hancock-Sullivan Bridge on Rt 1N)<br/><br/>2.6 mi one-way (part of a 6.5 mi system connecting 1,100+ acres), reaching Schoodic Mountain's bare, flat summit — 360-degree views over Frenchman Bay and Mount Desert Island. Links to the Down East Sunrise Trail and the 14,000+-acre Donnell Pond Public Reserved Land.<br/><br/>Tips<br/>- The summit views here are genuinely comparable to Acadia's big-name overlooks, with a fraction of the crowds]]></description>
