  <Placemark>
    <name>Schooner Appledore II Camden ME</name>
    <description><![CDATA[Schooner Appledore II<br/><br/>📍 18 Bayview Landing, Camden, ME 04843<br/><br/>Classic two-masted wooden schooner offering day sails, sunset sails, and fully customizable private charters from Camden Harbor. By far the most-reviewed boat operator in the area (2,700+ reviews) — the vessel winters in Key West, FL and returns to Maine each summer.<br/><br/>Tips<br/>- Sunset sail is the standout option if only doing one Camden Harbor cruise<br/>- Books up — reserve ahead in peak season<br/><br/>More info: https://appledore2.com/]]></description>
