  <Placemark>
    <name>Schooner Lazy Jack Camden ME</name>
    <description><![CDATA[Schooner Lazy Jack<br/><br/>📍 15 Public Landing, Camden, ME 04843<br/><br/>58-foot schooner Lazy Jack II, built by Captain Sean O'Connor in 2004. Offers relaxed, romantic 2-hour daysails and private charters on Penobscot Bay from Camden's Public Landing, running daily June through October.<br/><br/>Tips<br/>- Smaller and more intimate than the big windjammers — good for couples or small groups<br/>- Book ahead in peak summer<br/><br/>More info: https://schoonerlazyjack.com/]]></description>
