  <Placemark>
    <name>Schooner Olad &amp; Cutter Owl Camden ME</name>
    <description><![CDATA[Schooner Olad & Cutter Owl<br/><br/>📍 1 Bayview Landing, Camden, ME 04843<br/><br/>Two vessels run under one operation out of Camden Harbor: the restored 1927 yacht Olad offers 2-hour public sails and charters for up to 22 passengers, while the 1941 John Alden–designed Cutter Owl is a more intimate charter for up to 6 guests.<br/><br/>Tips<br/>- Olad for a bigger public sail, Cutter Owl for a small private group<br/>- Retail/booking office at 29 Main St, Camden<br/><br/>More info: https://www.maineschooners.com/]]></description>
