  <Placemark>
    <name>Scott's Place Camden ME</name>
    <description><![CDATA[Scott's Place<br/><br/>📍 Reny's Plaza, Route 1, Camden, ME (just south of town center)<br/><br/>A Camden takeout institution since 1974 — a wide-ranging lunch menu of hot and cold sandwiches, lobster rolls, cheeseburgers, hot dogs, wraps, onion rings, and fries, served from a stand in the Reny's parking lot. Rated 4.7. Cash only, open year-round with reduced winter hours. Picnic tables on site, plenty of free parking.<br/><br/>Must Order<br/>- Lobster roll<br/>- Burgers — specifically praised alongside the lobster roll as the standout dishes<br/><br/>Tips<br/>- Cash only — no cards, plan accordingly.<br/>- Some reviews note portions run a bit small for the price — go in expecting a quick, affordable bite rather than a huge meal.<br/>- Good option to grab food and eat at the picnic tables rather than sit-down dining.<br/><br/>More info: https://www.google.com/maps/place/Scott's+Place/@44.2054774,-69.081107,1704m/data=!3m2!1e3!5s0x4cadd71294e68da5:0xc50270c1eb079b5e!4m6!3m5!1s0x4cadd712e17a5063:0xf71f89cb5d1190ad!8m2!3d44.2054769!4d-69.0708896!16s%2Fg%2F1tm880cr?entry=ttu&g_ep=EgoyMDI2MDYxMC4wIKXMDSoASAFQAw%3D%3D]]></description>
