  <Placemark>
    <name>Sea Dog Brewing Company Camden ME</name>
    <description><![CDATA[Sea Dog Brewing Company<br/><br/>📍 1 Main St, Camden, ME 04843<br/><br/>Harborfront brewpub with a large back deck overlooking Camden's inner harbor. Rated ~4.1 (BeerAdvocate 4.07); Reddit specifically recommends the weekend Bloody Mary bar at brunch.<br/><br/>Tips<br/>- Open daily 11am-9pm.<br/>- One Tripadvisor listing shows an outlier 2.0/5 rank #40-of-40 figure that looks like a stale/duplicate listing artifact — general sentiment across Yelp and BeerAdvocate is clearly positive, worth a quick gut-check closer to the trip rather than trusting either extreme blindly.<br/>- Service reviews are mixed (some slow-service complaints) — not a five-star pick, but a solid harborfront brunch/beer option.<br/><br/>More info: https://www.seadogbrewing.com/location/camden/]]></description>
    <styleUrl>#c-red</styleUrl>
