  <Placemark>
    <name>Sea Hag Cider Co Rockport ME</name>
    <description><![CDATA[Sea Hag Cider Co.<br/><br/>📍 Rockport, ME<br/><br/>Small-batch hard cider tasting room in a low-key setting that stays well under the radar compared to better-known brewery spots. A genuinely under-the-radar artisan cider experience.<br/><br/>Tips<br/>- Small-batch, artisan focus<br/>- Low-key tasting room<br/>- Off the main tourist radar<br/>- Local craft cider<br/>- Casual, unpretentious atmosphere]]></description>
