    <name>Seal Cove Picnic Area Blue Hill ME</name>
    <description><![CDATA[Seal Cove Picnic Area<br/><br/>📍 675 Cape Rd, Sedgwick, ME<br/><br/>A picnic area with fire pits on the Blue Hill peninsula — a good spot for an evening fire and sunset watch. (4.7★, 136 reviews on Google Maps)<br/><br/>Tips<br/>- Has fire pits — a good option for an evening cookout or sunset watch]]></description>
