  <Placemark>
    <name>Seal Harbor Beach Seal Harbor ME</name>
    <description><![CDATA[Seal Harbor Beach<br/><br/>📍 Route 3, Seal Harbor, ME<br/><br/>A small ocean beach in the village of Seal Harbor, off the main Park Loop Road shuttle route. Blogs describe it as "nowhere near as crowded" as Sand Beach, though also "not as scenic" — a real trade-off for anyone who wants beach time without the crowds.<br/><br/>Tips<br/>- Limited parking right in the village — arrive early or plan to walk in<br/>- Good pairing with Little Long Pond or Day Mountain Trail, both nearby]]></description>
    <styleUrl>#c-green</styleUrl>
