  <Placemark>
    <name>Searsport Antique Mall Searsport ME</name>
    <description><![CDATA[Searsport Antique Mall<br/><br/>📍 Searsport ME<br/><br/>Sprawling multi-dealer antique mall in the self-proclaimed Antiques Capital of Maine.<br/><br/>Tips<br/>- Allow at least an hour to browse — it's large.<br/>- Combine with Penobscot Marine Museum nearby.]]></description>
