  <Placemark>
    <name>Searsport Public Pier</name>
    <description><![CDATA[Searsport Public Pier is a fishing pier that offers stunning views of the bay and islands. It is open until midnight and has picnic tables, but does not serve food or alcohol.<br/><br/>More info: https://www.google.com/maps/place/Searsport+Public+Pier/@44.4708154,-68.9663774,8069m/data=!3m1!1e3!4m11!1m3!2m2!1sscenic+spot!6e1!3m6!1s0x4cae6f4df506cef3:0x2fbfdc78285e7a81!8m2!3d44.4532524!4d-68.9255014!15sCgtzY2VuaWMgc3BvdFoNIgtzY2VuaWMgc3BvdJIBDGZpc2hpbmdfcGllcpoBJENoZERTVWhOTUc5blMwVkpRMEZuVFVOQmMzSmlVMmhCUlJBQuABAPoBBAgAEDw!16s%2Fg%2F11b7gp2c6h?entry=ttu&g_ep=EgoyMDI2MDcxMy4wIKXMDSoASAFQAw%3D%3D]]></description>
