    </Point>
  </Placemark>
  <Placemark>
    <name>Shelburne Farms Shelburne VT</name>
    <description><![CDATA[Shelburne Farms<br/><br/>📍 Shelburne VT<br/><br/>1,400-acre National Historic Landmark working farm on Lake Champlain with trails through farmlands, lakefront views, artisan cheese-making, and a Victorian-era Farm Barn.<br/><br/>Tips<br/>- Buy the cheddar at the farm store — it's made on-site.<br/>- The walking trail to the lakefront is free with farm admission.]]></description>
