  <Placemark>
    <name>Shelburne Museum Shelburne VT</name>
    <description><![CDATA[Shelburne Museum<br/><br/>📍 Shelburne VT<br/><br/>45-acre campus with 39 exhibition buildings housing 150,000+ artifacts — Impressionist paintings, folk art, quilts, furniture, and an intact 220-ft steamboat.<br/><br/>Tips<br/>- Allow a full half-day minimum — the campus is huge.<br/>- Shelburne Farms is just a few minutes away; combine for a full day.]]></description>
