    </Point>
  </Placemark>
  <Placemark>
    <name>Sherman's Maine Coast Book Shop &amp; Cafe Damariscotta ME</name>
    <description><![CDATA[Sherman's Maine Coast Book Shop & Café<br/><br/>📍 158 Main Street, Damariscotta, ME<br/><br/>Maine's oldest operating bookstore, open since 1886 — new books, gifts, and cards, with an adjoining café for coffee and baked goods while you browse.<br/><br/>Tips<br/>- Distinct from Barn Door Baking Co.'s standalone breakfast/lunch restaurant further down Main St (212 Main St) — the café here is the smaller in-store version.<br/>- Pet friendly.<br/><br/>More info: https://shermans.com/]]></description>
