  </Placemark>
  <Placemark>
    <name>Ship Harbor Nature Trail Acadia National Park ME</name>
    <description><![CDATA[Ship Harbor Nature Trail<br/><br/>📍 Route 102A, Tremont ME (Acadia National Park, quiet side)<br/><br/>A flat, easy 1.5-mile loop on the quiet side of the island near Bass Harbor/Tremont, with consistently strong reviews for its uncrowded coastal views. Good tidepooling and birdwatching along Ship Harbor.<br/><br/>Tips<br/>- Flat loop, no exposure — an easy, relaxed walk.<br/>- About half a mile from Wonderland Trail on the same road — easy to combine both in one outing.<br/>- Close to Bass Harbor Head Lighthouse if you want to round out a quiet-side morning.]]></description>
