  <Placemark>
    <name>Ships Inn Restaurant Nantucket MA</name>
    <description><![CDATA[Ships Inn Restaurant<br/><br/>📍 Nantucket MA<br/><br/>Fine-dining New American seafood restaurant in an 1831 historic whaling captain's house.<br/><br/>Must Order<br/>- Seasonal seafood tasting menu<br/><br/>Tips<br/>- Reservations essential — small dining room.<br/>- One of Nantucket's top dinner spots.]]></description>
