  <Placemark>
    <name>Shorter House Crawford NY</name>
    <description><![CDATA[Shorter House<br/><br/>📍 Andrews Road, Town of Crawford, Orange County, NY<br/><br/>A historic house on Andrews Road in the Town of Crawford, on the National Register of Historic Places. Sits well outside the byway's usual Ulster County core, closer to Middletown than to New Paltz or Ellenville.<br/><br/>Tips<br/>- Private property — a detour destination, not a natural stop on the main byway loop.<br/><br/>More info: https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=41.5717%2C%20-74.3458]]></description>
