  <Placemark>
    <name>Silvia Woodstock, NY</name>
    <description><![CDATA[Silvia<br/><br/>📍 Woodstock, NY<br/><br/>An open-kitchen wood-fire restaurant widely regarded as one of the Catskills' most accomplished tables — inventive fire-driven cooking with exceptional local sourcing.<br/><br/>Must Order<br/>- Wood-fired vegetables — the kitchen's greatest strength<br/>- 14-oz steak — with charred jalapeño chimichurri<br/>- Smoked fish — a recurring and outstanding starter<br/><br/>Tips<br/>- Reserve 1–2 weeks in advance for weekend dinner<br/>- The open kitchen makes the bar the best seat in the house<br/><br/>More info: https://www.google.com/maps/search/Silvia+Woodstock,+NY]]></description>
