    <description><![CDATA[Simon Trail<br/><br/>📍 Pinkham's Flats Road (Rt 204/Partridge Cove Rd), Lamoine, ME (2.3 mi past Lamoine Town Hall)<br/><br/>70 acres of lush woodland loop under conservation easement, with large pines and abundant ferns, mosses, and mushrooms. Includes an outdoor classroom (20-person capacity). 1 mi / 1.1 mi loop; popular for snowshoeing.]]></description>
