    <name>Skidompha Secondhand Book Shop Damariscotta ME</name>
    <description><![CDATA[Time: 2026-08-10T16:00:00<br/><br/>Skidompha Secondhand Book Shop<br/><br/>📍 Main Street, Damariscotta, ME<br/><br/>A used bookstore on Main Street run by the Skidompha Public Library, stocked with donated secondhand books. Named "Best Maine Used Bookstore" by Yankee Magazine. (Rating updated 2026-08-09 to 4.8 per Tom — the note previously left it blank since online review counts were thin.)<br/><br/>Tips<br/>- Proceeds support the Skidompha Public Library.<br/>- Coordinates are an approximate downtown-Main-Street match — no precise address geocode was available.<br/>- Easy pairing with other downtown Damariscotta Main Street stops.]]></description>
