  <Placemark>
    <name>Skunk Hollow Tavern Hartland VT</name>
    <description><![CDATA[Skunk Hollow Tavern offers American cuisine with a focus on hearty dishes. The price range is $30–50 per person. It's open for dinner from 5 PM to 8:30 PM on Thursday, Friday, Saturday, and Wednesday. They serve alcohol, including beer and cocktails.<br/><br/>More info: https://www.google.com/maps/place/Skunk+Hollow+Tavern/@43.530447,-72.504616,10.49z/data=!3m1!5s0x4cb4b456582c895d:0x460312c13b1a39e0!4m14!1m7!3m6!1s0x4cb4b456571dd271:0x73fa09b60881ddbf!2sThree+Tomatoes+Trattoria!8m2!3d43.642996!4d-72.2526206!16s%2Fm%2F02068p1!3m5!1s0x89e1dc08271916fb:0x75f9a108caa72f78!8m2!3d43.5455773!4d-72.4261254!16s%2Fg%2F1td669vn?entry=ttu&g_ep=EgoyMDI2MDYyMy4wIKXMDSoASAFQAw%3D%3D]]></description>
