    <description><![CDATA[Sky Acres Airport<br/><br/>📍 Styles Way, Verbank, NY 12585<br/><br/>A favorite stop for small, private plane owners was opened in 1965 on a former farm.<br/><br/>Tips<br/>- Stop 2 of 39 on the Union Vale, Beekman, Pawling & Dover Scenic Tour (Tour 6).]]></description>
