    <name>Slate's Restaurant and Bakery Hallowell ME</name>
    <description><![CDATA[Slate's Restaurant & Bakery<br/><br/>📍 Water Street, Hallowell, ME<br/><br/>A 25-plus-year local institution serving lunch and bakery items in the heart of Hallowell's antique district. A dining anchor for the Water Street browsing experience.<br/><br/>Tips<br/>- Center of Hallowell's downtown antique/gallery scene<br/>- Casual lunch spot with bakery items<br/>- Local favorite, not touristy<br/>- Good base for exploring Water Street shops]]></description>
