  <Placemark>
    <name>Smashed Burgers &amp; Brews Damariscotta ME</name>
    <description><![CDATA[Smashed Burgers & Brews<br/><br/>📍 85 Parking Lot Lane, Damariscotta, ME<br/><br/>A casual burger-and-brews spot known for its smashed-burger technique and house-made components — bacon jam, herb cheese, thick-cut house corned beef for the Reuben. Also does fish and chips, a Haddock Rachel, pizza, and wings. Reviewers consistently call out prompt, friendly, knowledgeable service and generous portions at reasonable prices, with a happy hour that makes an evening out especially affordable.<br/><br/>Must Order<br/>- French Herb Burger — topped with bacon jam and herb cheese, both house-made<br/>- Reuben — thick-cut house-made corned beef<br/>- Haddock Rachel<br/><br/>Tips<br/>- Happy hour is worth timing your visit around if you're budget-conscious.<br/>- Good option if the group wants a casual, no-fuss meal after an active day rather than a sit-down dinner.]]></description>
