  <Placemark>
    <name>Smoky Rock BBQ Red Hook, NY</name>
    <description><![CDATA[Smoky Rock BBQ<br/><br/>📍 Red Hook, NY<br/><br/>Serious wood-smoked barbecue using Hudson Valley-sourced meats — the best BBQ in Dutchess County.<br/><br/>Must Order<br/>- Brisket — long-smoked, properly rested<br/>- Pulled pork — consistently excellent<br/>- Smoked chicken — juicy and well-seasoned<br/><br/>Tips<br/>- Weekends only for dinner; check website for current hours<br/>- Sides are house-made; the cornbread and coleslaw are standouts<br/><br/>More info: https://www.google.com/maps/search/Smoky+Rock+BBQ+Red+Hook,+NY]]></description>
