  <Placemark>
    <name>Snyder Estate Natural Cement Historic District Rosendale, NY</name>
    <description><![CDATA[Snyder Estate Natural Cement Historic District<br/><br/>📍 Rosendale, NY<br/><br/>About 20 cement companies once worked this area, employing more than 5,000 men. The district preserves artifacts and structures from that era, just west of Main Street in Rosendale.<br/><br/>Tips<br/>- Rt 213, west of Main Street, Rosendale<br/>- Pair with the Rosendale trestle bridge (now a walking bridge) and Main Street's shops and cafes<br/><br/>More info: https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=41.8370%2C%20-74.0870]]></description>
