    <name>Sojourner Truth Statue Poughkeepsie NY</name>
    <description><![CDATA[Sojourner Truth Statue<br/><br/>📍 87 Haviland Rd, Poughkeepsie, NY<br/><br/>A historical landmark memorializing Sojourner Truth. Open 24 hours; not a food establishment.<br/><br/>Tips<br/>- Visitors often come to learn about Sojourner Truth's legacy and significance to the region.]]></description>
