  <Placemark>
    <name>Sonder Hudson, NY</name>
    <description><![CDATA[Sonder<br/><br/>📍 Hudson, NY<br/><br/>An intimate, seasonally driven tasting menu restaurant drawing serious food travelers to Hudson with consistently excellent technique-driven cooking.<br/><br/>Must Order<br/>- Tasting menu — 7–9 courses, the only option<br/>- Wine pairings — natural and classic producers curated thoughtfully<br/><br/>Tips<br/>- Reservations essential — books weeks out<br/>- Counter seating at the open kitchen is the best seat<br/><br/>More info: https://www.google.com/maps/search/Sonder+Hudson,+NY]]></description>
