  <Placemark>
    <name>Sour’s Taverna Littleton NH</name>
    <description><![CDATA[Overview<br/>Type: Tapas Restaurant  <br/>Best known for: Amazing food and service; Unique Greek take on tapas.  <br/>Location context: Not mentioned  <br/>Price level: $20–60  <br/>Visit timing: Not mentioned  <br/><br/>Typical Customers<br/>Demographics: Mix of locals and tourists  <br/>Group types: Couples, friends, families, small groups  <br/>Common occasions: Casual dinner, date night  <br/><br/>Vibe & Setting<br/>Atmosphere: Cozy and intimate  <br/>Noise level: Moderate  <br/>Decor & setting: Indoor seating, good lighting for dates  <br/>Service style: Attentive and friendly  <br/><br/>Recommended Dishes<br/>Overall dish consensus  <br/>Reviewers highly recommend dishes like Crispy lamb belly and lamb neck tortellini for their distinctive flavors and execution.  <br/><br/>How “top dishes” are determined  <br/>Top dishes are chosen based on popular mentions in the reviews, frequent appearances in photos, and repeated strong praise regarding flavor and execution.  <br/><br/>| Rank | Dish                             | Why it stands out                                  | How often it’s mentioned         | Ideal for               |<br/>|------|----------------------------------|---------------------------------------------------|----------------------------------|-------------------------|<br/>| 1    | Crispy lamb belly                | Notable for its crispy texture and delicious flavor.| Mentioned in many reviews      | Hearty sharing option   |<br/>| 2    | Lamb neck tortellini             | Praised for unique taste and great execution.      | Repeatedly called out as a favorite | Date night, sharing     |<br/>| 3    | Bluefin tuna crudo               | Acclaimed for fresh flavors and presentation.     | Appears in numerous photos      | Lighter option          |<br/><br/>Good alternates / backup choices<br/>- Pita bread with dips: Frequently mentioned for being a comforting shareable item.  <br/>- Roasted Brussels sprouts: Noted for their generous portion.  <br/><br/>Highlights (non-dish positives from reviews)<br/>Positive service: Reviewers consistently mention attentive and friendly service contributing to a pleasant dining experience.  <br/>Atmosphere: The cozy and intimate setting is ideal for dates and gatherings.  <br/><br/>Common Issues (from reviews)<br/>Busy times: Not mentioned  <br/>Wait times: Not mentioned  <br/><br/>Practical Notes<br/>Reservation / wait: Not mentioned  <br/>Accessibility: Not mentioned  <br/>Parking / transit: Not mentioned  <br/>Best use case: Best for date nights or casual gatherings with friends.<br/><br/>More info: https://www.google.com/maps/place/Sour%E2%80%99s+Taverna/@44.3066856,-71.775871,391m/data=!3m2!1e3!5s0x4cb46f2d76521e09:0xcacbc94895ffeb0d!4m14!1m7!3m6!1s0x4cb46f2d8d8d7741:0x655c417a30beacd!2sChang+Thai+Cafe!8m2!3d44.3066109!4d-71.7731008!16s%2Fg%2F1tg34trv!3m5!1s0x4cb46fe664b6746f:0xe7536e84b280f790!8m2!3d44.3066851!4d-71.7745719!16s%2Fg%2F11w9yznk5d?entry=ttu&g_ep=EgoyMDI2MDYxMy4wIKXMDSoASAFQAw%3D%3D]]></description>
