    <name>Spettro Poughkeepsie NY</name>
    <description><![CDATA[Overview<br/>Type: Restaurant<br/><br/>Best known for: Amazing food and atmosphere; Modern Italian cuisine.<br/><br/>Location context: Not mentioned<br/><br/>Price level: $20–30 per person<br/><br/>Visit timing: Not mentioned<br/><br/>Typical Customers<br/>Demographics: Not mentioned<br/><br/>Group types: Couples, friends, families<br/><br/>Common occasions: Brunch, special occasions, casual dinner<br/><br/>Vibe & Setting<br/>Atmosphere: Cozy, modern, casual<br/><br/>Noise level: Moderate<br/><br/>Decor & setting: Indoor seating<br/><br/>Service style: Attentive and friendly<br/><br/>Recommended Dishes<br/>Overall dish consensus<br/>Dishes like "Onion Soup" and pizza have received praise for their flavors and quality from reviewers, highlighting an enjoyable dining experience.<br/><br/>How “top dishes” are determined<br/>Top dishes are identified based on their frequency in reviews and menu mentions, along with strong praise from diners in their comments. <br/><br/>| Rank | Dish          | Why it stands out                               | How often it’s mentioned              | Ideal for                  |<br/>|------|---------------|-------------------------------------------------|------------------------------------|----------------------------|<br/>| 1    | Onion Soup    | Rich flavor, well-liked by many diners.       | Mentioned in numerous reviews       | Sharing at the table       |<br/>| 2    | Pizza         | Noted for excellent dough and toppings.       | Appears in numerous photos         | Hearty main                |<br/>| 3    | Prosciutto    | Delicious pairing with various dishes.        | Repeatedly called out as a favorite | Lighter option             |<br/><br/>Good alternates / backup choices<br/>- Calamari: Praised for its texture and flavor.<br/><br/>Highlights (non-dish positives from reviews)<br/>Flavors and Portions: Reviewers mentioned that dishes range from appetizers to desserts, consistently offering bold flavors and generous portions.<br/><br/>Atmosphere: The restaurant's vibe is described as cozy with low lighting, contributing to a pleasant dining experience.<br/><br/>Common Issues (from reviews)<br/>Service inconsistencies: Some diners reported mixed experiences with staff friendliness, particularly during busy times.<br/><br/>Practical Notes<br/>Reservation / wait: Reservations encouraged for busy times.<br/><br/>Accessibility: Not mentioned<br/><br/>Parking / transit: Not mentioned<br/><br/>Best use case: Ideal for date nights or casual dining with friends.<br/><br/>More info: https://www.google.com/maps/place/Spettro/@41.6920833,-73.8996782,828m/data=!3m2!1e3!4b1!4m6!3m5!1s0x89dd3f746a6c3633:0x2b2a1ad64202f32e!8m2!3d41.6920833!4d-73.8971033!16s%2Fg%2F11vb_35zhv?entry=ttu&g_ep=EgoyMDI2MDYxMy4wIKXMDSoASAFQAw%3D%3D]]></description>
