    <name>Spinnaker Restaurant Brewster MA</name>
    <description><![CDATA[Spinnaker Restaurant<br/><br/>📍 Brewster MA<br/><br/>Chef-owned inn restaurant open Thu–Sun evenings with innovative New American presentations; reviewers consistently rank it on par with the best in Boston or NYC.<br/><br/>Must Order<br/>- <br/><br/>Tips<br/>- Reservations strongly recommended — open Thu–Sun 5–8 pm only.<br/>- Small intimate room; book ahead especially for weekend dinners.]]></description>
