    <name>Spotty Dog Books &amp; Ale Hudson, NY</name>
    <description><![CDATA[Spotty Dog Books & Ale<br/><br/>📍 Hudson, NY<br/><br/>A beloved Hudson institution pairing 10,000+ new books with 12 rotating craft ales on tap — an excellent independent bookstore and convivial neighborhood bar in one space.<br/><br/>Tips<br/>- Selection skews literary fiction, art, and local history<br/>- Great mid-afternoon pint stop during a Warren Street gallery walk<br/><br/>More info: https://www.google.com/maps/search/Spotty+Dog+Books+&+Ale+Hudson,+NY]]></description>
