  <Placemark>
    <name>Spring Street Eatery</name>
    <description><![CDATA[Spring Street Eatery is a casual restaurant that offers a variety of dishes with a focus on comfort food. Prices range from $10 to $30, and it is open for lunch and dinner.<br/><br/>More info: https://www.google.com/maps/place/Spring+Street+Eatery/@44.4221712,-69.0166066,2023m/data=!3m1!1e3!4m13!1m5!2m4!1sRestaurants!5m1!4e9!6e5!3m6!1s0x4cae6f00561b029f:0x7f8aa246e2d1177d!8m2!3d44.4270204!4d-69.0036792!15sCgtSZXN0YXVyYW50c1oNIgtyZXN0YXVyYW50c5IBCnJlc3RhdXJhbnSaAURDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnhLUldWWVFsQlVWVXBhVDBWV1dVMVdSa05oVlU1WVdtczRNVlJ1WXhBQuABAPoBBAhAEEA!16s%2Fg%2F11mdxmd846?entry=ttu&g_ep=EgoyMDI2MDcxMy4wIKXMDSoASAFQAw%3D%3D]]></description>
