    <name>Spring Woods Gallery Sullivan ME</name>
    <description><![CDATA[Spring Woods Gallery<br/><br/>📍 Sullivan, ME<br/><br/>An art gallery in the small Down East village of Sullivan, a quiet stop along the Schoodic Scenic Byway route.<br/><br/>Tips<br/>- Check current hours before a dedicated trip — small rural galleries like this often keep limited, seasonal schedules.<br/><br/>More info: https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=44.5204%2C%20-68.1976]]></description>
