  <Placemark>
    <name>Spruce Peak at Stowe VT</name>
    <description><![CDATA[Spruce Peak at Stowe<br/><br/>📍 Six miles from downtown Stowe, at the base of Mount Mansfield, VT<br/><br/>A ski-in/ski-out alpine village at the base of Mount Mansfield, the centerpiece of a $400 million alpine neighborhood developed over 16 years. The Lodge at Spruce Peak — Stowe's only ski-in/ski-out luxury hotel — has 312 rooms, a 21,000-square-foot spa, ski access to over 100 trails, exclusive access to the private Stowe Mountain Club, a Bob Cupp-designed mountain golf course, and a heated outdoor pool. Beyond winter, the resort offers mountain biking, fly fishing, and golf.<br/><br/>Tips<br/>- A genuine luxury-resort splurge option if base-camping in Stowe — book well ahead in peak ski/foliage seasons.<br/><br/>More info: https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=44.5308%2C%20-72.7805]]></description>
