  <Placemark>
    <name>St. Clair Preserve Northport ME</name>
    <description><![CDATA[St. Clair Preserve<br/><br/>📍 Knights Pond Rd, Northport, ME<br/><br/>310 acres along the shore of Knight Pond, with swimming and paddling access and undeveloped lake views. Transferred to the Land Trust in 2015 by The Nature Conservancy, with initial donations dating to 1962 and 1988.<br/><br/>Tips<br/>- North shore trail access is 1.3 mi down Knights Pond Rd from Beech Hill Rd<br/>- South shore/lake access: park at the town boat launch at the end of Knights Pond Rd<br/><br/>More info: https://www.coastalmountains.org]]></description>
