    <description><![CDATA[St. Paul's Episcopal Church<br/><br/>📍 Route 44, Pleasant Valley, NY<br/><br/>Little changed since it was built in 1842, located across the highway from Albrecht's Dairy.<br/><br/>Tips<br/>- Stop 18 of 26 on the Hyde Park, Clinton & Pleasant Valley Scenic Tour (Tour 3).]]></description>
