  <Placemark>
    <name>Sterling Ridge Resort Cambridge VT</name>
    <description><![CDATA[Sterling Ridge Resort<br/><br/>📍 Jeffersonville, Cambridge, VT<br/><br/>A resort in Jeffersonville with cabin and log-home-style accommodations, well positioned between Stowe and Smugglers' Notch for skiing, hiking, and general Lamoille Valley exploring.<br/><br/>Tips<br/>- A good lodging base if splitting time between Stowe's east side and the Smugglers' Notch/Jeffersonville area.<br/><br/>More info: https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=44.6365%2C%20-72.8097]]></description>
