  <Placemark>
    <name>Stilwell Stone House Accord NY</name>
    <description><![CDATA[Stilwell Stone House<br/><br/>📍 Town of Rochester, near Accord, NY<br/><br/>An 18th-century stone farmhouse in the Rondout Valley stone-house tradition, part of a cluster of historic stone dwellings — alongside the nearby Stilwill Westbrook and Van Wagenen houses — built by early Dutch and Huguenot-descended settlers in the Town of Rochester.<br/><br/>Tips<br/>- Private residence — view from the road as part of a drive past the area's stone-house cluster.<br/><br/>More info: https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=41.8111%2C%20-74.1886]]></description>
    <styleUrl>#c-green</styleUrl>
    <ExtendedData>
      <Data name="vault_type"><value>Historical</value></Data>
