  <Placemark>
    <name>Stone Barn Northeast Harbor ME</name>
    <description><![CDATA[Stone Barn<br/><br/>📍 Corner of Norway Dr & Crooked Rd, near Northeast Harbor, ME<br/><br/>An unmarked historic stone barn at the corner of Norway Drive and Crooked Road, with a hiking trail behind it leading to a lupine field. Genuinely obscure — it's not signed as an attraction, so it doesn't get much visitor traffic.<br/><br/>Tips<br/>- No official signage — look for the stone barn itself at the Norway Dr/Crooked Rd corner<br/>- Best in lupine bloom season (typically June)]]></description>
