  <Placemark>
    <name>Stone L'Oven Pizza Co. Brewster MA</name>
    <description><![CDATA[Stone L'Oven Pizza Co.<br/><br/>📍 Brewster MA<br/><br/>Hand-tossed, stone-fired Neapolitan-style pies made with all-natural ingredients — a beloved local standout drawing diners from well outside Brewster.<br/><br/>Must Order<br/>- Neapolitan wood-fired pizza<br/><br/>Tips<br/>- Open Tue–Sun from 4 pm; closed Mondays.<br/>- Good casual dinner option on nights not suited for a full sit-down meal.]]></description>
