  <Placemark>
    <name>Stowe Pinnacle Trail Stowe VT</name>
    <description><![CDATA[Stowe Pinnacle Trail<br/><br/>📍 Stowe VT<br/><br/>Challenging 3.3-mile out-and-back to an open summit with sweeping panoramic views — one of the most-reviewed trails in Vermont and #1 activity in Stowe.<br/><br/>Tips<br/>- Allow 2.5–3 hours round trip.<br/>- The open meadow summit is the reward — clear days show Mount Mansfield and the Green Mountains.]]></description>
