  <Placemark>
    <name>Stowe Recreation Path Stowe VT</name>
    <description><![CDATA[Stowe Recreation Path<br/><br/>📍 Stowe VT<br/><br/>Paved 5.5-mile nonmotorized greenway from the village along the West Branch River — flat, family-friendly, passing restaurants, a brewery, and picnic areas.<br/><br/>Tips<br/>- Rent bikes in the village for the best experience.<br/>- The path runs past several restaurants and shops — easy to stop en route.]]></description>
