  <Placemark>
    <name>Sub Somboon Street Food</name>
    <description><![CDATA[Sub Somboon Street Food offers delicious Thai cuisine with prices ranging from $10 to $20. It is open for lunch and dinner, but it closes early on Sundays. Alcohol is not mentioned to be served.<br/><br/>More info: https://www.google.com/maps/place/Sub+Somboon+Street+Food/@44.08514,-69.200832,18853m/data=!3m1!1e3!4m13!1m5!2m4!1sRestaurants!5m1!4e9!6e5!3m6!1s0x4cadd12c646a2cd5:0x33d882d9b631d4d7!8m2!3d44.1295764!4d-69.0952048!15sCgtSZXN0YXVyYW50c1oNIgtyZXN0YXVyYW50c5IBCnJlc3RhdXJhbnSaAURDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnhOZUZWRlVrdGlSM2g0VDBSak5GUXpUbEpXVlRsQ1VWWmpNbU15WXhBQuABAPoBBAgAEEs!16s%2Fg%2F11y7bpfnbp?entry=ttu&g_ep=EgoyMDI2MDcxMy4wIKXMDSoASAFQAw%3D%3D]]></description>
