  <Placemark>
    <name>Subversive Brewing Catskill, NY</name>
    <description><![CDATA[Subversive Brewing<br/><br/>📍 Catskill, NY<br/><br/>A Catskill craft brewery using traditional and archaic brewing methods, celebrated for its smashburgers and creative tap list.<br/><br/>Tips<br/>- The smashburger rivals any in the valley — an unexpected highlight<br/>- Traditional and historic ales alongside accessible styles<br/>- The taproom has a good neighborhood energy<br/><br/>More info: https://www.google.com/maps/search/Subversive+Brewing+Catskill,+NY]]></description>
