  <Placemark>
    <name>Sugar Hill Errol NH</name>
    <description><![CDATA[Sugar Hill<br/><br/>📍 Near Errol, NH<br/><br/>A peak near Errol, along the Moose Path Trail corridor — the third distinct "Sugar Hill" in this vault, unrelated to the town near Franconia or the Kancamagus overlook of the same name.<br/><br/>Tips<br/>- No well-documented public trail found — treat as a landmark rather than a planned hike unless you find current access info locally.<br/><br/>More info: https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=44.6837%2C%20-71.1942]]></description>
