  <Placemark>
    <name>Sugarbush Golf Course Warren VT</name>
    <description><![CDATA[Sugarbush Golf Course<br/><br/>📍 Sugarbush Resort, Warren, VT<br/><br/>The golf course at Sugarbush Resort, set against Green Mountain views — the resort's warm-weather counterpart to its winter ski terrain. (Not to be confused with Sugarbush Farm in Woodstock, VT, an unrelated maple/cheese farm elsewhere in this vault.)<br/><br/>Tips<br/>- Book tee times ahead in peak summer/fall season.<br/><br/>More info: https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=44.1351%2C%20-72.8788]]></description>
