  <Placemark>
    <name>Sugarbush Valley Warren VT</name>
    <description><![CDATA[Sugarbush Valley<br/><br/>📍 Warren, VT<br/><br/>The valley encompassing Sugarbush Resort's two connected mountains, Lincoln Peak and Mount Ellen — one of Vermont's largest ski resorts, with extensive terrain and a full-service base village.<br/><br/>Tips<br/>- See the separate Sugarbush Golf Course note for warm-weather activity here.<br/><br/>More info: https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=44.1351%2C%20-72.8900]]></description>
