  <Placemark>
    <name>Sunnyside Damariscotta ME</name>
    <description><![CDATA[Sunnyside<br/><br/>📍 212 Main St, Damariscotta, ME<br/><br/>A breakfast-and-brunch spot from the team behind Barn Door Baking Co., open Friday through Monday only. Menu runs breakfast sandwiches, quiche, sausage, croissants, cinnamon rolls, biscuits, and savory hand pies similar to empanadas — real bakery craft applied to breakfast rather than a standard diner menu. Cozy atmosphere, friendly and well-trained staff.<br/><br/>Must Order<br/>- Buttermilk biscuits — the most-praised item<br/>- Quiche<br/>- Savory hand pies, if available that day<br/><br/>Tips<br/>- Open Friday, Saturday, Sunday, and Monday only — closed Tuesday–Thursday, so plan around that if you want to hit it.<br/>- Weekend mornings will draw a crowd given the reputation — go early.<br/>- Pair with a visit to Barn Door Baking Co. itself if you want more of their baked goods to go.<br/><br/>More info: https://www.barndoorbakingcompany.com/sunnyside]]></description>
