ently noted for being pleasant and accommodating.  <br/><br/>Common Issues (from reviews)  <br/>Service speed: Some reviews mention variability in service speed during busy hours.  <br/><br/>Practical Notes  <br/>Reservation / wait: Walk-in friendly, reservations not mentioned.  <br/>Accessibility: Not mentioned  <br/>Parking / transit: Not mentioned  <br/>Best use case: Great date-night spot<br/><br/>More info: https://www.google.com/maps/place/Sushi+Simon/@26.5135088,-80.058192,20z/data=!4m12!1m5!2m4!1sdeli!5m1!4e9!6e5!3m5!1s0x88d8df002d6e3c9f:0x9c3468ce50100d4b!8m2!3d26.5130927!4d-80.0578961!16s%2Fg%2F11mt59vb9x?entry=ttu&g_ep=EgoyMDI2MDYxMC4wIKXMDSoASAFQAw%3D%3D]]></description>
