ce.<br/><br/>Practical Notes<br/>Reservation / wait: Walk-in friendly.<br/><br/>Accessibility: Not mentioned<br/><br/>Parking / transit: Not mentioned<br/><br/>Best use case: Great for casual dinners or quick bites.<br/><br/>More info: https://www.google.com/maps/place/T%26M+Viet+House/@26.5881068,-80.1516835,983m/data=!3m1!1e3!4m14!1m7!3m6!1s0x88d927177321c51b:0xfce1363afb20f8d4!2sT%26M+Viet+House!8m2!3d26.5881068!4d-80.1491086!16s%2Fg%2F11vqgtfb0d!3m5!1s0x88d927177321c51b:0xfce1363afb20f8d4!8m2!3d26.5881068!4d-80.1491086!16s%2Fg%2F11vqgtfb0d?entry=ttu&g_ep=EgoyMDI2MDYxMC4wIKXMDSoASAFQAw%3D%3D]]></description>
