    <description><![CDATA[TREATS<br/><br/>📍 80 Main Street, Wiscasset, ME<br/><br/>A local favorite — bakery, specialty food market, and coffee shop in one, known for drop scones, artisan sandwiches, and a well-curated cheese/wine selection.<br/><br/>Tips<br/>- Good picnic-provisioning stop before continuing on to Edgecomb/Damariscotta.]]></description>
