    <name>TWO Bistro &amp; Cafe Hartford VT</name>
    <description><![CDATA[This restaurant serves a variety of dishes with a price range of $20–30 per person. It is open for both lunch and dinner and is known to be LGBTQ+ friendly. Alcohol is served.<br/><br/>More info: https://www.google.com/maps/place/TWO+Bistro+%26+Cafe/@43.6446646,-72.4070374,4333m/data=!3m1!1e3!4m14!1m7!3m6!1s0x4cb4ca509c04c4e5:0x2919955d13aeb40b!2sBig+Fatty's+BBQ!8m2!3d43.6461808!4d-72.3182871!16s%2Fg%2F1tgnwty6!3m5!1s0x4cb4cd000c55bf97:0xf1f97999b529a9db!8m2!3d43.6524955!4d-72.391678!16s%2Fg%2F11n9lz3fvv?entry=ttu&g_ep=EgoyMDI2MDYyMy4wIKXMDSoASAFQAw%3D%3D]]></description>
