  <Placemark>
    <name>Taco the Town Brunswick ME</name>
    <description><![CDATA[Taco the Town<br/><br/>📍 205 Maine St, at the Downtown Mall & Gazebo, Brunswick, ME<br/><br/>A devoted local following (4.9 stars, 180+ reviews) for genuinely excellent, generous California-style Mexican street food parked right in Brunswick's downtown gazebo park.<br/><br/>Must Order<br/>- Pescado Ensenada — grilled haddock burrito, crispy fish, well-balanced salsa, "Nana's" Mexican rice<br/>- Pollo Asado burrito — cumin-lime marinated chicken<br/>- Breakfast burrito — reviewers call it "next level"<br/>- Homemade horchata — cinnamon-forward, not too sweet<br/>- Vegan sweet potato taco<br/><br/>Tips<br/>- Counter/walk-up service, outdoor seating only, no reservations<br/>- Open Tue-Sat 9am-2pm; closed Sun/Mon; breakfast items from 9am<br/>- Call (207) 838-8226 to confirm hours day-of]]></description>
