    <name>Taconic State Parkway Putnam Valley, NY</name>
    <description><![CDATA[Taconic State Parkway<br/><br/>📍 Putnam Valley, NY<br/><br/>A southern segment of the Taconic State Parkway near Putnam Valley, marking the transition from the rural Hudson Valley stretch of the byway into the more suburban Westchester County section.<br/><br/>Tips<br/>- This segment sits roughly midway on the byway list between the Dutchess/Columbia County stops and the Westchester ones near Kensico Dam.<br/><br/>More info: https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=41.444849,-73.816066]]></description>
