  <Placemark>
    <name>Tall Provisions Littleton NH</name>
    <description><![CDATA[Overview<br/>Type: American restaurant<br/><br/>Best known for: Excellent food and drinks, refined meals with a simple menu.<br/><br/>Location context: Not specified<br/><br/>Price level: $30–50<br/><br/>Visit timing: Popular during dinner, busy atmosphere.<br/><br/>Typical Customers<br/>Demographics: Mix of locals and tourists.<br/><br/>Group types: Couples, friends, families.<br/><br/>Common occasions: Casual dinner, date night.<br/><br/>Vibe & Setting<br/>Atmosphere: Casual yet refined.<br/><br/>Noise level: Moderate.<br/><br/>Decor & setting: Indoor seating, comfortable atmosphere.<br/><br/>Service style: Attentive and friendly as noted in reviews.<br/><br/>Recommended Dishes<br/>Overall dish consensus<br/>Reviewers frequently recommend the seared scallops and corn chowder, which are highlighted for their exceptional quality and flavor.<br/><br/>How “top dishes” are determined<br/>Top dishes are identified based on frequent mentions in reviews, presence in photos, and general praise from diners.<br/><br/>| Rank | Dish                  | Why it stands out                                    | How often it’s mentioned      | Ideal for               |<br/>|------|-----------------------|-----------------------------------------------------|------------------------------|-------------------------|<br/>| 1    | Seared Scallops       | Incredible flavor and perfectly cooked.             | Mentioned in many reviews.   | Sharing at the table    |<br/>| 2    | Corn Chowder with Crab| Rich flavor, delicious and satisfying.              | Appears in numerous photos.  | Hearty starter          |<br/>| 3    | Rigatoni              | Full of flavor, highly praised for texture.         | Repeatedly called out as a favorite.| Hearty main            |<br/><br/>Good alternates / backup choices<br/>- Milk Bread Rolls: Noted for being delicious and a must-try.  <br/>- Other dishes: Fewer clearly highlighted dishes in reviews.<br/><br/>Highlights (non‑dish positives from reviews)<br/>Excellent Service: Reviewers commend the attentive service throughout their visits.<br/><br/>Comfortable Atmosphere: The setting is described as inviting and comfortable for dining.<br/><br/>Rave Reviews: Many patrons express satisfaction with the quality of food.<br/><br/>Common Issues (from reviews)<br/>Not specified: No significant issues mentioned by multiple reviewers.<br/><br/>Practical Notes<br/>Reservation / wait: Reservations recommended due to popularity.<br/><br/>Accessibility: Not mentioned.<br/><br/>Parking / transit: Not mentioned.<br/><br/>Best use case: Best for casual dinners and date nights.<br/><br/>More info: https://www.google.com/maps/place/Tall+Provisions/@44.3057138,-71.7704455,153a,49.9y,1.19t/data=!3m1!1e3!4m15!1m8!3m7!1s0x4cb469b6187f15c7:0xa9594392bb590b7f!2sLittleton,+NH+03561!3b1!8m2!3d44.3060969!4d-71.7703012!16zL20vMDFtOTV0!3m5!1s0x4cb46fab3d64b967:0x9aa250ffb878f91f!8m2!3d44.3060114!4d-71.770634!16s%2Fg%2F11wpfcp0tt?entry=ttu&g_ep=EgoyMDI2MDYxMy4wIKXMDSoASAFQAw%3D%3D]]></description>
