    <name>Tandem Glass Gallery &amp; Studio Dresden ME</name>
    <description><![CDATA[Tandem Glass Gallery & Studio<br/><br/>📍 6 Eagle Lodge Ln, Dresden, ME 04342<br/><br/>Contemporary blown-glass gallery and working studio in a 2,000 sq ft space, about 10 miles from Wiscasset. Visitors can watch glassblowing happening in the adjacent active studio while browsing museum-quality glass pieces.<br/><br/>Tips<br/>- Open daily 10am–5pm<br/><br/>More info: https://www.tandemglass.com/]]></description>
