  <Placemark>
    <name>Taste the Thai &amp; Sushi House Littleton NH</name>
    <description><![CDATA[Overview<br/>Type: Thai & Sushi Restaurant  <br/>Best known for: Authentic Thai flavors; diverse sushi selection  <br/>Location context: Not specified  <br/>Price level: $20–30 per person  <br/>Visit timing: Not mentioned  <br/><br/>Typical Customers<br/>Demographics: Mix of locals and tourists  <br/>Group types: Couples, families, friends  <br/>Common occasions: Casual dinner, date night  <br/><br/>Vibe & Setting<br/>Atmosphere: Casual, friendly  <br/>Noise level: Not mentioned  <br/>Decor & setting: Indoor seating, cozy vibe  <br/>Service style: Attentive and friendly  <br/><br/>Recommended Dishes<br/>Overall dish consensus  <br/>Reviewers commonly praise the Massaman Curry and Drunken Noodles as standout dishes that capture authentic Thai flavors.<br/><br/>How “top dishes” are determined  <br/>Top dishes are identified based on mentions in reviews and photographs. Dishes repeatedly praised for their quality and flavor form the basis of this list.<br/><br/>| Rank | Dish                 | Why it stands out                                 | How often it’s mentioned               | Ideal for                 |<br/>|------|----------------------|--------------------------------------------------|---------------------------------------|---------------------------|<br/>| 1    | Massaman Curry       | Rich coconut flavor, well-balanced.              | Mentioned in many reviews.           | Hearty main               |<br/>| 2    | Drunken Noodles      | Incredible flavor, melts in the mouth.           | Appears in numerous photos.          | Sharing at the table      |<br/>| 3    | Khow soi             | Unique, best first experience for Thai cuisine.  | Repeatedly called out as a favorite. | Not mentioned             |<br/><br/>Good alternates / backup choices  <br/>- Sashimi: Fresh ingredients, good complement to sushi.  <br/>- Pad Thai: Comforting and flavorful option.  <br/><br/>Highlights (non-dish positives from reviews)<br/>Service Quality: Consistent praise for friendly and attentive staff.<br/><br/>Fresh Ingredients: Reviewers highlight fresh ingredients in all dishes.<br/><br/>Common Issues (from reviews)<br/>Busy Times: Not specified  <br/><br/>Practical Notes<br/>Reservation / wait: Walk-in friendly  <br/>Accessibility: Not mentioned  <br/>Parking / transit: Not mentioned  <br/>Best use case: Great date-night spot<br/><br/>More info: https://www.google.com/maps/place/Taste+the+Thai+%26+Sushi+House/@44.3022585,-71.7580263,3233m/data=!3m1!1e3!4m15!1m8!3m7!1s0x4cb469b6187f15c7:0xa9594392bb590b7f!2sLittleton,+NH+03561!3b1!8m2!3d44.3060969!4d-71.7703012!16zL20vMDFtOTV0!3m5!1s0x4cb46fd26a2ef627:0x418f2eeb91a8a22b!8m2!3d44.3079386!4d-71.7560332!16s%2Fg%2F11h1m4sgyb?entry=ttu&g_ep=EgoyMDI2MDYxMy4wIKXMDSoASAFQAw%3D%3D]]></description>
