  <Placemark>
    <name>Terrapin Restaurant Rhinebeck, NY</name>
    <description><![CDATA[Terrapin Restaurant<br/><br/>📍 Rhinebeck, NY<br/><br/>A converted church turned acclaimed New American restaurant, named Best Restaurant in the Hudson Valley by multiple publications.<br/><br/>Must Order<br/>- NY strip steak — locally sourced, expertly prepared<br/>- Pan-seared salmon — sustainable and consistent<br/><br/>Tips<br/>- Reserve ahead — one of the most popular tables in the valley<br/>- The converted church interior is stunning; ask for the main room<br/>- Gluten-free options throughout the menu<br/><br/>More info: https://www.google.com/maps/search/Terrapin+Restaurant+Rhinebeck,+NY]]></description>
