    <description><![CDATA[Thai Smile<br/><br/>📍 Plymouth NH<br/><br/>Locally loved Thai restaurant in downtown Plymouth, a good detour option near Plymouth State University.<br/><br/>Must Order<br/>- <br/><br/>Tips<br/>- Good stop if passing through on the way south.]]></description>
