  <Placemark>
    <name>The Abbe Museum Bar Harbor ME</name>
    <description><![CDATA[The Abbe Museum<br/><br/>📍 26 Mount Desert Street, Bar Harbor, ME<br/><br/>Tucked right in town, this Smithsonian Affiliate offers a deep dive into the history, art, and culture of Maine's Native Wabanaki nations. It's a thoughtful, less-touristy break from the souvenir shops on Main Street.<br/><br/>Tips<br/>- Provides essential cultural context for the land you're visiting<br/>- Smithsonian Affiliate standards for quality<br/>- Smaller and more intimate than major museums<br/>- Located on Main Street but often overlooked by cruise ship tourists<br/>- Gift shop has thoughtfully curated items]]></description>
