  <Placemark>
    <name>The Abbey Craft Coffee &amp; Cocktails Brunswick ME</name>
    <description><![CDATA[The Abbey: Craft Coffee & Cocktails<br/><br/>📍 87 Maine St, Brunswick, ME<br/><br/>Opened Dec 2023 by owners Connor Scott and Lainey Catalino as a deliberate "third place" — locally-roasted (Bard Coffee) coffee shop by day, craft cocktail bar by night. A 2025 James Beard Award semifinalist for Best New Bar in the United States, notable recognition for a small-town Maine spot.<br/><br/>Must Order<br/>- Abbey Espresso Martini<br/>- Mimi's Creamery cocktail<br/>- Blueberry Cobbler Latte (and other specialty lattes)<br/>- Rotating small plates — popcorn, charcuterie boards, soups (change weekly)<br/><br/>Tips<br/>- No reservations — first-come, first-served; counter service by day, table service kicks in around 5pm<br/>- Sunday "Jazzy Brunch" with live jazz 11am-1pm; Monday "Industry Night" for hospitality workers<br/>- Hours: Mon/Wed-Sat 8am-11pm (kitchen closes 10pm), Sun 8am-3pm, closed Tuesday<br/>- Outdoor seating in summer, accessible via rear entrance<br/><br/>More info: https://theabbeymaine.com/]]></description>
