  <Placemark>
    <name>The Anchor Restaurant Round Pond ME</name>
    <description><![CDATA[The Anchor Restaurant<br/><br/>📍 Anchor Inn Rd, Round Pond, ME<br/><br/>An oceanside casual fine-dining restaurant and bar with views over Muscongus Bay on the Pemaquid Peninsula. Open seasonally, June through October.<br/><br/>Tips<br/>- Rating most in question among the restaurants in this batch: listed at 4.7, but independently I found Sirved at 3.9 and Tripadvisor at 4.1 (#2 of 6 in Round Pond) — a full point below the claimed figure, larger than the usual Google/Tripadvisor spread. Worth a fresh look before relying on this one.<br/>- Seasonal only — confirm it's open before making the drive.]]></description>
