  <Placemark>
    <name>The Barnacle 1 Bar Harbor ME</name>
    <description><![CDATA[What it is: A student-run Middle Eastern food truck (technically a stationary truck hardwired into utilities) serving shawarma, falafel wraps, and pitas with fresh, authentic ingredients. Currently temporarily closed.<br/><br/>Customers: Casual diners seeking budget-friendly, authentic Middle Eastern fare—students, tourists, and locals looking for unpretentious quick bites.<br/><br/>Vibe: Casual, budget-friendly, unpretentious; ordered at a walk-up window.<br/><br/>Strengths:<br/><br/>- Fresh, authentic shawarma and falafel wraps with aromatic spices (Syrian garlic sauce noted)<br/>- Thin, crispy pita<br/>- Large portions for the price<br/>- Vegan-friendly options; simple but tasty salad praised<br/>- Convenient location on main entrance driveway<br/><br/>Downsides:<br/><br/>- Currently temporarily closed (status unclear)<br/>- Limited menu (noted as "small")<br/><br/>More info: https://www.google.com/maps/place/The+Barnacle/@44.3992991,-68.2200113,1743a,35y,125.7h,44.45t/data=!3m1!1e3!4m15!1m8!3m7!1s0x4caebe4815802593:0x88e91a6528cad91b!2sBar+Harbor,+ME!3b1!8m2!3d44.3875617!4d-68.2042989!16zL20vMDJnMDZr!3m5!1s0x4caebfc3e3589a4f:0x334a09b0aabb61c!8m2!3d44.388789!4d-68.2042959!16s%2Fg%2F11hzfv6ypj?entry=ttu&g_ep=EgoyMDI2MDYxMC4wIKXMDSoASAFQAw%3D%3D]]></description>
