    <description><![CDATA[The Barnacle is an oyster bar restaurant offering seafood with expected prices ranging from $20 to $50 per person. It is open for dinner, starting at 3 PM.<br/><br/>More info: https://www.google.com/maps/place/The+Barnacle/@44.3838382,-68.2424674,4461m/data=!3m1!1e3!4m13!1m5!2m4!1sRestaurants!5m1!4e9!6e5!3m6!1s0x4caebfc3e3589a4f:0x334a09b0aabb61c!8m2!3d44.388789!4d-68.2042959!15sCgtSZXN0YXVyYW50c1oNIgtyZXN0YXVyYW50c5IBFW95c3Rlcl9iYXJfcmVzdGF1cmFudJoBRENpOURRVWxSUVVOdlpFTm9kSGxqUmpsdlQyeG9OR1F5Y0UxVlZtaDBUV3MwZW1Jd1duZE5iRloyWVZWck1GZHJSUkFC4AEA-gEECAAQOw!16s%2Fg%2F11hzfv6ypj?entry=ttu&g_ep=EgoyMDI2MDcwOC4wIKXMDSoASAFQAw%3D%3D]]></description>
