  <Placemark>
    <name>The Blue Feather Lewiston ME</name>
    <description><![CDATA[Time: 2026-08-22T12:00:00<br/><br/>The Blue Feather<br/><br/>📍 49 Lisbon St, Lewiston, ME 04240<br/><br/>One of five candidate lunch stops for the Bar Harbor → North Conway drive (2026-08-22) — Auburn/Lewiston sits almost exactly at the noon mark, ~150 miles / 3 hours in. A 2025 opening in downtown Lewiston with a 5.0 Tripadvisor rating — worth flagging that this comes from a small review count so far (early buzz, not yet a long track record like the other four options).<br/><br/>Must Order<br/>- Menu leans comfort food with a creative twist — not enough documented reviews yet to single out a standout dish<br/><br/>Tips<br/>- Open Saturdays 11am–9pm<br/>- Newest and least-proven of the five candidates; pick this one if you're feeling adventurous rather than wanting a sure thing<br/><br/>More info: https://www.google.com/maps/place/The+Blue+Feather/@44.0976289,-70.2180085,17z]]></description>
