  <Placemark>
    <name>The Bocuse Restaurant Hyde Park NY</name>
    <description><![CDATA[Overview<br/>Type: Fine dining restaurant<br/><br/>Best known for: Excellent service and high-quality food<br/><br/>Location context: Not mentioned<br/><br/>Price level: $50–100 per person<br/><br/>Visit timing: Not mentioned<br/><br/>Typical Customers<br/>Demographics: Not mentioned<br/><br/>Group types: Couples, families, larger groups<br/><br/>Common occasions: Special occasions, date night<br/><br/>Vibe & Setting<br/>Atmosphere: Formal, cozy<br/><br/>Noise level: Moderate<br/><br/>Decor & setting: Indoor seating, elegant decor<br/><br/>Service style: Attentive, friendly<br/><br/>Recommended Dishes<br/>Overall dish consensus  <br/>Escargot is particularly mentioned for its garlic sauce, while the Halibut is highly praised for its flavor.<br/><br/>How “top dishes” are determined  <br/>Top dishes are based on specific mentions in the Google Maps page content and reviews, including dishes frequently praised and labeled as popular.<br/><br/>| Rank | Dish                     | Why it stands out                                     | How often it’s mentioned      | Ideal for                  |<br/>|------|--------------------------|------------------------------------------------------|------------------------------|----------------------------|<br/>| 1    | Escargot                | Praised for its amazing garlic sauce and bread.     | Mentioned in many reviews    | Sharing at the table       |<br/>| 2    | Halibut                 | Dream-worthy with beurre blanc sauce.                | Repeatedly called out as a favorite | Special occasions           |<br/>| 3    | Maple Leaf Duck Breast   | Noted for excellent execution and flavor experience. | Appears in numerous photos    | Hearty main                |<br/><br/>Good alternates / backup choices  <br/>- Chocolate Cake: Celebrated for its rich flavor.<br/>- Beef Short Ribs: Known for being hearty and satisfying.<br/><br/>Highlights (non‑dish positives from reviews)<br/>Service excellence: Food way beyond expectations, with friendly staff.<br/><br/>Ambiance: Nice ambiance contributing to the dining experience.<br/><br/>Common Issues (from reviews)<br/>Signage problem: Hard to find due to poor signage.<br/><br/>Practical Notes<br/>Reservation / wait: Reservations recommended.<br/><br/>Accessibility: Not mentioned<br/><br/>Parking / transit: Not mentioned<br/><br/>Best use case: Great date-night spot.<br/><br/>More info: https://www.google.com/maps/place/The+Bocuse+Restaurant/@41.7455607,-73.9336396,154m/data=!3m1!1e3!4m11!1m4!2m3!1sThai+Spice+Cafe+%E2%80%93+Well-liked+Thai+on+Raymond+Avenue!5m1!4e3!3m5!1s0x89dd15e0f0de497b:0x3174acb95898cd35!8m2!3d41.7460154!4d-73.93356!16s%2Fg%2F1264pr3xc?entry=ttu&g_ep=EgoyMDI2MDYxMy4wIKXMDSoASAFQAw%3D%3D]]></description>
