  <Placemark>
    <name>The Bowsprit Bar @ The Harbour Cottage Inn Southwest Harbor ME</name>
    <description><![CDATA[The Bowsprit Bar @ The Harbour Cottage Inn is a private bar that offers a relaxing outdoor dining experience, known for its delicious food and cocktails. It attracts a diverse range of customers, including couples looking for a romantic evening as well as groups seeking a serene atmosphere. The overall vibe is casual yet classy, with a focus on providing a top-notch dining experience. Customers consistently praise the amazing service, beautiful outdoor space, and well-prepared food, particularly the charcuterie and cocktails. However, some might find limited hours or menu options an occasional downside.<br/><br/>More info: https://www.google.com/maps/place/The+Bowsprit+Bar+@+The+Harbour+Cottage+Inn/@44.2783521,-68.3190944,554m/data=!3m1!1e3!4m13!1m5!2m4!1sRestaurants!5m1!4e9!6e5!3m6!1s0x4caebdb0cad64609:0xfa5223cbefabf3fb!8m2!3d44.2783519!4d-68.3157676!15sCgtSZXN0YXVyYW50c1oNIgtyZXN0YXVyYW50c5IBCnJlc3RhdXJhbnSaASRDaGREU1VoTk1HOW5TMFZKUTBGblNVUmlPWFZtZVdkM1JSQULgAQD6AQQIABAz!16s%2Fg%2F11sv004c_g?entry=ttu&g_ep=EgoyMDI2MDYxMC4wIKXMDSoASAFQAw%3D%3D]]></description>
