  <Placemark>
    <name>The Brewster Fish House Brewster MA</name>
    <description><![CDATA[Overview<br/>Type: Restaurant  <br/>Best known for: Delicious food, great service  <br/>Location context: Not mentioned  <br/>Price level: $50–100  <br/>Visit timing: Busy during dinner hours<br/><br/>Typical Customers<br/>Demographics: Not specifically mentioned  <br/>Group types: Couples, friends, families  <br/>Common occasions: Casual dinner, special occasions  <br/><br/>Vibe & Setting<br/>Atmosphere: Casual, lively  <br/>Noise level: Moderate  <br/>Decor & setting: Indoor seating, lively atmosphere  <br/>Service style: Attentive, friendly  <br/><br/>Recommended Dishes<br/>Overall dish consensus  Lobster roll with lemon zest dressing, clam chowder, and ribeye have generated praise among diners.  <br/><br/>How “top dishes” are determined  Top dishes are chosen based on mentions in reviews, popularity in photos, and frequent praise from diners on the Google Maps page.<br/><br/>| Rank | Dish              | Why it stands out                     | How often it’s mentioned        | Ideal for          |<br/>|------|------------------|--------------------------------------|--------------------------------|--------------------|<br/>| 1    | Lobster Roll     | Strong lemon zest flavor.            | Repeatedly called out as a favorite. | Lighter option     |<br/>| 2    | Clam Chowder     | Rich and flavorful.                  | Mentioned in many reviews.     | Comfort food       |<br/>| 3    | Ribeye           | Juicy and well-cooked.              | Appears in some photos and reviews. | Hearty main       |<br/><br/>Good alternates / backup choices<br/>- Calamari: Notable appetizer praised for its taste.  <br/>- Creme Brulee: Enjoyed dessert with good reviews.<br/><br/>Highlights (non-dish positives from reviews)<br/>Food quality: Multiple reviews highlight the deliciousness of the food and its preparation.  <br/>Service: Patrons mention a friendly and attentive staff overall.  <br/><br/>Common Issues (from reviews)<br/>Wait times: Noted as busy during dinner hours, suggesting potential waits for seating.  <br/><br/>Practical Notes<br/>Reservation / wait: Long waits during busy times, walk-in friendly.  <br/>Accessibility: Not mentioned.  <br/>Parking / transit: Not mentioned.  <br/>Best use case: Great for casual dining with friends or family.<br/><br/>More info: https://www.google.com/maps/place/The+Brewster+Fish+House/@41.7635622,-70.0765092,820m/data=!3m1!1e3!4m14!1m7!3m6!1s0x89fb41ca0a783841:0x2037a6fae958ac04!2sThe+Brewster+Fish+House!8m2!3d41.7635622!4d-70.0739343!16s%2Fg%2F1wrtdx0w!3m5!1s0x89fb41ca0a783841:0x2037a6fae958ac04!8m2!3d41.7635622!4d-70.0739343!16s%2Fg%2F1wrtdx0w?entry=ttu&g_ep=EgoyMDI2MDYxMy4wIKXMDSoASAFQAw%3D%3D]]></description>
