  <Placemark>
    <name>The Bucking Lobster Northeast Harbor ME</name>
    <description><![CDATA[The place is a popular food truck in Maine best known for its delicious lobster rolls and innovative dishes like the banh mi lobster roll. It attracts a diverse clientele, including locals and tourists, often seeking casual dining experiences. The vibe is casual and friendly, with picnic tables available near a marina, creating a relaxed atmosphere. Reviewers consistently praise the exceptional staff, amazing service, and the food's quality, particularly the unique lobster dishes and chowder. Common downsides mentioned include limited hours of operation and the food truck's closing at the end of the season.<br/><br/>More info: https://www.google.com/maps/place/The+Bucking+Lobster/@44.29184,-68.2899484,1355m/data=!3m1!1e3!4m14!1m7!3m6!1s0x4cae97a048849b31:0x6bc7708886a47493!2sSeal+Cove+Auto+Museum!8m2!3d44.3053532!4d-68.4045448!16s%2Fg%2F1tkjkt8t!3m5!1s0x4caebd02c149f26d:0xa86d1c88032b9be4!8m2!3d44.2936804!4d-68.2847188!16s%2Fg%2F11kj_ndp1m?entry=ttu&g_ep=EgoyMDI2MDYxMC4wIKXMDSoASAFQAw%3D%3D]]></description>
