  <Placemark>
    <name>The Chart Room Hulls Cove ME</name>
    <description><![CDATA[The Chart Room<br/><br/>📍 565 Eden Street, Hulls Cove, ME<br/><br/>A waterfront restaurant located in Hulls Cove, just outside the downtown Bar Harbor corridor. This is one of the recommended bailout options when central Bar Harbor is at peak summer capacity.<br/><br/>Tips<br/>- Located northwest of downtown Bar Harbor<br/>- Waterfront setting<br/>- Less crowded than downtown establishments during peak August<br/>- Good alternative when parking/wait times in Bar Harbor get ugly]]></description>
