    <name>The Club</name>
    <description><![CDATA[The Club is a restaurant offering a variety of dishes with prices ranging from $20 to $30 per person. It is open for dinner on Fridays, Saturdays, and Mondays through Wednesdays.<br/><br/>More info: https://www.google.com/maps/place/The+Club/@44.4731832,-68.9256635,9359m/data=!3m1!1e3!4m10!1m3!2m2!1sscenic+spot!6e1!3m5!1s0x4cae67849c7ce8bd:0x436be08b80f2934d!8m2!3d44.4680049!4d-68.8562119!16s%2Fg%2F11rrf867kz?entry=ttu&g_ep=EgoyMDI2MDcxMy4wIKXMDSoASAFQAw%3D%3D]]></description>
