  <Placemark>
    <name>The Contented Sole Pemaquid ME</name>
    <description><![CDATA[Time: 2026-08-07T11:45:00<br/><br/>The Contented Sole<br/><br/>📍 32 Southside Rd, New Harbor, ME<br/><br/>Wharf-side seafood dining right next to Fort William Henry, with seating on a walkway directly over the harbor — some of the best views in the area, overlooking Pemaquid Harbor and John's Bay. Known for standout fish tacos, oysters, and fresh seafood, with non-seafood options too.<br/><br/>Must Order<br/>- Fish tacos — repeatedly called out as among the best around<br/>- Fresh oysters<br/><br/>Tips<br/>- Rating in question: listed at 4.7; independently I only found Tripadvisor (4.0, ranked #5 of 10 in New Harbor over 244 reviews) and a secondary platform at 4.2 — a real gap versus the claimed figure, more than the usual Google/Tripadvisor spread.<br/>- Prices run a bit high and the menu isn't extensive, but the location is the draw.<br/><br/>More info: https://thecontentedsole.com/]]></description>
