    <name>The Den at Stowe VT</name>
    <description><![CDATA[The Den at Stowe<br/><br/>📍 360 Mansfield Base, Stowe, VT<br/><br/>A casual, full-service bar inside the Mansfield Base Lodge, serving cold local beers with free live music on select nights — a low-key après-ski or après-hike stop rather than a destination venue.<br/><br/>Tips<br/>- Check current live music schedule before making a special trip.<br/><br/>More info: https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=44.5291%2C%20-72.7843]]></description>
