  <Placemark>
    <name>The Dining Room at Edson Hill 1 Stowe VT</name>
    <description><![CDATA[Edson Hill Tavern is a women-owned restaurant located in Stowe, Vermont, known for its upscale, casual fine dining experience. It attracts a diverse clientele, including couples, families, and groups looking for a special evening out. The atmosphere is charming and classy, striking a balance between relaxed and elegant. Customers consistently praise the great food, fine service, and the delightful ambiance. However, some reviewers note that the service could be more special, and a few feel the experience doesn't quite match that of high-end establishments.<br/><br/>More info: https://www.google.com/maps/place/The+Dining+Room+at+Edson+Hill/@44.5122363,-72.7805237,15562m/data=!3m1!1e3!4m7!3m6!1s0x4cb593e15cd421b3:0xcba3756ec1d201a5!4b1!8m2!3d44.5110103!4d-72.7346432!16s%2Fg%2F11c208qfdg?entry=ttu&g_ep=EgoyMDI2MDYxMC4wIKXMDSoASAFQAw%3D%3D]]></description>
