    <description><![CDATA[The Farm House<br/><br/>📍 Bar Harbor, ME<br/><br/>A surviving farm building from Bar Harbor's Gilded Age era, when estate farms supplied the grand "cottages" along West Street with dairy, produce, and livestock.<br/><br/>Tips<br/>- A private/historic structure best appreciated from the street as part of a West Street cottage-district walk or drive.<br/><br/>More info: https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=44.3883%2C%20-68.2192]]></description>
