  <Placemark>
    <name>The Happy Clam Shack Bar Harbor ME</name>
    <description><![CDATA[What it is: Casual takeout clam shack specializing in fresh lobster rolls, steamed clams, clam chowder, lobster bisque, and blueberry pie, with outdoor wood-fired cooking equipment built by the owners.<br/><br/>Customers: Tourists and locals seeking authentic Maine seafood experience; families and casual diners; repeat visitors (6+ years mentioned).<br/><br/>Vibe: Casual, unpretentious outdoor-only venue with picnic tables and umbrellas; lively, friendly, laid-back atmosphere with genuine owner presence.<br/><br/>Strongest positives:<br/><br/>- Exceptionally fresh, high-quality lobster consistently praised as "best we've ever had" (soft-shell noted)<br/>- Signature blueberry pie—"slice of heaven" (mentioned in 61 reviews)<br/>- Outstanding lobster rolls highlighted as "one of our highlight lobster rolls in Maine" (mentioned in 94 reviews)<br/>- Genuine friendliness and hospitality; described as "friendliest people we met on our travels" and "local gem"<br/>- Excellent value for quality ($20–30/person)<br/><br/>Downsides:<br/><br/>- Outdoor seating only (no indoor dining)<br/>- Takeout-focused model limits dining experience<br/><br/>More info: https://www.google.com/maps/place/The+Happy+Clam+Shack/@44.420652,-68.335271,792m/data=!3m1!1e3!4m14!1m7!3m6!1s0x4caeeb3450b62b41:0xfa2c7d55ef3b46ef!2sThe+Happy+Clam+Shack!8m2!3d44.4206482!4d-68.3326961!16s%2Fg%2F11c3tcwz69!3m5!1s0x4caeeb3450b62b41:0xfa2c7d55ef3b46ef!8m2!3d44.4206482!4d-68.3326961!16s%2Fg%2F11c3tcwz69?entry=ttu&g_ep=EgoyMDI2MDYxMC4wIKXMDSoASAFQAw%3D%3D]]></description>
