  <Placemark>
    <name>The Inn on Park Row Brunswick ME</name>
    <description><![CDATA[The Inn on Park Row (BISTRO165 / PUB165)<br/><br/>📍 165 Park Row, Brunswick, ME<br/><br/>A historic-inn dining room and evening pub, not just for inn guests — leans into partnerships with local Maine farms and purveyors. Cozy fireplace pub atmosphere in the evening, good for a relaxed dinner or cocktails.<br/><br/>Must Order<br/>- Maine wild blueberry pancakes and farm-fresh eggs (breakfast)<br/>- Charcuterie board with Maine cheeses and house-made dips<br/>- Weekly chef specials (Fri/Sat nights)<br/>- Maine Beer Company and Banded Brewery on tap<br/><br/>Tips<br/>- Reservations not strictly required — open to the public, not just inn guests<br/>- Dinner service daily 4-9pm; breakfast served in the front parlors mornings<br/>- Phone (207) 729-4914<br/><br/>More info: https://www.onesixtyfivemaine.com/eat-drink]]></description>
