  <Placemark>
    <name>The Island Chef</name>
    <description><![CDATA[This restaurant specializes in lunch, offering Cuban sandwiches and other sandwiches, with prices ranging from $10 to $20. It closes at 3 PM and does not serve dinner or alcohol.<br/><br/>More info: https://www.google.com/maps/place/The+Island+Chef/@44.1054502,-71.1974853,2197m/data=!3m1!1e3!4m6!3m5!1s0x4cb398ccaeee2b23:0x50fb0bbbe179bb39!8m2!3d44.1052965!4d-71.19388!16s%2Fg%2F1tdltwm6?entry=ttu&g_ep=EgoyMDI2MDcxMi4wIKXMDSoASAFQAw%3D%3D]]></description>
