    <name>The Little Grille 1 Littleton NH</name>
    <description><![CDATA[Overview<br/>Type: Restaurant<br/><br/>Best known for: Good food with varied menu options including burgers and tacos.<br/><br/>Location context: Not specified <br/><br/>Price level: $20–30 per person<br/><br/>Visit timing: Not mentioned<br/><br/>Typical Customers<br/>Demographics: Locals and families<br/><br/>Group types: Couples, families, groups<br/><br/>Common occasions: Casual dinner, date night, quick bite<br/><br/>Vibe & Setting<br/>Atmosphere: Cozy, casual<br/><br/>Noise level: Moderate<br/><br/>Decor & setting: Outdoor seating available<br/><br/>Service style: Attentive and friendly<br/><br/>Recommended Dishes<br/>Overall dish consensus  <br/>Popular dishes include tacos and chicken fajitas, often highlighted for freshness and arrangement.<br/><br/>How “top dishes” are determined  <br/>Top dishes are identified based on mentions in reviews and popularity noted on the Google Maps page, particularly those that are frequently praised. <br/><br/>| Rank | Dish                     | Why it stands out                  | How often it’s mentioned        | Ideal for          |<br/>|------|--------------------------|-----------------------------------|---------------------------------|--------------------|<br/>| 1    | Chicken Fajitas          | Fresh ingredients, well-arranged. | Mentioned in a few reviews.     | Sharing at the table|<br/>| 2    | Tacos (beef, chicken, shrimp, vegetarian) | Generous portions and good flavor. | Mentioned in multiple reviews. | Quick bite         |<br/>| 3    | Steak Tips               | Delicious and well-cooked.       | Mentioned a few times.          | Hearty main       |<br/><br/>Good alternates / backup choices  <br/>- Ravioli: Comforting and hearty.<br/>- Burgers: Noted for good flavor.<br/><br/>Highlights (non‑dish positives from reviews)<br/>Atmosphere: The ambiance is comfortable and inviting, ideal for a relaxed dining experience.<br/><br/>Service: Waitstaff is noted as attentive, often providing extras without prompt.<br/><br/>Common Issues (from reviews)<br/>Wait times: Not mentioned.<br/><br/>Practical Notes<br/>Reservation / wait: Walk-in friendly.<br/><br/>Accessibility: Not mentioned.<br/><br/>Parking / transit: Not mentioned.<br/><br/>Best use case: Great for casual family dinners.<br/><br/>More info: https://www.google.com/maps/place/The+Little+Grille/@44.3032808,-71.7697128,616m/data=!3m1!1e3!4m15!1m8!3m7!1s0x4cb469b6187f15c7:0xa9594392bb590b7f!2sLittleton,+NH+03561!3b1!8m2!3d44.3060969!4d-71.7703012!16zL20vMDFtOTV0!3m5!1s0x4cb46f31b2d7ba13:0xaecafc1f47433a7c!8m2!3d44.304239!4d-71.770435!16s%2Fg%2F1tf5pv9w?entry=ttu&g_ep=EgoyMDI2MDYxMy4wIKXMDSoASAFQAw%3D%3D]]></description>
