service: Many reviewers commend the attentiveness and friendliness of the staff.<br/><br/>Outdoor seating: Reviewers enjoy the option to dine outside, enhancing the overall experience.<br/><br/>Common Issues (from reviews)<br/>Not mentioned: No significant issues reported in reviews.<br/><br/>Practical Notes<br/>Reservation / wait: Not mentioned.<br/><br/>Accessibility: Not mentioned.<br/><br/>Parking / transit: Not mentioned.<br/><br/>Best use case: Best for casual dinners with friends or family.<br/><br/>More info: https://www.google.com/maps/place/The+Little+Grille/@44.304239,-71.7730099,793m/data=!3m1!1e3!4m14!1m7!3m6!1s0x4cb46f31b2d7ba13:0xaecafc1f47433a7c!2sThe+Little+Grille!8m2!3d44.304239!4d-71.770435!16s%2Fg%2F1tf5pv9w!3m5!1s0x4cb46f31b2d7ba13:0xaecafc1f47433a7c!8m2!3d44.304239!4d-71.770435!16s%2Fg%2F1tf5pv9w?entry=ttu&g_ep=EgoyMDI2MDYxMy4wIKXMDSoASAFQAw%3D%3D]]></description>
