    <description><![CDATA[The Lobster Pound Restaurant<br/><br/>📍 Lincolnville ME<br/><br/>Beachfront classic since 1936 serving live lobster, chowder, and fish and chips with water views.<br/><br/>Must Order<br/>- Live lobster<br/>- Chowder<br/><br/>Tips<br/>- Right next to the Islesboro ferry terminal — easy to combine with a ferry trip.]]></description>
