  <Placemark>
    <name>The Mad River Valley, Vermont Camden ME</name>
    <description><![CDATA[Tucked between two ridges of the Green Mountains, this valley avoids the massive commercial ski-resort crowds of places like Stowe, preserving an authentic, pastoral landscape.<br/><br/>- The Scene: A stunning patchwork of verdant dairy farms, cascading rivers, historic barns, and panoramic mountain passes.<br/>    <br/>- The Food: Vermont’s artisanal food movement is anchored right here. The valley features incredible farm-to-table bistros, world-renowned craft breweries, and independent farmsteads where you can source award-winning cheeses. The dining experience here is centered around high-quality, unpretentious elegance.]]></description>
