    <description><![CDATA[The Notch Grille<br/><br/>📍 Gorham NH<br/><br/>Off-lobby restaurant and bar with a diverse menu, strong beer/ale selection, and welcoming service.<br/><br/>Must Order<br/>- <br/><br/>Tips<br/>- Good dinner option after a day on the Pinkham Notch trails.]]></description>
