  <Placemark>
    <name>The Ocean House Restaurant Dennis MA</name>
    <description><![CDATA[Overview  <br/>Type: Restaurant  <br/>  <br/>Best known for: Exquisite food and exceptional service, particularly seafood offerings.  <br/>  <br/>Location context: Cape Cod/Martha's Vineyard area  <br/>  <br/>Price level: $100+ per person  <br/>  <br/>Visit timing: Busy during weekends and holidays  <br/>  <br/>Typical Customers  <br/>Demographics: Tourists, couples, and locals  <br/>  <br/>Group types: Couples, friends, families, and celebrations  <br/>  <br/>Common occasions: Special occasions, date night, casual dinners  <br/>  <br/>Vibe & Setting  <br/>Atmosphere: Casual yet refined, with a cozy feel  <br/>  <br/>Noise level: Moderate  <br/>  <br/>Decor & setting: Indoor seating with ocean views  <br/>  <br/>Service style: Attentive and personable, with some reports of rude service  <br/>  <br/>Recommended Dishes  <br/>Overall dish consensus  <br/>The tuna tartare stands out as a must-order item, frequently noted for its remarkable flavor. Baked or fried oysters are also highly praised among diners.  <br/>  <br/>How “top dishes” are determined  <br/>Top dishes are chosen based on reviews mentioning specific items repeatedly with strong praise, alongside dishes that appear popular in menus and photos.  <br/>  <br/>| Rank | Dish                | Why it stands out                               | How often it’s mentioned              | Ideal for                |<br/>|------|---------------------|------------------------------------------------|--------------------------------------|--------------------------|<br/>| 1    | Tuna Tartare        | Best tuna tartare ever, praised for flavor    | Mentioned in many reviews            | Sharing at the table     |<br/>| 2    | Baked or Fried Oysters | Highly praised for deliciousness             | Appears in numerous photos           | Hearty main              |<br/>| 3    | Scallops            | Well-seasoned and tender, often recommended   | Repeatedly called out as a favorite  | Special occasions        |<br/><br/>Good alternates / backup choices  <br/>- Caesar Salad: Notable for freshness.  <br/>- Spaghetti: Generous portions praised for flavor.  <br/>- Custard: Creamy texture, delightful dessert option.  <br/>  <br/>Highlights (non‑dish positives from reviews)  <br/>Service: Guests often cite attentive and friendly service, with some negative remarks about host staffing.  <br/>  <br/>View: Stunning ocean views add to the dining experience, making it memorable.  <br/>  <br/>Common Issues (from reviews)  <br/>Service issue: Some guests report rude service at the host desk, particularly from older staff members.  <br/>  <br/>High price: Noted as a pricey establishment, which may deter budget-conscious diners.  <br/>  <br/>Practical Notes  <br/>Reservation / wait: Reservations are recommended, especially during peak times.  <br/>  <br/>Accessibility: Not mentioned  <br/>  <br/>Parking / transit: Not mentioned  <br/>  <br/>Best use case: Great for special occasions or romantic dinners.<br/><br/>More info: https://www.google.com/maps/place/The+Ocean+House+Restaurant/@41.654906,-70.1274933,821m/data=!3m2!1e3!4b1!4m6!3m5!1s0x89fb3ea08e55cdb9:0xcf49a51c42d2bc5b!8m2!3d41.654906!4d-70.1249184!16s%2Fg%2F1tfw4212?entry=ttu&g_ep=EgoyMDI2MDYxMy4wIKXMDSoASAFQAw%3D%3D]]></description>
