    <description><![CDATA[Overview<br/>Type: Restaurant<br/><br/>Best known for: Small plate/tapas style dining, locally sourced ingredients.<br/><br/>Location context: Cape Cod<br/><br/>Price level: $50–100<br/><br/>Visit timing: Not mentioned<br/><br/>Typical Customers<br/>Demographics: Mix of locals and tourists<br/><br/>Group types: Couples, friends, families<br/><br/>Common occasions: Casual dinner, date night<br/><br/>Vibe & Setting<br/>Atmosphere: Cozy and charming<br/><br/>Noise level: Moderate<br/><br/>Decor & setting: Mix of antiques and modern touches, indoor seating<br/><br/>Service style: Attentive and friendly<br/><br/>Recommended Dishes<br/>Overall dish consensus: Reviewers frequently praise the ceviche, braised beef Thai dish, and falafel wrap as must-try options.<br/><br/>How “top dishes” are determined: Top dishes are identified based on their appearance in user reviews, popularity, and repeated mentions of praise in the Google Maps place page content.<br/><br/>| Rank | Dish                             | Why it stands out                                                  | How often it’s mentioned         | Ideal for                  |<br/>|------|----------------------------------|-------------------------------------------------------------------|----------------------------------|----------------------------|<br/>| 1    | Ceviche                          | Praised for its fresh flavor and presentation.                    | Mentioned in many reviews        | Sharing at the table       |<br/>| 2    | Braised Beef Thai Dish           | Noted for its unique flavor profile and hearty portion.           | Appears in numerous reviews      | Hearty main                |<br/>| 3    | Falafel Wrap (Vegan)            | Loved for its taste and healthy option for light eaters.         | Repeatedly called out as a favorite | Lighter option             |<br/><br/>Good alternates / backup choices<br/><br/>- Scallops: Noted for their excellent preparation and flavors.<br/><br/>- Oysters: Considered a fresh and enjoyable selection.<br/><br/>Highlights (non‑dish positives from reviews)<br/>Service: Reviewers commend the attentive and welcoming staff, enhancing the dining experience.<br/><br/>Ambiance: The charming and homey setting adds a welcoming feel to the restaurant.<br/><br/>Common Issues (from reviews)<br/>Inconsistency: Some reviews mentioned occasional disappointment with particular dishes compared to past visits.<br/><br/>Crowd levels: Reports indicate it can be busy during the off-season, which may affect service.<br/><br/>Practical Notes<br/>Reservation / wait: Not mentioned<br/><br/>Accessibility: Not mentioned<br/><br/>Parking / transit: Not mentioned<br/><br/>Best use case: Great for a casual dinner with friends or a date night.<br/><br/>More info: https://www.google.com/maps/place/The+Pheasant/@41.7408574,-70.207642,3330m/data=!3m1!1e3!4m14!1m7!3m6!1s0x89fb3880c4ab1199:0x477389cf32bf3ca5!2sScargo!8m2!3d41.7387861!4d-70.1909389!16s%2Fg%2F1tnpggwp!3m5!1s0x89fb477e1b6740c3:0x290f975174853f77!8m2!3d41.7418899!4d-70.1880059!16s%2Fg%2F1tj4cj5t?entry=ttu&g_ep=EgoyMDI2MDYxMC4wIKXMDSoASAFQAw%3D%3D]]></description>
