    <name>The Pickled Wrinkle Birch Harbor ME</name>
    <description><![CDATA[The Pickled Wrinkle<br/><br/>📍 Birch Harbor, Schoodic Peninsula, ME<br/><br/>A local favorite restaurant in Birch Harbor known for seafood. Stays well below Bar Harbor's wait times and prices, making it an ideal lunch stop during a Schoodic day trip without the downtown crowds.<br/><br/>Tips<br/>- Located in quiet Birch Harbor, away from main tourist corridor<br/>- Casual atmosphere, local clientele<br/>- Good lunch option during Day 1 of Schoodic exploration<br/>- Less crowded than downtown Bar Harbor restaurants<br/>- Call ahead to confirm hours during shoulder season]]></description>
