    <name>The Quechee Inn at Marshland Farm Hartford VT</name>
    <description><![CDATA[The Quechee Inn is a historic inn established in 1793, known for its warm ambiance and views of the Ottauquechee River. It offers classic American cuisine with a focus on local ingredients, expected prices range from $15 to $35 per entrée. It's open for both lunch and dinner and serves a selection of local wines and craft beers.<br/><br/>More info: https://www.google.com/maps/place/The+Quechee+Inn+at+Marshland+Farm/@43.648801,-72.4078252,16z/data=!4m11!3m10!1s0x4cb4cb6725550f57:0xf33c7f2b93002b08!5m4!1s2026-09-21!2i4!4m1!1i2!8m2!3d43.648696!4d-72.4073899!16s%2Fm%2F021fw1t?entry=ttu&g_ep=EgoyMDI2MDYyMy4wIKXMDSoASAFQAw%3D%3D]]></description>
