    <name>The Ransom Tavern Woodstock VT</name>
    <description><![CDATA[The Ransom Tavern is a restaurant offering a fine dining experience with a focus on American cuisine. The expected price range is $30–40 per person. It is open for dinner starting at 5 PM on Thursdays through Sundays and is closed on Mondays, Tuesdays, and Wednesdays. Alcoholic beverages are served.<br/><br/>More info: https://www.google.com/maps/place/The+Ransom+Tavern/@43.5656843,-72.6494992,20578m/data=!3m1!1e3!4m13!1m5!2m4!1srestaurants+with+reservations.+!5m1!4e9!6e5!3m6!1s0x89e1d1fb671c78ef:0x31ad64e3a45a3442!8m2!3d43.5656857!4d-72.5329436!15sCh5yZXN0YXVyYW50cyB3aXRoIHJlc2VydmF0aW9ucy4iMlIwL2dlby90eXBlL2VzdGFibGlzaG1lbnRfcG9pL2FjY2VwdHNfcmVzZXJ2YXRpb25zWg0iC3Jlc3RhdXJhbnRzkgEKcmVzdGF1cmFudJoBRENpOURRVWxSUVVOdlpFTm9kSGxqUmpsdlQyNVdkbUl3TlRaaGJUUXpXVmh3V2xSRVNqUmtWVTU2VjFoV2FsVldSUkFC4AEA-gEECAAQQg!16s%2Fg%2F11fjbw8dnx?entry=ttu&g_ep=EgoyMDI2MDYyMy4wIKXMDSoASAFQAw%3D%3D]]></description>
