    <description><![CDATA[Time: 2026-09-20T06:45:00<br/><br/>The Rooftop at Pelham House Resort is a seafood-focused restaurant offering a dining experience with beautiful ocean views. Prices range from $50 to $100 per person. It is open for lunch and dinner, serving alcohol.<br/><br/>More info: https://www.google.com/maps/place/The+Rooftop+at+Pelham+House+Resort/@41.6766915,-70.2131724,52237m/data=!3m2!1e3!5s0x89fb3c1cd776815b:0xc1500310b0585230!4m14!1m7!3m6!1s0x89fb3d6660c13051:0xd4d62b93e602c9ce!2sThe+Rooftop+at+Pelham+House+Resort!8m2!3d41.6529863!4d-70.1330844!16s%2Fg%2F11smvm7d6z!3m5!1s0x89fb3d6660c13051:0xd4d62b93e602c9ce!8m2!3d41.6529863!4d-70.1330844!16s%2Fg%2F11smvm7d6z?entry=ttu&g_ep=EgoyMDI2MDYxNi4wIKXMDSoASAFQAw%3D%3D]]></description>
