  <Placemark>
    <name>The Round Hearth Café &amp; Marketplace Stowe VT</name>
    <description><![CDATA[The Round Hearth Cafe is a restaurant located in Stowe, Vermont, best known for its cozy atmosphere and menu offerings that feature items like Hot Chocolate and Pastrami Caramelized Onion Mustard Gouda. It attracts a diverse clientele, including families and couples, often visiting for casual dining or quick bites after outdoor activities. The vibe is friendly and casual, making it an inviting place for guests to relax. Customers frequently praise the quality of the food and the welcoming service, appreciating the cafe's LGBTQ+ friendly approach as well as its women-owned identity. Some common downsides mentioned include limited hours of operation and occasional wait times during peak hours.<br/><br/>More info: https://www.google.com/maps/place/The+Round+Hearth+Caf%C3%A9+%26+Marketplace/@44.4978043,-72.7609253,15635m/data=!3m1!1e3!4m11!3m10!1s0x4cb591c9a7542553:0x37e17b35426cfa1a!5m4!1s2026-09-21!2i4!4m1!1i2!8m2!3d44.4892825!4d-72.7293608!16s%2Fg%2F11hnr3zywh?entry=ttu&g_ep=EgoyMDI2MDYxMC4wIKXMDSoASAFQAw%3D%3D]]></description>
