    <description><![CDATA[Overview<br/>Type: Pub and café<br/><br/>Best known for: Great atmosphere & service, diverse menu including popular food items.<br/><br/>Location context: Not mentioned<br/><br/>Price level: $20–30 per person<br/><br/>Visit timing: Open daily from 6 AM–1 AM, hours may differ on special occasions.<br/><br/>Typical Customers<br/>Demographics: Locals and visitors, LGBT friendly<br/><br/>Group types: Couples, friends, families, locals<br/><br/>Common occasions: Casual dining, brunch, welcoming social space<br/><br/>Vibe & Setting<br/>Atmosphere: Casual, inviting, lively pub environment<br/><br/>Noise level: Moderate<br/><br/>Decor & setting: Indoor seating with a patio, dog-friendly<br/><br/>Service style: Friendly and attentive service based on reviews<br/><br/>Recommended Dishes<br/>Overall dish consensus<br/>Reviewers highly recommend chicken wings and clam chowder for their taste and preparation.<br/><br/>How “top dishes” are determined<br/>Top dishes are chosen based on mentions in reviews, popularity labeling, and frequent appearance in food photos or positive commentary.<br/><br/>Top dishes to order<br/>| Rank | Dish            | Why it stands out                                 | How often it’s mentioned          | Ideal for             |<br/>|------|-----------------|--------------------------------------------------|-----------------------------------|-----------------------|<br/>| 1    | Chicken Wings    | Known for being flavorful and popular among patrons.| Mentioned in many reviews        | Sharing at the table  |<br/>| 2    | Clam Chowder     | Praised for its taste and comforting nature.     | Repeatedly called out as a favorite | Hearty main          |<br/><br/>Good alternates / backup choices<br/>- Lemon Drop Shots: A favorite for those looking for refreshing options.<br/>- Homemade Cheesecakes: Notable for their deliciousness as per multiple reviews.<br/><br/>Highlights (non-dish positives from reviews)<br/>Atmosphere: Reviewers love the inviting vibe and friendly owner.<br/><br/>Service: Customers appreciate the attentive and welcoming staff service.<br/><br/>Common Issues (from reviews)<br/>Food Quality: Some reviewers noted inconsistency in food preparation; wings appeared to be microwaved at times.<br/><br/>Practical Notes<br/>Reservation / wait: Walk-in friendly; no reservations needed mentioned.<br/><br/>Accessibility: Not mentioned<br/><br/>Parking / transit: Not mentioned<br/><br/>Best use case: Great spot for locals looking for a diverse pub experience or casual dining with friends.<br/><br/>More info: https://www.google.com/maps/place/The+Seal+Pub+%26+Cafe/@41.6310565,-70.077509,16149m/data=!3m1!1e3!4m6!3m5!1s0x89fb3ff62a2dc923:0xde97ab57796410f0!8m2!3d41.686106!4d-70.0757601!16s%2Fg%2F11frs8rywq?entry=ttu&g_ep=EgoyMDI2MDYxMC4wIKXMDSoASAFQAw%3D%3D]]></description>
