  <Placemark>
    <name>The Stadium Bar Harbor ME</name>
    <description><![CDATA[The Stadium<br/><br/>📍 62 Main St, Bar Harbor, ME 04609<br/><br/>Take-out-only lobster roll shop, bakery, and coffee bar in downtown Bar Harbor — open early (7am) for made-from-scratch baked goods and espresso drinks, plus lobster rolls through the afternoon. A TripAdvisor Travelers' Choice award-winner.<br/><br/>Must Order<br/>- Lobster roll — the shop's namesake item, widely cited as among the best on the island<br/>- Baked goods / espresso drinks — made from scratch, good for a morning stop<br/><br/>Tips<br/>- Take-out only, no dine-in seating<br/>- Coordinates are an approximation (downtown Main St) — worth confirming the exact storefront location against Google Maps before you go<br/>- Good backup option for a night without a dinner reservation during the Bar Harbor base camp stay<br/><br/>More info: https://www.google.com/maps/search/The+Stadium+62+Main+St+Bar+Harbor+ME]]></description>
