  <Placemark>
    <name>The Table Montgomery NY</name>
    <description><![CDATA[Overview<br/>Type: Restaurant  <br/>Best known for: Delicious food, great service, and artistic food presentation  <br/>Location context: Montgomery, NY  <br/>Price level: $20–30 per person  <br/>Visit timing: Brunch  <br/><br/>Typical Customers  <br/>Demographics: Locals and visitors  <br/>Group types: Families, larger groups, celebrations  <br/>Common occasions: Brunch, special occasions  <br/><br/>Vibe & Setting  <br/>Atmosphere: Casual and lively  <br/>Noise level: Moderate  <br/>Decor & setting: Indoor seating, cozy environment  <br/>Service style: Attentive and friendly  <br/><br/>Recommended Dishes  <br/>Overall dish consensus  <br/>Reviewers frequently recommend the French toast as a must-try dish, praising its deliciousness. Eggplant fries and crab cakes also receive positive mentions.  <br/><br/>How “top dishes” are determined  <br/>Top dishes are identified based on their frequency in reviews, positive mentions, and visual presence in photos on the Google Maps page.  <br/><br/>| Rank | Dish            | Why it stands out                          | How often it’s mentioned                | Ideal for               |<br/>|------|----------------|-------------------------------------------|----------------------------------------|------------------------|<br/>| 1    | French toast   | Best tasting brunch item with great flavor. | Mentioned in several reviews           | Sharing at the table   |<br/>| 2    | Eggplant fries | Unique and tasty, a crowd favorite.          | Repeatedly called out as a favorite      | Lighter option         |<br/>| 3    | Crab cakes     | Highly praised for flavor and presentation.  | Appears in numerous photos             | Hearty main           |<br/><br/>Good alternates / backup choices  <br/>- Bliss Burger: Noted for its satisfying taste.  <br/>- French fries: Comforting and enjoyable.  <br/><br/>Highlights (non‑dish positives from reviews)  <br/>Service: Attentive and friendly staff enhance the dining experience.  <br/>Cleanliness: The environment is consistently described as clean and inviting.  <br/><br/>Common Issues (from reviews)  <br/>Reservation need: Recommended for larger groups due to popularity.  <br/>Wait times: Some reviews mentioned potential waits during busy hours.  <br/><br/>Practical Notes  <br/>Reservation / wait: Reservations recommended for larger groups.  <br/>Accessibility: Not mentioned  <br/>Parking / transit: Not mentioned  <br/>Best use case: Great for brunch with friends or special occasions.<br/><br/>More info: https://www.google.com/maps/place/The+Table/@41.5266312,-74.2409669,830m/data=!3m1!1e3!4m14!1m7!3m6!1s0x89dcd5e863ca4ded:0x7d0039c76cbcb0b!2s88+Charles+St+Restaurant!8m2!3d41.5266312!4d-74.238392!16s%2Fg%2F1tkc7p4d!3m5!1s0x89dcd5e87e2e535f:0x37da3341c4ac80b9!8m2!3d41.527225!4d-74.2385726!16s%2Fg%2F11c5dsqxqq?entry=ttu&g_ep=EgoyMDI2MDYxMy4wIKXMDSoASAFQAw%3D%3D]]></description>
