  <Placemark>
    <name>The Toad Hill Farm Venue Franconia NH</name>
    <description><![CDATA[The Toad Hill Farm Venue<br/><br/>📍 Franconia, NH<br/><br/>A private event venue on nearly 600 acres of woodland and pasture in Franconia, hosting weddings and celebrations since 2000, with panoramic views of the Presidential Range from its hilltop Main House. Local lore claims the property inspired Robert Frost's "The Road Not Taken."<br/><br/>Tips<br/>- A private event venue, not a general-public attraction — the view and grounds are the draw if you have a connection to an event here.<br/><br/>More info: https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=44.1995%2C%20-71.7684]]></description>
