  <Placemark>
    <name>The View Camden ME</name>
    <description><![CDATA[The View<br/><br/>📍 16 Bay View St, Camden, ME (rooftop of the 16 Bay View hotel)<br/><br/>An open-air rooftop bar and restaurant with over 2,000 sq ft of genuinely cinematic views over Camden Harbor and the Camden Hills — the setting is the main draw. Menu is a small-plates/shareable format built around fresh, locally sourced ingredients: ceviche, grilled broccolini, cauliflower steak. Rated 4.2 on Tripadvisor (#21 of 41 Camden restaurants) — reads more as a cocktail lounge with elevated food than a full dinner-house.<br/><br/>Must Order<br/>- Grilled shrimp<br/>- Ceviche<br/>- A cocktail — the drinks list is a real focus here, not an afterthought<br/><br/>Tips<br/>- Seasonal only — reopens for the season around June 1; confirm it's open before planning around it.<br/>- Go for sunset — the view is the whole point.<br/>- Best treated as a drinks-and-shared-plates stop, not a full sit-down dinner.<br/><br/>More info: https://www.google.com/maps/place/The+View/@44.2087599,-69.0653899,220m/data=!3m1!1e3!4m13!1m5!2m4!1sRestaurants!5m1!4e9!6e5!3m6!1s0x4cadd72658fd758b:0x53888135c362af34!8m2!3d44.2093407!4d-69.0639707!15sCgtSZXN0YXVyYW50c1oNIgtyZXN0YXVyYW50c5IBCnJlc3RhdXJhbnSaASNDaFpEU1VoTk1HOW5TMFZKUTBGblNVUnlOMDkxYUZOQkVBReABAPoBBAhLEEc!16s%2Fg%2F11f7b3m32w?entry=ttu&g_ep=EgoyMDI2MDYwOS4wIKXMDSoASAFQAw%3D%3D]]></description>
