  <Placemark>
    <name>The Waterfront Restaurant Camden ME</name>
    <description><![CDATA[The Waterfront Restaurant<br/><br/>📍 48 Bay View St, Camden, ME<br/><br/>A long-established, high-volume harborfront restaurant — 3,885 reviews on Restaurant Guru, 1,830 on Tripadvisor (4.1/5, #6 of 36 Camden restaurants), which for a town this size signals a real local institution rather than a passing trend. New England clam chowder made from a 45-year-old recipe, plus crab cakes, lobster rolls, and haddock tacos.<br/><br/>Must Order<br/>- New England clam chowder (the 45-year-old house recipe)<br/>- Crab and artichoke fondue<br/>- Crab cakes<br/>- Key lime pie or the peachy lime pie for dessert<br/><br/>Tips<br/>- No reservations taken — walk in, and expect a wait at peak times given the volume of reviews/popularity.<br/>- Lunch 11:30am–4:30pm, dinner 5pm–8pm.<br/>- Good gluten-free, vegan, and vegetarian coverage.<br/><br/>More info: https://www.google.com/maps/place/The+Waterfront+Restaurant/@44.2085492,-69.0648416,1144m/data=!3m1!1e3!4m15!1m8!3m7!1s0x4cadd8093b8682c5:0x545acfe2a5130197!2sCamden,+ME!3b1!8m2!3d44.2097928!4d-69.0647838!16zL20vMDExeDIy!3m5!1s0x4cadd70e990224ad:0xbeee23d3285bc557!8m2!3d44.2085054!4d-69.0628735!16s%2Fg%2F1ty73w59?entry=ttu&g_ep=EgoyMDI2MDYwOS4wIKXMDSoASAFQAw%3D%3D]]></description>
