  <Placemark>
    <name>The White Mountain Notches, New Hampshire (Inland Valleys) Camden ME</name>
    <description><![CDATA[To experience New England's most dramatic mountain vistas without the tourist-trap energy of the main highway corridors, base yourself in the quieter valleys surrounding the eastern notches, such as Jackson or Chocorua.<br/><br/>- The Scene: Soaring granite peaks, pristine glacial lakes, and deep mountain passes. Choosing a base camp in a historic, quiet village keeps you entirely insulated from the tour bus routes.<br/>    <br/>- The Food: The region has a fantastic selection of upscale, independent culinary options. You will find historic, romantic fieldstone inns offering meticulously crafted New American menus, refined alpine-inspired dining, and wine cellars that cater to a very discerning palate.]]></description>
