    <name>The Wicked Oyster Wellfleet MA</name>
    <description><![CDATA[The Wicked Oyster<br/><br/>📍 Wellfleet MA<br/><br/>Upscale New American restaurant in a historic Wellfleet building — local favorite for oysters and seasonal seafood.<br/><br/>Must Order<br/>- Wellfleet oysters on the half shell<br/><br/>Tips<br/>- Reservations recommended — small room fills up fast.<br/>- One of the best dinner spots on the Outer Cape.]]></description>
