    <description><![CDATA[The Zack Shack is a casual restaurant offering a variety of fast food options. The price range is $10–20 per person. It is open for lunch and closes at 6 PM.<br/><br/>More info: https://www.google.com/maps/place/The+Zack+Shack/@44.08514,-69.200832,18853m/data=!3m1!1e3!4m13!1m5!2m4!1sRestaurants!5m1!4e9!6e5!3m6!1s0x4cadcfca3e924c45:0x49870a9578be459!8m2!3d44.0920359!4d-69.1431651!15sCgtSZXN0YXVyYW50c1oNIgtyZXN0YXVyYW50c5IBCnJlc3RhdXJhbnSaAURDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMjVzVVUxdWNHOVRXRkp2VkRCS01GTkljRlpUTURGUlRtcEJNMDFyUlJBQuABAPoBBQjpARBL!16s%2Fg%2F11cn0s2kbk?entry=ttu&g_ep=EgoyMDI2MDcxMy4wIKXMDSoASAFQAw%3D%3D]]></description>
