    <name>Thomaston Cafe Thomaston ME</name>
    <description><![CDATA[Thomaston Cafe<br/><br/>📍 Thomaston ME<br/><br/>Cozy bistro known for hearty breakfasts, fresh-baked pastries, and locally sourced dinners.<br/><br/>Must Order<br/>- Breakfast pastries<br/>- Locally-sourced dinner specials<br/><br/>Tips<br/>- Good stop between Camden and Rockland/Owls Head.]]></description>
