  <Placemark>
    <name>Thomaston Cafe</name>
    <description><![CDATA[Thomaston Cafe is an American restaurant serving a variety of dishes. Expected prices range from $20 to $30 per person. It is open for lunch and dinner, with specific hours from 11 AM to 2 PM and 5 PM to 8 PM on select days. The restaurant does not explicitly mention alcohol service.<br/><br/>More info: https://www.google.com/maps/place/Thomaston+Cafe/@44.08514,-69.200832,18853m/data=!3m1!1e3!4m13!1m5!2m4!1sRestaurants!5m1!4e9!6e5!3m6!1s0x4cadcf70b8ce55d7:0x2e1959bee5c11040!8m2!3d44.078811!4d-69.182462!15sCgtSZXN0YXVyYW50c1oNIgtyZXN0YXVyYW50c5IBE2FtZXJpY2FuX3Jlc3RhdXJhbnSaASRDaGREU1VoTk1HOW5TMFZKUTBGblNVUk9iMDlMV1hCUlJSQULgAQD6AQQIABBJ!16s%2Fg%2F1tfny5ky?entry=ttu&g_ep=EgoyMDI2MDcxMy4wIKXMDSoASAFQAw%3D%3D]]></description>
