    <description><![CDATA[Hiking area providing trails for mountain biking and hiking. No specific food offerings or prices indicated. Likely open during daytime hours, but no specific mention of lunch or dinner service. Alcohol service is not mentioned.<br/><br/>More info: https://www.google.com/maps/place/Thomaston+Town+Forest+Multiuse+Trail/@44.0744758,-69.1725469,17945a,35y,2.65t/data=!3m1!1e3!4m15!1m8!3m7!1s0x4cadcc4c5f4aa20d:0x7a26e129ee369379!2sOwls+Head,+ME!3b1!8m2!3d44.082303!4d-69.0572612!16zL20vMHRxaHA!3m5!1s0x4cadc55a50b09329:0xbb8956393fb2b645!8m2!3d44.0873138!4d-69.1951738!16s%2Fg%2F11gnr0mc0r?entry=ttu&g_ep=EgoyMDI2MDcxMy4wIKXMDSoASAFQAw%3D%3D]]></description>
