  <Placemark>
    <name>Thorndale Millbrook NY</name>
    <description><![CDATA[Thorndale<br/><br/>📍 Millbrook, NY (private, view from road only)<br/><br/>Noted for its gardens, this ca. 1848 estate is owned by descendants of Isaac Thorne, a Quaker who settled here ca. 1725.<br/><br/>Tips<br/>- Private property (PVT) — view from the road as you pass.<br/>- Stop 16 of 17 on the Washington & Amenia Scenic Tour (Tour 4).<br/>- No public address for this private estate — coordinates left blank.]]></description>
