  <Placemark>
    <name>Thurston's Lobster Pound Southwest Harbor ME</name>
    <description><![CDATA[Thurston's Lobster Pound is a seafood restaurant famous for its lobster rolls and a variety of other seafood dishes. It attracts families and groups looking for a casual dining experience, especially those visiting the coastal Maine area. The vibe is relaxed and casual, with options for outdoor seating overlooking the bay, making it a great spot for leisurely meals. <br/><br/>Customers consistently praise the efficiency of the service, the quality of the seafood, and the friendliness of the staff. However, some have noted that the prices for drinks can be steep, and there may be a wait during peak hours.<br/><br/>More info: https://www.google.com/maps/place/Thurston's+Lobster+Pound/@44.2514225,-68.334502,9150m/data=!3m1!1e3!4m6!3m5!1s0x4caea2effe931ad5:0x4ffc316939a68015!8m2!3d44.2391987!4d-68.352689!16s%2Fg%2F124t00wzx?entry=ttu&g_ep=EgoyMDI2MDYxMC4wIKXMDSoASAFQAw%3D%3D]]></description>
