    <name>Todd Wildlife Sanctuary Bristol ME</name>
    <description><![CDATA[Time: 2026-08-07T14:45:00<br/><br/>Todd Wildlife Sanctuary<br/><br/>📍 Audubon Rd, Bristol, ME<br/><br/>A wildlife refuge offering bird watching and outdoor exploration. Does not serve food or alcohol.<br/><br/>Tips<br/>- Watch for rocky terrain in places; sturdy footwear recommended.]]></description>
