  <Placemark>
    <name>Tomi Sushi And Noodle Bar Rockport ME</name>
    <description><![CDATA[Tomi Sushi And Noodle Bar is an Asian-owned restaurant known for its sushi and Thai cuisine fusion. It attracts a diverse crowd, including sushi enthusiasts and families, and is often visited for casual dining occasions. The overall vibe is casual and lively, with a focus on fresh food and generous portions. Customers frequently praise the great service, robust and well-priced menu, and the deliciousness of the food. Some criticisms include inconsistency in certain dishes like ramen and issues with portion sizes for the price.<br/><br/>More info: https://www.google.com/maps/place/Tomi+Sushi+And+Noodle+Bar/@44.1795942,-69.0961804,5307m/data=!3m1!1e3!4m13!1m5!2m4!1sRestaurants!5m1!4e9!6e5!3m6!1s0x4cadd738d624018d:0xb96dfd0240bc9960!8m2!3d44.1932935!4d-69.0792665!15sCgtSZXN0YXVyYW50c1oNIgtyZXN0YXVyYW50c5IBEHN1c2hpX3Jlc3RhdXJhbnSaAURDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnc1YmxwWGJEVlJWR1IwVkc1YVUyTkVSazlrV0dSSlZHdHZkR0Z0WXhBQuABAPoBBAgAECo!16s%2Fg%2F11fzb138nn?entry=ttu&g_ep=EgoyMDI2MDYxMC4wIKXMDSoASAFQAw%3D%3D]]></description>
