  <Placemark>
    <name>Tonys Nose Chatham, NY</name>
    <description><![CDATA[Tonys Nose<br/><br/>📍 Chatham, NY<br/><br/>A rise near Chatham in Columbia County, the northernmost point on this Taconic Byway list and close to the Massachusetts border — a good marker for where the byway drive begins to shift into the Berkshires.<br/><br/>Tips<br/>- Furthest north of the byway stops — plan it as a turnaround point or a link toward the Berkshires.<br/><br/>More info: https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=42.434242,-73.563445]]></description>
