    <name>Tops'l Farm Waldoboro ME</name>
    <description><![CDATA[Tops'l Farm<br/><br/>📍 365 Bremen Rd, Waldoboro, ME 04572<br/><br/>83-acre working farm hosting multi-day retreat-style weddings and events: a Farmhouse, Farm Cottage, and 11 woodland cabins sleeping 34 total, plus a sauna/cold-plunge Meadowhouse and farm-grown meals.<br/><br/>Tips<br/>- Private-event venue, not a drop-in attraction — only relevant if attending or booking an event here<br/><br/>More info: https://www.topslfarm.com/]]></description>
