  <Placemark>
    <name>Trackside Station Rockland ME</name>
    <description><![CDATA[Trackside Station<br/><br/>📍 4 Union St, Rockland, ME 04841<br/><br/>American restaurant/bar in Rockland's old train station, complete with original details and tracks outside. Rated 4.1 on Tripadvisor (#22 of 49 Rockland restaurants), 4.4 on Restaurant Guru.<br/><br/>Tips<br/>- Open Tue-Sat 11am-8pm; closed Sun/Mon.<br/>- Weekend entertainment (DJ, Name That Tune, live music) — Reddit specifically recommended this for trivia nights.]]></description>
