    </Point>
  </Placemark>
  <Placemark>
    <name>Trapt Escape Rooms Rockport ME</name>
    <description><![CDATA[Trapt Escape Rooms<br/><br/>📍 461 Commercial St, Rockport, ME 04856<br/><br/>Six themed escape rooms plus pool tables and a full arcade — the main escape-room destination in the Midcoast area. A good bailout option for a rainy afternoon or an evening activity with a group.<br/><br/>Tips<br/>- Book ahead — rooms fill up, especially weekends<br/>- Good rainy-day or evening bailout activity<br/><br/>More info: https://traptinmaine.com/]]></description>
