  <Placemark>
    <name>Trevor Zoo at Millbrook School Millbrook, NY</name>
    <description><![CDATA[Trevor Zoo at Millbrook School<br/><br/>📍 Millbrook, NY<br/><br/>America's only accredited zoo on a secondary school campus — native and exotic species in a beautiful rural Dutchess County setting.<br/><br/>Tips<br/>- Open to the public; check trevoratmillbrook. for current hours<br/>- About 20 minutes east of Rhinecliff — a good half-day excursion<br/>- Student naturalists are often present and happy to discuss the animals<br/><br/>More info: https://www.google.com/maps/search/Trevor+Zoo+at+Millbrook+School+Millbrook,+NY]]></description>
