    <description><![CDATA[Tuck & Roll Food Truck is a casual dining spot serving a variety of foods including breakfast items and sandwiches. Prices are generally between $10-$20. It is currently open for lunch, closing at 2 PM.<br/><br/>More info: https://www.google.com/maps/place/Tuck+%26+Roll+Food+Truck/@44.08514,-69.200832,18853m/data=!3m1!1e3!4m13!1m5!2m4!1sRestaurants!5m1!4e9!6e5!3m6!1s0x4cadcfce780ded09:0xfe505002c99e786c!8m2!3d44.1005525!4d-69.1084!15sCgtSZXN0YXVyYW50c1oNIgtyZXN0YXVyYW50c5IBCnJlc3RhdXJhbnSaAURDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMjFXWmxwNlpHdE9iR1JHVGpBNU5WWkZVWGxpUjNodFpGVk5kMlZJWXhBQuABAPoBBAgAEDk!16s%2Fg%2F11qbv4n1hx?entry=ttu&g_ep=EgoyMDI2MDcxMy4wIKXMDSoASAFQAw%3D%3D]]></description>
