    <name>Tuckerbox 1 Hartford VT</name>
    <description><![CDATA[Tuckerbox is a Turkish restaurant offering a variety of dishes with average prices ranging from $20 to $30 per person. It is currently closed and opens for dinner at 5 PM, but closed on Mondays.<br/><br/>More info: https://www.google.com/maps/place/Tuckerbox/@43.645902,-72.3213645,980m/data=!3m1!1e3!4m14!1m7!3m6!1s0x4cb4ca509c04c4e5:0x2919955d13aeb40b!2sBig+Fatty's+BBQ!8m2!3d43.6461808!4d-72.3182871!16s%2Fg%2F1tgnwty6!3m5!1s0x4cb4ca86e8f5205f:0x59e3ca49beaab18f!8m2!3d43.6485512!4d-72.3189951!16s%2Fg%2F1th86qsz?entry=ttu&g_ep=EgoyMDI2MDYyMy4wIKXMDSoASAFQAw%3D%3D]]></description>
