  <Placemark>
    <name>Two Feet Brewing Bangor ME</name>
    <description><![CDATA[Two Feet Brewing<br/><br/>📍 80 Columbia St, Bangor, ME 04401<br/><br/>Family-run downtown Bangor brewpub — craft brews by Cory Ricker, pub fare and desserts by his wife Nit-Noi, son Zak running the pub. Rated 4.6 (Chamber of Commerce, 386 reviews), 98% recommend on Facebook.<br/><br/>Tips<br/>- Mon-Thu 11am-8pm, Fri/Sat 11am-9pm, Sun 12-6pm.<br/><br/>More info: https://www.facebook.com/2FeetBrewery/]]></description>
