  <Placemark>
    <name>Two Lights State Park Cape Elizabeth ME</name>
    <description><![CDATA[Two Lights State Park<br/><br/>📍 7 Tower Dr, Cape Elizabeth, ME<br/><br/>Coastal state park near Portland with dramatic rocky shoreline, scenic trails, and picnic areas near the historic Two Lights lighthouses. (4.7★, 1603 reviews on Google Maps)<br/><br/>Tips<br/>- Bring a picnic and chairs — open lawn areas right above the rocky coast<br/>- Pairs well with a stop at the nearby Lobster Shack restaurant]]></description>
