  <Placemark>
    <name>Two Salty Dogs Pet Outfitters</name>
    <description><![CDATA[This is a pet supply store called Two Salty Dogs, operating mainly for pet supplies with a cozy atmosphere. It's currently closed and opens at 10 AM on Friday. They do not serve food or alcohol as it is a pet supply store.<br/><br/>More info: https://www.google.com/maps/place/Two+Salty+Dogs+Pet+Outfitters/@43.851179,-69.6293567,19z/data=!3m1!4b1!4m14!1m7!3m6!1s0x4cad98eec2d3b7ed:0x12936dbd4731d26e!2sTwo+Salty+Dogs+Pet+Outfitters!8m2!3d43.851179!4d-69.628713!16s%2Fg%2F1q6h_qvqs!3m5!1s0x4cad98eec2d3b7ed:0x12936dbd4731d26e!8m2!3d43.851179!4d-69.628713!16s%2Fg%2F1q6h_qvqs?entry=ttu&g_ep=EgoyMDI2MDYyNC4wIKXMDSoASAFQAw%3D%3D]]></description>
