  <Placemark>
    <name>Two Way Brewing Red Hook, NY</name>
    <description><![CDATA[Two Way Brewing<br/><br/>📍 Red Hook, NY<br/><br/>A popular craft brewery and taproom in Red Hook with excellent beers and a welcoming atmosphere — one of Dutchess County's favorite local gathering spots.<br/><br/>Tips<br/>- Rotating tap list — check Instagram for current releases<br/>- Food trucks often on-site on weekends<br/>- Indoor and outdoor seating<br/><br/>More info: https://www.google.com/maps/search/Two+Way+Brewing+Red+Hook,+NY]]></description>
