  <Placemark>
    <name>Tymor Park Union Vale NY</name>
    <description><![CDATA[Tymor Park and Tymor Forest<br/><br/>📍 Duncan Rd, Union Vale, NY 12540<br/><br/>Consisting of 500 acres, deeded to the Town of Union Vale by Mr. and Mrs. Ralph Connor in 1971 as a town park and recreation center. Local government is currently housed in the former dairy barn of Tymor Farms. Limited use is provided outside groups by special permit.<br/><br/>Tips<br/>- Contact Park Manager 845/724-5460 for visitor information.<br/>- Stop 11 of 39 on the Union Vale, Beekman, Pawling & Dover Scenic Tour (Tour 6).]]></description>
    <styleUrl>#c-green</styleUrl>
