  <Placemark>
    <name>US Bell Bell Foundry Downeast Maine</name>
    <description><![CDATA[U.S. Bell — Bell Foundry<br/><br/>📍 Downeast Maine, near Schoodic Peninsula, ME<br/><br/>A working bell foundry open for casual visits along the Schoodic National Scenic Byway. This is a genuinely unique artisan stop that most tourists never discover—a chance to see traditional bell-casting in action.<br/><br/>Tips<br/>- Located between Winter Harbor and Corea on the byway<br/>- Working foundry; hours may vary<br/>- Unique artisan experience away from typical tourist attractions<br/>- Call ahead to confirm they're open before visiting<br/>- A memorable and unusual stop for a full Schoodic day]]></description>
