  <Placemark>
    <name>Underground Bakery &amp; Cafe</name>
    <description><![CDATA[Underground Bakery & Cafe is a restaurant specializing in breakfast and brunch items with a price range of $10–20 per person. It is open for breakfast and lunch, but closed for dinner and does not serve alcohol.<br/><br/>More info: https://www.google.com/maps/place/Underground+Bakery+%26+Cafe/@44.0333281,-71.1619231,6595m/data=!3m1!1e3!4m6!3m5!1s0x4cb3a0beda717181:0x3a97c0c12575acae!8m2!3d44.0333623!4d-71.121903!16s%2Fg%2F11byz9g2rs?entry=ttu&g_ep=EgoyMDI2MDcxMi4wIKXMDSoASAFQAw%3D%3D]]></description>
