  <Placemark>
    <name>V M Gourmet Foods</name>
    <description><![CDATA[V M Gourmet Foods was a restaurant offering gourmet food but is currently temporarily closed. The expected price range was moderate, typically serving lunch and dinner, with alcohol likely available.<br/><br/>More info: https://www.google.com/maps/place/V+M+Gourmet+Foods/@44.0504956,-71.1288738,514m/data=!3m1!1e3!4m6!3m5!1s0x4cb3a0e3b0ea5e1f:0xf885eb3126a55703!8m2!3d44.051814!4d-71.1258364!16s%2Fg%2F12633vbrc?entry=ttu&g_ep=EgoyMDI2MDcxMi4wIKXMDSoASAFQAw%3D%3D]]></description>
