  <Placemark>
    <name>Valley Cove and Somes Sound Mount Desert ME</name>
    <description><![CDATA[Valley Cove & Somes Sound<br/><br/>📍 Mount Desert Island, ME (along Somes Sound fjord)<br/><br/>Located along the fjord splitting Mount Desert Island, Valley Cove offers striking vertical cliffs meeting calm waters, providing a serene backdrop for a stroll. The combination of dramatic geology and peaceful waters makes it a hidden gem.<br/><br/>Tips<br/>- Accessible by the Valley Cove Trail<br/>- The fjord-like setting is rare for Maine<br/>- Excellent for photography with dramatic cliff views<br/>- Less crowded than the Loop Road<br/>- Best visited during calm weather for water reflections]]></description>
