    </Point>
  </Placemark>
  <Placemark>
    <name>Vanderbilt Mansion NHS Hyde Park, NY</name>
    <description><![CDATA[Vanderbilt Mansion NHS<br/><br/>📍 Hyde Park, NY<br/><br/>A Gilded Age Beaux-Arts mansion built for Frederick Vanderbilt in 1899, with original furnishings intact, formal Italian gardens, and sweeping Hudson River views.<br/><br/>Tips<br/>- $10 house tour; grounds free with NPS pass or $10 day use<br/>- The formal gardens in late September show early foliage<br/>- Combine with FDR Home 2 miles south — both NPS<br/>- Also stop 5 of 26 on the Hyde Park, Clinton & Pleasant Valley Scenic Tour (Tour 3)<br/><br/>More info: https://www.google.com/maps/search/Vanderbilt+Mansion+NHS+Hyde+Park,+NY]]></description>
