  <Placemark>
    <name>Vermont State House Montpelier VT</name>
    <description><![CDATA[Vermont State House<br/><br/>📍 Montpelier VT<br/><br/>America's smallest state capitol — a stunning Greek Revival building with a gold dome set against wooded hills. Free guided tours available when legislature is not in session.<br/><br/>Tips<br/>- Free guided tours typically available daily in summer.<br/>- The dome and surrounding grounds are photogenic from the front steps.]]></description>
