  <Placemark>
    <name>Vessel &amp; Vine Brunswick ME</name>
    <description><![CDATA[Vessel & Vine<br/><br/>📍 4 Pleasant St, Brunswick, ME<br/><br/>Part wine bar, part small-plates restaurant, part gourmet retail market — a communal, shareable-plates spot with an expertly curated global wine list and knowledgeable staff for pairing suggestions. Also sells the cheese/charcuterie/wine to go.<br/><br/>Must Order<br/>- Muhammara — Middle Eastern red pepper-walnut dip<br/>- Dolmas<br/>- Cheese and charcuterie boards (rotating local selections)<br/>- Seasonal cocktails — Hot Toddys noted as a winter standout<br/><br/>Tips<br/>- Reservations recommended, especially weekends — "can get quite busy"<br/>- Hours: Tue-Thu 11am-7/9pm, Fri-Sat 11am-8/10pm, Sun 12-6pm, closed Monday<br/>- Consider happy hour for deals<br/>- Phone (207) 721-3000]]></description>
    <styleUrl>#c-purple</styleUrl>
