    <name>Vigneto Cafe</name>
    <description><![CDATA[Vigneto Café is an Italian restaurant offering dishes like Chicken Vigneto and Veal Parmigiana, with prices ranging from $30 to $70. It serves lunch and dinner and offers alcohol.<br/><br/>More info: https://www.opentable.com/r/vigneto-cafe-highland?corrid=dcd2cd21-1c16-4db0-9116-3b22551c1fc1&avt=eyJ2IjozLCJtIjoxLCJwIjowLCJzIjowLCJuIjowfQ&p=2&sd=2026-09-06T18%3A30%3A00]]></description>
