  <Placemark>
    <name>Viles Arboretum Augusta ME</name>
    <description><![CDATA[Viles Arboretum<br/><br/>📍 Forest Avenue, Augusta, ME<br/><br/>A free 224-acre botanical garden with six miles of trails, cultivated gardens, and a peaceful pond loop. Described by visitors as "a peaceful place for a walk and contemplation"—perfect for a quiet nature break.<br/><br/>Tips<br/>- Free admission and parking<br/>- Six miles of trail network at your own pace<br/>- Cultivated gardens and native plantings<br/>- Pond loop walk is particularly scenic<br/>- Bring water and comfortable walking shoes<br/>- Good picnic spot if you brought food<br/>- Peaceful alternative to downtown crowds]]></description>
