    <name>Vinolio</name>
    <description><![CDATA[**Vinolio** - Gourmet grocery store offering specialty foods. Prices range from **$10–30**. **Open until 4 PM**, serves a variety of gourmet items including sandwiches and wine.<br/><br/>More info: https://www.google.com/maps/place/Vinolio/@44.422236,-69.0165379,1996m/data=!3m1!1e3!4m13!1m5!2m4!1sRestaurants!5m1!4e9!6e5!3m6!1s0x4cae6e5affda187f:0xe62f59b244cb6b73!8m2!3d44.4264526!4d-69.0063594!15sCgtSZXN0YXVyYW50c1oNIgtyZXN0YXVyYW50c5IBFWdvdXJtZXRfZ3JvY2VyeV9zdG9yZZoBRENpOURRVWxSUVVOdlpFTm9kSGxqUmpsdlQyNVNlR013YURST1JFNXRXRE53UmxZeWFFUk5hVEUxV2xkNGRWWnJSUkFC4AEA-gEECAAQRQ!16s%2Fg%2F1260ct89k?entry=ttu&g_ep=EgoyMDI2MDcxMy4wIKXMDSoASAFQAw%3D%3D]]></description>
