  <Placemark>
    <name>Vintage Room Camden ME</name>
    <description><![CDATA[Vintage Room<br/><br/>📍 16 Bay View St, Camden, ME (inside the 16 Bay View hotel)<br/><br/>A moody, low-lit craft cocktail bar and eatery tucked inside the 16 Bay View hotel — equal parts cocktail bar, late-night lounge, and restaurant, easy to stumble past if you don't know it's there. The menu leans shareable: burgers, arancini, crab tostadas, and cheese boards, with global influences (Southeast Asian, Mediterranean) mixed into American classics. Rated 4.6 on Restaurant Guru (146 reviews).<br/><br/>Must Order<br/>- "Not Just a Burger" — the standout dish reviewers keep talking about days later<br/>- Crab tostadas<br/>- Arancini<br/>- A cocktail — the list rotates quarterly, and even the zero-proof options are treated seriously<br/><br/>Tips<br/>- Happy hour is specifically called out as worth catching.<br/>- Good pick for a late-evening drink-and-small-plates stop rather than a full sit-down dinner.<br/>- Reserve ahead: (207) 706-7990 or 844-213-7990.<br/><br/>More info: https://www.google.com/maps/place/Vintage+Room/@44.2087599,-69.0653899,220m/data=!3m1!1e3!4m13!1m5!2m4!1sRestaurants!5m1!4e9!6e5!3m6!1s0x4cadd78fb131ad3d:0xe291f788e16eee74!8m2!3d44.2091541!4d-69.0640288!15sCgtSZXN0YXVyYW50c1oNIgtyZXN0YXVyYW50c5IBCnJlc3RhdXJhbnSaASRDaGREU1VoTk1HOW5TMFZKUTBGblNVUlVjV1JwYkRSM1JSQULgAQD6AQQIWhBM!16s%2Fg%2F11t78svj5y?entry=ttu&g_ep=EgoyMDI2MDYwOS4wIKXMDSoASAFQAw%3D%3D]]></description>
