  <Placemark>
    <name>Wadsworth Cove Beach Castine ME</name>
    <description><![CDATA[Wadsworth Cove Beach<br/><br/>📍 Wadsworth Cove, Castine, ME<br/><br/>Crystal-clear, shallow water on a quiet Castine cove — great for dogs and kids, and far less trafficked than the coast's bigger-name beaches. (4.8★, 53 reviews on Google Maps)<br/><br/>Tips<br/>- Shallow entry — good for kids and dogs<br/>- Pairs well with a walk through historic Castine village]]></description>
