  <Placemark>
    <name>Waitsfield Village Historic District VT</name>
    <description><![CDATA[Waitsfield Village Historic District<br/><br/>📍 Waitsfield, VT<br/><br/>Waitsfield's compact, walkable historic village center — 19th-century commercial buildings clustered around the Mad River and its historic covered bridge.<br/><br/>Tips<br/>- Good base for shops, cafes, and the Mad River Glass Gallery, all within a short walk.<br/><br/>More info: https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=44.1901%2C%20-72.8241]]></description>
