  <Placemark>
    <name>Wales N Johnson House Woodstock VT</name>
    <description><![CDATA[Wales N. Johnson House<br/><br/>📍 43 Senior Lane, Woodstock, VT<br/><br/>Built in 1889-90 by the owner of a local sawmill, a high-quality vernacular Queen Anne example. Now operates as the Jackson House Inn. Listed on the National Register of Historic Places in 1995.<br/><br/>Tips<br/>- A working inn — book a stay to see the interior, or admire from the road.<br/><br/>More info: https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=43.6122%2C%20-72.5500]]></description>
