    <name>Walpole Barn Walpole ME</name>
    <description><![CDATA[Walpole Barn<br/><br/>📍 135 State Rt 129, Walpole, ME 04573<br/><br/>Retail shop specializing in fine wine, oysters, gifts, and home accessories, with a recently added wine-and-oyster service counter.<br/><br/>Tips<br/>- Hours vary by day — closed Tuesdays, check before making a special trip<br/>- Near Round Pond / South Bristol — easy to combine with The Art of Antiquing<br/><br/>More info: https://walpolebarn.com/]]></description>
