  <Placemark>
    <name>Walter's Cafe Brunswick ME</name>
    <description><![CDATA[Walter's Cafe<br/><br/>📍 149 Maine St, Lower Level Unit 4 (Tontine Mall), Brunswick, ME<br/><br/>Opened June 2024 by Maine restaurateur Walter Loeman and partner Dorian Lewis, emphasizing ingredients from local organic farms. A short walk from Bowdoin College, with reviewers specifically praising the personalized, friendly service.<br/><br/>Must Order<br/>- Walter's #15 Classic Caesar — house dressing, grilled chicken<br/>- Carolina BBQ — roasted pork, grilled corn muffin<br/>- Beef Stroganoff<br/>- Shaved roast beef on ciabatta<br/>- Blueberry coffee cake; daily-changing soup<br/><br/>Tips<br/>- Counter service, casual; sandwiches can be griddled, gluten-free buns available (+$3)<br/>- Serves Rock City Coffee<br/>- Hours: Mon-Sat 8am-3pm, closed Sunday — breakfast/lunch only, no dinner<br/><br/>More info: https://www.originalwalterscafe.com/menu/]]></description>
    <styleUrl>#c-purple</styleUrl>
