  <Placemark>
    <name>Waltz's Soda Fountain Damariscotta ME</name>
    <description><![CDATA[Waltz's Soda Fountain<br/><br/>📍 167 Main Street, Damariscotta, ME (next to the Post Office / inside Reny's Underground)<br/><br/>⚠️ Possible closure — a Yelp listing dated June 2026 shows this as CLOSED, though every review and directory entry otherwise describes it as an active, ~75-year-old family-run soda fountain. Worth a quick check (call ahead or look for it in person) before making it a priority stop — this wasn't confirmed either way.<br/><br/>A classic 1948 soda fountain and lunch counter, same local family since it opened — sandwiches, ice cream, fountain drinks (vanilla Coke, lime rickeys).<br/><br/>Tips<br/>- Coordinates are an estimate (no precise geocode found) — use the Google Maps link above for actual navigation.]]></description>
