  <Placemark>
    <name>Wanderwood Nobleboro ME</name>
    <description><![CDATA[Wanderwood<br/><br/>📍 79 Sidelinger Rd, Nobleboro, ME 04555<br/><br/>Event venue and organic farm minutes from Damariscotta and Newcastle, hosting weddings, elopements, and family gatherings with an emphasis on sustainability.<br/><br/>Tips<br/>- Private-event venue — not open for casual drop-in visits, only relevant if attending or hosting an event here<br/><br/>More info: https://www.wanderwoodmaine.com/]]></description>
