  <Placemark>
    <name>Warren Covered Bridge Warren VT</name>
    <description><![CDATA[Warren Covered Bridge<br/><br/>📍 Warren Village, VT<br/><br/>A historic covered bridge over the Mad River, right in the heart of Warren village — an easy, picturesque stop paired with the Warren Store and the rest of the village.<br/><br/>Tips<br/>- Combine with a stop at the Warren Store for a classic Mad River Valley village visit.<br/><br/>More info: https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=44.1111%2C%20-72.8570]]></description>
