  <Placemark>
    <name>Warren Street Hudson, NY</name>
    <description><![CDATA[Warren Street<br/><br/>📍 Hudson, NY<br/><br/>Six-block gallery and antiques corridor with 60+ shops, cafes, and boutiques — one of the best antiquing and gallery streets in the Northeast.<br/><br/>Tips<br/>- Allow 2–3 hours to browse the full length<br/>- Highest density of interesting shops between 4th and 7th Streets<br/>- Best visited on a weekday to avoid weekend NYC crowds<br/><br/>More info: https://www.google.com/maps/search/Warren+Street+Hudson,+NY]]></description>
