  <Placemark>
    <name>Warren Village Historic District Warren VT</name>
    <description><![CDATA[Warren Village Historic District<br/><br/>📍 Warren, VT<br/><br/>Warren's small, well-preserved historic village center — general store, church, and covered bridge, the classic postcard image of a Mad River Valley ski town.<br/><br/>Tips<br/>- Compact enough to see on foot in 20-30 minutes; a natural pairing with the Warren Covered Bridge.<br/><br/>More info: https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=44.1132%2C%20-72.8559]]></description>
