  <Placemark>
    <name>Wasses Hot Dogs Rockland ME</name>
    <description><![CDATA[Wasses Hot Dogs<br/><br/>📍 2 North Main Street, Rockland, ME<br/><br/>An iconic Maine food stand since 1972 — classic pan-fried hot dogs with grilled onions, cooked in peanut oil.<br/><br/>Tips<br/>- Quick, cheap, cash-and-carry — a Maine institution more than a sit-down meal.]]></description>
