  <Placemark>
    <name>Wasses Hot Dogs</name>
    <description><![CDATA[Wasses Hot Dogs is a casual hot dog restaurant located at 93 Lincolnville Ave. It offers affordable prices ranging from $1–10, primarily serving hot dogs for lunch. It is closed on Mondays and Sundays and opens for lunch only, not offering dinner.<br/><br/>More info: https://www.google.com/maps/place/Wasses+Hot+Dogs/@44.4242103,-69.0343713,1968m/data=!3m1!1e3!4m13!1m5!2m4!1sRestaurants!5m1!4e9!6e5!3m6!1s0x4cae6e69a045af5d:0x586abe27df1b7363!8m2!3d44.4241498!4d-69.0224013!15sCgtSZXN0YXVyYW50c1oNIgtyZXN0YXVyYW50c5IBEmhvdF9kb2dfcmVzdGF1cmFudJoBRENpOURRVWxSUVVOdlpFTm9kSGxqUmpsdlQycENjMVpGTlcxVVZGWjJZVVY0UkU5SFduQldSMFozWWxocmVGTkdSUkFC4AEA-gEECAAQPA!16s%2Fg%2F11c51wfxc6?entry=ttu&g_ep=EgoyMDI2MDcxMy4wIKXMDSoASAFQAw%3D%3D]]></description>
