  <Placemark>
    <name>Watchtower Farms Wallkill, NY</name>
    <description><![CDATA[Watchtower Farms<br/><br/>📍 Wallkill, NY<br/><br/>Located off Red Mills Road since 1963, Watchtower Farms is part of the worldwide Jehovah's Witnesses organization. Land is farmed across the towns of Shawangunk, Gardiner, New Paltz, and Rosendale — about half in rolling pasture for beef herds, the balance in field corn, wheat, alfalfa, and hay.<br/><br/>Tips<br/>- Guided tours of the printing facility available<br/>- The agricultural land offers some of the most photogenic Shawangunk Mountain views along the whole byway<br/><br/>More info: https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=41.6360%2C%20-74.2080]]></description>
    <styleUrl>#c-green</styleUrl>
