  <Placemark>
    <name>Water Street Market New Paltz, NY</name>
    <description><![CDATA[Water Street Market<br/><br/>📍 New Paltz, NY<br/><br/>A charming open-air artisan market and dining destination overlooking the Wallkill River, home to The Parish restaurant and specialty shops.<br/><br/>Tips<br/>- The Parish inside does New Orleans-inspired food — good for lunch<br/>- Artisan vendors focus on art, jewelry, and crafts — a good browse before or after eating<br/>- The Wallkill River views from the outdoor seating are particularly pleasant<br/><br/>More info: https://www.google.com/maps/search/Water+Street+Market+New+Paltz,+NY]]></description>
