  <Placemark>
    <name>West Road School Pleasant Valley NY</name>
    <description><![CDATA[West Road School<br/><br/>📍 West Rd (CR 71), Pleasant Valley, NY<br/><br/>In former years Pleasant Valley was a farm and railroad center and a summer vacation retreat. Sawmill Plaza was the site of the railroad station for the Poughkeepsie and Eastern RR (1870). The station was removed in 1990 to these school grounds.<br/><br/>Tips<br/>- Stop 21 of 26 on the Hyde Park, Clinton & Pleasant Valley Scenic Tour (Tour 3).]]></description>
    <styleUrl>#c-green</styleUrl>
