      <coordinates>-68.204703,44.3912293,0</coordinates>
    </Point>
  </Placemark>
  <Placemark>
    <name>Western Point Overlook Acadia National Park ME</name>
    <description><![CDATA[Western Point Overlook<br/><br/>📍 Park Loop Rd, Acadia National Park, ME<br/><br/>A network of little paths leading out to cliffs over the sea, off Park Loop Road — low-traffic given its small review count. (4.8★, 16 reviews on Google Maps)<br/><br/>Tips<br/>- Multiple small paths branch off toward the cliffs — worth exploring a bit rather than just the first view]]></description>
