  <Placemark>
    <name>Whales Tale Waterpark Lincoln NH</name>
    <description><![CDATA[Whale's Tale Waterpark<br/><br/>📍 481 Daniel Webster Highway, Lincoln, NH<br/><br/>A 17-acre water park with 11 attractions, running for over 30 years and a repeat TripAdvisor Travelers' Choice winner. Highlights include Willie's Wild Waves (a 60-foot wave pool), Jonah's Escape (a lazy river with gentle waterfalls), and Whale Harbor, a shallow pool built for young kids.<br/><br/>Tips<br/>- Coolers allowed (no alcohol or glass); free parking and tube rentals.<br/>- After-2pm discounted admission available at the gate or online.<br/><br/>More info: https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=44.0717%2C%20-71.6858]]></description>
