  <Placemark>
    <name>Whip Bar &amp; Grill Stowe VT</name>
    <description><![CDATA[The Whip Bar & Grill is a restaurant located in the Green Mountain Inn, best known for its diverse menu options, including steaks and chicken wings. It attracts a variety of customers, including families and couples, often dining out for special occasions or casual meals. The overall vibe is casual and welcoming, suitable for families while maintaining a level of fine dining experience, with the atmosphere described as lively. Consistently praised positives include the delicious food and drinks, attentive service, and a pleasant atmosphere. Common issues noted by customers are the portion sizes, with some not finishing their meals, and instances of service delays due to unforeseen circumstances like maintenance issues.<br/><br/>More info: https://www.google.com/maps/place/Whip+Bar+%26+Grill/@44.4651613,-72.6893761,895m/data=!3m1!1e3!4m6!3m5!1s0x4cb59655b83d1e21:0x72907a96a2075a0a!8m2!3d44.465192!4d-72.687114!16s%2Fg%2F1tmbvqnc?entry=ttu&g_ep=EgoyMDI2MDYxMC4wIKXMDSoASAFQAw%3D%3D]]></description>
