    <name>White Mountain Cider Company Glen NH</name>
    <description><![CDATA[White Mountain Cider Company<br/><br/>📍 Glen NH<br/><br/>Award-winning seasonal/contemporary restaurant in a converted cider mill, famous for fresh cider donuts and an extensive cocktail bar.<br/><br/>Must Order<br/>- Fresh cider donuts<br/><br/>Tips<br/>- Reservations recommended — consistently the top-rated spot in the area.]]></description>
