  <Placemark>
    <name>White Mountains Visitor Center North Woodstock NH</name>
    <description><![CDATA[White Mountains Visitor Center<br/><br/>📍 North Woodstock, NH (western end of the Kancamagus Highway)<br/><br/>The main trip-planning stop at the western end of the Kancamagus Highway, with trail condition updates, National Forest parking permits, and staff who can advise on foliage timing and current road/trail closures.<br/><br/>Tips<br/>- Good first stop before heading east on the Kancamagus — pick up a parking pass here if you'll be stopping at any of the trailheads along the way.<br/><br/>More info: https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=44.0354%2C%20-71.6771]]></description>
