  <Placemark>
    <name>Wicked Fresh Craft Burgers Conway NH</name>
    <description><![CDATA[Overview<br/>Type: American burger restaurant  <br/>Best known for: Delicious burgers and fast service  <br/>Location context: Not mentioned  <br/>Price level: $10–20 per person  <br/>Visit timing: Open daily from 11 AM to 8 PM  <br/><br/>Typical Customers<br/>Demographics: Locals and tourists  <br/>Group types: Solo, couples, families, friends  <br/>Common occasions: Quick bites, casual lunch or dinner  <br/><br/>Vibe & Setting<br/>Atmosphere: Casual and lively  <br/>Noise level: Loud  <br/>Decor & setting: Indoor seating  <br/>Service style: Fast, friendly  <br/><br/>Recommended Dishes<br/>Overall dish consensus  <br/>Reviewers suggest the burgers, particularly the Hangry Burger and the Mountain Man burger, as standout options. The double cheeseburger with bacon and fried egg is also highlighted for its flavor.  <br/><br/>How “top dishes” are determined  <br/>Top dishes are chosen based on mentions in the Google Maps place page and user reviews. This includes dishes labeled as popular, those frequently featured in photos, and items that reviewers praise repeatedly.  <br/><br/>| Rank | Dish                       | Why it stands out                                 | How often it’s mentioned                  | Ideal for              |<br/>|------|----------------------------|--------------------------------------------------|------------------------------------------|------------------------|<br/>| 1    | Hangry Burger              | Features a great crunch with jalapeños.         | Mentioned in many reviews                | Hearty main           |<br/>| 2    | Mountain Man burger        | Exceptionally filling and very good.            | Appears in numerous photos               | Casual dinner         |<br/>| 3    | Double cheeseburger       | Delicious flavors with bacon and fried egg.     | Repeatedly called out as a favorite     | Sharing at the table   |<br/><br/>Good alternates / backup choices<br/>- Turkey Burger: Noted for its flavor.  <br/>- Wicked Burger and Fries: Mentioned for its quality.  <br/><br/>Highlights (non‑dish positives from reviews)<br/>Fast service: Customers appreciate the quick, no-hassle service.  <br/>Friendly staff: Many reviews mention the kindness of the employees.  <br/><br/>Common Issues (from reviews)<br/>Long wait times: Some customers report waiting 40 minutes for their orders, particularly during busy times.  <br/><br/>Practical Notes<br/>Reservation / wait: Walk-in friendly; may experience wait during peak hours.  <br/>Accessibility: Not mentioned  <br/>Parking / transit: Not mentioned  <br/>Best use case: Great for casual meals with friends or family.<br/><br/>More info: https://www.google.com/maps/place/Wicked+Fresh+Craft+Burgers/@44.0170578,-71.1098868,5509m/data=!3m1!1e3!4m6!3m5!1s0x4cb3a0b0728c8aeb:0x794bc56027e03b53!8m2!3d44.027015!4d-71.117135!16s%2Fg%2F11ddxq5npb?entry=ttu&g_ep=EgoyMDI2MDYxMy4wIKXMDSoASAFQAw%3D%3D]]></description>
