  <Placemark>
    <name>Wilcox Memorial Hall &amp; Milan Town Hall NY</name>
    <description><![CDATA[Wilcox Memorial Hall & Milan Town Hall<br/><br/>📍 Lafayetteville, Milan, NY 12581<br/><br/>A living monument to the Wilcox family, this white frame Neo-Colonial Revival hall, completed in 1966, is one of the most beautiful and well-appointed halls in Dutchess County.<br/><br/>Tips<br/>- Stop 22 of 33 on the Rhinebeck, Red Hook & Milan Scenic Tour (Tour 1).<br/>- For a side trip: Wilcox Park, a short distance on Rt. 199 East, is 615 acres of forested hills, streams and a lake for swimming, boating and other activities. Call 845/758-6100 for visitor information.]]></description>
