  <Placemark>
    <name>Wildflours Gluten-Free Bakery Brunswick ME</name>
    <description><![CDATA[Wildflours Gluten-Free Bakery<br/><br/>📍 54 Cumberland St, Brunswick, ME<br/><br/>A dedicated (not just gluten-free-friendly, fully gluten-free facility) bakery — rare and valuable for celiac/GF travelers — with extensive vegan/dairy-free crossover options (bread is always dairy-free too), serving multiple dietary-restriction needs at once.<br/><br/>Must Order<br/>- Cherry coconut muffin and pumpkin chocolate chip muffin (customer favorites)<br/>- Pumpkin donuts — reviewers call them the best GF donuts they've had<br/>- Custom cakes and cheesecakes (6"-10")<br/>- Specialty bars — Caramel Chocolate Pretzel Bar, Grasshopper Brownie<br/>- Take-n-bake cinnamon buns<br/><br/>Tips<br/>- Custom cakes/cheesecakes/pies need 7 business days' notice<br/>- Grab-bags of day-old muffins available at a discount<br/>- Morning-only: Mon-Fri 7am-2pm, Sat 7am-12pm, closed Sunday<br/>- Cash-only status not confirmed — worth calling ahead if that matters<br/><br/>More info: https://www.wildfloursmaine.com/]]></description>
