  <Placemark>
    <name>Wing's Castle Millbrook NY</name>
    <description><![CDATA[Wing's Castle<br/><br/>📍 717 Bangall Road, Millbrook, NY 12545<br/><br/>A unique architectural site — this Hudson River stone castle was built using salvaged materials from antique buildings by artist-owners Peter and Toni Wing between 1971 and 1993. Tours available; a similarly-designed addition operates as a bed and breakfast.<br/><br/>Tips<br/>- Call 845/677-9085 for tour information.<br/>- Stop 7 of 17 on the Washington & Amenia Scenic Tour (Tour 4) — reached via Bangall Rd off CR 57.]]></description>
    <styleUrl>#c-green</styleUrl>
