    </Point>
  </Placemark>
  <Placemark>
    <name>Winnisquam Lake Laconia NH</name>
    <description><![CDATA[Winnisquam Lake<br/><br/>📍 Laconia / Belmont / Sanbornton / Tilton, NH<br/><br/>Connected to Lake Winnipesaukee via the Winnipesaukee River and Opechee Bay, Winnisquam is a smaller, quieter lake bordering four towns — popular for boating and fishing without Winnipesaukee's summer crowds.<br/><br/>Tips<br/>- A good detour for a quieter lake stop if the main Winnipesaukee shoreline feels busy.<br/><br/>More info: https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=43.5450%2C%20-71.5089]]></description>
