  <Placemark>
    <name>Wired Gallery High Falls NY</name>
    <description><![CDATA[Wired Gallery<br/><br/>📍 11 Mohonk Rd, High Falls, NY<br/><br/>Founded in May 2012 by Sevan Melikyan, originally on the upper floor of a barn next to the Depuy Canal House, where artwork was hung using wires — the source of the gallery's name. Moved to its current location on Mohonk Road in 2014. Focuses on Mid-Hudson Valley artists, especially from Ulster County.<br/><br/>Tips<br/>- Open Saturday and Sunday, 11am–4pm, or by appointment — check current hours before a special trip.<br/>- Easy pairing with Depuy Canal House Restaurant nearby.<br/><br/>More info: https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=41.8303%2C%20-74.1361]]></description>
