  <Placemark>
    <name>Wiscasset Bay Gallery Wiscasset ME</name>
    <description><![CDATA[Wiscasset Bay Gallery<br/><br/>📍 75 Main Street, Wiscasset, ME (temporary location during repairs, per gallery's own site as of 2026-08)<br/><br/>Established 1985 — two floors of 19th through 21st century American and European paintings, with an emphasis on Maine and Monhegan Island artists.<br/><br/>Tips<br/>- Distinct from Sylvan Gallery a few doors down (60 Main St) — this one skews historical/traditional, Sylvan skews contemporary.<br/>- Hours: Mon–Sat 10am–5:30pm, Sun 11am–5pm (per gallery's site — verify before relying on it).<br/><br/>More info: https://wiscassetbaygallery.com/]]></description>
