    <description><![CDATA[Wiscasset Old Jail & Museum<br/><br/>📍 Wiscasset ME<br/><br/>Atmospheric 1811 jail and adjoining museum offering a vivid look at 19th-century incarceration.<br/><br/>Tips<br/>- Pair with a stop at Red's Eats while in town.]]></description>
