  <Placemark>
    <name>Wiscasset Waterville &amp; Farmington Railway Museum Alna ME</name>
    <description><![CDATA[Wiscasset, Waterville & Farmington Railway Museum<br/><br/>📍 97 Cross Rd, Sheepscot Station, Alna, ME 04535<br/><br/>Volunteer-run museum and operating narrow-gauge steam railway preserving the historic Wiscasset, Waterville & Farmington line. Offers train rides on restored track through the Sheepscot Valley — about 10 minutes north of Wiscasset village in Alna.<br/><br/>Tips<br/>- Check the seasonal operating schedule before visiting — not open daily<br/>- Good pairing with a Wiscasset Main Street stop<br/><br/>More info: https://wordpress.wwfry.org/]]></description>
