  <Placemark>
    <name>Wm. Farmer &amp; Sons Hudson, NY</name>
    <description><![CDATA[Wm. Farmer & Sons<br/><br/>📍 Hudson, NY<br/><br/>Hudson's most acclaimed restaurant, set in a boutique hotel, serving inventive New American plates including grass-fed tartare, Argentine prawns, and a celebrated smash burger.<br/><br/>Must Order<br/>- Grass-fed beef tartare — clean and well-seasoned<br/>- Argentine prawns — the signature dish<br/>- Smash burger — consistently called the best in the valley<br/><br/>Tips<br/>- Reservations strongly recommended for dinner<br/>- The bar area is great for a cocktail without a reservation<br/><br/>More info: https://www.google.com/maps/search/Wm.+Farmer+&+Sons+Hudson,+NY]]></description>
