  <Placemark>
    <name>Wolfeboro Historical Society NH</name>
    <description><![CDATA[Wolfeboro Historical Society<br/><br/>📍 Wolfeboro, NH<br/><br/>A local-history museum in downtown Wolfeboro, which bills itself as "the oldest summer resort in America" thanks to Royal Governor John Wentworth's 1768 estate on nearby Lake Wentworth.<br/><br/>Tips<br/>- Combine with the Wright Museum of WWII and Abenaki Tower for a Wolfeboro-area day.<br/><br/>More info: https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=43.5809%2C%20-71.2023]]></description>
