  <Placemark>
    <name>Woodbarn at Marsh-Billings-Rockefeller NHP Woodstock VT</name>
    <description><![CDATA[Woodbarn / Horse Shed<br/><br/>📍 Marsh-Billings-Rockefeller National Historical Park, Woodstock, VT<br/><br/>A historic farm outbuilding within Marsh-Billings-Rockefeller National Historical Park, part of the working farm complex tied to the Marsh, Billings, and Rockefeller families' successive ownership of the property. Distinct from the park's main Carriage Barn Visitor Center, which has its own note in this vault.<br/><br/>Tips<br/>- See the park's Carriage Barn Visitor Center note for general visiting info — this building is one piece of the wider farm complex.<br/><br/>More info: https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=43.6305%2C%20-72.5213]]></description>
