  <Placemark>
    <name>Woods Hole Science Aquarium Woods Hole MA</name>
    <description><![CDATA[Woods Hole Science Aquarium<br/><br/>📍 Woods Hole MA<br/><br/>Small free NOAA Fisheries aquarium featuring local marine species, harbor seals, and touch tanks — excellent for kids.<br/><br/>Tips<br/>- Free admission — one of the best free stops on the Cape.<br/>- Harbor seal feedings are a highlight; check the schedule at the entrance.]]></description>
