  <Placemark>
    <name>Woodstock Artists Association &amp; Museum Woodstock, NY</name>
    <description><![CDATA[Woodstock Artists Association & Museum<br/><br/>📍 Woodstock, NY<br/><br/>The oldest art organization in the Catskills, founded in 1919, with rotating exhibitions representing the deep artistic heritage of the Woodstock community.<br/><br/>Tips<br/>- Free admission to the galleries<br/>- Permanent collection includes Hudson River School and Woodstock Colony artists<br/>- A good 30–45 minute stop in the village center<br/><br/>More info: https://www.google.com/maps/search/Woodstock+Artists+Association+&+Museum+Woodstock,+NY]]></description>
