  </Placemark>
  <Placemark>
    <name>Woodstock Farm Sanctuary High Falls NY</name>
    <description><![CDATA[Woodstock Farm Sanctuary<br/><br/>📍 High Falls, NY<br/><br/>A farm animal rescue and sanctuary — the name is a holdover from its original location in Woodstock, NY, though the sanctuary itself is now based near High Falls. Public tours let visitors meet rescued cows, pigs, goats, sheep, and poultry.<br/><br/>Tips<br/>- Tours are typically reservation-based — check ahead rather than arriving unannounced.<br/>- Note this is unrelated to the New England 2026 itinerary's Woodstock, VT stops — same name, different place.<br/><br/>More info: https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=41.8092%2C%20-74.1679]]></description>
    <styleUrl>#c-green</styleUrl>
