  <Placemark>
    <name>Worthy Kitchen Woodstock VT</name>
    <description><![CDATA[Worthy Kitchen is an American restaurant offering casual dining with prices ranging from $20 to $30 per person. It opens at 4 PM for dinner and offers a variety of dishes, including craft beers and burgers. It serves alcohol.<br/><br/>More info: https://www.google.com/maps/place/Worthy+Kitchen/@43.6223817,-72.5377723,5128m/data=!3m1!1e3!4m14!1m6!2m5!1srestaurants+with+reservations!5m2!4e9!15saccepts_reservations!6e5!3m6!1s0x89e1d81196d5ec01:0x5dd7950ee4b6f0ca!8m2!3d43.6326556!4d-72.5038667!!16s%2Fg%2F1pp2vgks_?entry=ttu&g_ep=EgoyMDI2MDYyMy4wIKXMDSoASAFQAw%3D%3D]]></description>
