    </Point>
  </Placemark>
  <Placemark>
    <name>YOIKI Japanese express</name>
    <description><![CDATA[YOIKI Japanese express is an Asian restaurant located at 164 New County Rd, serving Japanese food. Expect prices to be around $10–20 per person. It opens at 11 AM and operates during lunch hours but is closed on Tuesdays.<br/><br/>More info: https://www.google.com/maps/place/YOIKI+Japanese+express/@44.08514,-69.200832,18853m/data=!3m1!1e3!4m13!1m5!2m4!1sRestaurants!5m1!4e9!6e5!3m6!1s0x4cadcf6a50e8baef:0x1ac694da8639d5f!8m2!3d44.0966822!4d-69.131394!15sCgtSZXN0YXVyYW50c1oNIgtyZXN0YXVyYW50c5IBCnJlc3RhdXJhbnSaASNDaFpEU1VoTk1HOW5TMFZKVUZWNVduVnFOVzlJYW1WbkVBReABAPoBBAgAECo!16s%2Fg%2F11wr1z4cyh?entry=ttu&g_ep=EgoyMDI2MDcxMy4wIKXMDSoASAFQAw%3D%3D]]></description>
