  <Placemark>
    <name>Young's Lobster Pound Belfast ME</name>
    <description><![CDATA[Young's Lobster Pound<br/><br/>📍 2 Fairview St, Belfast, ME 04915<br/><br/>BYOB waterfront lobster pound — pick your own lobster, steamed fresh, picnic tables with Penobscot Bay views. Rated 4.4 on Google (986 ratings), 4.3 Tripadvisor (#2 of 34 Belfast restaurants).<br/><br/>Tips<br/>- Open daily, Mon-Sat 9am-8pm, Sun 9am-7pm.<br/>- Reddit's specific tip: bring your own beer/snacks, sit outside for sunset if weather allows.<br/>- Touristy and can have long waits during peak season — go early evening for the sunset, per Reddit.<br/><br/>More info: https://www.facebook.com/youngslobsterpound/]]></description>
    <styleUrl>#c-red</styleUrl>
    <ExtendedData>
      <Data name="vault_type"><value>Restaurant</value></Data>
