  <Placemark>
    <name>Zion Episcopal Church Wappingers Falls NY</name>
    <description><![CDATA[Zion Episcopal Church<br/><br/>📍 Satterlee Pl, Wappingers Falls, NY 12590<br/><br/>The first in the village, ca. 1833, this late Gothic Revival church was constructed of brownstone from Benjamin Clapp's local quarry.<br/><br/>Tips<br/>- Stop 6 of 38 on the Beacon & Fishkill Heritage Tour (Tour 7).]]></description>
    <styleUrl>#c-green</styleUrl>
