  <Placemark>
    <name>✅ 12 1st S St Bar Harbor ME</name>
    <description><![CDATA[Time: 2026-08-15T00:00:00<br/><br/>Rocko's Cottage, Bar Harbor – Review<br/>Overall: A genuinely local, hosted-with-care downtown cottage rather than an anonymous rental — consistently praised for cleanliness, hospitality, and an unbeatable walk-everywhere location.<br/><br/>---<br/><br/>📋 Fast Facts<br/>- Listing type: Entire home (2BR/1BA), ~900 sq ft<br/>- Sleeps: 4<br/>- Host: Lisa and Rick — Bar Harbor locals (Lisa 60+ years in town; Rick a recently-retired Jackson Laboratory engineer). This is their actual home, rented by the week only in summer.<br/>- Rate seen: ~$295/night (subject to change)<br/><br/>---<br/><br/>🛋️ Space & Amenities<br/>- Kitchen: full kitchen, living room<br/>- Laundry: washer & dryer on site<br/>- Outdoor: deck/patio<br/>- Climate: A/C, heater, fireplace<br/>- Connectivity: internet, cable/satellite<br/>- Parking: on-site; pets welcome<br/><br/>---<br/><br/>📍 Location & Neighborhood<br/>Downtown Bar Harbor, an easy walk to nearly everything — the free Island Explorer bus hub is two blocks away, and restaurants, the Village Green, Abbe Museum, Bar Harbor Historical Society, and Jesup Memorial Library are all within about 0.2–0.4 miles. No need to worry about parking once you're settled in.<br/><br/>---<br/><br/>🔑 Check-in & House Rules<br/>Hosts live locally and have historically greeted guests in person at arrival.<br/><br/>---<br/><br/>⭐ Host & Reviews<br/>Reviews consistently highlight excellent communication, an immaculately clean home, and hosts who "think of every little thing" — guests describe it as a step above typical VRBO stays. Everything in town is described as an easy, quiet walk from the cottage.<br/><br/>---<br/><br/>👍 Pros<br/>- Real local hosts with a strong hospitality track record<br/>- Unbeatable walkable downtown location<br/>- Consistently spotless<br/><br/>---<br/><br/>👎 Cons<br/>- Small footprint (900 sq ft, 1 bath) — best for a couple or small family, not a large group<br/>- Only available by the week in summer (less flexible for short stays)<br/><br/>---<br/><br/>🎯 Best For<br/>Couples or small families who want to walk everywhere in downtown Bar Harbor without a car.<br/><br/>---<br/><br/>🔗 Sources<br/>- Rocko's Cottage Nestled in the Heart of Downtown Bar Harbor<br/><br/>More info: https://www.vrbo.com/232330?dateless=true&x_pwa=1&rfrr=HSR&pwa_ts=1783459962610&referrerUrl=aHR0cHM6Ly93d3cudnJiby5jb20vSG90ZWwtU2VhcmNo&useRewards=true&adults=2&regionId=561&destination=Bar+Harbor%2C+Maine%2C+United+States+of+America&destType=MARKET&neighborhoodId=890182262554296320&selected=33486288&latLong=44.387673%2C-68.205357&searchId=3dc8cc51-f527-45da-b347-f283a7671201&sort=RECOMMENDED&userIntent=&expediaPropertyId=33486288]]></description>
