    <name>✅ 46 Jackson St, Littleton NH</name>
    <description><![CDATA[Time: 2026-08-26T00:00:00<br/><br/>Home in Littleton – Review<br/>Overall: A spacious 3-bedroom colonial in the heart of Littleton, hosted by an 8-year Superhost with a strong review record (4.91★, 56 reviews) — walkable to Main Street with a mountain view.<br/><br/>---<br/><br/>📋 Fast Facts<br/>- Listing type: Entire home, colonial<br/>- Bedrooms / Beds: 3 bedrooms, 7 beds total (Bedroom 1: 1 double; Bedroom 2: 1 queen; Bedroom 3: 1 queen, 1 double, 1 single, 1 bunk)<br/>- Bathrooms: 1.5<br/>- Max guests: 6<br/>- Host: Deborah A — Superhost, 8 years hosting<br/><br/>---<br/><br/>🛋️ Space & Amenities<br/>- Kitchen: yes<br/>- Laundry: washer & dryer<br/>- Outdoor: mountain view<br/>- Connectivity: Fast Wi-Fi (251 Mbps), dedicated workspace<br/>- Parking: free driveway parking (4 spaces)<br/>- Other: 40" HDTV with Roku/Chromecast, pets allowed, smoke + CO alarms installed<br/>- Note: must climb stairs<br/><br/>---<br/><br/>📍 Location & Neighborhood<br/>Walk to award-winning Main Street — shops, restaurants, spas, a historic opera house, and a riverwalk. Hiking, biking, live theater and music, water sports, and other White Mountains activities are minutes away, along with a playground and pool within walking distance.<br/><br/>---<br/><br/>🔑 Check-in & House Rules<br/>Check-in after 3:00 PM, checkout before 12:00 PM. Pets allowed.<br/><br/>---<br/><br/>⭐ Host & Reviews<br/>Deborah A, Superhost with 8 years of hosting experience. 4.91 out of 5 stars across 56 reviews.<br/><br/>---<br/><br/>👍 Pros<br/>- Superhost with a strong, well-established review record<br/>- Spacious for a group (3BR/7 beds/6 guests)<br/>- Free driveway parking and fast Wi-Fi/workspace — good for remote work days<br/>- Walkable to Main Street<br/><br/>---<br/><br/>👎 Cons<br/>- Only 1.5 baths for up to 6 guests<br/>- Some bedrooms have less conventional bed setups (bunk/single mixed in) — check fit for your group<br/><br/>---<br/><br/>🎯 Best For<br/>A group or family wanting a spacious, walkable, well-reviewed base in downtown Littleton.<br/><br/>More info: https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/626085727753547407]]></description>
