  <Placemark>
    <name>✅ AirBnB 442 Main St Chatham MA</name>
    <description><![CDATA[Time: 2026-09-09T00:00:00<br/><br/>Full Renovation! Amazing Spot with Views! – Review<br/>Overall: A bright, fully renovated second-story condo right on Main Street, professionally managed by a long-established Superhost with an excellent review record (4.93★, 151 reviews) — modern and turnkey, walkable to everything downtown.<br/><br/>---<br/><br/>📋 Fast Facts<br/>- Listing type: Entire condominium, second-story walkup<br/>- Bedrooms / Beds: 2 bedrooms, 2 beds (1 king, 1 double)<br/>- Bathrooms: 1<br/>- Max guests: 4<br/>- Host: Del Mar Vacations — Superhost, 10 years hosting<br/><br/>---<br/><br/>🛋️ Space & Amenities<br/>- Kitchen: bright kitchen/living area, new appliances, island seating<br/>- Laundry: washer & dryer<br/>- Outdoor: deck with a gas grill<br/>- Climate: central A/C<br/>- Living area: large flat-screen TV, sectional couch<br/>- Pets: dogs welcomed, $40/night per dog fee<br/>- Linens: sheets and bath towels provided, beds made upon arrival<br/><br/>---<br/><br/>📍 Location & Neighborhood<br/>Right on Main Street — walkable to local shops, galleries, a movie theater, and restaurants (Impudent Oyster, Chatham Squire, Bluefins Sushi & Sake Bar, Wild Goose Tavern). About a 3-minute drive to Lighthouse Beach and Oyster Pond Beach.<br/><br/>---<br/><br/>🔑 Check-in & House Rules<br/>Self check-in via smartlock, after 4:00 PM. Checkout before 9:00 AM (early — plan accordingly). Dogs allowed with a $40/night fee.<br/><br/>---<br/><br/>⭐ Host & Reviews<br/>Del Mar Vacations, Superhost with 10 years of hosting experience. 4.93 out of 5 stars across 151 reviews — a well-established, professionally managed property.<br/><br/>---<br/><br/>👍 Pros<br/>- Completely renovated, modern condo right on Main Street<br/>- Strong, well-established review record<br/>- Outdoor deck with gas grill — good for cooking in<br/>- Linens/towels provided, beds made on arrival<br/><br/>---<br/><br/>👎 Cons<br/>- Only 1 bathroom for 4 guests<br/>- Early checkout (9:00 AM)<br/>- Second-story walkup — worth checking for stairs if that's a concern<br/>- Extra pet fee if bringing a dog<br/><br/>---<br/><br/>🎯 Best For<br/>A couple or small family wanting a modern, low-maintenance, walkable Main Street base in Chatham.<br/><br/>More info: https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/32892701]]></description>
