    <name>✅ Alpine Tavern at The Wentworth Littleton NH</name>
    <description><![CDATA[Time: 2026-08-26T18:45:00<br/><br/>Alpine Tavern at The Wentworth is a bar & grill offering American cuisine with a price range of $50–100 per person. It is open for dinner from 4 PM to 9 PM daily and serves alcohol.<br/><br/>More info: https://www.google.com/maps/place/Alpine+Tavern+at+The+Wentworth/@44.1470544,-71.1848855,784m/data=!3m2!1e3!4b1!4m6!3m5!1s0x4cb3996bcf693235:0xc6a2e08b4d0ee84b!8m2!3d44.1470544!4d-71.1823106!16s%2Fg%2F11krq04t1l?entry=ttu&g_ep=EgoyMDI2MDYxNi4wIKXMDSoASAFQAw%3D%3D]]></description>
