  <Placemark>
    <name>✅ American Bounty CIA Hyde Park, NY</name>
    <description><![CDATA[Time: 2026-09-24T18:45:00<br/><br/>American Bounty CIA<br/><br/>📍 1946 Campus Drive, Hyde Park, NY 12538<br/><br/>The CIA's New American restaurant, on OpenTable's Top 100 Brunch list, showcasing Hudson Valley ingredients executed by advanced culinary students.<br/><br/>Must Order<br/>- Sunday brunch prix fixe — the top 100 pick — outstanding value<br/>- Hudson Valley duck — a recurring signature<br/>- Seasonal vegetable dishes — among the most creative preparations<br/><br/>Tips<br/>- Brunch books faster than dinner — reserve early<br/>- Much more relaxed atmosphere than The Bocuse<br/>- Phone: (845) 471-6608 — 10-minute grace period, call if running late<br/>- Located inside Roth Hall; enter campus following signs for "Restaurant & Visitor Parking," park in the Anton Plaza garage<br/>- Campus is cashless — all major credit cards accepted<br/><br/>More info: https://www.opentable.com/r/american-bounty-at-the-culinary-institute-of-america-hyde-park?corrid=dcd2cd21-1c16-4db0-9116-3b22551c1fc1&avt=eyJ2IjozLCJtIjoxLCJwIjowLCJzIjoxLCJuIjowfQ&p=2&sd=2026-09-06T18%3A30%3A00]]></description>
