  <Placemark>
    <name>✅ Aster &amp; Rose Restaurant Camden ME</name>
    <description><![CDATA[Time: 2026-08-06T18:00:00<br/><br/>Aster & Rose<br/><br/>📍 581 Youngtown Rd, Lincolnville, ME (at the Youngtown Inn — a short drive from downtown Camden, not in Camden itself)<br/><br/>The top-rated restaurant in Lincolnville — 4.8 on Restaurant Guru across 477 reviews, ranked #1 of 15 Lincolnville restaurants. Set in a beautiful old farmhouse at the historic Youngtown Inn, just minutes from downtown Camden but a genuinely different, quieter countryside setting with Camden Hills views. Locally sourced, seasonal, creatively prepared cuisine with attentive service and a strong wine/cocktail list — a cozy, romantic atmosphere.<br/><br/>Must Order<br/>- Whatever's featured seasonally — the kitchen is built around what's fresh, not a fixed menu<br/><br/>Tips<br/>- Open Wednesday–Saturday, dinner only, 5pm–9pm.<br/>- Book via Tock: exploretock.com/asterrose.<br/>- Worth the short drive from Camden proper — it reads as a special-occasion destination, not a quick stop.<br/><br/>More info: https://www.google.com/maps/place/Aster+%26+Rose+Restaurant/@44.2691958,-69.1002327,787m/data=!3m2!1e3!4b1!4m6!3m5!1s0x4cae775eb918804b:0x6d07c0c2faed1ed4!8m2!3d44.269192!4d-69.0976578!16s%2Fg%2F11swk7hf2q?entry=ttu&g_ep=EgoyMDI2MDYwOS4wIKXMDSoASAFQAw%3D%3D]]></description>
