  <Placemark>
    <name>✅ Branches Grill and Cafe Chatham MA</name>
    <description><![CDATA[Time: 2026-09-11T18:30:00<br/><br/>[!warning] Reservation conflict — 2026-09-11<br/>This 6:30 PM reservation overlaps with a new phone reservation just made at Impudent Oyster at 6:15 PM the same night. This one already has a confirmed receipt on file — likely the one to keep, but confirm before cancelling the other.<br/><br/>Overview<br/>Type: Restaurant  <br/><br/>Best known for: Great food and exceptional service. Bathroom facilities are well-stocked.<br/><br/>Location context: Chatham, MA area  <br/><br/>Price level: $20–30 per person  <br/><br/>Visit timing: Not mentioned  <br/><br/>Typical Customers<br/>Demographics: Locals and tourists  <br/><br/>Group types: Couples and families  <br/><br/>Common occasions: Casual dining and dinner  <br/><br/>Vibe & Setting<br/>Atmosphere: Casual and friendly  <br/><br/>Noise level: Moderate  <br/><br/>Decor & setting: Indoor seating with an inviting atmosphere  <br/><br/>Service style: Attentive and personable  <br/><br/>Recommended Dishes<br/>Overall dish consensus  <br/>Popular items include the Crab and Corn Chowder, Jerk Chicken Combo, and Escovitch Fish, praised for their flavors and preparations.<br/><br/>How “top dishes” are determined  <br/>Top dishes are chosen based on their appearance in multiple reviews and photos, along with strong praise from visitors mentioning their enjoyment.<br/><br/>| Rank | Dish                          | Why it stands out                                    | How often it’s mentioned     | Ideal for                    |<br/>|------|-------------------------------|------------------------------------------------------|-------------------------------|-------------------------------|<br/>| 1    | Crab and Corn Chowder        | Perfectly seasoned and absolutely delicious.         | Mentioned in several reviews. | Great for sharing             |<br/>| 2    | Jerk Chicken Combo Meal      | Large portions with balanced flavors and sauces.     | Repeatedly called out as a favorite. | Hearty main                  |<br/>| 3    | Escovitch Fish               | Fresh and flavorful, a highlight of the menu.       | Appears in numerous photos.   | Good for special occasions    |<br/><br/>Good alternates / backup choices  <br/>- Grilled Lemon Pepper Shrimp: Noted for its delicious flavor.<br/>- Surf and Turf: Comforting and generous serving size.<br/><br/>Highlights (non-dish positives from reviews)<br/>Friendly Service: Many reviews highlight the attentive and personable service, contributing to a pleasant dining experience.<br/><br/>Clean Facilities: Reviewers frequently mention the cleanliness and well-stocked bathroom, enhancing the overall impression of the restaurant.<br/><br/>Common Issues (from reviews)<br/>Busy Times: Not mentioned.<br/><br/>Long Waits: Some guests reported longer waits during peak hours, like dinner service.<br/><br/>Practical Notes<br/>Reservation / wait: Not mentioned  <br/><br/>Accessibility: Not mentioned  <br/><br/>Parking / transit: Ample street parking available in the area.  <br/><br/>Best use case: Best for casual dinners and family outings.  <br/><br/>Guest-Favorite Dish & Drink Recommendations<br/><br/>Across OpenTable, Google, and Tripadvisor reviews, several dishes stand out as crowd favorites:<br/><br/>- Jerk Chicken (Combo or Quesadilla): Tender, juicy chicken marinated in classic Jamaican spices. The jerk quesadilla—packed with melted cheese and seasoned meat—is a top-rated appetizer.<br/>    <br/>- Curried Goat: Slow-cooked until tender in rich, aromatic curry spices, served alongside fragrant rice, beans, and sweet fried plantains.<br/>    <br/>- Ian’s Rum Punch: The restaurant’s signature cocktail, lauded by reviewers as smooth, perfectly balanced, and essential for starting the meal.<br/>    <br/>- Grilled Lemon Pepper Shrimp & Eggplant: A fresh, lighter entree pairing charred seafood with seasonal vegetables.<br/>    <br/>- Pumpkin Soup & Jamaican Festival: Highly recommended comforting starters featuring homemade island seasonings.<br/><br/>More info: https://www.google.com/maps/place/Branches+Grill+and+Cafe/@41.6786019,-69.9899069,4128m/data=!3m1!1e3!4m11!1m3!2m2!1sRestaurants!6e5!3m6!1s0x89fb15cb4bc13357:0xedf3edca99b94bda!8m2!3d41.6892421!4d-69.9663327!15sCgtSZXN0YXVyYW50c1oNIgtyZXN0YXVyYW50c5IBCnJlc3RhdXJhbnSaAURDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnh3ZEZWdGJGSlhha0p5VW0xM2VWVkZNREZrV0dSRlpWWnNkbEZ1WXhBQuABAPoBBAgAEDg!16s%2Fg%2F11gzqvr4yg?entry=ttu&g_ep=EgoyMDI2MDYxMC4wIKXMDSoASAFQAw%3D%3D]]></description>
