  <Placemark>
    <name>✅ Cafe Louis - Costa Media Camden ME</name>
    <description><![CDATA[Time: 2026-08-10T18:30:00<br/><br/>Cafe Louis on the Costa Media<br/><br/>📍 50 Elm St, Camden, ME<br/><br/>A small, family-owned restaurant inspired by chef Evan Richardson's grandparents, serving Costa Rican and Caribbean food — genuinely distinctive for Midcoast Maine, where this cuisine is otherwise hard to find. Reviewers single out the chicken as "hands down the best chicken we have ever eaten," with smoky flavor and crispy skin.<br/><br/>Must Order<br/>- Costa Rican-style chicken — the standout dish by a wide margin<br/>- Radicchio salad<br/>- Calamari<br/>- Mussels<br/><br/>Tips<br/>- Hours are irregular — Sun–Tue 3pm–9pm, closed Wed–Thu, open Fri; happy hour 3–5pm, dinner 5pm–close. Confirm current hours before going, since this schedule is unusual.<br/>- Reservations recommended at (207) 230-8424.<br/>- A genuine change of pace from the seafood-heavy Camden dining scene.<br/><br/>More info: https://www.google.com/maps/place/Cafe+Louis+-+Costa+Media/@44.2082064,-69.0698581,576m/data=!3m1!1e3!4m13!1m5!2m4!1sRestaurants!5m1!4e9!6e5!3m6!1s0x4cadd7deb7ed5a19:0x6a4b739c53f5fdd2!8m2!3d44.2081533!4d-69.0666541!15sCgtSZXN0YXVyYW50c1oNIgtyZXN0YXVyYW50c5IBCnJlc3RhdXJhbnSaASRDaGREU1VoTk1HOW5TMFZKUTBGblNVTXhibUZmYUdsQlJSQULgAQD6AQQIHhA9!16s%2Fg%2F11y1qxd_kp?entry=ttu&g_ep=EgoyMDI2MDYwOS4wIKXMDSoASAFQAw%3D%3D]]></description>
