  <Placemark>
    <name>✅ Del Mar Bar &amp; Bistro Chatham MA</name>
    <description><![CDATA[Time: 2026-09-14T18:45:00<br/><br/>Del Mar Bar & Bistro<br/><br/>📍 907 Main St, Chatham, MA 02633<br/><br/>A cool, coastal-elegant nightspot for eating, drinking, and socializing — native seafood, bistro classics, and wood-fired thin-crust pizzas paired with a strong cocktail and wine list. Rated #2 of 56 restaurants in Chatham on Tripadvisor (4.6) and 4.7 on Google across 300+ reviews; one reviewer called it "one of the best all-around restaurants on Cape Cod."<br/><br/>Must Order<br/>- Fig & prosciutto wood-fired pizza — repeatedly singled out as one of the best non-traditional pizzas on the menu<br/>- Maple-glazed roasted duckling with bourbon cherries — a standout main<br/>- Wild mushroom & brie tart — rich, well-balanced starter<br/>- Oysters Rockefeller and braised short rib — recurring menu favorites<br/>- Lemon Drop martini — the cocktail program is a genuine strength, not an afterthought<br/>- Ask about the Japanese pumpkin ravioli if it's running as a special — it's not a permanent menu item<br/><br/>Tips<br/>- Reservations strongly recommended — this place books up quickly, especially in-season<br/>- On the pricier side (entrées/shared plates $30-50+; a couple with cocktails or wine can run $150-250), but reviewers consistently feel the quality justifies it<br/>- Multiple dining spaces, including a covered patio strung with lights — nice for a warm-weather date night<br/>- Dinner only, Monday–Saturday, 4:30 PM to close<br/><br/>More info: https://www.google.com/maps/place/Del+Mar+Bar+%26+Bistro/@41.6786019,-69.9899069,4128m/data=!3m1!1e3!4m11!1m3!2m2!1sRestaurants!6e5!3m6!1s0x89fb14bd01846881:0x25bef925d5453213!8m2!3d41.6860075!4d-69.9694353!15sCgtSZXN0YXVyYW50c1oNIgtyZXN0YXVyYW50c5IBBmJpc3Ryb5oBI0NoWkRTVWhOTUc5blMwVkpRMEZuU1VOU0xYVkxTVmRuRUFF4AEA-gEECCEQPQ!16s%2Fg%2F1tdksvgl?entry=ttu&g_ep=EgoyMDI2MDYxMC4wIKXMDSoASAFQAw%3D%3D]]></description>
