  <Placemark>
    <name>✅ Franny's Bistro Aug 11 Camden ME</name>
    <description><![CDATA[Time: 2026-08-11T19:00:00<br/><br/>Franny's Bistro — Aug 11 visit<br/><br/>📍 55 Chestnut St, Camden, ME<br/><br/>Camden's #1-ranked restaurant on Tripadvisor (4.7/5, out of 41) — a real distinction, not a marginal edge. Fresh, local-ingredient-driven menu: shrimp dumplings over cucumber noodles, standout mussels and halibut specials, and "Kraken" (balsamic calamari) as a regular favorite. Warm, attentive service in an inviting room.<br/><br/>Must Order<br/>- Shrimp dumplings over cucumber noodles<br/>- Kraken (calamari in balsamic)<br/>- Mussels or halibut, whichever is featured as the day's special<br/>- Crème brûlée for dessert<br/><br/>Tips<br/>- Open Wednesday–Saturday, 5pm–8pm only.<br/>- Walk-ins accepted but rarely successful in peak season — this reservation is worth protecting.<br/>- See the main Franny's Bistro note for the fuller writeup; this note tracks the Aug 11 visit specifically.<br/><br/>Reservation confirmation (Aug 11)<br/><br/>More info: https://www.google.com/maps/place/Franny's+Bistro/@44.206831,-69.0687992,831m/data=!3m1!1e3!4m13!1m5!2m4!1sRestaurants!5m1!4e9!6e5!3m6!1s0x4cadd78ea7eaef0b:0xb4b12681059b9564!8m2!3d44.2078696!4d-69.0640303!15sCgtSZXN0YXVyYW50c1oNIgtyZXN0YXVyYW50c5IBCnJlc3RhdXJhbnSaAURDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMjVOTWxkWWNGbGFTR2hNWlZob2ExTXdSazlPVlRGc1VsZDRWbVJyUlJBQuABAPoBBAgAEEA!16s%2Fg%2F11hdnlgmjl?entry=ttu&g_ep=EgoyMDI2MDYwOS4wIKXMDSoASAFQAw%3D%3D]]></description>
