  <Placemark>
    <name>✅ Franny's Bistro Camden ME</name>
    <description><![CDATA[Time: 2026-08-05T18:45:00<br/><br/>Day: `=dateformat(this.start-date-time, "cccc")`<br/> <br/> Day: `=dateformat(this.start-date-time, "cccc")`<br/>Reservation confirmation (Aug 5)<br/><br/>Franny’s Bistro — Camden, Maine<br/><br/>A well-loved bistro at 55 Chestnut St, rated 4.6 from 238+ reviews. It’s co-owned by Jennifer and Jack Neal, with food often described as American bistro with global influences. Expect a cozy, moody-lit space — great for date night — with reservations strongly recommended in summer.<br/><br/>The dish to order: Scallops & mussels over cheddar-bacon grits with creamed corn. This is the house signature — while the owners may debate their most famous dish, the consensus from customers leans toward the scallops and mussels. One diner specifically called out the combination as genius, pairing perfectly-cooked fish with creamed corn and bacon over cheddar grits.<br/><br/>Other strong picks:<br/><br/>- Roast chicken — tender, not dry, with a garlic-herb drizzle great for dunking focaccia, served with potatoes and broccoli rabe<br/>- Shrimp dumplings over cucumber noodles — a popular, fresh starter<br/>- Halibut special (when available) — topped with roasted peaches, fingerling potatoes, and grilled asparagus, called some of the best of a trip by one Tripadvisor reviewer<br/>- The Kraken (calamari in balsamic) — addictively good, a favorite among regulars<br/>- Steak frites — a reliable crowd-pleaser, kids and adults alike<br/>- Crème brûlée — called a must-try for dessert<br/><br/>Good to know: They also do a strong non-alcoholic cocktail and wine list if you’re not drinking, and portions on the salads run a bit small for the price per some reviewers — better to lean into the entrees and shared apps.<br/><br/>Want this pinned on your New England 2026 map alongside the other Midcoast spots?<br/><br/>More info: https://www.google.com/maps/place/Franny's+Bistro/@44.206831,-69.0687992,831m/data=!3m1!1e3!4m13!1m5!2m4!1sRestaurants!5m1!4e9!6e5!3m6!1s0x4cadd78ea7eaef0b:0xb4b12681059b9564!8m2!3d44.2078696!4d-69.0640303!15sCgtSZXN0YXVyYW50c1oNIgtyZXN0YXVyYW50c5IBCnJlc3RhdXJhbnSaAURDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMjVOTWxkWWNGbGFTR2hNWlZob2ExTXdSazlPVlRGc1VsZDRWbVJyUlJBQuABAPoBBAgAEEA!16s%2Fg%2F11hdnlgmjl?entry=ttu&g_ep=EgoyMDI2MDYwOS4wIKXMDSoASAFQAw%3D%3D]]></description>
