    <name>✅ Impudent Oyster Chatham MA</name>
    <description><![CDATA[Time: 2026-09-11T18:15:00<br/><br/>[!warning] Reservation conflict — 2026-09-11<br/>This 6:15 PM reservation (booked by phone 2026-08-12) overlaps with an existing confirmed reservation at Branches Grill and Cafe at 6:30 PM the same night. One of these needs to be cancelled.<br/><br/>Overview<br/>Type: Seafood restaurant<br/><br/>Best known for: Creative seafood dishes, exceptional service<br/><br/>Location context: 15 Chatham Bars Ave<br/><br/>Price level: $40–80 per person<br/><br/>Visit timing: Opens for dinner at 5 PM; notable for being busy during peak hours<br/><br/>Typical Customers<br/>Demographics: Mix of locals and tourists<br/><br/>Group types: Couples, families, groups<br/><br/>Common occasions: Special occasions, casual dinners, date nights<br/><br/>Vibe & Setting<br/>Atmosphere: Inviting and lively, with a unique setting in a converted church<br/><br/>Noise level: Moderate<br/><br/>Decor & setting: Indoor dining with a vibrant ambiance, bar area<br/><br/>Service style: Friendly and attentive<br/><br/>Recommended Dishes<br/>Overall dish consensus<br/>Reviewers highly recommend the Oysters Rockefeller and the Fish Sandwich as top choices. The calamari and drink options also receive positive mentions.<br/><br/>How “top dishes” are determined<br/>Top dishes are identified based on mentions in reviews, popularity in photos, and strong favorable feedback from diners.<br/><br/>| Rank | Dish                       | Why it stands out                         | How often it’s mentioned             | Ideal for               |<br/>|------|----------------------------|------------------------------------------|-------------------------------------|--------------------------|<br/>| 1    | Oysters Rockefeller         | Praised for their rich flavor and texture| Mentioned in many reviews            | Sharing at the table     |<br/>| 2    | Fish Sandwich              | Known for being fresh and hearty        | Repeatedly called out as a favorite | Hearty main              |<br/>| 3    | Calamari                   | Lauded for its crisp texture            | Appears in numerous photos          | Lighter option           |<br/><br/>Good alternates / backup choices<br/>- Cocktails: Noted for being creative and delicious.<br/>- Bacon Wrapped Scallops: Praised as a standout appetizer.<br/><br/>Highlights (non-dish positives from reviews)<br/>Service excellence: Guests frequently comment on the attentive and friendly service.<br/><br/>Atmospheric charm: The unique setting in a converted church adds to the dining experience.<br/><br/>Common Issues (from reviews)<br/>Reservation challenges: Many mention difficulty in getting reservations, especially during peak times.<br/><br/>Wait times: Walk-ins may experience long waits, particularly during busy hours.<br/><br/>Practical Notes<br/>Reservation / wait: Reservations recommended, particularly for dinner<br/><br/>Accessibility: Not mentioned<br/><br/>Parking / transit: Not mentioned<br/><br/>Best use case: Great for special occasion dining or a memorable date night.<br/><br/>More info: https://www.google.com/maps/place/Impudent+Oyster/@41.6797756,-69.9615568,757m/data=!3m1!1e3!4m13!1m5!2m4!1sRestaurants!5m1!4e9!6e5!3m6!1s0x89fb149fc02213c9:0xb16d573f01900dd5!8m2!3d41.680064!4d-69.9564259!15sCgtSZXN0YXVyYW50c1oNIgtyZXN0YXVyYW50c5IBEnNlYWZvb2RfcmVzdGF1cmFudJoBI0NoWkRTVWhOTUc5blMwVkpRMEZuU1VOS01EZzJUV0pSRUFF4AEA-gEECGEQQw!16s%2Fg%2F1tdkhpp3?entry=ttu&g_ep=EgoyMDI2MDYxMC4wIKXMDSoASAFQAw%3D%3D]]></description>
