    <description><![CDATA[Time: 2026-09-19T18:30:00<br/><br/>Pain D'Avignon is a Modern French restaurant and bakery in Chatham, specializing in French cuisine. It offers lunch and brunch, and serves alcohol. Expected prices range from $20–30 per person.<br/><br/>More info: https://www.google.com/maps/place/Pain+d%E2%80%99Avignon+Restaurant+Boulangerie/@41.7076199,-70.3581593,104463m/data=!3m1!1e3!4m10!1m2!2m1!1sPain+d%E2%80%99Avignon+Restaurant+Boulangerie!3m6!1s0x89fb15340d0a666d:0x5fd0057c73aa13e7!8m2!3d41.687133!4d-69.9673906!15sCidQYWluIGTigJlBdmlnbm9uIFJlc3RhdXJhbnQgQm91bGFuZ2VyaWVaJyIlcGFpbiBkIGF2aWdub24gcmVzdGF1cmFudCBib3VsYW5nZXJpZZIBCnJlc3RhdXJhbnTgAQA!16s%2Fg%2F11y75fg33m?entry=ttu&g_ep=EgoyMDI2MDYxNi4wIKXMDSoASAFQAw%3D%3D]]></description>
