    <description><![CDATA[Time: 2026-09-15T18:30:00<br/><br/>Pate's is an American restaurant that serves a variety of dishes, particularly seafood. The price range is $50–60 per person, and it is open for dinner from 4:30 PM to 9 PM daily. Alcohol is served.<br/><br/>More info: https://www.google.com/maps/place/Pates+Restaurant/@41.6851626,-69.9912271,3264m/data=!3m2!1e3!4b1!4m6!3m5!1s0x89fb14ea9ab0633f:0x21ec85887f01471f!8m2!3d41.6851631!4d-69.9809488!16s%2Fg%2F1v4k7k53?entry=ttu&g_ep=EgoyMDI2MDYxNi4wIKXMDSoASAFQAw%3D%3D]]></description>
