    <description><![CDATA[Time: 2026-09-06T18:30:00<br/><br/>Simon Pearce is a restaurant known for its American cuisine, including dishes like North Star Farm Lamb Shoulder Pappardelle and Crispy Sesame Chicken. It offers lunch and dinner service and serves alcohol. Prices are generally considered pricey.<br/><br/>More info: https://www.google.com/maps/place/Simon+Pearce/@43.6460589,-72.4220369,795m/data=!3m2!1e3!4b1!4m6!3m5!1s0x4cb4cca0fca5cd17:0xc2f3e6a3d6ab104c!8m2!3d43.646055!4d-72.419462!16s%2Fm%2F021fw2n?entry=ttu&g_ep=EgoyMDI2MDYyMy4wIKXMDSoASAFQAw%3D%3D]]></description>
