    <description><![CDATA[Time: 2026-08-17T18:30:00<br/><br/>Table Salt is an upscale restaurant in Bar Harbor offering New American cuisine with prices ranging from $50 to $100 per person. It is open for dinner from 5 PM to 9 PM daily and serves alcohol.<br/><br/>More info: https://www.google.com/maps/place/Table+Salt/@44.3869713,-68.2069076,781m/data=!3m1!1e3!4m14!1m7!3m6!1s0x4caebf894087db6d:0xe16b9d26ffdebc05!2sTable+Salt!8m2!3d44.3869713!4d-68.2043327!16s%2Fg%2F11xdhn5npq!3m5!1s0x4caebf894087db6d:0xe16b9d26ffdebc05!8m2!3d44.3869713!4d-68.2043327!16s%2Fg%2F11xdhn5npq?entry=ttu&g_ep=EgoyMDI2MDYxNi4wIKXMDSoASAFQAw%3D%3D]]></description>
