    <name>✅ The Bocuse Restaurant CIA Hyde Park, NY</name>
    <description><![CDATA[Time: 2026-09-22T18:45:00<br/><br/>The Bocuse Restaurant CIA<br/><br/>📍 Hyde Park, NY<br/><br/>Student-run French fine dining at the Culinary Institute of America — a Michelin-level experience at a fraction of NYC prices, executed by CIA's most advanced students.<br/><br/>Must Order<br/>- Classic French tasting menu — changes seasonally<br/>- Soufflé — a CIA signature — order it at the start of the meal<br/>- Cheese course — exceptional selection curated by CIA faculty<br/><br/>Tips<br/>- Reserve 2–3 weeks in advance — essential<br/>- Lunch is slightly more relaxed than dinner<br/>- Smart casual dress expected<br/><br/>More info: https://www.opentable.com/r/the-bocuse-restaurant-at-the-culinary-institute-of-america-hyde-park?corrid=dabacd31-2e38-459b-b007-c9fd2968f3db&avt=eyJ2IjozLCJtIjowLCJwIjowLCJzIjoxLCJuIjowfQ&p=2&sd=2026-09-06T18%3A30%3A00]]></description>
