    <description><![CDATA[Time: 2026-09-21T00:00:00<br/><br/>The Heartwood at Vassar is a boutique hotel located in New York's scenic Hudson Valley. It offers a menu of local and seasonal fare and serves breakfast and lunch, with some dinner options available. The hotel features a bar that serves alcohol. Pricing is moderate, with hotel rates around $174 per night.<br/><br/>More info: https://www.google.com/maps/place/The+Heartwood+at+Vassar/@41.6912527,-73.9103075,1679m/data=!3m1!1e3!4m18!1m6!2m5!1sHotels!5m3!5m2!1s2026-09-21!2i4!3m10!1s0x89dd3e50a011abff:0x44f9066fb98a01c!5m4!1s2026-09-21!2i4!4m1!1i2!8m2!3d41.6905804!4d-73.9007203!16s%2Fg%2F11w1kf88xw?entry=ttu&g_ep=EgoyMDI2MDYxNi4wIKXMDSoASAFQAw%3D%3D]]></description>
