    <name>✅ The Salt Line Poughkeepsie NY 2</name>
    <description><![CDATA[Time: 2026-09-23T18:30:00<br/><br/>The Salt Line is a restaurant known for its diverse menu featuring dishes such as Grass Fed Steak and Long Island Duck. It attracts a mix of patrons, including couples on date nights, families, and LGBTQ+ groups, often for celebrations and casual dining occasions. The atmosphere is upscale yet inviting, with a lively vibe enhanced by excellent service and a focus on delicious food. Customers consistently praise the perfectly cooked chicken, attentive service, and the overall enjoyable dining experience. Common criticisms are not explicitly mentioned, but some customers may find wait times longer during busy periods.<br/><br/>Note: Confirmed via Resy "Reservation Booked" confirmation — Wed, Sep 23 at 6:30pm, 2 guests, Dining Room. No cancellation fee, but please cancel at least 24 hours in advance. Third and final Salt Line visit alongside Sep 22 (4 guests) and Sep 24 (5 guests, has a $15/guest cancellation fee).<br/><br/>More info: https://www.google.com/maps/place/The+Salt+Line/@41.6892315,-73.9015897,608m/data=!3m1!1e3!4m20!1m8!3m7!1s0x89c2b9b935200001:0xa7fbe7f1959624e!2sHudson+Valley,+NY!3b1!8m2!3d41.9209018!4d-73.9612887!16zL20vMDI5anF2!3m10!1s0x89dd3f0066b164a7:0x6c4617546701e16b!5m4!1s2026-09-21!2i4!4m1!1i2!8m2!3d41.6906907!4d-73.9006066!16s%2Fg%2F11w55vmqj7?entry=ttu&g_ep=EgoyMDI2MDYxMC4wIKXMDSoASAFQAw%3D%3D]]></description>
