    <description><![CDATA[Time: 2026-08-23T18:30:00<br/><br/>White Mountain Cider Co is a New American restaurant offering a variety of dishes including warm cider doughnuts and scallop & crab risotto. Prices range from $10 to $70, making it suitable for both lunch and dinner, and it serves alcohol.<br/><br/>More info: https://www.google.com/maps/place/White+Mountain+Cider+Co/@44.1040611,-71.1954694,789m/data=!3m2!1e3!4b1!4m6!3m5!1s0x4cb398b772333577:0x63b4e141f95f80aa!8m2!3d44.1040611!4d-71.1954694!16s%2Fg%2F1tcx13sn?entry=ttu&g_ep=EgoyMDI2MDcwOC4wIKXMDSoASAFQAw%3D%3D]]></description>
