  <Placemark>
    <name>✅ Woodstock AirBnB Woodstock VT</name>
    <description><![CDATA[Time: 2026-09-04T00:00:00<br/><br/>Woodstock Carriage House – Review<br/>Overall: A secluded, fully-renovated carriage house on a private 280-acre working estate — a quiet, scenic retreat rather than a downtown stay, about 2 miles from Woodstock village.<br/><br/>---<br/><br/>📋 Fast Facts<br/>- Listing name: Woodstock Carriage House (280 acres, views, gardens, skiing, farm)<br/>- Property type: Converted carriage house, formerly the horse caretaker's residence<br/>- Distance to town: ~2 miles from downtown Woodstock<br/><br/>---<br/><br/>🛋️ Space & Amenities<br/>- Fully furnished<br/>- Outdoor: deck with views over the estate's fields and mountains<br/>- Practical: slate-floor ski/mud entrance, separate back entrance for storing bikes/ski gear and changing out of active wear<br/>- Parking: doorstep parking<br/><br/>---<br/><br/>📍 Location & Neighborhood<br/>Set within a private, undeveloped 280-acre property with multiple secluded ponds (trout fishing, and wildlife viewing — deer, ducks, birds of prey). Convenient to Killington, Pico, Okemo, and Suicide Six ski areas, plus downtown Woodstock restaurants, shopping, fishing, and hiking.<br/><br/>---<br/><br/>🔑 Check-in & House Rules<br/>Not confirmed from available sources — check the listing directly.<br/><br/>---<br/><br/>⭐ Host & Reviews<br/>Not confirmed from available sources, but the listing appears frequently and prominently in Woodstock, VT vacation rental searches.<br/><br/>---<br/><br/>👍 Pros<br/>- Genuinely secluded, private setting rare for a base camp this close to town<br/>- Real outdoor access — ponds, fields, wildlife, mountain views<br/>- Practical mudroom/gear entrance suited to an active outdoor trip<br/><br/>---<br/><br/>👎 Cons<br/>- 2 miles from downtown means a car is needed for anything in town (not a walkable base camp)<br/>- Remote setting may not suit travelers wanting quick in-town access<br/><br/>---<br/><br/>🎯 Best For<br/>Travelers who want a quiet, scenic retreat near Woodstock and easy access to the surrounding ski areas, rather than a walkable in-town stay.<br/><br/>---<br/><br/>🔗 Sources<br/>- Woodstock Carriage House-280 acres-Views-Gardens-Skiing-Farm<br/><br/>More info: https://www.vrbo.com/104613ha?dateless=true&x_pwa=1&rfrr=HSR&pwa_ts=1783460599483&referrerUrl=aHR0cHM6Ly93d3cudnJiby5jb20vSG90ZWwtU2VhcmNo&useRewards=true&adults=2&regionId=10868&destination=Woodstock%2C+Vermont%2C+United+States+of+America&destType=MARKET&latLong=43.624245%2C-72.518509&searchId=955cf04a-220f-43f0-9779-dc43f2c80688&sort=RECOMMENDED&userIntent=&expediaPropertyId=33559745]]></description>
