  <Placemark>
    <name>✅ von Trapp Family Lodge &amp; Resort Dining Room 1 Stowe VT</name>
    <description><![CDATA[Time: 2026-09-03T18:30:00<br/><br/>Von Trapp Family Lodge & Resort is a relaxed, Alpine-style mountain resort located 3 miles from the Stowe ski slopes and 6 miles from Bingham Falls. It is well-known for its picturesque setting and amenities catering to both relaxation and outdoor activities, attracting families, couples, and outdoor enthusiasts, particularly in winter for skiing and in summer for hiking. The overall vibe is casual yet inviting, making it suitable for a variety of occasions, including family vacations, romantic getaways, and group retreats. Visitors consistently praise the immaculate grounds, excellent staff, and clean facilities. However, some guests have noted the softness of the pillows and the need for punctuality for scheduled tours due to the resort's efficient management style.<br/><br/>More info: https://www.google.com/maps/place/von+Trapp+Family+Lodge+%26+Resort/@44.4649088,-72.7459202,411m/data=!3m1!1e3!4m11!3m10!1s0x4cb590d36543edb1:0x21920f8850f87951!5m4!1s2026-09-21!2i4!4m1!1i2!8m2!3d44.4654749!4d-72.7451814!16s%2Fm%2F02vn6h6?entry=ttu&g_ep=EgoyMDI2MDYxMC4wIKXMDSoASAFQAw%3D%3D]]></description>
