  <Placemark>
    <name>✅ von Trapp Family Lodge &amp; Resort Lounge Stowe VT</name>
    <description><![CDATA[Time: 2026-09-02T18:30:00<br/><br/>The von Trapp Family Lodge & Resort is a relaxed, Alpine-style mountain resort located 3 miles from the Stowe ski slopes and 6 miles from Bingham Falls. It is best known for its picturesque surroundings and family-friendly atmosphere, attracting visitors seeking a casual outdoor experience.<br/><br/>Typical customers include families, couples, and groups looking for leisure activities, especially during winter and summer vacations. The vibe is informal and cozy, offering a mix of recreational options and a welcoming environment.<br/><br/>Strengths noted in reviews include the immaculate cleanliness of the lodge, the excellent staff service, and the beautiful grounds. Guests also appreciate the resort's family-friendly amenities and its pet-friendly policy.<br/><br/>Common downsides mentioned include discomfort with some pillows reported as too soft, and occasional concerns about timing for scheduled tours due to strict management.<br/><br/>More info: https://www.google.com/maps/place/von+Trapp+Family+Lodge+%26+Resort/@44.4652093,-72.7452802,144m/data=!3m1!1e3!4m11!3m10!1s0x4cb590d36543edb1:0x21920f8850f87951!5m4!1s2026-09-21!2i4!4m1!1i2!8m2!3d44.4654749!4d-72.7451814!16s%2Fm%2F02vn6h6?entry=ttu&g_ep=EgoyMDI2MDYxMC4wIKXMDSoASAFQAw%3D%3D]]></description>
