    <description><![CDATA[Time: 2026-08-11T18:30:00<br/><br/>La Bella Vita is an Italian restaurant offering a variety of dishes including pizza and pasta. It is open for both lunch and dinner and serves alcohol. Prices are moderate, typically ranging from $15 to $30 per meal.<br/><br/>More info: https://www.google.com/maps/place/La+Bella+Vita+-+Samoset+Resort/@44.1178058,-69.0838872,159m/data=!3m1!1e3!4m11!3m10!1s0x4cadd1c0655c9679:0x1f94772a78a49593!5m4!1s2026-09-21!2i4!4m1!1i2!8m2!3d44.1183764!4d-69.0834203!16s%2Fg%2F1v2jchxr?entry=ttu&g_ep=EgoyMDI2MDYxNi4wIKXMDSoASAFQAw%3D%3D]]></description>
