  <Placemark>
    <name>✅❌ The Salt Line Poughkeepsie NY</name>
    <description><![CDATA[Time: 2026-09-22T18:30:00<br/><br/>The Salt Line is a restaurant known for its diverse menu featuring dishes such as Grass Fed Steak and Long Island Duck. It attracts a mix of patrons, including couples on date nights, families, and LGBTQ+ groups, often for celebrations and casual dining occasions. The atmosphere is upscale yet inviting, with a lively vibe enhanced by excellent service and a focus on delicious food. Customers consistently praise the perfectly cooked chicken, attentive service, and the overall enjoyable dining experience. Common criticisms are not explicitly mentioned, but some customers may find wait times longer during busy periods.<br/><br/>CANCELLED (confirmed via Resy email, Sep 22 ~10:52am) — this Tue, Sep 22 at 6:30pm, 4 guests, Dining Room reservation was cancelled. Dinner that night is still covered by The Bocuse Restaurant at 6:45pm. Not related to the other two Salt Line visits: Sep 23 (2 guests, still active) and Sep 24 (5 guests, still active, $15/guest cancellation fee).<br/><br/>More info: https://www.google.com/maps/place/The+Salt+Line/@41.6892315,-73.9015897,608m/data=!3m1!1e3!4m20!1m8!3m7!1s0x89c2b9b935200001:0xa7fbe7f1959624e!2sHudson+Valley,+NY!3b1!8m2!3d41.9209018!4d-73.9612887!16zL20vMDI5anF2!3m10!1s0x89dd3f0066b164a7:0x6c4617546701e16b!5m4!1s2026-09-21!2i4!4m1!1i2!8m2!3d41.6906907!4d-73.9006066!16s%2Fg%2F11w55vmqj7?entry=ttu&g_ep=EgoyMDI2MDYxMC4wIKXMDSoASAFQAw%3D%3D]]></description>
