  <Placemark>
    <name>✅❗️ Brasserie LeBrun Bar Harbor ME</name>
    <description><![CDATA[Time: 2026-08-16T18:30:00<br/><br/>What it is: An elegant French brasserie in Bar Harbor specializing in elevated classics like steak frites, oysters, and seasonal entrees.<br/><br/>Customers: Diners seeking an upscale, high-quality dinner; couples, travelers, and food enthusiasts who appreciate fine-dining preparation in a refined setting.<br/><br/>Vibe: Elegant, sophisticated, and polished; refined atmosphere suitable for special occasions, yet welcoming and hospitable.<br/><br/>Strongest positives:<br/><br/>- Exceptional food quality described as "altering" one's dining experience, with highlights including steak frites, short ribs, and tuna tartare<br/>- High-quality, attentive, and welcoming service (hostess and servers specifically praised)<br/>- Elegant, sophisticated atmosphere<br/>- Consistently cited as a "best restaurant" experience in Bar Harbor<br/><br/>Downsides:<br/><br/>- Some dishes are considered pricey relative to the portion size (e.g., pork belly, mushroom side)<br/><br/>More info: https://www.google.com/maps/place/Brasserie+LeBrun/@44.3887341,-68.2140074,698m/data=!3m1!1e3!4m13!1m5!2m4!1sRestaurants!5m1!4e9!6e5!3m6!1s0x4caebf7c736bae5b:0x60d1a9deddec1fd!8m2!3d44.3888304!4d-68.2097356!15sCgtSZXN0YXVyYW50c1oNIgtyZXN0YXVyYW50c5IBCnJlc3RhdXJhbnSaASNDaFpEU1VoTk1HOW5TMFZKUTBGblNVTklhMDFQVGt0QkVBReABAPoBBQiFBBBA!16s%2Fg%2F11stqk3gmj?entry=ttu&g_ep=EgoyMDI2MDYxMC4wIKXMDSoASAFQAw%3D%3D]]></description>
