    <name>✅❗️ Havana Bar Harbor ME</name>
    <description><![CDATA[Time: 2026-08-19T18:30:00<br/><br/>What it is: Upscale Latin American restaurant featuring a contemporary blend of Latin and American cuisine with signature dishes like seafood paella, lobster moqueca, and lobster cake.<br/><br/>Customers: Diners seeking fine dining experiences—couples, special occasions, travelers; LGBTQ+ friendly environment.<br/><br/>Vibe: Classy, colorful, upscale; elegant ambiance with attentive service; dine-in only.<br/><br/>Strongest positives:<br/><br/>- Exceptional seafood dishes: lobster paella and moqueca (each mentioned in 75+ reviews); mussels praised as "best we have ever eaten"<br/>- Lobster cake (mentioned in 125 reviews)<br/>- Impressive wine list and seasonal desserts<br/>- Warm, knowledgeable servers providing excellent recommendations<br/><br/>Downsides:<br/><br/>- None consistently mentioned across reviews<br/><br/>More info: https://www.google.com/maps/place/Havana/@44.3854121,-68.2046771,137a,35y,125.7h,44.99t/data=!3m1!1e3!4m15!1m8!3m7!1s0x4caebe4815802593:0x88e91a6528cad91b!2sBar+Harbor,+ME!3b1!8m2!3d44.3875617!4d-68.2042989!16zL20vMDJnMDZr!3m5!1s0x4caebf65b05732db:0x2cb64a1b062406e4!8m2!3d44.3841514!4d-68.2031965!16s%2Fg%2F1tfdd1ff?entry=ttu&g_ep=EgoyMDI2MDYxMC4wIKXMDSoASAFQAw%3D%3D]]></description>
