    <description><![CDATA[Time: 2026-08-03T18:45:00<br/><br/>This restaurant offers Italian cuisine with a moderate price range ($15-$30 per entree). It is open for both lunch and dinner and serves alcohol.<br/><br/>More info: https://www.google.com/maps/place/Isa+Bistro/@43.6549541,-70.2663707,1586m/data=!3m1!1e3!4m19!1m11!2m10!1sRestaurants!3m5!2sThe+Westin+Portland+Harborview!3s0x4cb29c1150fe1919:0x604dfd1f1dbe0271!4m2!1d-70.2640432!2d43.6548418!5m1!4e9!6e5!3m6!1s0x4cb29c12ee43330f:0xa3f1ff835a50f1ee!8m2!3d43.6580908!4d-70.2649402!15sCgtSZXN0YXVyYW50c1oNIgtyZXN0YXVyYW50c5IBBmJpc3Ryb5oBJENoZERTVWhOTUc5blMwVkpRMEZuU1VSd2RYTkxlWGRCUlJBQuABAPoBBAgWEEg!16s%2Fg%2F11byck3h39?entry=ttu&g_ep=EgoyMDI2MDcyMC4wIKXMDSoASAFQAw%3D%3D]]></description>
