    <name>✅❗️ LUNE Chatham MA</name>
    <description><![CDATA[Time: 2026-09-16T18:30:00<br/><br/>Lune is a women-owned restaurant in Dennis Port, MA, offering a fine dining experience with a focus on upscale dishes such as Steak Tartare and Burrata. It serves dinner only from Wednesday to Sunday, with prices expected to be $100+ per person. The restaurant is LGBTQ+ friendly and serves alcohol.<br/><br/>More info: https://www.google.com/maps/place/LUNE/@41.6667198,-70.1370676,3277m/data=!3m1!1e3!4m14!1m7!3m6!1s0x89fb3f4813fab2ed:0x181a0e3b4b63ecfa!2sLUNE!8m2!3d41.6667219!4d-70.1267538!16s%2Fg%2F11vzv8d_4l!3m5!1s0x89fb3f4813fab2ed:0x181a0e3b4b63ecfa!8m2!3d41.6667219!4d-70.1267538!16s%2Fg%2F11vzv8d_4l?hl=en-US&entry=ttu&g_ep=EgoyMDI2MDYxNi4wIKXMDSoASAFQAw%3D%3D]]></description>
