  <Placemark>
    <name>✅❗️ Mr Tuna Portland ME</name>
    <description><![CDATA[Time: 2026-08-04T12:00:00<br/><br/>Mr. Tuna<br/><br/>📍 83 Middle Street, Portland, ME<br/><br/>Mr. Tuna is one of Portland's most acclaimed restaurants, full stop. Chef Jordan Rubin is a James Beard Nominee for Best Chef: Northeast and a Food & Wine Best New Chef (2025). The restaurant was named #6 Best Restaurant in the Country by Food & Wine.<br/><br/>Must Order<br/>- Tuna de Tigre — ceviche-style blend of Peruvian and Thai flavors; named one of the 26 best dishes in the USA by the NY Times (2024)<br/>- Tuna Tasting — a four-cut journey through local Maine bluefin<br/>- Torched halibut deluxe maki — pickled red onion, aji amarillo, avocado, acid-cured shishito, cilantro<br/>- Lunch bento box — the best value on the menu<br/>- Sushi burrito — a lunch-only crowd favorite<br/><br/>Tips<br/>- Open 11am–9:30pm daily; lunch bento specials run midday<br/>- Portions are small and prices reflect the quality — budget $30+ for a satisfying lunch<br/>- Honored with the Innovation Award from Gulf of Maine Research Institute for responsible sourcing<br/>- Steps from Eventide and Duckfat — do all three on the same afternoon<br/><br/>More info: https://www.google.com/maps/place/Mr.+Tuna,+83+Middle+St,+Portland,+ME]]></description>
