  <Placemark>
    <name>✅❗️ Natalie's Restaurant at Camden Harbour Inn, A Member of Small Luxury Hotels ME</name>
    <description><![CDATA[Time: 2026-08-07T18:30:00<br/><br/>Natalie's — Aug 7 visit<br/><br/>📍 83 Bayview St, Camden, ME (at Camden Harbour Inn)<br/><br/>The most decorated restaurant in Camden — the first and only Maine restaurant to win OpenTable's Diners' Choice Top 100 Best Restaurant in America award, plus AAA Four Diamond recognition, a Wine Spectator Award of Excellence, and Relais & Châteaux membership. French-leaning fine dining under executive chefs Chris Long and Shelby Stevens: à la carte, or three-, seven-, or lobster-tasting menus (lobster prepared four ways). Rated 4.9 on Restaurant Guru across 2,920 reviews. A 200-label wine list with 25+ by the glass.<br/><br/>Must Order<br/>- The lobster tasting menu, if you want the full experience — starts with Maine oysters, then lobster ceviche with avocado and peppers, a smoky lobster steam bun, and lobster risotto<br/>- Otherwise, the seven-course tasting menu for the fullest picture of the kitchen<br/>- Filet américain or swordfish if going à la carte<br/><br/>Tips<br/>- This is the splurge night of the trip — dress and budget accordingly.<br/>- Book well ahead; a restaurant with this reputation fills up fast in peak season.<br/>- Harbor-view setting inside Camden Harbour Inn — arrive a little early to enjoy the grounds.<br/><br/>More info: https://www.google.com/maps/place/Natalie's+Restaurant+at+Camden+Harbour+Inn,+A+Member+of+Small+Luxury+Hotels/@44.2057117,-69.0626585,175m/data=!3m1!1e3!4m13!1m5!2m4!1sRestaurants!5m1!4e9!6e5!3m6!1s0x4cadd70fb9257661:0x31ca8e1d87368211!8m2!3d44.2057774!4d-69.0616898!15sCgtSZXN0YXVyYW50c1oNIgtyZXN0YXVyYW50c5IBFm5ld19lbmdsYW5kX3Jlc3RhdXJhbnTgAQA!16s%2Fg%2F1vrq96_r?entry=ttu&g_ep=EgoyMDI2MDYwOS4wIKXMDSoASAFQAw%3D%3D]]></description>
