  <Placemark>
    <name>✅❗️ Nina June Rockport ME</name>
    <description><![CDATA[Time: 2026-08-14T19:00:00<br/><br/>Nina June is a women-owned restaurant in Rockport, ME, offering Italian cuisine with a focus on seafood and pasta. It serves dinner from Wednesday to Saturday, with prices expected to be around $60-$70 per person. The restaurant serves alcohol and has a welcoming atmosphere for all, including LGBTQ+ guests.<br/><br/>More info: https://www.google.com/maps/place/Nina+June/@44.1873577,-69.0753685,784m/data=!3m1!1e3!4m14!1m7!3m6!1s0x4cadd72ffeac25d5:0x4ae4a27eb17eb1d1!2sNina+June!8m2!3d44.1873577!4d-69.0727936!16s%2Fg%2F11c1nwggq3!3m5!1s0x4cadd72ffeac25d5:0x4ae4a27eb17eb1d1!8m2!3d44.1873577!4d-69.0727936!16s%2Fg%2F11c1nwggq3?entry=ttu&g_ep=EgoyMDI2MDYxNi4wIKXMDSoASAFQAw%3D%3D]]></description>
