  <Placemark>
    <name>✅❗️ Porcelli's Bar Harbor ME</name>
    <description><![CDATA[Time: 2026-08-18T18:30:00<br/><br/>What it is: Italian restaurant featuring handmade pasta dishes including pappardelle, mushroom gnocchi ragu, seafood risotto, osso buco, and cacio e pepe.<br/><br/>Customers: Diners seeking elevated Italian cuisine without formality—couples, groups, travelers; vegan-friendly options available.<br/><br/>Vibe: Casual-to-upscale Italian; relaxed, welcoming atmosphere; described as "a little Italian gem" with elegant but unpretentious setting.<br/><br/>Strongest positives:<br/><br/>- Flavorful, high-quality handmade pasta and seafood risotto (with generous portions including lobster tail, scallops, shrimp, clams, mussels)<br/>- Fine dining food quality without stuffy atmosphere<br/>- Good wine selection<br/>- Attentive, friendly service; described as "awesome" and "not overbearing"<br/>- Vegan pasta options (gnocchi noted as "fantastic")<br/><br/>Downsides:<br/><br/>- Slow service between courses (waited over an hour between appetizer and entree)<br/><br/>More info: https://www.google.com/maps/place/Porcelli's/@44.3854121,-68.2046771,137a,35y,125.7h,44.99t/data=!3m1!1e3!4m15!1m8!3m7!1s0x4caebe4815802593:0x88e91a6528cad91b!2sBar+Harbor,+ME!3b1!8m2!3d44.3875617!4d-68.2042989!16zL20vMDJnMDZr!3m5!1s0x4caebf000cab42d3:0xc533060515fc8430!8m2!3d44.3839032!4d-68.2036126!16s%2Fg%2F11y451bc5s?entry=ttu&g_ep=EgoyMDI2MDYxMC4wIKXMDSoASAFQAw%3D%3D]]></description>
