    <name>✅❗️ Select Oyster Bar</name>
    <description><![CDATA[Time: 2026-08-03T12:00:00<br/><br/>on, MA](https://encrypted-tbn0.gstatic.com/images?q=tbn:ANd9GcSgGUxZBD7zjULmdTJRQ5MyGEPaytG9cpz2Dpx-H52LHw&s)<br/><br/>More info: https://www.google.com/maps/place/Select+Oyster+Bar/@42.3485926,-71.0866886,812m/data=!3m1!1e3!4m14!1m7!3m6!1s0x89e37a0f95a1549b:0xb1c0b98204eb6d11!2sSelect+Oyster+Bar!8m2!3d42.3485887!4d-71.0841083!16s%2Fg%2F11b6ghmbwx!3m5!1s0x89e37a0f95a1549b:0xb1c0b98204eb6d11!8m2!3d42.3485887!4d-71.0841083!16s%2Fg%2F11b6ghmbwx?entry=ttu&g_ep=EgoyMDI2MDYyOS4wIKXMDSoASAFQAw%3D%3D]]></description>
