    <name>✅❗️ Vito Marcello's Italian Bistro</name>
    <description><![CDATA[Time: 2026-08-22T18:30:00<br/><br/>Vito Marcello's Italian Bistro is an Italian restaurant offering a menu priced between $20-$60 per person. It serves dinner daily, closing at 9:30 PM most days, and does serve alcohol.<br/><br/>More info: https://www.google.com/maps/place/Vito+Marcello's+Italian+Bistro/@44.0514106,-71.1295884,716m/data=!3m1!1e3!4m6!3m5!1s0x4cb3a0e3c9da571f:0xed5ac83c36801d77!8m2!3d44.0518923!4d-71.1253186!16s%2Fg%2F1262ppsbs?entry=ttu&g_ep=EgoyMDI2MDcxMi4wIKXMDSoASAFQAw%3D%3D]]></description>
