  <Placemark>
    <name>✅❗️ von Trapp Family Lodge &amp; Resort Stowe VT</name>
    <description><![CDATA[Time: 2026-08-31T16:00:00<br/><br/>The von Trapp Family Lodge & Resort is a 4-star hotel located in Stowe, known for its relaxed Alpine-style accommodations and proximity to ski slopes. It attracts a diverse clientele including families, couples, and business groups, particularly those seeking a scenic mountain getaway or hosting events. The overall vibe of the resort is casual yet polished, making it suitable for both leisure and business purposes.<br/><br/>Visitors consistently praise the cleanliness and efficient service of the lodge, alongside its pleasant outdoor pool and fitness facilities. However, some guests mention issues with the softness of the pillows and the overall breakfast options, indicating a desire for improvement in these areas.<br/><br/>More info: https://www.google.com/maps/place/von+Trapp+Family+Lodge+%26+Resort/@44.4654726,-72.7666041,6525m/data=!3m1!1e3!4m11!3m10!1s0x4cb590d36543edb1:0x21920f8850f87951!5m4!1s2026-09-21!2i4!4m1!1i2!8m2!3d44.4654749!4d-72.7451814!16s%2Fm%2F02vn6h6?entry=ttu&g_ep=EgoyMDI2MDYxMC4wIKXMDSoASAFQAw%3D%3D]]></description>
