    <name>✅❗️ ❌❌twenty-eight Atlantic Chatham MA (Visit 2)</name>
    <description><![CDATA[Time: 2026-09-18T18:45:00<br/><br/>Note: Second of two visits to twenty-eight Atlantic during the Chatham MA stay — confirmation #2110050195, booked June 22, 2026. The first visit is Sep 11 (Visit 1), confirmation #2110052411.<br/><br/>More info: https://www.google.com/maps/place/twenty-eight+Atlantic/@41.7228278,-70.005598,3262m/data=!3m2!1e3!4b1!4m6!3m5!1s0x89fb6b2c2c9eb68d:0x43679028a22560c6!8m2!3d41.7228283!4d-69.9953197!16s%2Fg%2F1tjfc93k?entry=ttu&g_ep=EgoyMDI2MDYxNi4wIKXMDSoASAFQAw%3D%3D]]></description>
