  <Placemark>
    <name>✅❗️❌ Cactus Club Cafe Boston MA</name>
    <description><![CDATA[Time: 2026-08-02T18:30:00<br/><br/>Cactus Club Boston is best approached as a place to order the crowd-pleasers and skip the more ordinary items. The strongest bets are the Sushi Set, truffle fries, peach Bellini, and one of the shared starters like the Creole crab & spinach dip or sticky garlic ribs.[bostonglobe +1]<br/>What to order<br/>•	The Sushi Set. It’s one of the most consistently praised choices and gives you a good sampling of the sushi section.[opentable +1]<br/>•	Peach Bellini. Multiple recent reviews single it out as the drink to get, and it’s one of the restaurant’s signature draws.[bostonglobe +1]<br/>•	Truffle Fries. They show up repeatedly in reviews and are a reliable starter or side.[opentable +1]<br/>•	Sticky Garlic Ribs or Creole Crab & Spinach Dip. Both are among the better shareables and fit the menu’s social, share-heavy style.[bostonglobe +1]<br/>•	Chicken Shawarma Bowl or Tofu Bowl. If you want something more substantial but not steak-heavy, recent social reviews highlight these as flavorful and balanced.[instagram]<br/>What to skip or be cautious with<br/>•	Steak Frites can be fine, but one review specifically called out the fries as a letdown.[yelp]<br/>•	The menu is broad, and the Boston Globe framed it as a “Canadian Cheesecake Factory,” which is a polite way of saying breadth matters more than deep specialization here.[bostonglobe]<br/>•	If you’re going mainly for sushi or steak, you may get better value at a dedicated sushi bar or steakhouse.[bostonglobe]<br/>Best order by mood<br/>•	For a first visit: Sushi Set, truffle fries, Peach Bellini.[opentable +1]<br/>•	For sharing: Creole crab & spinach dip, sticky garlic ribs, one sushi order.[opentable +1]<br/>•	For a heartier meal: Creole Steak & Jumbo Shrimp or Steak Frites, though the steak-and-shrimp option sounds more compelling than the fries-focused one.[yelp +1]<br/>Overall, Cactus Club Boston seems strongest when you lean into the dishes people actually talk about: the Bellini, sushi, fries, and a few shareable starters<br/><br/>Cancelled<br/><br/>More info: https://www.google.com/maps/place/Cactus+Club+Cafe/@42.3507344,-71.0768522,812m/data=!3m2!1e3!4b1!4m6!3m5!1s0x89e37b82fc8ab439:0x3a296e97fb75034e!8m2!3d42.3507305!4d-71.0742773!16s%2Fg%2F11xg5bw3g6?entry=ttu&g_ep=EgoyMDI2MDYwOS4wIKXMDSoASAFQAw%3D%3D]]></description>
