  <Placemark>
    <name>✅❗️❌ Copita Northeast Harbor ME</name>
    <description><![CDATA[Time: 2026-08-21T06:30:00<br/><br/>Copita is a restaurant located in Northeast Harbor, Maine, known for its upscale dining experience featuring a variety of delicious entrees and appetizers. It typically attracts visitors looking for a higher-end meal, including families, couples, and travelers seeking a cozy place to unwind after a long day. The overall vibe is warm and welcoming, with a casual yet refined atmosphere perfect for leisurely dinners. Customers consistently praise the excellent food quality, attentive service, and inviting ambiance. However, some diners have mentioned specific issues such as overly salty dishes and occasional service miscommunication regarding food portions.<br/><br/>More info: https://www.google.com/maps/place/Copita/@44.29184,-68.2899484,1355m/data=!3m1!1e3!4m14!1m7!3m6!1s0x4cae97a048849b31:0x6bc7708886a47493!2sSeal+Cove+Auto+Museum!8m2!3d44.3053532!4d-68.4045448!16s%2Fg%2F1tkjkt8t!3m5!1s0x4caebd63b9a1bba7:0x6d57e27958a53c3e!8m2!3d44.2949009!4d-68.2892824!16s%2Fg%2F11j9d3rs8q?entry=ttu&g_ep=EgoyMDI2MDYxMC4wIKXMDSoASAFQAw%3D%3D]]></description>
