  <Placemark>
    <name>🚨Red Sky Restaurant Southwest Harbor ME</name>
    <description><![CDATA[Recommended by Thom Smith. <br/><br/>Red Sky Restaurant stands out as a fine dining option offering inspired American cuisine. It appeals mainly to those celebrating special occasions or seeking an upscale dining experience. The atmosphere is warm and elegant, making it perfect for a nice dinner date or celebration. Customers often praise the restaurant for its exquisite cuisine and attentive service, while others mention that it may be on the pricier side, which not everyone is comfortable with.<br/><br/>More info: https://www.google.com/maps/place/Red+Sky+Restaurant/@44.2797099,-68.3263769,124m/data=!3m1!1e3!4m13!1m5!2m4!1sRestaurants!5m1!4e9!6e5!3m6!1s0x4caebd3d0ae4bc11:0x98c5cae931a3f144!8m2!3d44.2796985!4d-68.3251234!15sCgtSZXN0YXVyYW50c1oNIgtyZXN0YXVyYW50c5IBFmZpbmVfZGluaW5nX3Jlc3RhdXJhbnSaASRDaGREU1VoTk1HOW5TMFZKUTBGblNVTnlNWEJmZWw5blJSQULgAQD6AQUIgQEQRg!16s%2Fg%2F1tf70jm0?entry=ttu&g_ep=EgoyMDI2MDYxMC4wIKXMDSoASAFQAw%3D%3D]]></description>
